// The Chinese of the config schema's descriptions, by their English text, for config.js. A test in app/workbench
// fails when the schema has a description this lacks, or this holds one the schema no longer has.
//
// 配置 schema 描述的中文，以英文原文为键，供 config.js 使用。schema 中有此处缺少的描述、或此处有 schema 已不再包含的描述时，
// app/workbench 中的测试会失败。
window.FitSchemaZh = {
"The will's topic: a topic name, without + or #.": "遗嘱消息的主题：一个主题名，不含 + 或 #。",
"The will's payload, as text. Empty when left out.": "遗嘱消息的负载，为文本。不设置时为空。",
"In version 5, the will's content type, as text/plain.": "在版本 5 中，遗嘱消息的内容类型，例如 text/plain。",
"The will's QoS: 0, 1 or 2. 0 when left out.": "遗嘱消息的 QoS：0、1 或 2。不设置时为 0。",
"In version 5, how long the broker keeps the will for a subscriber not connected, rounded up to seconds. None when left out.": "在版本 5 中，代理为未连接的订阅者保留遗嘱消息的时长，向上取整到秒。不设置时不限。",
"Publish the will retained: the broker keeps it for clients that subscribe later, until a message to the topic replaces it.": "以保留消息发布遗嘱：代理为之后订阅的客户端保留它，直到该主题的新消息替换它。",
"In version 5, authenticate by enhanced authentication (AUTH) with this SCRAM method, of username and password_env's password, rather than with the password in CONNECT: the password does not cross the wire, and fit checks the broker knows it. EMQX 5's SCRAM authenticator takes SCRAM-SHA-256 and SCRAM-SHA-512. The password in CONNECT when left out.": "在版本 5 中，用此 SCRAM 方法、以 username 和 password_env 的密码做增强认证（AUTH），而不是在 CONNECT 中发送密码：密码不经过网络传输，且 fit 会校验代理确实知道该密码。EMQX 5 的 SCRAM 认证器支持 SCRAM-SHA-256 和 SCRAM-SHA-512。不设置时在 CONNECT 中发送密码。",
"A will message the broker publishes once the source's connection ends other than by fit closing it: lost, or kept alive in vain. None when left out.": "源的连接不是由 fit 关闭而结束时（连接丢失，或保活超时），代理发布的遗嘱消息。不设置时没有。",
"A will message the broker publishes once the sink's connection ends other than by fit closing it: lost, or kept alive in vain. None when left out.": "目标端的连接不是由 fit 关闭而结束时（连接丢失，或保活超时），代理发布的遗嘱消息。不设置时没有。",
"In version 5, how long the broker waits, once the connection is lost, before it publishes the will, rounded up to seconds: nothing is published if fit is back within it. The broker publishes it sooner when the session ends first: at once for the sink, whose session ends with its connection. At once when left out.": "在版本 5 中，连接丢失后代理等待多久再发布遗嘱，向上取整到秒：fit 在此期间重新连上则不发布。会话先结束时代理会更早发布：目标端的会话随连接结束，因此立即发布。不设置时立即发布。",
"In version 5, user properties the will carries, in the order of their names.": "在版本 5 中，遗嘱消息携带的用户属性，按名称排序。",
"With cdc, the most transactions read from the change tables at once. 1000 when left out or 0.": "使用 cdc 时，一次从变更表读取的最多事务数。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How the connection is encrypted: on, TLS negotiated in TDS's pre-login, refused by a server that cannot; strict, TDS 8's TLS first (SQL Server 2022 and later; on Linux, 2025 and later); off, none, the password and rows in clear. The server's certificate is checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off. on when left out.": "连接的加密方式：on，在 TDS 的 pre-login 中协商 TLS，不支持的服务器会被拒绝；strict，TDS 8 的先 TLS（SQL Server 2022 及以后；Linux 上为 2025 及以后）；off，不加密，密码与行都以明文传输。服务器证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验，校验不能关闭。不设置时为 on。",
"The server's host and port: SQL Server 2016 or later. 127.0.0.1:1433 when left out.": "服务器的主机与端口：SQL Server 2016 或更高版本。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:1433。",
"The name the server's certificate must have; address's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称；不设置时为 address 中的主机。",
"How long connecting, and each wait for the server, may take. 60s when left out or 0.": "连接以及每次等待服务器所允许的最长时间。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"Tables left out of those tables names, as schema.table globs.": "从 tables 所列的表中排除的表，形式为 schema.table 通配模式。",
"How long the source waits, once it has read every change, before it looks again. 500ms when left out or 0.": "源读完所有变更后，再次查看前等待的时间。不设置或为 0 时为 500ms。",
"With cdc, the most changed rows held at once to put the change tables' rows in order: a window of transactions with more is read again smaller, and a single transaction with more is read in pages of this many. 10000 when left out or 0.": "使用 cdc 时，为给变更表的行排序而同时持有的最多变更行数：超过它的事务窗口会缩小后重读，超过它的单个事务按这个行数分页读取。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The key's columns of tables, by schema.table, in place of the primary key (or the unique index CDC was enabled with): for a table without one. A table with neither has records without a key, and its snapshot is read in one query.": "按 schema.table 给出各表的键列，替代主键（或启用 CDC 时指定的唯一索引）：用于没有主键的表。两者都没有的表，其记录没有键，其快照用一条查询读取。",
"Where changes come from: cdc, the change tables, with whole rows before and after each change, every change in order; change_tracking, the keys changed since the last version, each row read back as it is then, an absent row a delete (lighter on the server, but changes between two polls are merged and rows have no before). cdc when left out.": "变更的来源：cdc，变更表，每个变更都有变更前后的整行，所有变更按顺序；change_tracking，自上一版本以来变更的键，每行按当时的状态读回，不存在的行视为删除（对服务器更轻，但两次轮询之间的变更会合并，且行没有变更前的值）。不设置时为 cdc。",
"The tables read, as schema.table globs (* and ? within a name, [ranges]): dbo.orders, sales.*. A table named whole must have CDC (or change tracking) on, or the pipeline fails saying how to turn it on; a glob matches the tables that have it, and picks up a table CDC begins to capture later. Every table CDC (or change tracking) follows when left out.": "读取的表，形式为 schema.table 通配模式（名称内可用 * 与 ?，以及 [范围]）：dbo.orders、sales.*。完整写出名称的表必须开启 CDC（或 change tracking），否则流水线失败并说明如何开启；通配模式匹配已开启的表，并会接上之后 CDC 开始捕获的表。不设置时为 CDC（或 change tracking）跟踪的所有表。",
"Whether the tables' rows are read before the changes: initial, when the pipeline has no checkpoint; always, at every start of the source, unless its checkpoint is inside a snapshot, which it goes on with; never, the changes alone, from the checkpoint or from now. The position is read first and the changes start there, so what changes during the snapshot comes again. initial when left out.": "是否在读取变更前先读取表的行：initial，流水线没有检查点时；always，源每次启动时，除非其检查点位于快照之中（此时继续该快照）；never，只读变更，从检查点或从现在开始。位置会先被读取，变更从那里开始，因此快照期间发生的变更会再次到来。不设置时为 initial。",
"The database whose tables are read.": "要读取其表的数据库。",
"The SQL login, which needs SELECT on the tables, and on the cdc schema (db_owner, or the role CDC was enabled with) or VIEW CHANGE TRACKING on them; with auth, the Windows account (kerberos, ntlm). Needed but with auth's entra.": "SQL 登录名，需要对表的 SELECT 权限，以及对 cdc 架构的权限（db_owner，或启用 CDC 时指定的角色）或对表的 VIEW CHANGE TRACKING 权限；使用 auth 时为 Windows 账户（kerberos、ntlm）。除 auth 的 entra 外都需要。",
"The rows a snapshot's query reads, by key, each in a transaction of its own. 1000 when left out or 0.": "快照的每条查询按键读取的行数，每条查询在自己的事务中。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The records' namespace. The codec's, or the topic, when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为编解码器给出的，或为主题。",
"What makes records of a message's payload, as json for a JSON object. When left out, a message record whose after holds topic, payload (bytes), qos, retain, and those of the MQTT 5 properties the message has: content_type, response_topic, correlation_data and user_properties (a map, a name sent more than once an array of its values).": "把消息的负载转成记录的编解码器，例如 JSON 对象用 json。不设置时，生成一条 message 记录，其 after 包含 topic、payload（字节）、qos、retain，以及消息带有的 MQTT 5 属性：content_type、response_topic、correlation_data 和 user_properties（一个映射，出现多次的名称对应其各个值组成的数组）。",
"The topic a record goes to: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace, and {key}, its key's text (a route transform can map namespaces first). A record whose topic is empty or holds + or # fails. {namespace} when left out.": "记录发往的主题：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间）和 {key}（其键的文本）的文本（可先用 route 转换映射命名空间）。主题为空或含 + 或 # 的记录会失败。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The most bytes of a packet fit takes, told to a broker of version 5, which then drops a message larger for fit; a larger packet ends the connection. 1048576 when left out or 0.": "fit 接受的单个报文的最大字节数，会告知版本 5 的 broker，broker 随后会丢弃发给 fit 的更大消息；收到更大的报文会断开连接。不设置或为 0 时为 1048576。",
"In version 5, user properties every message carries, in the order of their names.": "在版本 5 中，每条消息携带的用户属性，按名称排序。",
"The user name sent in CONNECT.": "在 CONNECT 中发送的用户名。",
"In version 5, the messages' content type, as application/json.": "在版本 5 中，消息的内容类型，例如 application/json。",
"The environment variable holding the password sent in CONNECT, read when the pipeline loads.": "保存 CONNECT 中所发送密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取。",
"The brokers, host:port each (1883, or 8883 with tls), tried in turn until one takes the connection.": "broker 列表，每个为 host:port（1883，启用 tls 时为 8883），依次尝试，直到某个接受连接。",
"In a job (mode once), how long without a message ends the reading: the source ends once the sinks have every message it read. 5s when left out or 0.": "在作业（mode 为 once）中，多久没有消息即结束读取：待所有 sink 都收到它读到的每条消息后，源结束。不设置或为 0 时为 5s。",
"The client ID, which names the session the broker keeps: one pipeline's, and no other client's, since a second connection of it takes the session over.": "客户端 ID，它命名 broker 保留的会话：只属于一个管道，不可给其他客户端使用，因为同一 ID 的第二个连接会接管该会话。",
"The most messages of QoS 1 and 2 a broker of version 5 sends before fit acknowledges them, and the most messages read and not yet handed to the pipeline. Since a message is acknowledged once the sinks have it, keep it above the sinks' batch.max_records; brokers bound it too (EMQX's max_inflight, Mosquitto's max_inflight_messages). 128 when left out or 0.": "版本 5 的 broker 在 fit 确认之前最多发送的 QoS 1 和 2 消息数，也是已读取但尚未交给管道的最多消息数。由于消息在 sink 收到后才确认，应使其大于 sink 的 batch.max_records；broker 自身也有限制（EMQX 的 max_inflight、Mosquitto 的 max_inflight_messages）。不设置或为 0 时为 128。",
"The brokers, host:port each (1883, or 8883 with tls), tried in turn until one takes the connection: the nodes of one cluster, which share the session.": "broker 列表，每个为 host:port（1883，启用 tls 时为 8883），依次尝试，直到某个接受连接：应为同一集群的节点，它们共享会话。",
"The client ID, in a clean session of its own; fit-sync- and random letters when left out.": "客户端 ID，使用自己的全新会话；不设置时为 fit-sync- 加随机字符。",
"The most QoS the broker sends the topics' messages at: 0, at most once, lost when fit is away; 1, at least once, kept in the session and sent again until acknowledged; 2, as 1, and taken once in a connection. 1 when left out.": "broker 发送这些主题消息时的最高 QoS：0，至多一次，fit 不在线时丢失；1，至少一次，保存在会话中并重发直至确认；2，同 1，且在一个连接中只接收一次。不设置时为 1。",
"How long a broker of version 5 keeps the session, and the messages for it, while fit is not connected; a broker may hold it shorter (EMQX's session_expiry_interval). In 3.1.1 the broker's own setting (Mosquitto's persistent_client_expiration). 24h when left out or 0.": "fit 未连接时，版本 5 的 broker 保留会话及其消息的时长；broker 可能保留得更短（EMQX 的 session_expiry_interval）。在 3.1.1 中由 broker 自己的设置决定（Mosquitto 的 persistent_client_expiration）。不设置或为 0 时为 24h。",
"The QoS messages are published at: 0, sent and not acknowledged, so a message the connection loses is lost; 1, acknowledged (PUBACK); 2, acknowledged once handed on (PUBCOMP). 1 when left out.": "发布消息所用的 QoS：0，发送且不确认，连接丢失的消息即丢失；1，需确认（PUBACK）；2，转交后确认（PUBCOMP）。不设置时为 1。",
"How long connecting, the broker's answers to CONNECT and SUBSCRIBE, and each write may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、broker 对 CONNECT 和 SUBSCRIBE 的应答以及每次写入可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The most bytes of a packet fit takes from the broker. A message larger than the broker takes (its Maximum Packet Size, in version 5) fails, at once. 1048576 when left out or 0.": "fit 从 broker 接受的单个报文的最大字节数。超过 broker 所接受大小（版本 5 中其 Maximum Packet Size）的消息会立即失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1048576。",
"The topic filters subscribed to, + standing for a level and # for the levels under one, as sensors/+/temperature or devices/#; a shared subscription, $share/group/filter, splits the messages among the clients of the group.": "订阅的主题过滤器，+ 代表一级，# 代表某级之下的所有级，例如 sensors/+/temperature 或 devices/#；共享订阅 $share/group/filter 会把消息分给组内的各客户端。",
"How long connecting, the broker's answer to CONNECT, and each write may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、broker 对 CONNECT 的应答以及每次写入可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"What makes a message's payload of a record, as json for a JSON object. When left out, after's (or before's) payload field, its bytes or text as they are, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; and, in version 5, the field content_type, and the map user_properties, become the message's properties, so that the source mqtt's records are published as they were read.": "把记录转成消息负载的编解码器，例如 JSON 对象用 json。不设置时，取 after（或 before）的 payload 字段，其字节或文本原样使用，没有该字段时取记录的规范 JSON；并且在版本 5 中，字段 content_type 和映射 user_properties 成为消息的属性，使 mqtt 源的记录按读到时的样子发布。",
"The MQTT version spoken: 3.1.1 or 5. 5 when left out.": "使用的 MQTT 版本：3.1.1 或 5。不设置时为 5。",
"In version 5, how long the broker keeps a message for a subscriber not connected, rounded up to seconds. None when left out.": "在版本 5 中，broker 为未连接的订阅者保留消息的时长，向上取整到秒。不设置时不限。",
"The keep-alive told to the broker: fit pings it every half of it, and takes a ping not answered within it as the connection lost. At most 65535s; a broker of version 5 may set its own. 60s when left out or 0.": "告知 broker 的保活时长：fit 每隔其一半发送一次 ping，在此时长内未得到应答即视为连接丢失。最多 65535s；版本 5 的 broker 可设定自己的值。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The most messages of QoS 1 and 2 published and not yet acknowledged; lowered to the broker's receive maximum in version 5. 64 when left out or 0.": "已发布但尚未确认的 QoS 1 和 2 消息的最大数量；在版本 5 中会降到 broker 的 receive maximum。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"Publish retained messages: the broker keeps each topic's last, for clients that subscribe later, and a delete clears it.": "发布保留消息：broker 为之后订阅的客户端保存每个主题的最后一条消息，删除操作会清除它。",
"Sample goroutines blocking on channels, selects and locks for the block profile: one event per this many nanoseconds spent blocked, on average, 1 for every one. 0, none, when left out; set it only while looking, since it costs every blocking event.": "为阻塞剖析（block profile）采样在通道、select 和锁上阻塞的 goroutine：平均每阻塞这么多纳秒采样一个事件，1 为每个都采样。不设置时为 0，不采样；只在排查时设置，因为每个阻塞事件都会因此增加开销。",
"Sample one in this many contended mutexes for the mutex profile, 1 for every one. 0, none, when left out.": "为互斥锁剖析（mutex profile）在每这么多次锁竞争中采样一次，1 为每次都采样。不设置时为 0，不采样。",
"Serve Go's runtime profiles, as net/http/pprof does, at the Admin API's /debug/pprof/: CPU, heap, allocations, goroutines, blocking, mutexes and execution traces, for go tool pprof and go tool trace. Off when left out: the endpoints answer 404, and blocking and mutexes are not sampled. Follows every config applied, with no restart. Needs admin; served on the Admin API's own address, behind its token, and not through the console.": "像 net/http/pprof 一样，在 Admin API 的 /debug/pprof/ 提供 Go 运行时的性能剖析数据：CPU、堆、内存分配、goroutine、阻塞、互斥锁和执行追踪，供 go tool pprof 与 go tool trace 使用。不设置时关闭：这些路径返回 404，阻塞和互斥锁也不采样。随每次应用的配置生效，无需重启。需要 admin；只在 Admin API 自己的地址上、凭其令牌提供，控制台不提供。",
"The longest a profile's seconds may ask for: a CPU profile or a trace samples for that long, and a delta profile waits that long, holding its connection to the Admin API all the while; a request for longer is refused with 400. 1m when left out.": "一次剖析的 seconds 最多可请求的时长：CPU 剖析和执行追踪会采样这么久，增量剖析会等待这么久，其间一直占用与 Admin API 的连接；请求更长时间的返回 400。不设置时为 1m。",
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file lines are appended to; \"stdout\" when left out.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入行的文件路径；不设置时为 \"stdout\"。",
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file messages are appended to, of every logger loggers does not set one for. When left out, debug and info messages go to stdout and warn and error ones to stderr. A change takes a restart.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入消息的文件路径，适用于 loggers 中未单独设置的所有日志记录器。不设置时，debug 和 info 消息输出到 stdout，warn 和 error 消息输出到 stderr。修改后需重启生效。",
"\"stdout\", \"stderr\", or the path of a file the logger's messages are appended to. A change takes a restart.": "\"stdout\"、\"stderr\" 或追加写入该日志记录器消息的文件路径。修改后需重启生效。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the directory's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of one's own.": "PEM 文件，包含用于校验该目录证书的证书，取代系统根证书，用于自建 CA。",
"A PEM file with cert_file's private key.": "PEM 文件，包含 cert_file 的私钥。",
"A PEM file with the Admin API's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the API is served over TLS, 1.2 or later. The files are read again when they change, so that a renewed certificate is served without a restart. Not for a Unix socket.": "PEM 文件，包含 Admin API 的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，API 通过 TLS（1.2 或更高版本）提供服务。文件变化时会重新读取，因此续期后的证书无需重启即可生效。不适用于 Unix 套接字。",
"A PEM file with the API's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the API is served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含 API 的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，API 通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A PEM file with the CAs Consul's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证 Consul 证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs that clients' certificates must chain to: with it, every client must present a valid certificate, besides the token, before it is heard. Needs cert_file and key_file; read again when it changes, as they are.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书必须链接到的 CA：设置后，每个客户端除令牌外还必须出示有效证书，否则不予受理。需要 cert_file 和 key_file；与它们一样，文件变化时会重新读取。",
"A PEM file with the CAs etcd's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证 etcd 证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs the receiver's certificate is verified with, over https; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 验证接收端证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the CAs the server's certificate is verified with, over TLS; the system's when left out.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 TLS 验证服务器证书所用的 CA；不设置时使用系统 CA。",
"A PEM file with the certificate's private key.": "PEM 文件，包含该证书的私钥。",
"A PEM file with the certificate, followed by any intermediates.": "PEM 文件，包含该证书及其后的任何中间证书。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over TLS; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 TLS 发送的客户端证书；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https, as Consul's verify_incoming asks for; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书，即 Consul 的 verify_incoming 所要求的；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https, as etcd's client-cert-auth asks for; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书，即 etcd 的 client-cert-auth 所要求的；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the client certificate sent over https; with key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 发送的客户端证书；需配合 key_file。",
"A PEM file with the console's certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the console is served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含控制台的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，控制台通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A PEM file with the pages' certificate, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, the pages are served over TLS.": "PEM 文件，包含页面的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，页面通过 TLS 提供服务。",
"A TURN server's password.": "TURN 服务器的密码。",
"A TURN server's username.": "TURN 服务器的用户名。",
"A URL fit asks, with the name in the query as domain=<name>, whether a name may have a certificate: an answer of 2xx allows it, and any other refuses it. Refusals are remembered for a minute. At most 8 asks are under way at once, and 5 a second on average, 20 at once, however they are answered; a handshake past them fails without asking.": "fit 询问某个名称能否获得证书的 URL，名称以 domain=<name> 放在查询参数中：返回 2xx 表示允许，其他均为拒绝。拒绝结果会被记住一分钟。同时进行的询问最多 8 个，平均每秒 5 个、一次最多 20 个，无论应答如何；超出时握手直接失败，不再询问。",
"A directory the install scripts of vendors whose drivers are downloaded by hand look for the packages in, under the vendor's name; the working directory when left out.": "供手动下载驱动的厂商的安装脚本查找软件包的目录，位于厂商名称之下；不设置时为工作目录。",
"A disk tier for the zone: every response kept in memory is written to disk too, on a pool of goroutines of its own, and one the memory no longer holds is read back from disk, on that pool, and kept in memory again. None when left out. Caches of one zone take the disk of the last one loaded.": "该区域的磁盘层：内存中保存的每个响应也会写入磁盘，由其专属的 goroutine 池完成；内存中已不再保留的响应由该池从磁盘读回，并重新保存到内存中。不设置时无磁盘层。同一区域的多个缓存使用最后加载的那个磁盘。",
"A file holding a token that every request must carry, as \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\"; no token is asked for when left out.": "包含令牌的文件，每个请求都必须携带该令牌，形式为 \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\"；不设置时不要求令牌。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read each time a watch starts; none when left out. The token needs to read the keys under prefix.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读取 prefix 下各键的权限。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read each time a watch starts; none when left out. The token needs to read the services and nodes served.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读取所提供的服务和节点的权限。",
"A file holding the ACL token to send, read when fit starts; none when left out. The token needs to read and write the keys under prefix and to make sessions.": "包含要发送的 ACL 令牌的文件，在 fit 启动时读取；不设置时无令牌。该令牌需要有读写 prefix 下各键以及创建会话的权限。",
"A file holding the key's secret, read each time the config is applied; the handler media_tokens rotates this file to refuse just the tokens this key signed. At least 16 bytes, its line breaks at the end aside. Or secret, one of the two.": "保存该密钥 secret 的文件，每次应用配置时读取；处理器 media_tokens 轮换该文件，以只拒绝该密钥签发的 token。至少 16 字节，末尾的换行不计。或 secret，二者取其一。",
"A file holding the password to authenticate with, read at each connection; none when left out.": "包含用于认证的密码的文件，每次连接时读取；不设置时无密码。",
"A file holding the password, its surrounding spaces trimmed.": "包含密码的文件，会去除其前后的空白。",
"A file holding the secret tokens are signed with, read each time the config is applied: the handler media_tokens rotates it, and every token signed before is refused. At least 16 bytes, its line breaks at the end aside. Or secret, one of the two, or keys. None when left out: a random key of the process's signs, which a restart forgets.": "保存签发 token 所用 secret 的文件，每次应用配置时读取：处理器 media_tokens 会轮换它，此前签发的每个 token 都会被拒绝。至少 16 字节，末尾的换行不计。或 secret，二者取其一，或 keys。不设置时无：由进程的随机密钥签名，重启后即失效。",
"A file holding username's password, read each time a watch starts.": "包含 username 的密码的文件，每次开始监听（watch）时读取。",
"A file holding username's password, read each time fit authenticates.": "包含 username 的密码的文件，每次 fit 进行认证时读取。",
"A file of header fields sent with each export, one \"Name: value\" a line, as an API key a receiver asks for; read when fit starts. None when left out.": "包含请求头字段的文件，每次导出时随请求发送，每行一个 \"Name: value\"，例如接收端要求的 API 密钥；在 fit 启动时读取。不设置时无此项。",
"A file whose contents are the secret of tokens signed with HS256, HS384 or HS512; at least 32 bytes.": "其内容为用 HS256、HS384 或 HS512 签名的令牌之密钥的文件；至少 32 字节。",
"A keyring of signing keys, each a name and its secret or secret_file, in place of secret or secret_file: a token is signed with one key and checked against every key, so rotating one key, as the handler media_tokens does, refuses only the tokens that key signed and the others stay good. One of the two: keys, or secret/secret_file. None when left out.": "签名密钥的密钥环，每个密钥有一个名称及其 secret 或 secret_file，用来代替 secret 或 secret_file：token 用一个密钥签名，并用每个密钥校验，所以轮换一个密钥（如处理器 media_tokens 所做）只会拒绝该密钥签发的 token，其他 token 保持有效。二者取其一：keys，或 secret/secret_file。不设置时为无。",
"A kubeconfig file to reach the cluster with: its server, CA, client certificate, token or token file. When left out, the pod's service account, inside the cluster, or else $KUBECONFIG or ~/.kube/config. Exec and auth-provider plugins are not supported.": "用于访问集群的 kubeconfig 文件：使用其中的服务器、CA、客户端证书、令牌或令牌文件。不设置时，在集群内使用 Pod 的服务账号，否则使用 $KUBECONFIG 或 ~/.kube/config。不支持 Exec 和 auth-provider 插件。",
"A name unique among the listeners, by which routes refer to this one.": "在各监听器中唯一的名称，路由通过它引用该监听器。",
"A name unique among the routes, for logs and metrics.": "在各路由中唯一的名称，用于日志和指标。",
"A name unique among the services.": "在各服务中唯一的名称。",
"A name unique among the upstreams, by which handlers refer to this one.": "在各上游中唯一的名称，处理器通过它引用该上游。",
"A note about the model its peers show.": "关于其对端所显示的模型的备注。",
"A note about the node its peers show. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change it.": "关于其对端所显示的节点的备注。其页面以及 settings.allow_hub_manage 所允许的中心节点可以修改它。",
"A prefix put before the path, as in \"/v2\".": "加在路径之前的前缀，例如 \"/v2\"。",
"A prefix removed from the request path before it is looked up under the root; a request whose path lacks it gets 404.": "在根目录下查找之前，从请求路径中移除的前缀；路径不含该前缀的请求返回 404。",
"A regular expression in Go's syntax that the path, as escaped (\"/a%20b\", \"/a%2Fb\"), must match for the request to be redirected; the rest go on to the handler. Every request is redirected when left out. A URL made from the request that would leave the site, which to does not, is answered 400: one that starts with \"//\" or \"/\\\", and, when to starts with a group ($1), one with a scheme.": "Go 语法的正则表达式，转义形式的路径（\"/a%20b\"、\"/a%2Fb\"）必须匹配它，请求才会被重定向；其余请求继续交给处理器。不设置时所有请求都被重定向。由请求构成、会离开本站的 URL（to 本身并非如此时）答 400：以 \"//\" 或 \"/\\\" 开头的，以及 to 以分组（$1）开头时带 scheme 的。",
"A regular expression in Go's syntax; each match in the path is replaced with replacement.": "Go 语法的正则表达式；路径中的每处匹配都替换为 replacement。",
"A request field to set to the certificate's subject, as in \"CN=alice,O=Example\", for the handler and the upstream a proxy sends the request to; any the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, is removed, with or without a certificate.": "要设置为证书主题（subject）的请求字段，例如 \"CN=alice,O=Example\"，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用；客户端发送的同名字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）一律被移除，无论是否有证书。",
"A request field to set to the user's name for the handler, and the upstream a proxy sends the request to; any the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, is replaced.": "要设置为用户名的请求字段，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用；客户端发送的同名字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）会被替换。",
"A response that takes longer than this to begin counts as slow; none is when left out.": "开始响应所用时间超过该值的响应计为慢响应；不设置时不统计。",
"A string the plugin reads, for settings of its own.": "插件读取的字符串，用于其自身的设置。",
"A ws or wss listener's path. /tunnel when left out.": "ws 或 wss 监听器的路径。不设置时为 /tunnel。",
"Addresses and prefixes peers may not be at, beyond the internal ranges denied by default; an address with a port denies that port alone.": "加密的 WebSocket，用于将中心节点的控制台页面传送给无法以其他方式访问它们的代理的 web_proxies。需要 console。不设置时无此项。",
"An encrypted WebSocket that carries the hub's console pages to the web_proxies of proxies that cannot reach them otherwise. Needs console. None when left out.": "对端不得位于的地址和前缀，在默认拒绝的内部地址段之外另行添加；带端口的地址仅拒绝该端口。",
"An environment variable holding the password.": "包含密码的环境变量。",
"An expression the request must match, combining matchers with &&, ||, ! and parentheses, as in Host(\"a.example\") && (PathPrefix(\"/api/\") || Method(\"POST\")). Its matchers are Host, Path, PathPrefix, PathRegexp, Method, Header(name, value...), Query(key, value...) and RemoteIP, whose arguments are strings quoted as in Go. It counts as one matcher in the order of routes, and its hosts and paths do not make a route more specific: give it a priority.": "请求必须匹配的表达式，可用 &&、||、! 和括号组合匹配器，例如 Host(\"a.example\") && (PathPrefix(\"/api/\") || Method(\"POST\"))。其匹配器有 Host、Path、PathPrefix、PathRegexp、Method、Header(name, value...)、Query(key, value...) 和 RemoteIP，参数为按 Go 语法加引号的字符串。它在路由排序中算作一个匹配器，其中的主机和路径不会使路由更具体：请为它设置 priority。",
"An upstream that takes the requests when none of the chosen upstream's backends is in rotation, for failing or for its health checks, and one of its own is.": "当所选上游的后端都不在轮转中（因故障或其健康检查）、而它自己有后端在轮转时，接收请求的上游。",
"Anything else the node tells the hubs, which their pages show.": "节点告知中心节点的其他内容，由中心节点的页面显示。",
"Anything else the proxy tells the hubs, which their pages show.": "代理告知中心节点的其他内容，由中心节点的页面显示。",
"Ask clients for certificates and verify them (mutual TLS).": "要求客户端提供证书并验证（双向 TLS）。",
"Audiences of which a token's aud must name one; any when left out.": "令牌的 aud 必须包含其中之一的受众；不设置时接受任意受众。",
"Bounds on the calls the node forwards to its models' upstreams; the defaults when left out.": "对节点转发给其模型上游的调用的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the hub's links; the defaults when left out.": "对中心节点各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the node's links; the defaults when left out.": "对节点各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Bounds on the proxy's links; the defaults when left out.": "对代理各链路的限制；不设置时使用默认值。",
"Certificates from files. A client is given the first whose names match the one it asks for, or the first of all when none does or it asks for none.": "来自文件的证书。客户端获得名称与其请求的名称相匹配的第一个证书；若无一匹配或客户端未请求名称，则获得全部证书中的第一个。",
"Changes to the request's fields, made before the handler, and the upstream a proxy sends the request to, sees them.": "对请求字段的修改，在处理器之前进行，代理转发请求的上游也能看到这些修改。",
"Changes to the response's fields, made just before it is sent, whichever handler wrote it.": "对响应字段的修改，在响应发出前一刻进行，无论由哪个处理器写出。",
"Connect over TLS.": "通过 TLS 连接。",
"Count and time requests by listener and route, for the Admin API's /metrics, which serves the rest of fit's metrics without it; off when left out, since it costs every request a little. Needs admin.": "按监听器和路由统计请求数量与耗时，供 Admin API 的 /metrics 使用；没有它时 /metrics 仍提供 fit 的其余指标；不设置时关闭，因为这会给每个请求增加少许开销。需要 admin。",
"Destinations refused, written as in allow, whatever allow holds.": "被拒绝的目标，写法同 allow，无论 allow 中有什么。",
"Destinations refused, written as in allow, whatever allow holds: a host name that resolves to an address deny holds is refused once it is connected, before anything is sent.": "被拒绝的目标，写法同 allow，无论 allow 中有什么：解析到 deny 所含地址的主机名，在连接建立后、发送任何数据之前即被拒绝。",
"This fit's node ID, which the Admin API's GET /node answers and a manager of many fits knows it by: 1 to 64 letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-', starting with a letter or digit. Left out, fit makes one, a random UUID, once, and keeps it in the store, or without one in a file beside the config, as fit.node-id beside fit.json; set it where neither lasts, as in a container whose config is read-only.": "本 fit 的节点 ID：Admin API 的 GET /node 返回它，管理多个 fit 的管理端以它识别本节点。1 到 64 个字母、数字、'.'、'_' 和 '-'，以字母或数字开头。不设置时，fit 只生成一次（随机 UUID），保存在 store 中；没有 store 时保存在配置旁的文件里，如 fit.json 旁的 fit.node-id。两者都无法持久保存时请设置它，例如配置只读的容器中。",
"Do not serve the dashboard, the read-only web pages at /dashboard/ that show the routes, services, upstreams and their health, certificates and config versions from the Admin API's GET endpoints; served when left out or false.": "不提供仪表盘，即位于 /dashboard/ 的只读网页，通过 Admin API 的 GET 端点展示路由、服务、上游及其健康状况、证书和配置版本；不设置或为 false 时提供。",
"Each address's weight, in the order of addresses: its share of requests under weighted_round_robin, and how many requests it takes to be as busy as an address of weight 1 under least_conn. 1 each when left out.": "各地址的权重，顺序与 addresses 一致：在 weighted_round_robin 下是其获得请求的份额，在 least_conn 下是它需要承担多少请求才算与权重为 1 的地址同样繁忙。不设置时各为 1。",
"Encodings whose compressed twins, name.br, name.zst and name.gz, are served in place of a file to a client that accepts them: the one it prefers by Accept-Encoding, and among equals the first listed. None when left out.": "编码列表，对于接受这些编码的客户端，其压缩副本 name.br、name.zst 和 name.gz 会取代原文件被提供：按客户端 Accept-Encoding 的偏好选择，偏好相同时取列表中靠前的。不设置时无此项。",
"Encrypt every session with this passphrase, 10 to 79 characters, which callers must have too (pbkeylen 16). Unencrypted when left out.": "用此口令加密每个会话，10 到 79 个字符，调用方也必须持有（pbkeylen 为 16）。不设置时不加密。",
"Export the metrics the Admin API's /metrics serves, requests counted included, every interval. No metrics over OTLP when left out.": "每隔一个 interval 导出 Admin API 的 /metrics 所提供的指标，包括请求计数。不设置时不通过 OTLP 导出指标。",
"Fields copied from a 2xx answer onto the request, for the handler and the upstream a proxy sends it to. Any of these the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, are removed, so that it cannot pass them off as the auth service's.": "从 2xx 应答复制到请求上的字段，供处理器以及代理转发请求的上游使用。客户端发送的这些字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）会被移除，使其无法冒充为认证服务所设。",
"Fields to delete: names, or a prefix ending in \"*\", as in \"X-Debug-*\".": "要删除的字段：名称，或以 \"*\" 结尾的前缀，例如 \"X-Debug-*\"。",
"Fields to set, each replacing any of the same name.": "要设置的字段，每个都会替换同名的任何字段。",
"Files and directories left out, by pattern, as files writes them, as trailers or **/extras/**; a directory left out is not walked. None when left out.": "按模式略去的文件和目录，写法与 files 相同，如 trailers 或 **/extras/**；被略去的目录不会被遍历。不设置时为无。",
"Follow symbolic links that lead out of the library's roots. A link that stays within its root is followed either way; one that leads out is refused, and reported, when left out or false.": "跟随指向媒体库根目录之外的符号链接。留在其根目录之内的链接无论如何都会被跟随；不设置或为 false 时，指向外部的链接会被拒绝并报告。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin given the response's body, how much of it the plugin may hold, pausing it to see more, or make it; past it the response fails, or goes on without the plugin when on_error is skip. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "对于获得响应体的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，插件最多可持有多少响应体，暂停以查看更多内容或自行生成；超出后响应失败，或在 on_error 为 skip 时不经该插件继续。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin that exports response callbacks, which it is given: all, the header, the body and the trailer; headers, the header alone, the body going by untouched; none, none of them, the plugin forgetting each request once it has gone on. all when left out.": "对于导出响应回调的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，它获得哪些内容：all，响应头、响应体和尾部（trailer）；headers，仅响应头，响应体原样通过；none，都不提供，请求继续后插件即忘记该请求。不设置时为 all。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin that follows responses, how many an instance follows at once, each keeping its context; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "对于跟踪响应的 Proxy-Wasm 插件，一个实例同时可跟踪多少个，各自保留其上下文；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin, its VM configuration, which it reads as it starts; config is its plugin configuration.": "对于 Proxy-Wasm 插件，其 VM 配置，插件在启动时读取；config 是其插件配置。",
"For a Proxy-Wasm plugin, properties it reads by their path (proxy_get_property), beside the request's own: request.path, request.url_path, request.query, request.host, request.method, request.scheme, request.protocol, source.address and plugin_name.": "对于 Proxy-Wasm 插件，除请求自身的属性外，它按路径读取（proxy_get_property）的属性：request.path、request.url_path、request.query、request.host、request.method、request.scheme、request.protocol、source.address 和 plugin_name。",
"Further URLs the publish and play pages show for a stream, for tools outside the browser, as the streaming role's RTMP, RTSP, SRT and HTTP-FLV ones: {stream} stands for the stream's name, {token} for the page's token, {host} for the host the page was loaded from.": "发布页和播放页为流额外显示的 URL，供浏览器之外的工具使用，如流媒体角色的 RTMP、RTSP、SRT 和 HTTP-FLV 地址：{stream} 代表流的名称，{token} 代表页面的 token，{host} 代表页面加载自的主机。",
"Gzip a file when it is rotated. On when left out.": "切割时用 gzip 压缩文件。不设置时为开启。",
"HTTPS by default: a config that writes no listeners is served over HTTPS on port 443, with certificates obtained with acme for the host names its routes match, and over HTTP on port 80 only to be redirected; a listener whose tls is empty gets certificates for the host names of the routes it serves. On when left out.": "默认启用 HTTPS：未写任何监听器的配置，通过 HTTPS 在 443 端口提供服务，用 acme 为其路由所匹配的主机名获取证书，并仅为重定向而在 80 端口提供 HTTP；tls 为空的监听器会为其所服务路由的主机名获取证书。不设置时为开启。",
"Headers the request must have, each with one of the values listed as the value of one of its fields, or with any value when none are listed. Names ignore case; values do not.": "请求必须具有的请求头，每个请求头的值须是所列值之一，未列出值时可为任意值。名称不区分大小写；值区分大小写。",
"Host names to obtain certificates for with ACME, as the top-level acme says, through its challenges: the CA must reach fit at each name on port 80, where any listener of fit's in the clear answers HTTP-01, or on port 443, where this listener answers TLS-ALPN-01. A client asking for one of these names is given its certificate once there is one; until then, and for other names, the certificates from files.": "通过 ACME 获取证书的主机名，如顶层 acme 所述，经由其挑战（challenge）：CA 必须能在 80 端口访问到各名称对应的 fit，fit 的任何明文监听器在该端口应答 HTTP-01；或在 443 端口，由此监听器应答 TLS-ALPN-01。请求这些名称之一的客户端，在证书就绪后获得该证书；在此之前以及对其他名称，使用来自文件的证书。",
"Host names, exact, or with a leading \"*.\" wildcard, which stands for one label, or a leading \"**.\" wildcard, which stands for one label or more, as the Gateway API's wildcards do.": "主机名，可为精确名称，或以 \"*.\" 通配符开头（代表一个标签），或以 \"**.\" 通配符开头（代表一个或多个标签），与 Gateway API 的通配符一致。",
"How a request's line is written, with the same fields whichever: json, a JSON object; text, time, level, msg and the fields as key=value (logfmt); or line, the time and level, then the fields as key=value, as fit's own log writes lines. A request's level is its status's, as level says. json when left out. A change takes a restart.": "请求行的写法，无论哪种都含相同字段：json，JSON 对象；text，time、level、msg 及各字段，以 key=value 形式（logfmt）；line，先是时间和级别，再是各字段的 key=value，与 fit 自身日志的行格式相同。请求的级别取决于其状态，如 level 所述。不设置时为 json。修改后需重启生效。",
"How certificates are obtained during handshakes, for listeners whose tls sets on_demand: whom to ask whether a name may have one, and how fast and how many.": "握手期间如何获取证书，针对 tls 设置了 on_demand 的监听器：向谁询问某名称能否获得证书，以及速率和数量限制。",
"How certificates for the names listeners list in tls.acme are obtained and renewed; the defaults when left out. Its settings are read when fit starts: a change to them takes effect when fit restarts. The names follow every reload.": "对各监听器在 tls.acme 中列出的名称，如何获取和续期证书；不设置时使用默认值。其设置在 fit 启动时读取：修改后需重启 fit 才生效。名称则在每次重新加载时更新。",
"How each event loop waits while none of its connections has an event ready: park, in Go's network poller, which gives the loop's CPU to other work at once, but on a busy server looks for the loop's events only when a CPU runs out of work or every 10ms; or block, in epoll_wait, which wakes the loop as soon as one arrives. Choose block for a shorter latency tail near saturation over HTTP/1.1, at the cost of the median and a little h2 throughput: proxying an API at 200,000 requests a second on 6 CPUs, block took the HTTP/1.1 p99 from 4.3 to 2.9-3.9ms and the median from 0.95 to 1.57ms, left h2 and the maximum as they were, and served h2 0.9% less at saturation. Linux only. park when left out.": "每个事件循环在其连接都没有就绪事件时如何等待：park，在 Go 的网络轮询器中挂起，立即把该循环的 CPU 让给其他工作，但在繁忙的服务器上，只有某个 CPU 没有工作可做时或每 10ms 才会查看该循环的事件；或 block，在 epoll_wait 中等待，事件一到即被唤醒。若要在接近饱和时缩短 HTTP/1.1 的延迟尾部，可选 block，代价是中位延迟和少量 h2 吞吐：在 6 个 CPU 上以每秒 200,000 个请求代理 API 时，block 使 HTTP/1.1 的 p99 从 4.3 降至 2.9-3.9ms，中位延迟从 0.95 升至 1.57ms，h2 与最大值不变，饱和时 h2 少处理 0.9%。仅限 Linux。未设置时为 park。",
"How far back requests are counted, in ten steps; 10s when left out.": "请求统计回溯多久，分十步；不设置时为 10s。",
"How far exp and nbf may be off, for clocks that differ; none when left out.": "exp 和 nbf 允许偏差多少，用于时钟不一致的情况；不设置时不允许偏差。",
"How fib, the network engine fit serves and dials on, is set up: its event loops, workers and buffers. fib's own defaults for what is left out, and for all of it when engine is. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "fib 的设置方式，fib 是 fit 用于监听和拨出的网络引擎：其事件循环、工作线程和缓冲区。未设置的部分使用 fib 自身的默认值，engine 未设置时全部如此。在 fit 启动时读取：修改后需重启 fit 才生效。",
"How hard the compressors work: fastest, default (gzip 5, zstd's default, brotli 4) or better (gzip 7, zstd's better, brotli 6); default when left out.": "压缩器的压缩力度：fastest、default（gzip 5、zstd 的默认级别、brotli 4）或 better（gzip 7、zstd 的 better、brotli 6）；不设置时为 default。",
"How large a file may grow before it is rotated: a write that would take it past this starts a new file. 1 GiB when left out; 0 does not rotate by size.": "文件长到多大后切割：会使文件超过该值的写入会先开始一个新文件。不设置时为 1 GiB；0 表示不按大小切割。",
"How long a QUIC connection may hear nothing from its peer before it is closed. 30s when left out.": "QUIC 连接在多久收不到对端任何消息后关闭。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a QUIC handshake may take. 10s when left out.": "QUIC 握手最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a TCP or TLS client's connection may stay open without an allocation, before its first Allocate or after its allocation ended, before it is closed. 30s when left out. A change starts a new server.": "TCP 或 TLS 客户端的连接，在没有分配（allocation）的情况下可保持打开多久，即首次 Allocate 之前或其分配结束之后，超时即关闭。不设置时为 30s。修改后会启动新的服务器。",
"How long a WHEP offer may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, its request held, before it is answered 404. Answered 404 at once when left out.": "WHEP offer 等待尚无发布者的流所允许的时长（其请求会被挂起），超时后返回 404。不设置时立即返回 404。",
"How long a call may run; past it the call is stopped and its instance replaced, and the request goes as a failure does (on_error). 100ms when left out.": "一次调用最多可运行多久；超时则调用被停止、其实例被替换，请求按失败处理（on_error）。不设置时为 100ms。",
"How long a call may wait for its response to begin. 5m when left out.": "一次调用等待其响应开始最多可多久。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a client may take from connecting to publishing or playing. 10s when left out.": "客户端从连接到发布或播放所允许的时长。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a connect to a service may take; shorter than a hub's call_timeout, so that the hub hears either way. 5s when left out.": "连接到服务最多可用多久；短于中心节点的 call_timeout，使中心节点无论如何都能收到结果。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a connected peer may be silent, its media and ICE consent checks alike, before its session is ended: a publisher's ends its stream and its viewers. 30s when left out.": "已连接的对端可保持静默多久（媒体和 ICE 同意检查均计入），超时则结束其会话：发布者的会话结束时，其流及其观看者也随之结束。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a connection or a udp session may carry nothing either way before both sides are closed; 10m for a connection and 1m for a udp session when left out.": "连接或 udp 会话在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则两侧都被关闭；不设置时，连接为 10m，udp 会话为 1m。",
"How long a connection to an upstream may take. 10s when left out.": "到上游的连接最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a connection without a session may go without a request before it is closed. 60s when left out.": "没有会话的连接在无请求的情况下可保持多久，超时后关闭。不设置时为 60s。",
"How long a file is written before it is rotated, at the next period boundary of the log's time_zone: 24h turns at midnight, 1h on the hour; a fraction of a second, or a period over 24h that is not a whole number of days, is refused. Off when left out.": "一个文件写多久后切割，在日志 time_zone 的下一个周期边界切割：24h 在午夜切割，1h 在整点切割；小于 1 秒、或超过 24h 但不是整天数的间隔会被拒绝。不设置时不按时间切割。",
"How long a handshake waits for its name's certificate, as long as fib's handshake timeout by default. 10s when left out.": "握手等待其名称的证书最多多久，默认与 fib 的握手超时相同。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a job may wait for the file pool before it is given up, as a request answered 503. 10s when left out.": "作业等待文件池的最长时间，超过即放弃，相应的请求答 503。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a job, an action or an install, may run before it is killed, 10s to 168h. 1h when left out.": "一个作业、操作或安装最多可运行多久，超时则被终止，范围 10s 到 168h。不设置时为 1h。",
"How long a line may wait in the buffer before it is written; 1s when left out.": "一行日志在缓冲区中最多等待多久后写出；不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a link may hear nothing before it is pinged; one that hears nothing for three of them is closed. 15s when left out.": "链路在多久收不到任何消息后发送 ping；连续三个这样的间隔都没有收到任何消息则关闭该链路。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a link may take to register once it is open; it is closed past it. 10s when left out.": "链路在打开后最多可用多久完成注册；超时则关闭。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a link waits after a failed dial, or a lost hub, before it dials again. 3s when left out.": "链路在拨号失败或丢失中心节点后，等待多久再重新拨号。不设置时为 3s。",
"How long a link's dial may take. 5s when left out.": "链路拨号最多可用多久。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a lock outlives an instance that stopped holding it without giving it back; its holder renews it every third of that. At least 10s; 30s when left out.": "锁在持有它的实例停止持有却未归还后，还能存续多久；其持有者每隔该时长的三分之一续期一次。至少 10s；不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a login lasts at most, however busy. 12h when left out.": "一次登录最长持续多久，无论多忙。不设置时为 12h。",
"How long a login lasts without a request. 30m when left out.": "一次登录在没有请求的情况下持续多久。不设置时为 30m。",
"How long a member stays in its room without a heartbeat: the pages send one every third of it. 30s when left out.": "成员在没有心跳的情况下可留在房间多久：页面每隔其三分之一时长发送一次心跳。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a name taken on demand is kept, and renewed, with no handshake asking for it; then it is dropped and no longer counts against max_names, and its certificate stays in the storage for the next handshake that asks for it, which the ask URL must allow again. 168h, a week, when left out.": "按需获取的名称在没有握手请求它的情况下，被保留并续期多久；之后它被丢弃，不再计入 max_names，其证书仍保留在存储中，供下一个请求它的握手使用，而 ask URL 必须再次允许该名称。不设置时为 168h，即一周。",
"How long a node may take to answer the hub: to open a tunnel, or to list or set its services. 15s when left out.": "节点最多可用多久应答中心节点：打开隧道，或列出、设置其服务。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a nonce is good for; a request with an older one is answered 438 with a fresh one. 10m when left out. Applies to the next nonce.": "随机数（nonce）的有效期；带有更旧随机数的请求会收到 438 和一个新的随机数。不设置时为 10m。适用于下一个随机数。",
"How long a peer may send nothing, keep-alives included, before its session ends. 5s when left out.": "对端在不发送任何数据（包括保活）的情况下可保持多久，超时后其会话结束。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a ping may go unanswered before it counts as lost. 5s when left out.": "ping 最多可无应答多久，超时则计为丢失。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a ping may wait for its pong, behind everything sent before it, before the link is taken for too slow and closed. 30s when left out.": "ping 在排在它之前发送的所有内容之后，最多等待其 pong 多久，超时则认为链路过慢并关闭。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a player may outlive its stream's publisher, waiting for the next one. A player ends with its publisher when left out.": "播放器在其流的发布者离开后可继续存活多久，以等待下一个发布者。不设置时，播放器随其发布者一同结束。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. 404 at once for a stream without a publisher when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，对没有发布者的流立即返回 404。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. A caller playing a stream without a publisher is rejected with 1404 when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，播放没有发布者的流的调用方会被 1404 拒绝。",
"How long a player may wait for a stream with no publisher yet, or for the next one after its publisher leaves. A play of a stream without a publisher fails at once when left out.": "播放器等待尚无发布者的流、或等待发布者离开后的下一个发布者所允许的时长。不设置时，播放没有发布者的流会立即失败。",
"How long a playlist request may wait for a stream with no publisher yet. 404 at once when left out.": "播放列表请求等待尚无发布者的流所允许的时长。不设置时立即返回 404。",
"How long a probe may take, connecting included, before it fails; 2s when left out. No longer than interval.": "一次探测（包括连接）最多可用多久，超时则失败；不设置时为 2s。不得超过 interval。",
"How long a proxied connection may carry nothing either way before both sides are closed. 5m when left out.": "被代理的连接在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则两侧都被关闭。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a publisher may send nothing, and a player's output not move, before its connection is closed. 30s when left out.": "发布者在不发送任何数据、播放器的输出也不前进的情况下可保持多久，超时后关闭其连接。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a relayed peer address may send nothing before its relay is closed, whatever its media server sends it; ICE's consent checks, every 5 seconds or so, keep a live one open. 30s when left out.": "被中继的对端地址在没有发送任何数据的情况下，其中继可保持多久后被关闭，无论其媒体服务器向它发送了什么；ICE 的同意检查约每 5 秒一次，可使存活的中继保持打开。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a request may wait for an instance; past it it is answered 503. 1s when left out.": "请求等待实例最多可多久；超时则返回 503。不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a request waits for another's fetch of its response before it goes on to fetch for itself. 5s when left out.": "请求等待另一个请求为其获取响应最多多久，之后改为自行获取。不设置时为 5s。",
"How long a response is fresh for when it gives no lifetime of its own (no s-maxage, max-age or Expires) and its status allows one to be assumed (200, 203, 300, 301, 308, 404, 405, 410, 414, 501): in place of a tenth of the time since its Last-Modified, at most a day, which is used when this is left out.": "响应在没有给出自身生存期（无 s-maxage、max-age 或 Expires）且其状态允许假定一个生存期（200、203、300、301、308、404、405、410、414、501）时，保持新鲜多久：取代自其 Last-Modified 起经过时间的十分之一（至多一天，未设置本项时使用此值）。",
"How long a response may wait for its client to take what it was sent, each time it waits, before the client loses it: its HTTP/1 connection closed, its HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 stream reset. A client that keeps reading, however slowly, is not cut off, and nor is a response that has nothing to send. 30s when left out.": "响应每次等待其客户端接收已发送的内容时，最多可等待多久，超时则客户端丢失该响应：其 HTTP/1 连接被关闭，其 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 流被重置。无论多慢，只要客户端持续读取就不会被切断，没有内容可发送的响应也不会。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a revoke may wait for the secret file's write before it is answered 504; the write, one at a time on a pool of its own, never blocks a worker. 10s when left out.": "一次吊销在返回 504 之前等待 secret 文件写入的最长时间；写入在自己的线程池上一次一个，从不阻塞 worker。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a room's event stream may wait for its browser to take what it was sent before it is cut off. 30s when left out.": "房间的事件流等待其浏览器接收已发送内容所允许的时长，超时后被切断。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a rotated file is kept after it was last written: 720h (30 days) when left out; 0 keeps it until a count or size limit removes it.": "切割出的文件在最后一次写入后保留多久：不设置时为 720h（30 天）；0 表示一直保留，直到数量或总大小上限将其删除。",
"How long a session is kept with nothing relayed for it: from its answer until its peer's first request, and after its last relay ends. Its ufrags are forgotten then, and its URL answers 404. 30s when left out.": "会话在没有任何内容为其中继时保留多久：从其应答到对端的第一个请求，以及其最后一次中继结束之后。届时其 ufrag 被遗忘，其 URL 返回 404。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a session may go without a request, RTCP or, while recording, RTP before it and its connection end; clients are told so in the Session header and send keep-alives. 60s when left out.": "会话在没有请求、RTCP（录制时还包括 RTP）的情况下可保持多久，超时后会话及其连接结束；客户端会在 Session 头中得知该时长并发送保活。不设置时为 60s。",
"How long a session may take from its answer to a connected PeerConnection before it is ended. 30s when left out.": "会话从其应答到连接上 PeerConnection 最多可用多久，超时则结束。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a session may take from its answer to a connected PeerConnection before it is ended; once connected, ICE consent bounds it. 15s when left out.": "会话从其应答到 PeerConnection 建立连接所允许的时长，超时则结束会话；连接建立后由 ICE consent 约束。不设置时为 15s。",
"How long a stream's segmenting runs without a request before it stops. 30s when left out.": "流的切片在没有请求的情况下运行多久后停止。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long a stream, as a model call relayed between roles, may carry nothing either way before it ends. 2m when left out.": "流（即在各角色之间中继的模型调用）在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则结束。不设置时为 2m。",
"How long a token fit issues is good for, unless fit media-token's -ttl says otherwise. 12h when left out.": "fit 签发的 token 的有效期，除非 fit media-token 的 -ttl 另行指定。不设置时为 12h。",
"How long a tunnel may carry nothing either way before it and its connection to the destination are closed. 5m when left out.": "隧道在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则它及其到目标的连接都被关闭。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long a tunnel may carry nothing either way before it is closed. 2h when left out.": "隧道在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则关闭。不设置时为 2h。",
"How long a tunnel, as a WebSocket the proxy has joined to its upstream is, may carry nothing either way before it is closed; 10m when left out.": "隧道（即代理已与其上游连接起来的 WebSocket）在双向都没有数据的情况下可保持多久，超时则关闭；不设置时为 10m。",
"How long a whole response may take, from sending the request to the end of its body; 1h when left out. A request past it before its response began gets 504, and one past it later is cut short.": "整个响应最多可用多久，从发送请求到其响应体结束；不设置时为 1h。响应开始之前超时的请求得到 504，之后超时的则被截断。",
"How long an export may take, connecting included; a batch not sent by then is dropped and counted. 10s when left out.": "一次导出最多可用多久（包括连接）；到时尚未发出的批次被丢弃并计数。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long an idle connection is kept before it is closed; 60s when left out.": "空闲连接在被关闭前保留多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long an idle connection is kept; 60s when left out.": "空闲连接保留多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long an upstream may go silent in the middle of its response before the call is cut short. 5m when left out.": "上游在响应中途可静默多久，超时则调用被截断。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long an upstream may take to begin its response, from when the call starts, its connect included, as a model reading a long prompt does. 5m when left out.": "上游从调用开始（含其连接）到开始响应最多可用多久，例如模型读取长提示词时。不设置时为 5m。",
"How long connecting may take; 5s when left out. A request that times out connecting is answered 504.": "连接最多可用多久；不设置时为 5s。连接超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long each request to Consul may take, connecting included, beyond the five minutes a blocking query waits for a change. 10s when left out.": "向 Consul 发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接），阻塞查询等待变更的五分钟除外。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to etcd may take, connecting included, and a watch to start; a watch then lasts until it fails. 10s when left out.": "向 etcd 发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接），以及一次监听（watch）的启动；监听启动后持续到其失败为止。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to the API server may take, but watches, which last five minutes each. 10s when left out.": "向 API 服务器发出的每个请求最多可用多久，但监听（watch）除外，其每次持续五分钟。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long each request to the CA may take. 30s when left out.": "向 CA 发出的每个请求最多可用多久。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long each request to the store may take, connecting included. 10s when left out.": "向存储发出的每个请求最多可用多久（包括连接）。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long from the start of one probe of an address to the start of the next; 5s when left out.": "从一次对某地址的探测开始，到下一次探测开始之间间隔多久；不设置时为 5s。",
"How long it stays open before letting requests through to try; 30s when left out.": "熔断后保持打开多久，之后才放行请求进行试探；不设置时为 30s。",
"How long listing the containers may take, connecting included. 10s when left out.": "列出容器最多可用多久（包括连接）。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long obtaining one certificate may take, challenges included, before it is given up and tried again later. 10m when left out.": "获取一个证书最多可用多久（包括挑战），超时则放弃并稍后重试。不设置时为 10m。",
"How long opening a connection may take; 10s when left out. A request whose connect times out gets 504.": "建立连接最多可用多长时间；不设置时为 10s。连接超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long past its lifetime a response may still be answered when fetching it again fails, with no response or a 500, 502, 503 or 504, for a response that does not say how long itself (Cache-Control stale-if-error, RFC 5861). None when left out.": "当重新获取响应失败（无响应，或返回 500、502、503、504）时，对于自身未声明时长的响应，在其生命周期结束后仍可继续应答多久（Cache-Control stale-if-error，RFC 5861）。不设置时为无。",
"How long past its lifetime a response may still be answered while the cache fetches it again in the background, for a response that does not say how long itself (Cache-Control stale-while-revalidate, RFC 5861). None when left out. A response that says must-revalidate, proxy-revalidate or s-maxage is never answered stale.": "当缓存在后台重新获取响应时，对于自身未声明时长的响应，在其生命周期结束后仍可继续应答多久（Cache-Control stale-while-revalidate，RFC 5861）。不设置时为无。声明了 must-revalidate、proxy-revalidate 或 s-maxage 的响应绝不会以过期状态应答。",
"How long resolving and connecting to a destination may take. 10s when left out.": "解析并连接目标最多可用多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long resolving and connecting to a destination may take; past it the request is answered 504. 10s when left out.": "解析并连接目标最多可用多长时间；超时则请求返回 504。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long segments are: a stream with video is cut at the first key frame after it. Set it to the key frame interval. 2s when left out.": "分片的时长：含视频的流在其后的第一个关键帧处切分。应设置为关键帧间隔。不设置时为 2s。",
"How long the TURN credentials an answer carries are good for. 1h when left out.": "应答所携带的 TURN 凭据的有效时长。不设置时为 1h。",
"How long the application may go silent in the middle of a response; 60s when left out.": "应用在响应中途最多可静默多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the application may take to begin its response; 60s when left out.": "应用开始响应最多可花多长时间；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the client keeps the cookie, as its Max-Age; until the browser closes when left out.": "客户端保留该 cookie 的时长，即其 Max-Age；不设置时到浏览器关闭为止。",
"How long the hub may take to answer a registration or a call. 10s when left out.": "中心节点应答一次注册或调用最多可花多长时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long the opening of a tunnel may take, through the hub to the node and on to the service. 20s when left out.": "打开一条隧道（经中心节点到节点，再到服务）最多可花多长时间。不设置时为 20s。",
"How long the upstream may go silent in the middle of a response body; 60s when left out.": "上游在响应体中途最多可静默多久；不设置时为 60s。",
"How long the upstream may take, once the request is sent, to begin its response; 60s when left out. A request past it gets 504.": "请求发出后，上游开始响应最多可花多长时间；不设置时为 60s。超时的请求返回 504。",
"How long to wait for the auth service's answer, after which the request is answered 504 Gateway Timeout; 10s when left out. A service that cannot be reached is answered 502 Bad Gateway.": "等待认证服务应答的时长，超时后请求返回 504 Gateway Timeout；不设置时为 10s。无法连接的服务返回 502 Bad Gateway。",
"How long what the handler learned of a request path, the file it names and its validators, is trusted before the disk is looked at again, where no watch reports its changes. On Linux a watch of the directories under the root reports a change within moments, a file written, replaced or removed, a directory renamed, or a symbolic link on the way to the root pointed elsewhere, and what it watches is trusted until it does; this interval is for other systems, and for a file that is a symbolic link, whose target's changes the watch does not see. A file is told by its size, modification and status change times and inode, so one replaced by another of the same size and modification time is seen too. 0 looks at the disk for every request, with no watch, so that a response always carries the file as it is on disk then, also on a network file system, whose changes from other machines no watch sees. 5s when left out.": "在没有监听报告变更时，处理器所获知的请求路径、其对应的文件及其校验信息，在再次查看磁盘之前被信任多久。Linux 上会监听根目录下的目录，变更在片刻内即被报告：文件被写入、替换或删除，目录被改名，或根目录路径上的软链接改了指向；被监听的内容一直信任到监听报告变更为止。这个间隔用于其他平台，以及本身是软链接的文件（监听看不到其目标的变更）。文件按大小、修改时间、状态变更时间和 inode 识别，所以大小和修改时间都不变的替换也能发现。设为 0 时每个请求都查看磁盘、不做监听，响应总是磁盘上当时的文件，网络文件系统上其他机器的写入也一样。不设置时为 5s。",
"How many bytes of files are kept in memory at most; 64 MiB when left out.": "内存中最多保留多少字节的文件；不设置时为 64 MiB。",
"How many bytes of lines may wait to be written; lines past it are dropped. 4 MiB when left out.": "最多可有多少字节的行等待写入；超出的行会被丢弃。不设置时为 4 MiB。",
"How many bytes of responses may wait, across every connection, for clients to take them, the backpressure on them all; past it, every connection stops reading until some go. A number of bytes, or a share of the memory fit may use, such as \"25%\": the machine's, or the container's memory limit where that is lower. Takes effect at start, not on a reload. \"50%\" when left out or 0; 256 MiB where the memory cannot be read.": "所有连接上最多可有多少字节的响应等待客户端接收，即对全部连接的背压；超出后，所有连接都会停止读取，直到有部分被取走。可为字节数，或 fit 可用内存的占比，如 \"25%\"：取本机内存，或容器内存限制（若更低）。启动时生效，重新加载不生效。不设置或为 0 时为 \"50%\"；无法读取内存时为 256 MiB。",
"How many certificates are obtained at once; the rest wait their turn. 2 when left out or 0.": "同时获取多少个证书；其余的排队等待。不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many certificates may be obtained every interval; a handshake past it fails. 10 when left out or 0.": "每个间隔内可获取多少个证书；超出后握手失败。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many event loops each engine waits for its connections' events on, which spread the waits, accepts and wake-ups over cores; the connections' work runs on the workers either way. fib's default when left out or 0: 1 on up to 4 CPUs, 2 on up to 16, and the CPUs divided by 8 on more. Windows has one loop whatever this says.": "每个引擎用多少个事件循环等待其连接的事件，这些循环将等待、accept 和唤醒分散到各个核心上；无论如何，连接的工作都在工作线程上运行。不设置或为 0 时取 fib 的默认值：最多 4 个 CPU 时为 1，最多 16 个时为 2，更多时为 CPU 数除以 8。Windows 无论此值为何都只有一个循环。",
"How many failed requests to an address within fail_timeout take it out of rotation for fail_timeout, as nginx's max_fails does: a connect that failed, an upstream that broke off or timed out. 1 when left out; 0 keeps every address in rotation.": "在 fail_timeout 内对某地址有多少次失败请求，就将其移出轮转 fail_timeout 的时间，与 nginx 的 max_fails 相同：连接失败、上游中断或超时。不设置时为 1；0 表示所有地址始终保持在轮转中。",
"How many idle connections to one address are kept for later requests; 32 when left out, and 0 keeps none.": "为后续请求保留多少个到同一地址的空闲连接；不设置时为 32，0 表示不保留。",
"How many instances of the plugin run calls at once, each with its own memory: the CPUs fit has, at most 16, when left out or 0.": "插件同时运行多少个调用实例，每个实例有各自的内存：不设置或为 0 时为 fit 可用的 CPU 数，最多 16。",
"How many links to the hub carry tunnels; each tunnel goes over one throughout. 10 when left out or 0.": "多少条到中心节点的链路承载隧道；每条隧道始终走其中一条。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many members a room may have; a join past it is answered 503. A room may have twice as many watchers, its members' event streams among them. 16 when left out.": "一个房间最多可有多少成员；超出的加入请求返回 503。房间的观看者可多一倍，成员的事件流也计算在内。不设置时为 16。",
"How many names may have certificates obtained on demand, in all; past it, a handshake for another fails. 1000 when left out or 0.": "总共最多允许按需获取多少个名称的证书；超出后，对其他名称的握手失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How many of the configs applied, the running one included, are kept to be read back. 10 when left out or 0.": "保留多少份已应用的配置（含当前运行的）以供回读。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"How many probes in a row must fail to take an address out of rotation; 2 when left out or 0.": "连续多少次探测失败才将某地址移出轮转；不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many probes in a row must pass to put an address that was out back in; 2 when left out or 0.": "连续多少次探测通过才将已移出的地址放回轮转；不设置或为 0 时为 2。",
"How many requests a key may make at once, after it has been idle: the bucket's size. The rate, rounded up, when left out.": "某个键在空闲之后可一次发出多少个请求：即令牌桶的容量。不设置时为向上取整后的速率。",
"How many requests a second each key may make, on average; at least 0.001.": "每个键平均每秒可发出多少个请求；至少为 0.001。",
"How many requests it lets through, half-open, that must all fare well for it to close; 5 when left out. Others are answered 503 meanwhile.": "半开状态下放行多少个请求，这些请求必须全部成功才会关闭；不设置时为 5。其间其他请求返回 503。",
"How many requests may wait for a connection to one address once its max_conns are busy; one past it is answered 503 at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "当某地址的 max_conns 个连接都在忙时，最多有多少个请求可等待到该地址的连接；超出的请求立即返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests may wait for a connection when max_conns are busy; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "当 max_conns 个连接都在忙时，最多有多少个请求可等待连接；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests may wait for an instance; past it a request is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "最多有多少个请求可等待实例；超出后请求返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How many requests the window must have counted before it can open; 20 when left out.": "窗口须统计多少个请求之后才可打开；不设置时为 20。",
"How many responses are compressed at once; past it, responses go uncompressed, so that the compressors' memory, a few hundred kilobytes each, is bounded. 1024 when left out.": "同时压缩多少个响应；超出后响应不再压缩，以便限制压缩器的内存（每个几百 KB）。不设置时为 1024。",
"How many rooms may have members or watchers at once; a join or a watch past it is answered 503. 64 when left out.": "同时允许多少个房间有成员或观看者；超出的加入或观看请求返回 503。不设置时为 64。",
"How many segments a playlist lists. 6 when left out or 0.": "一个播放列表列出多少个分片。不设置或为 0 时为 6。",
"How many tasks each engine's pool holds waiting for a worker. fib's default, which follows its workers, when left out or 0.": "每个引擎的池中最多有多少个任务等待工作线程。不设置或为 0 时取 fib 的默认值，该值随其工作线程数而定。",
"How many times a request may be sent again after the first; 2 when left out.": "首次之后，一个请求最多可重新发送多少次；不设置时为 2。",
"How many workers an idle pool keeps, rather than retiring every one and starting them again when work arrives. None when left out or 0.": "空闲的池保留多少个工作线程，而不是全部退出再在有工作到来时重新启动。不设置或为 0 时为无。",
"How messages are written, those of every logger loggers does not set one for, as fib writes its own: line, the time, level and message, then the attributes as key=value; text, every part as key=value (logfmt); or json, a JSON object a line. Each carries the logger's name as logger. line when left out. A change takes a restart.": "消息的写入方式，适用于 loggers 未为其设置格式的每个日志器，与 fib 自身的写法一致：line，时间、级别和消息，随后是 key=value 形式的属性；text，每个部分都是 key=value（logfmt）；或 json，每行一个 JSON 对象。每条都带有日志器名称，字段为 logger。不设置时为 line。更改需重启。",
"How often a quiet QUIC connection is pinged, so that it neither idles out nor loses its NAT mapping. 10s when left out.": "多久对空闲的 QUIC 连接发一次 ping，使其既不会空闲超时，也不会丢失 NAT 映射。不设置时为 10s。",
"How often spans are exported, and sooner when 256 KiB of them wait. 5s when left out.": "多久导出一次 span，当积压达到 256 KiB 时会更早导出。不设置时为 5s。",
"How often the JWK set is fetched again; 1h when left out. A token naming a kid the set does not have has it fetched sooner, at most every 10s.": "多久重新获取一次 JWK 集；不设置时为 1h。令牌中的 kid 若不在该集中，则会提前重新获取，最频繁为每 10s 一次。",
"How often the catalog is read again whether or not it changed. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有变化，多久重新读取一次目录。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the containers are listed again whether or not an event came, in case one was missed. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有事件到来，多久重新列出一次容器，以防遗漏事件。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the keys are read again whether or not a watch event came. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有监视事件到来，多久重新读取一次键。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the metrics are exported. 30s when left out.": "多久导出一次指标。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the node reads its hardware again, 5s to 1h. 30s when left out.": "节点多久重新读取一次其硬件信息，范围 5s 到 1h。不设置时为 30s。",
"How often the roots are scanned again, at least 10s; a scan also runs when the library is made, when the config changes its roots, patterns or bounds, and on the Admin API's POST /media/library/<name>/rescan. A file whose size and time are unchanged is not probed again. 10m when left out.": "重新扫描根目录的间隔，至少 10s；媒体库创建时、配置修改其根目录、模式或上限时，以及 Admin API 的 POST /media/library/<name>/rescan 也会触发扫描。大小和时间都未变的文件不会再次探测。不设置时为 10m。",
"How often the round trip to the hub is measured. 5s when left out.": "多久测量一次到中心节点的往返时间。不设置时为 5s。",
"How often what the keys provide is sent again whether or not it changed, so that a part refused because of the rest of the config is tried again. 30s when left out.": "无论是否有变化，多久重新发送一次这些键所提供的内容，以便因配置其余部分而被拒绝的部分得到重试。不设置时为 30s。",
"How requests are matched, and what handles them.": "请求如何匹配，以及由什么处理。",
"How requests are spread over the addresses: round_robin, in turn; weighted_round_robin, in turn by weight (smoothly, as nginx does); least_conn, to the address with the fewest requests under way for its weight; random, at random by weight; p2c, to the less busy for its weight of two addresses chosen at random; ip_hash, uri_hash, header_hash and cookie_hash, by a consistent hash of the client's IP address, the request's path and query, the header hash_key names or the cookie it names, so that the same key goes to the same address while it is up, and adding or removing an address moves only the keys that went to it or will. A request without the header or cookie goes in turn. round_robin when left out, or weighted_round_robin when weights are given.": "请求如何分配到各地址：round_robin，依次轮流；weighted_round_robin，按权重依次轮流（平滑，与 nginx 相同）；least_conn，分给按权重计算正在处理请求最少的地址；random，按权重随机；p2c，在随机选出的两个地址中分给按权重计算较空闲的一个；ip_hash、uri_hash、header_hash 和 cookie_hash，分别按客户端 IP 地址、请求的路径和查询、hash_key 所指定的请求头或其所指定的 cookie 做一致性哈希，使相同的键在地址可用期间始终到同一地址，增删地址时只移动原本或将要分到该地址的键。没有该请求头或 cookie 的请求按轮流分配。不设置时为 round_robin，给出权重时为 weighted_round_robin。",
"How requests reach the upstream: http/1.1 in the clear, h2c (HTTP/2 in the clear, which the servers must expect), or h2 (TLS, with HTTP/2 when the server chooses it through ALPN and HTTP/1.1 otherwise). http/1.1 when left out.": "请求如何到达上游：http/1.1 明文，h2c（明文 HTTP/2，服务器必须预期此方式），或 h2（TLS，服务器通过 ALPN 选择时使用 HTTP/2，否则使用 HTTP/1.1）。不设置时为 http/1.1。",
"How the logger's messages are written: line, text or json, as the log's format. A change takes a restart.": "日志器的消息如何写入：line、text 或 json，含义同日志的 format。更改需重启。",
"IP addresses and CIDR prefixes, as in \"10.0.0.0/8\", the client's address must be in: the address of the connection, not of X-Forwarded-For.": "客户端地址必须在其中的 IP 地址和 CIDR 前缀，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"：指连接的地址，而非 X-Forwarded-For。",
"Instead of the password, its bcrypt hash, as fit hash-password makes it: Basic and the query's user and pass only, checked off fib's workers. A password once found right is remembered, as a keyed SHA-256, so that the next check is at once.": "用密码的 bcrypt 哈希代替密码，由 fit hash-password 生成：仅适用于 Basic 以及查询参数中的 user 和 pass，在 fib 的 worker 之外校验。校验通过的密码会以带密钥的 SHA-256 形式记住，下次校验即可立即完成。",
"Instead of the password, the long-term key it derives, as coturn's turnadmin -k prints it: MD5(name \":\" realm \":\" password) in hex, optionally after 0x, so that the password is not kept.": "不使用密码，而是使用由它派生的长期密钥，与 coturn 的 turnadmin -k 输出相同：MD5(name \":\" realm \":\" password) 的十六进制，可带 0x 前缀，这样就不必保存密码。",
"Instead of the token, its SHA-256 in hex, so that the config does not hold it, as sha256sum prints it for the token alone, without a newline: printf %s \"$TOKEN\" | sha256sum.": "用 token 的十六进制 SHA-256 代替 token，使配置中不保存 token 本身，其值与 sha256sum 对 token 单独（不含换行）的输出一致：printf %s \"$TOKEN\" | sha256sum。",
"Its share of the requests, against the others' weights.": "其占请求的份额，相对于其他项的权重而言。",
"Its value.": "其值。",
"Keep accounts, keys and certificates in Redis, etcd or Consul instead of a directory, for instances of fit on several hosts: one instance obtains a certificate, holding a lock there, and the others take it from there; each challenge's answer is kept there too, so that whichever instance the CA reaches answers it. Not with storage.": "将账户、密钥和证书保存在 Redis、etcd 或 Consul 中而不是目录里，用于多主机上的 fit 实例：一个实例获取证书时在那里持有锁，其他实例从那里取用；每个质询的应答也保存在那里，这样无论 CA 访问到哪个实例，都能应答。不能与 storage 同时使用。",
"Keep each client on one address with a cookie: a request whose cookie names an address that is up goes there, and any other gets the cookie for the address it went to. No cookie when left out.": "用 cookie 将每个客户端固定在一个地址：cookie 指向某个可用地址的请求会到该地址，其他请求则会得到其所到地址对应的 cookie。不设置时不使用 cookie。",
"Keep the config encrypted in a file of its own, the store, which is the base config fit runs from then on: every config applied is written to it, and what this file sets beside admin is only the store's first content, used when the store does not exist yet. Left out, the config lives in this file.": "将配置加密保存在其自身的文件即存储（store）中，它是此后 fit 运行所依据的基础配置：每次应用的配置都会写入其中，而本文件中除 admin 外的设置仅作为存储的初始内容，在存储尚不存在时使用。不设置时，配置保存在本文件中。",
"Keep the model without serving it.": "保留模型但不提供服务。",
"Keep them in Consul's KV store, with locks held by sessions.": "将其保存在 Consul 的 KV 存储中，锁由会话持有。",
"Keep them in Redis, a standalone server or a primary (not Redis Cluster), with locks of SET NX and an expiry.": "将其保存在 Redis（独立服务器或主节点，不支持 Redis Cluster）中，锁使用 SET NX 和过期时间。",
"Keep them in etcd, through its v3 JSON gateway, with locks held by leases.": "通过 etcd 的 v3 JSON 网关将其保存在 etcd 中，锁由租约持有。",
"Layer 4 services: the upstreams the connections of tcp listeners are proxied to, byte for byte, and the datagrams of udp listeners, one for one.": "第 4 层服务：tcp 监听器的连接按字节原样代理到的上游，以及 udp 监听器的数据报一对一转发到的上游。",
"Leave the Authorization field, with the password, on the request the handler sees; it is removed when left out.": "在处理器看到的请求上保留带密码的 Authorization 字段；不设置时会将其移除。",
"Leave the endpoint out of the dials, keeping it for later.": "将该端点从拨号列表中去掉，留待以后使用。",
"Let a request without a certificate through as well, unauthenticated; refused with 403 Forbidden when left out.": "同时放行没有证书的请求，视为未认证；不设置时以 403 Forbidden 拒绝。",
"Let linked hubs manage the node: edit its models, change GPU settings, run its fixed actions and follow their jobs. Never its own settings, and never a command of their own. Off when left out.": "允许已关联的中心节点管理该节点：编辑其模型、更改 GPU 设置、运行其固定操作并跟踪其作业。绝不能改其自身设置，也绝不能执行其自带的命令。不设置时为关闭。",
"Lets every request that misses fetch for itself. When left out, a request that misses while another fetches the same response waits for that fetch, up to lock_timeout, and is answered from what it keeps (a cache lock), so that many requests for a response not kept make one fetch.": "让每个未命中的请求各自去获取。不设置时，若某请求未命中而另一请求正在获取同一响应，则它会等待该次获取，最长 lock_timeout，然后用其保存的内容应答（缓存锁），这样对未缓存响应的大量请求只会产生一次获取。",
"Limits that apply to every listener.": "适用于每个监听器的限制。",
"List a directory that has no index file, rather than answering 404. Files whose names start with a dot are left out.": "当目录没有索引文件时列出其内容，而不是返回 404。名称以点开头的文件不会列出。",
"Listen listen_tcp and listen_tls with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default; listen's UDP sockets have none. A change of it starts a new server and drains the old one.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 listen_tcp 和 listen_tls，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭；listen 的 UDP 套接字没有该功能。更改它会启动新服务器并排空旧服务器。",
"Listen the Admin API with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default; a Unix socket has no paths.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 Admin API，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭；Unix 套接字没有路径可用。",
"Listen the RTMP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 RTMP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the RTSP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听 RTSP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the console with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听控制台，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listen the listener's TCP connections with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not; a client without Multipath TCP falls back too. Off by default: a listener is plain TCP. udp listeners and HTTP/3 take none.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听该监听器的 TCP 连接，不支持时回退到普通 TCP；没有多路径 TCP 的客户端也会回退。不设置时为关闭：监听器就是普通 TCP。udp 监听器和 HTTP/3 没有该功能。",
"Listen the pages with Multipath TCP where the kernel offers it (Linux 5.6+, net.mptcp.enabled), falling back to plain TCP where it does not. Off by default.": "在内核支持时（Linux 5.6+、net.mptcp.enabled）以多路径 TCP（Multipath TCP）监听页面，不支持时回退到普通 TCP。不设置时为关闭。",
"Listeners, routes, services and upstreams from a Kubernetes cluster's Gateway API resources: the Gateways of the GatewayClasses whose controllerName is fit's, and their HTTPRoutes, GRPCRoutes, TLSRoutes, TCPRoutes and UDPRoutes, whose status fit writes back.": "来自 Kubernetes 集群 Gateway API 资源的监听器、路由、服务和上游：controllerName 为 fit 的 GatewayClass 下的 Gateway，及其 HTTPRoute、GRPCRoute、TLSRoute、TCPRoute 和 UDPRoute，fit 会回写它们的状态。",
"Listeners, routes, upstreams and services from the keys under a prefix in Consul's KV store, each holding a JSON object of them.": "来自 Consul KV 存储中某前缀下各键的监听器、路由、上游和服务，每个键保存其中的一个 JSON 对象。",
"Listeners, routes, upstreams and services from the keys under a prefix in etcd, each holding a JSON object of them.": "来自 etcd 中某前缀下各键的监听器、路由、上游和服务，每个键保存其中的一个 JSON 对象。",
"Local addresses that serve a hub's console pages through its encrypted console_socket.": "通过中心节点加密的 console_socket 提供其控制台页面的本地地址。",
"Local addresses whose connections are tunneled to a node's service.": "其连接被隧道转发到某节点服务的本地地址。",
"Make no listener in the clear to redirect to HTTPS. ACME's HTTP-01 challenge is then answered by none, and certificates come through TLS-ALPN-01.": "不创建明文监听器来重定向到 HTTPS。这样 ACME 的 HTTP-01 质询无人应答，证书改经 TLS-ALPN-01 获取。",
"Mark the cookie Secure, so that it is sent only over HTTPS. It is always HttpOnly and SameSite=Lax.": "将该 cookie 标记为 Secure，使其仅通过 HTTPS 发送。它始终为 HttpOnly 和 SameSite=Lax。",
"Methods, as in \"GET\"; compared as written, since methods are case-sensitive.": "方法，如 \"GET\"；按原样比较，因为方法区分大小写。",
"Middleware a request passes through, in order, before the handler.": "请求在到达处理器之前依次经过的中间件。",
"More parameters for the application, set after fit's own.": "应用的更多参数，在 fit 自身的参数之后设置。",
"Named libraries of media files: directories scanned into a catalog of items, each a title with its renditions, audio, subtitles and poster, probed off fib's workers on a bounded file pool of the library's own, and read by the Admin API's /media/library. None when left out: no files are scanned or served.": "命名的媒体文件库：将目录扫描成条目目录（catalog），每个条目是一部作品及其各个版本（rendition）、音轨、字幕和海报；在媒体库自己的有界文件池上探测，不占用 fib 的 worker，并由 Admin API 的 /media/library 读取。不设置时为无：不扫描也不提供任何文件。",
"Named policies of who may publish and play which streams, with tokens, users and keys for tokens fit signs: the handlers and roles that take media (whip, whep, webrtc_proxy) refer to one with their auth param. A handler without auth lets everyone in, as the route's middleware allow.": "具名策略，规定谁可以发布和播放哪些流，包含 token、用户以及 fit 所签发 token 的密钥：接收媒体的处理器和角色（whip、whep、webrtc_proxy）通过其 auth 参数引用某个策略。没有 auth 的处理器放行所有人，由路由的中间件决定。",
"Obtain a certificate during the handshake for a name a client asks for that neither the files nor acme have, as the top-level acme.on_demand allows; needs it.": "当客户端请求的名称既不在文件中也不在 acme 中时，在握手期间获取其证书，与顶层 acme.on_demand 允许的相同；需要它。",
"On Linux, move a large upload (128KB or more, framed by its Content-Length) from a client's HTTP/1.1 connection without TLS to an HTTP/1.1 upstream without TLS with splice(2), the kernel passing its pages from one socket to the other, rather than copying it through the proxy. An upload that cannot go so, to an h2, h2c or TLS upstream, or chunked, goes the ordinary way. It costs the proxy about 40% less CPU on such uploads and the upstream about 5% more, which reads the body cold rather than as the proxy just wrote it, and more once the upstream itself is the bottleneck: false suits an upstream whose CPU is scarcer than the proxy's. False copies every upload. True when left out.": "在 Linux 上，用 splice(2) 把较大的上传（128KB 及以上、以 Content-Length 定界）从客户端不带 TLS 的 HTTP/1.1 连接搬到不带 TLS 的 HTTP/1.1 上游，由内核把页从一个 socket 交给另一个，而不经代理拷贝。不能这样走的上传（发往 h2、h2c 或 TLS 上游的，或 chunked 的）照常经代理转发。这样代理处理此类上传的 CPU 约少 40%，上游约多 5%（它读到的是冷数据，而不是代理刚写入的），上游本身成为瓶颈时会更多：上游 CPU 比代理更紧张时宜设为 false。为 false 时所有上传都拷贝。不设置时为 true。",
"OpenTelemetry: traces of requests, with W3C trace context sent on to upstreams, and metrics, exported over OTLP/HTTP to a collector. Neither when left out. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "OpenTelemetry：请求的追踪（W3C trace context 会继续传给上游）和指标，通过 OTLP/HTTP 导出到收集器。不设置时两者均无。在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"PEM files of public keys or certificates (RSA, ECDSA or Ed25519) tokens are verified with.": "用于验证令牌的公钥或证书（RSA、ECDSA 或 Ed25519）的 PEM 文件。",
"PEM files of the certificate authorities a client's certificate must chain to. They are watched as certificate files are: a change loads the config again.": "客户端证书必须链到的证书颁发机构的 PEM 文件。它们与证书文件一样受监视：变更会重新加载配置。",
"Paths tried in turn for a request, as nginx's try_files: {path} stands for the request's path, and one ending in / for a directory, served by its index file. The first that exists is served, and when none does the answer is 404; [\"{path}\", \"{path}/\", \"/index.html\"] serves a single-page app. A directory asked for without its slash is not redirected then.": "依次为请求尝试的路径，与 nginx 的 try_files 相同：{path} 代表请求的路径，以 / 结尾的代表目录，由其索引文件提供。提供第一个存在的，都不存在时应答 404；[\"{path}\", \"{path}/\", \"/index.html\"] 可提供单页应用。此时请求目录而不带斜杠不会被重定向。",
"Paths tried in turn, as nginx's try_files, for the script to run: {path} stands for the request's path, and the first whose script exists under root runs; [\"{path}\", \"{path}/index.php\", \"/index.php\"] sends what is no script of its own to the front controller, as most PHP applications want. Looked up on a pool of goroutines of its own. Left out, the path runs as it is.": "依次尝试的路径，与 nginx 的 try_files 相同，用于确定要运行的脚本：{path} 代表请求的路径，第一个其脚本存在于 root 下的路径会被运行；[\"{path}\", \"{path}/index.php\", \"/index.php\"] 会把本身不是脚本的请求交给前端控制器，大多数 PHP 应用都需要如此。在其自有的 goroutine 池上查找。不设置时，路径按原样运行。",
"Paths, exact or ending in \"*\" to match a prefix.": "路径，精确匹配，或以 \"*\" 结尾以匹配前缀。",
"Prefixes to take off the path: the first that the path starts with, at a segment boundary, is removed, and what is left starts with '/'. \"/api\" makes \"/api/users\" \"/users\" and \"/api\" \"/\", and leaves \"/apix\" alone.": "要从路径中去掉的前缀：路径在段边界处所匹配的第一个前缀会被移除，剩余部分以 '/' 开头。\"/api\" 使 \"/api/users\" 变为 \"/users\"、\"/api\" 变为 \"/\"，而 \"/apix\" 保持不变。",
"Probe each address on a schedule, and take one that fails its probes out of rotation until it passes them again; no probes when left out. Probes and max_fails take an address out each on their own account.": "按计划探测每个地址，并将探测失败的地址移出轮转，直到其再次通过探测；不设置时不探测。探测和 max_fails 各自独立地将地址移出。",
"Put media servers behind fit: the UDP port the webrtc_proxy handler's answers name, which relays each peer to the media server that answered it, found by the ICE ufrag of the peer's first STUN request. Routes with webrtc_proxy handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "将媒体服务器置于 fit 之后：webrtc_proxy 处理器的应答所指明的 UDP 端口，它按对端首个 STUN 请求的 ICE ufrag 找到应答它的媒体服务器，并将每个对端中继到该服务器。没有它时，带 webrtc_proxy 处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"Query parameters the request must have, each with one of the values listed, or with any value when none are listed; compared once unescaped.": "请求必须带有的查询参数，每个参数取所列值之一；未列出值时可取任意值；在反转义后比较。",
"Refuse to connect where an address, or the address its host name resolves to, is loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified, multicast or the host's own, decided once each connection is open and before anything is sent on it; a request refused so gets 502, as one whose connect fails. For addresses others choose: the Kubernetes provider sets it on the upstreams of ExternalName Services. Off when left out.": "拒绝连接到这样的地址：地址本身或其主机名解析出的地址是环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定、组播地址或本机自己的地址，在每个连接打开之后、发送任何内容之前判断；被这样拒绝的请求得到 502，与连接失败的请求相同。用于由他人选择的地址：Kubernetes provider 为 ExternalName Service 的 upstream 设置它。不设置时关闭。",
"Regular expressions in Go's syntax, matched against the path anywhere in it unless anchored with ^ and $.": "Go 语法的正则表达式，在路径的任意位置匹配，除非用 ^ 和 $ 锚定。",
"Request fields to set to claims, as {\"X-User\": \"sub\"}: a string as it is, anything else as JSON. Any of these fields the client sent, also spelled with _ for -, are removed, with or without the claim.": "要设置为声明（claim）值的请求字段，如 {\"X-User\": \"sub\"}：字符串按原样，其他类型按 JSON。客户端发送的这些字段（包括以 _ 代替 - 的写法）无论有无对应声明都会被移除。",
"Response headers. Content-Type defaults to text/plain; charset=utf-8 when there is a body.": "响应头。有响应体时 Content-Type 默认为 text/plain; charset=utf-8。",
"Retries allowed each second beyond budget_ratio, so that a proxy taking few requests may still retry; 10 when left out.": "在 budget_ratio 之外每秒允许的重试次数，使接收请求很少的代理仍可重试；不设置时为 10。",
"Retries may add at most this share of the requests the proxy takes, so that retries cannot multiply the load on an upstream already failing; 0.2 when left out.": "重试最多可占代理所接收请求的这一比例，使重试不会成倍加重已在失败的上游的负载；不设置时为 0.2。",
"Rotate the file log.output names, and remove old rotated files: the size and interval a file is rotated at, and the age, count and total size past which rotated files are removed. None when left out: the file grows without bound, as before.": "切割 log.output 指定的文件并清理旧的切割文件：文件按多大、按什么间隔切割，以及超过多长时间、多少个文件、多大总量后删除旧的切割文件。不设置时不做任何切割：文件会像以前一样无限增长。",
"Rotate the file output names, and remove old rotated files: the size and interval a file is rotated at, and the age, count and total size past which rotated files are removed. None when left out: the file grows without bound, as before.": "切割 output 指定的文件并清理旧的切割文件：文件按多大、按什么间隔切割，以及超过多长时间、多少个文件、多大总量后删除旧的切割文件。不设置时不做任何切割：文件会像以前一样无限增长。",
"Rotate this logger's file, when output names one of its own; the log's rotate is used when the logger writes to the log's output. The settings are the log's rotate's.": "当 output 指定该 logger 自己的文件时，切割这个文件；logger 写向日志的 output 时使用日志的 rotate。设置项与日志的 rotate 相同。",
"Routes with a higher priority are picked first; among equal ones, the most specific host, then path, then the one with the most other matchers set (method, header, query, remote_ip, path_regexp, expr), then the one written first.": "优先级较高的路由优先选取；优先级相同时，依次取最具体的 host、最具体的路径、设置了最多其他匹配器（method、header、query、remote_ip、path_regexp、expr）的路由，最后取写在最前面的。",
"Routes, upstreams and services from the labels of running Docker containers.": "来自运行中 Docker 容器标签的路由、上游和服务。",
"Routes, upstreams and services from the tags of the services in a Consul catalog, sending to their instances whose health checks pass.": "来自 Consul 目录中各服务标签的路由、上游和服务，发送到其健康检查通过的实例。",
"Run GPU settings, tool installs and actions that need root with sudo -n when fit does not run as root; sudo must not ask for a password. On when left out.": "当 fit 不以 root 运行时，用 sudo -n 运行需要 root 的 GPU 设置、工具安装和操作；sudo 不得询问密码。不设置时为开启。",
"Run a TURN server (RFC 8656), which relays UDP for WebRTC peers and other ICE agents that cannot reach each other directly. None when left out.": "运行 TURN 服务器（RFC 8656），为无法直接互通的 WebRTC 对端和其他 ICE 代理中继 UDP。不设置时为无。",
"Run a hub: nodes and proxies link to it, and it joins a proxy's tunnels to a node's.": "运行中心节点：节点和代理链接到它，由它连接代理的隧道与节点的隧道。",
"Run a hub: nodes and proxies link to it, and it passes calls between them.": "运行中心节点：节点和代理链接到它，由它在两者之间传递调用。",
"Run a node: it links to hubs and opens the tunnels they ask for to the services it exposes.": "运行节点：它链接到各中心节点，并按其要求打开到其所暴露服务的隧道。",
"Run a node: it serves models from local or remote upstreams to the hubs and proxies linked to it.": "运行节点：它将本地或远程上游的模型提供给链接到它的中心节点和代理。",
"Run a proxy: an OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible API, for agents, that calls the models of the nodes it reaches.": "运行代理：为智能体提供兼容 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 的 API，调用其所能到达的节点的模型。",
"Run a proxy: local ports and web proxies forwarded through a hub to the services of a node.": "运行代理：本地端口和 Web 代理经由中心节点转发到某节点的服务。",
"Run fit as a WebRTC media server: the UDP port the PeerConnections of the whip and whep handlers share, the ICE servers told to their peers, and their limits. Routes with whip or whep handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "将 fit 作为 WebRTC 媒体服务器运行：whip 和 whep 处理器的 PeerConnection 共用的 UDP 端口、告知其对端的 ICE 服务器，以及其限制。没有它时，带 whip 或 whep 处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"STUN and TURN servers the pages' PeerConnections use, as a browser's iceServers. None when left out: fit's media server is an ICE lite agent that browsers reach directly, and tells them of its own ICE servers in its answers' Link headers.": "页面的 PeerConnection 使用的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，即浏览器的 iceServers。不设置时为无：fit 的媒体服务器是 ICE lite 代理，浏览器可直接访问，并会在应答的 Link 头中告知其自身的 ICE 服务器。",
"STUN and TURN servers the peers are told of in Link headers (RFC 9725), for their side of ICE; fit's is an ICE lite agent on its own address.": "在 Link 头（RFC 9725）中告知对端的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，供其 ICE 使用；fit 自身是位于其自有地址上的 ICE lite 代理。",
"STUN and TURN servers the peers are told of in Link headers (RFC 9725), for their side of ICE; fit's side needs none, as it is an ICE lite agent on its own address.": "通过 Link 头（RFC 9725）告知对端的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器，供其一侧的 ICE 使用；fit 一侧不需要，因为它在自己的地址上是 ICE lite 代理。",
"Send a copy of a share of the requests whose bodies arrive whole (64KB at most) to another upstream, and drop its answers. At most 256 copies are under way at once; past that, requests are not copied. The requests themselves do not wait for their copies.": "将一部分请求的副本（其请求体须完整到达，最大 64KB）发送到另一个上游，并丢弃其应答。同时最多有 256 个副本在途；超出后不再复制请求。请求本身不等待其副本。",
"Send a request that failed again, to the backend the upstream picks next: one whose connection could not be made, whatever its method, and, for GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, TRACE, PUT and DELETE, one that failed before its response began or was answered with a status of statuses. A request whose body streams (past 64KB, or still arriving) is never sent again. No retries when left out.": "将失败的请求重新发送到上游接着选取的后端：连接未能建立的请求，无论其方法；对于 GET、HEAD、OPTIONS、TRACE、PUT 和 DELETE，还包括在响应开始前失败，或应答状态码属于 statuses 的请求。请求体为流式（超过 64KB，或仍在到达）的请求绝不会重新发送。不设置时不重试。",
"Send each upstream connection a PROXY protocol header of this version (v1, text, or v2, binary) first, naming the client's address and the one it connected to. For tcp listeners.": "先向每个上游连接发送此版本的 PROXY 协议头（v1，文本；或 v2，二进制），写明客户端地址及其所连接的地址。用于 tcp 监听器。",
"Send requests to the backends of ExternalName Services, to the host name each names, refusing one that is loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified or multicast, by address or by the address the name resolves to, or the host's own: whoever may create a Service could otherwise point a route at fit's Admin API or the cloud's metadata service. Off when left out: a backend that is an ExternalName Service is not resolved, and its route says so in its status.": "把请求发送到 ExternalName Service 的后端，即它所指的主机名；但拒绝本身是或解析为环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定或组播地址，或本机自己地址的后端：否则任何能创建 Service 的人都能让路由指向 fit 的 Admin API 或云的元数据服务。不设置时关闭：ExternalName Service 后端不会被解析，其路由在 status 中说明原因。",
"Send to the port a container's port is published on, on the host, rather than to the container's own address: for a fit outside Docker that cannot reach containers' addresses, as on Docker Desktop.": "发送到容器端口在主机上发布的端口，而不是容器自身的地址：适用于无法访问容器地址的 Docker 外部的 fit，如 Docker Desktop。",
"Sent as Access-Control-Allow-Origin, as \"*\", for players on other origins. None when left out.": "作为 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 发送，如 \"*\"，供其他源的播放器使用。不设置时为无。",
"Sent as Access-Control-Allow-Origin, which a web player on another origin (flv.js, mpegts.js) needs, as \"*\". None when left out.": "作为 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 发送，其他源的网页播放器（flv.js、mpegts.js）需要它，如 \"*\"。不设置时为无。",
"Serve Ingresses too: those whose ingressClassName, or kubernetes.io/ingress.class annotation, names an IngressClass whose controller is controller_name, and those naming none when such a class is the default. Their rules are served on http_port, and on https_port for the hosts of their tls, with the certificates of its Secrets. fit's account then needs to list and watch Ingresses and IngressClasses. No Ingresses when left out.": "同时处理 Ingress：其 ingressClassName 或 kubernetes.io/ingress.class 注解指定了控制器为 controller_name 的 IngressClass 的，以及在此类为默认时未指定任何类的。其规则在 http_port 上提供，其 tls 的主机则在 https_port 上提供，使用其 Secret 中的证书。此时 fit 的账户需要列出和监视 Ingress 与 IngressClass。不设置时不处理 Ingress。",
"Serve TLS, with these certificates: the listener's HTTP is HTTPS.": "提供 TLS，使用这些证书：监听器的 HTTP 即为 HTTPS。",
"Serve the console, web pages behind a user name and password from which the whole config, admin aside, is read and changed; off when left out.": "提供控制台，即需用户名和密码访问的网页，可从中读取和更改整个配置（admin 除外）；不设置时为关闭。",
"Serve the pages: the index, the call, the publish and the play pages, and their script and style. False serves none of them: their paths answer 404, for a deployment whose page is its own; the login and the room API stay, for that page. True when left out.": "提供这些页面：首页、通话、推流和播放页，以及它们的脚本和样式。为 false 时一个都不提供：这些路径返回 404，供使用自有页面的部署使用；登录和房间 API 仍然可用。不设置时为 true。",
"Settings of some loggers of their own, by name (those levels lists), over level, output, format and rotate: engine's to a file of its own, say, or access_log's as json.": "按名称（levels 中列出的那些）为部分 logger 单独设置，覆盖 level、output、format 与 rotate：例如让 engine 写到自己的文件，或让 access_log 写成 json。",
"Show a login form for the users of the auth policy: a right password is answered with a token the policy signs, for its token_ttl, set as the HttpOnly cookie fit_media_token (SameSite=Strict, Secure over TLS), which the WHIP, WHEP and HLS requests of the pages carry, and handed to the page too. Without it the pages ask for a token instead, as fit media-token prints, when auth needs one.": "为 auth 策略的用户显示登录表单：密码正确时返回一个由该策略签发的 token，有效期为其 token_ttl，并设置为 HttpOnly cookie fit_media_token（SameSite=Strict，TLS 下为 Secure），页面的 WHIP、WHEP 和 HLS 请求会携带它，同时也交给页面。不设置时，若 auth 需要 token，页面会要求提供 token，可由 fit media-token 输出。",
"Sources of routes, upstreams, services and listeners other than this file and the Admin API, merged into the config: what this config writes wins over every provider, and a provider over those listed after it; a provider's element named as one before it is left out. The Admin API's /config/effective shows the result and where each part came from. Read when fit starts: a change takes effect when fit restarts.": "除本文件和 Admin API 外的路由、上游、服务和监听器来源，合并进配置：本配置所写的优先于所有提供者，提供者优先于其后列出的；提供者中与其前者同名的元素会被忽略。Admin API 的 /config/effective 显示结果及各部分的来源。在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"Static bearer tokens, each with the streams it may publish and play: sent as Authorization: Bearer, a token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie.": "静态 bearer token，每个 token 有其可发布和可播放的流：以 Authorization: Bearer、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie 发送。",
"Statuses of the upstream's, 5xx ones, that have a request of an idempotent method sent again, as 502, 503 and 504; none when left out, so that only requests that got no response are.": "上游的哪些状态码（5xx）会使幂等方法的请求被重新发送，如 502、503 和 504；不设置时为无，即仅未收到响应的请求会重发。",
"TCP addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":3478\", for clients on networks that block UDP: turn:host:3478?transport=tcp. Their allocations relay UDP, and end when their connection closes.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 TCP 地址，如 \":3478\"，供屏蔽 UDP 的网络上的客户端使用：turn:host:3478?transport=tcp。其分配中继 UDP，并在其连接关闭时结束。",
"TLS addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":5349\" or \":443\", with tls's certificates, for clients that only TLS gets through for: turns:host:5349?transport=tcp. As listen_tcp otherwise.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 TLS 地址，如 \":5349\" 或 \":443\"，使用 tls 的证书，供只能通过 TLS 的客户端使用：turns:host:5349?transport=tcp。其余同 listen_tcp。",
"Take a PROXY protocol header, of version 1 or 2, at the start of each connection from a trusted address, and serve the connection as from the client it names. For listeners of tcp and of HTTP over TCP; with tls the header comes before TLS. HTTP/3 takes none.": "在来自受信任地址的每个连接开头接受版本 1 或 2 的 PROXY 协议头，并按其所指明的客户端来处理该连接。适用于 tcp 监听器和基于 TCP 的 HTTP 监听器；与 tls 同用时，该头位于 TLS 之前。HTTP/3 不接受。",
"Take and play streams over RTMP, as rtmp://host/app/stream: OBS and ffmpeg publish, players play. None when left out.": "通过 RTMP 接收和播放流，如 rtmp://host/app/stream：OBS 和 ffmpeg 发布，播放器播放。不设置时为无。",
"Take and play streams over RTSP 1.0 with interleaved RTP (RTP/AVP/TCP), as rtsp://host/app/stream. None when left out.": "通过 RTSP 1.0 接收和播放流，RTP 以交织方式传输（RTP/AVP/TCP），如 rtsp://host/app/stream。不设置时为无。",
"Take and play streams over SRT, MPEG-TS on UDP, the stream named by the caller's stream ID. None when left out.": "通过 SRT（UDP 上的 MPEG-TS）接收和播放流，流由调用方的 stream ID 指定。不设置时为无。",
"Take any QUIC certificate, which lets anyone on the path read and change what the quic links carry: for tests only. Refused for a quic:// endpoint whose host is not a loopback one, unless body_password is set; pin and ca_file override it.": "接受任何 QUIC 证书，这会让路径上的任何人都能读取和篡改 quic 链路所承载的内容：仅用于测试。主机不是回环地址的 quic:// 端点不接受此项，除非设置了 body_password；pin 与 ca_file 优先于它。",
"Take every running container with routes or services in its labels; only those labelled <label_prefix>.enable=true when left out or false. A container labelled <label_prefix>.enable=false is never taken.": "接管每个标签中带有路由或服务的运行中容器；不设置或为 false 时，仅接管带 <label_prefix>.enable=true 标签的。带 <label_prefix>.enable=false 标签的容器绝不会被接管。",
"Take every service in the catalog; only those tagged <tag_prefix>.enable=true when left out or false. An instance tagged <tag_prefix>.enable=false is never taken.": "接管目录中的每个服务；不设置或为 false 时，仅接管带 <tag_prefix>.enable=true 标签的。带 <tag_prefix>.enable=false 标签的实例绝不会被接管。",
"The ACL user to authenticate as, with password_file; the default user when left out.": "用于认证的 ACL 用户，与 password_file 配合；不设置时为默认用户。",
"The API agents on this machine or the LAN call, /v1/chat/completions, /v1/messages, /v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent, /api/chat, /v2/chat and the rest; none when left out.": "本机或局域网上的智能体调用的 API：/v1/chat/completions、/v1/messages、/v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent、/api/chat、/v2/chat 等；不设置时为无。",
"The API the upstream speaks: openai (OpenAI and every OpenAI-compatible server, as DeepSeek, Qwen, Mistral, Groq, xAI, OpenRouter, vLLM, llama.cpp), anthropic, gemini (Google's Gemini API), azure_openai (Azure OpenAI deployments, which agents call as openai), ollama (Ollama's own API) or cohere (Cohere's v2 API). It sets the agent endpoints the model is reached through, the upstream URL and the auth header.": "上游所使用的 API：openai（OpenAI 及所有兼容 OpenAI 的服务器，如 DeepSeek、Qwen、Mistral、Groq、xAI、OpenRouter、vLLM、llama.cpp）、anthropic、gemini（Google 的 Gemini API）、azure_openai（Azure OpenAI 部署，智能体按 openai 调用）、ollama（Ollama 自有 API）或 cohere（Cohere 的 v2 API）。它决定访问模型所用的智能体端点、上游 URL 和认证头。",
"The Admin API, through which the running config is read and replaced, and which serves metrics in Prometheus's text format at /metrics; off when left out. Its settings are read when fit starts: a change to them takes effect when fit restarts.": "Admin API，用于读取和替换运行中的配置，并在 /metrics 以 Prometheus 文本格式提供指标；不设置时为关闭。其设置在 fit 启动时读取：更改在 fit 重启后生效。",
"The Docker network whose address of a container's is used, when the container is on several and has no <label_prefix>.network label; the first by name when left out.": "使用其地址的 Docker 网络，用于容器处于多个网络且没有 <label_prefix>.network 标签时；不设置时取按名称排在第一的。",
"The Host header sent upstream; the client's when left out.": "发往上游的 Host 头；不设置时为客户端的。",
"The IP address Gateway listeners are bound on, each on its port; every address when left out.": "绑定 Gateway 监听器的 IP 地址，每个监听器在各自的端口上；不设置时为所有地址。",
"The LLM feature's roles to run beside the gateway, on its engine: a hub, a node and a proxy, which share AI models among machines and serve them to agents. None when left out. What their web pages change is written back here.": "LLM 功能在网关旁其引擎上运行的角色：中心节点（hub）、节点（node）和代理（proxy），它们在机器之间共享 AI 模型并将其提供给智能体。不设置时为无。其网页所做的更改会回写到此处。",
"The OTLP/HTTP receiver: http:// or https:// and a host and port, as of an OpenTelemetry Collector; traces go to its /v1/traces and metrics to /v1/metrics, as JSON. http://127.0.0.1:4318 when left out.": "OTLP/HTTP 接收端：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口，如 OpenTelemetry Collector 的；追踪以 JSON 发送到其 /v1/traces，指标发送到 /v1/metrics。不设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:4318。",
"The PEM certificate the tls, wss and quic listeners without cert_file present, which nodes and proxies pin by its SHA-256 fingerprint; with key. When a listener needs one and none is set, the hub makes a self-signed one and keeps it: here, with admin.store, or else in a file beside the config, 0600, as fit.tunnel.hub.pem beside fit.json; so that it outlives a restart, and the pins of it stay good.": "没有 cert_file 的 tls、wss 和 quic 监听器出示的 PEM 证书，节点和代理按其 SHA-256 指纹固定；与 key 配合。当监听器需要而未设置时，中心节点会生成一个自签名证书并保存：有 admin.store 时保存在这里，否则保存在配置旁的文件中（权限 0600），例如 fit.json 旁的 fit.tunnel.hub.pem；这样重启后证书不变，对它的固定指纹依然有效。",
"The PEM private key of cert.": "cert 的 PEM 私钥。",
"The SHA-256 fingerprint of the hub's certificate, as its pages show it, which tls://, wss:// and quic:// endpoints check the certificate against, in place of the chain and name checks: for a hub with a self-signed certificate. Without it or ca_file, the certificate is checked against the system's roots.": "中心节点证书的 SHA-256 指纹，与其页面所示一致，tls://、wss:// 和 quic:// 端点据此校验证书，取代证书链和名称校验：用于使用自签名证书的中心节点。没有它或 ca_file 时，证书按系统根证书校验。",
"The SHA-256 of the key, in hex.": "密钥的 SHA-256，十六进制。",
"The TCP address RTMP clients connect to, as in \":1935\". A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, closing its connections.": "RTMP 客户端连接的 TCP 地址，如 \":1935\"。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，关闭其连接。",
"The TCP address RTSP clients connect to, as in \":8554\". RTP goes interleaved on the same connection (RTP/AVP/TCP); a SETUP asking for UDP is answered 461, which ffmpeg and most players then retry over TCP. A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, closing its connections.": "RTSP 客户端连接的 TCP 地址，如 \":8554\"。RTP 在同一连接上交织传输（RTP/AVP/TCP）；要求 UDP 的 SETUP 会返回 461，ffmpeg 和大多数播放器随后会改用 TCP 重试。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，关闭其连接。",
"The UDP address SRT callers reach, as in \":8890\". A change of any field but auth starts the listener again, ending its sessions.": "SRT 调用方访问的 UDP 地址，如 \":8890\"。修改除 auth 之外的任何字段都会重新启动监听器，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address every peer's media reaches fit at, one port all PeerConnections share, as in \":8189\". A wildcard host advertises the address of every interface that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change starts the media server again, ending its sessions.": "所有对端的媒体访问 fit 的 UDP 地址，所有 PeerConnection 共用一个端口，如 \":8189\"。通配主机会通告所有处于启用状态的接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。更改会重启媒体服务器，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address every peer's media reaches fit at, one port all the role's PeerConnections share, as in \":8188\"; not webrtc.media's. A wildcard host advertises every interface's address that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change of any field starts it again, ending its sessions.": "所有对端的媒体到达 fit 的 UDP 地址，该角色所有 PeerConnection 共用一个端口，如 \":8188\"；不是 webrtc.media 的。通配主机会通告所有已启用接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。修改任何字段都会重新启动它，结束其会话。",
"The UDP address peers reach the media servers behind fit at, one port for them all, as in \":8190\": the proxied answers name it as their only candidate. A wildcard host advertises the address of every interface that is up, unless public_ips is set. A change ends every relay and session.": "对端访问 fit 之后的媒体服务器的 UDP 地址，所有媒体服务器共用一个端口，如 \":8190\"：被代理的应答将其作为唯一的候选。通配主机会通告所有处于启用状态的接口的地址，除非设置了 public_ips。更改会结束所有中继和会话。",
"The UDP addresses clients reach the server at, as in \":3478\", the port TURN's turn: URIs default to. A change of listen, listen_tcp or listen_tls starts a new server and drains the old one.": "客户端用来访问服务器的 UDP 地址，如 \":3478\"，即 TURN 的 turn: URI 默认使用的端口。更改 listen、listen_tcp 或 listen_tls 会启动新服务器并排空旧服务器。",
"The UDP port the PeerConnections of the stream_whip and stream_whep handlers share, which publish into the hub with WHIP and play from it with WHEP. Routes with those handlers answer 503 without it. None when left out.": "stream_whip 和 stream_whep 处理器的 PeerConnection 共用的 UDP 端口，它们用 WHIP 发布到 hub，用 WHEP 从中播放。没有它时，带这些处理器的路由返回 503。不设置时为无。",
"The URL of a JWK set (RFC 7517) whose signing keys tokens are verified with.": "JWK 集（RFC 7517）的 URL，令牌用其中的签名密钥验证。",
"The URL of a stream's HLS playlist, {stream} standing for its name, as /hls/{stream}/index.m3u8 for the streaming role's hls handler: the play page plays it where the browser plays HLS itself, with the page's token. None when left out.": "流的 HLS 播放列表的 URL，{stream} 代表其名称，如流媒体角色的 hls 处理器的 /hls/{stream}/index.m3u8：在浏览器自身支持 HLS 的情况下，播放页会连同页面的 token 一起播放它。不设置时为无。",
"The media_library names whose items the library page lists, at most 16: those the viewer may play, play on vod/<library>/<id> under auth, that can be served, with their posters, searched and paged; the player page plays one with hls.js, vendored in the binary. With the auth policy's url_signing, and playing not public, the player plays through a playback URL the pages sign for the viewer, its address and a session of its own, good for url_signing's ttl, whose playlists hand the player its grant; otherwise through the plain URL, which the login's cookie lets in. None when left out: no library page.": "片库页面列出其条目的 media_library 名称，最多 16 个：列出观众可以播放（在 auth 下对 vod/<library>/<id> 有 play 权限）且能够提供的条目，带海报，可搜索、分页；播放页面用内置在二进制中的 hls.js 播放其中一个。auth 策略设有 url_signing 且播放不公开时，播放器经由页面为该观众、其地址和一个独立会话签名的播放地址播放，有效期为 url_signing 的 ttl，其播放列表把授权交给播放器；否则经由普通 URL 播放，由登录的 cookie 放行。不设置时为无：没有片库页面。",
"The URL of an item's multivariant playlist, as a vod handler serves it, {library} standing for its library's name and {id} for its ID: a path on this server or an http or https URL, ending in {id}/ and the playlist's name. The item's poster is beside it, poster and its extension. /vod/{library}/{id}/index.m3u8 when left out, the vod handler's own prefix.": "条目的多变体播放列表的 URL，即 vod 处理器提供它的地址，{library} 代表媒体库名称，{id} 代表条目 ID：本服务器上的路径，或 http、https URL，以 {id}/ 和播放列表的名称结尾。条目的海报在它旁边，名为 poster 加其扩展名。不设置时为 /vod/{library}/{id}/index.m3u8，即 vod 处理器自己的前缀。",
"List the streaming role's channels on the library page too, those the viewer may play, with what each plays now and next, played from hls, which must be set, through a playback URL signed for the viewer as an item's is. Off when left out.": "在片库页面上也列出流媒体角色的频道：观众可以播放的那些，附带每个频道正在播放和接下来播放的内容；从 hls 播放（必须设置 hls），与条目一样经由为观众签名的播放地址。不设置时关闭。",
"The URL of the CA's ACME directory. Let's Encrypt's when left out; https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory is its staging CA, for tests.": "CA 的 ACME directory 的 URL。不设置时为 Let's Encrypt 的；https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory 是其测试用的 staging CA。",
"The URL streams are played from with WHEP, {stream} standing for the stream's name. /whep/{stream} when left out.": "用 WHEP 播放流的 URL，{stream} 代表流的名称。不设置时为 /whep/{stream}。",
"The URL streams are published to with WHIP, {stream} standing for the stream's name: a whip handler's, or stream_whip's for the streaming role, on this server or another. /whip/{stream} when left out.": "用 WHIP 发布流的 URL，{stream} 代表流的名称：可以是 whip 处理器的，或流媒体角色的 stream_whip 的，位于本服务器或其他服务器上。不设置时为 /whip/{stream}。",
"The URL, with {stream}, {token} and {host} filled in by the page.": "URL，其中的 {stream}、{token} 和 {host} 由页面填入。",
"The actions anyone may take without credentials, as [\"play\"] for streams anyone may watch and only some may publish. None when left out: every request needs credentials.": "任何人无需凭据即可执行的操作，如 [\"play\"]，用于任何人可观看而只有部分人可发布的流。不设置时为无：每个请求都需要凭据。",
"The address clients are told for their relayed sockets instead of relay_ip, for a server behind a 1:1 NAT that maps it to relay_ip. Of relay_ip's family. A change starts a new server.": "告知客户端其中继套接字所用的地址，代替 relay_ip，用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后、将其映射到 relay_ip 的服务器。与 relay_ip 属同一地址族。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The address fit relays a media server's peers to, by the media server's address in the upstream, as {\"10.0.0.2:8080\": \"10.0.0.2:8189\"}, or an IP alone, which takes the port of its answer's candidate. When left out, the answer's first host candidate, or server-reflexive one, IPv4 first.": "fit 将媒体服务器的对端中继到的地址，按上游中的媒体服务器地址对应，如 {\"10.0.0.2:8080\": \"10.0.0.2:8189\"}，或仅给出 IP，此时取其应答中候选项的端口。不设置时取应答中的第一个 host 候选项，或 server-reflexive 候选项，IPv4 优先。",
"The address the CA may write to about the account's certificates; none when left out.": "CA 可就账户的证书向其发信的地址；不设置时为无。",
"The address the relayed sockets bind to, one of the host's, not a wildcard; clients are told it, unless public_ip is set. Its family is every allocation's. Peers on it, and on public_ip, are relayed to on the ports of the server's own relayed addresses alone, and on those allowed_peers lists with their port. A change starts a new server.": "中继套接字绑定的地址，须为主机自身的地址之一，不能是通配地址；除非设置了 public_ip，否则告知客户端的就是它。其地址族即每个分配的地址族。位于该地址及 public_ip 上的对端，仅按服务器自身中继地址的端口中继，以及按 allowed_peers 所列的带端口地址中继。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The address the sockets toward the media servers leave from, one of the host's, for a firewall in front of them that admits one source address, or a host with several interfaces. Of the media servers' family: a media address of the other family is not relayed. The route's pick when left out. Applies to the next relay.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的出口地址，须为主机自身的地址之一，用于其前方只放行一个源地址的防火墙，或有多个网卡的主机。与媒体服务器属同一地址族：另一地址族的媒体地址不会被中继。不设置时由路由选择。对下一次中继生效。",
"The addresses (\"10.0.0.1\") and networks (\"10.0.0.0/8\") of proxies in front of fit: for a request that comes from one, the client's address is the last in X-Forwarded-For that is not one of them. None when left out, and the client is the connection's peer.": "fit 前方代理的地址（\"10.0.0.1\"）和网络（\"10.0.0.0/8\"）：对来自其中之一的请求，客户端地址取 X-Forwarded-For 中最后一个不属于它们的地址。不设置时为无，客户端即连接的对端。",
"The addresses (\"10.0.0.1\") and networks (\"10.0.0.0/8\") of proxies in front of this one, whose X-Forwarded-* and Forwarded fields are believed. None when left out.": "本代理前方代理的地址（\"10.0.0.1\"）和网络（\"10.0.0.0/8\"），其 X-Forwarded-* 和 Forwarded 字段被信任。不设置时为无。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the clients that may use the proxy, as \"10.0.0.0/8\"; others are answered 403.": "可使用该代理的客户端的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"；其他客户端得到 403 响应。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the clients that may use the proxy, as \"10.0.0.0/8\"; others are refused.": "可使用该代理的客户端的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"；其他客户端被拒绝。",
"The addresses and CIDR ranges of the proxies that send the header, as \"10.0.0.0/8\": a connection from one of them must begin with a header, within 10s, or it is closed, and one from elsewhere is served as it is, with no header.": "发送该头部的代理的地址和 CIDR 范围，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\"：来自其中之一的连接必须在 10s 内以头部开始，否则被关闭；来自其他地址的连接则照常服务，不带头部。",
"The addresses and prefixes, as in \"10.1.0.0/16\", peers may be at even when denied_peers or the default denial cover them: loopback, private, link-local and other internal ranges are denied unless listed here, so that the relay cannot reach into the network it runs in. An address with a port, as in \"10.0.0.5:8189\", allows that port alone, which is how a peer on relay_ip itself, such as webrtc.media, is reached.": "即使 denied_peers 或默认拒绝规则覆盖了，对端仍可位于的地址和前缀，如 \"10.1.0.1/16\"：回环、私有、链路本地及其他内部范围默认被拒绝，除非在此列出，以使中继无法触及其所在的网络。带端口的地址，如 \"10.0.0.5:8189\"，仅允许该端口，这是触及位于 relay_ip 本身上的对端（如 webrtc.media）的方式。",
"The addresses fit listens on, and the protocols each one serves. When left out, HTTPS by default makes them from the routes' host names; see auto_https.": "fit 监听的地址，及各自提供的协议。不设置时，HTTPS 默认由路由的主机名生成；参见 auto_https。",
"The addresses of the upstream's servers, each a host and a port, as in \"10.0.0.1:8080\" or \"backend:80\".": "上游的服务器地址，每个为主机加端口，如 \"10.0.0.1:8080\" 或 \"backend:80\"。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at instead of the interfaces' own, as behind a 1:1 NAT.": "告知对端用来访问该端口的地址，代替接口自身的地址，如位于 1:1 NAT 之后时。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at, with its port, instead of the interfaces' own: a server behind a 1:1 NAT, or a load balancer that forwards the port unchanged. A change starts the media server again.": "告知对端用以访问该端口的地址（含端口），代替网卡自身的地址：用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后的服务器，或原样转发该端口的负载均衡器。更改会重启媒体服务器。",
"The addresses peers are told to reach the port at, with its port, instead of the interfaces' own: a server behind a 1:1 NAT. Applies to the next answer.": "告知对端用以访问该端口的地址（含端口），代替网卡自身的地址：用于位于 1:1 NAT 之后的服务器。对下一次应答生效。",
"The addresses where clients reach fit's Gateways, IP addresses or host names, written into each one's status.addresses, as clients of the Gateway API and its conformance tests read them. None are written when left out, and those there are kept.": "客户端访问 fit 的 Gateway 的地址，IP 地址或主机名，写入各 Gateway 的 status.addresses，供 Gateway API 的客户端及其一致性测试读取。不设置时不写入，已有的保持不变。",
"The algorithms tokens may be signed with; any that fits the keys when left out. none never is.": "令牌可使用的签名算法；不设置时为任何与密钥相符的算法。none 永远不允许。",
"The api-version query every call of an azure_openai model carries, as 2024-10-21: required for azure_openai, and only taken there.": "azure_openai 模型的每次调用所带的 api-version 查询参数，如 2024-10-21：azure_openai 必填，且仅在该处使用。",
"The bcrypt hash of the user's password, as fit hash-password makes it.": "用户密码的 bcrypt 哈希，由 fit hash-password 生成。",
"The bcrypt hash of the user's password, as fit hash-password or htpasswd -B makes it.": "用户密码的 bcrypt 哈希，由 fit hash-password 或 htpasswd -B 生成。",
"The bytes a connection may have waiting to be written before it stops reading until they drain, the backpressure on one connection; limits.max_pending_bytes bounds them all together. When left out or 0, fib sizes it from read_buffer_size and the machine: four read buffers, at least 64 KiB and at most 256 KiB, so 256 KiB at the default 64 KiB read buffer on a machine with enough memory.": "一个连接在停止读取、等待其排空之前，可以有多少字节等待写出，即单个连接的背压；limits.max_pending_bytes 则限制所有连接的总和。不设置或为 0 时，fib 根据 read_buffer_size 和机器情况确定：四个读缓冲区，至少 64 KiB、至多 256 KiB，因此在默认 64 KiB 读缓冲区、内存充足的机器上为 256 KiB。",
"The bytes a connection reads its socket into at a time, which is also the most a proxied body is passed on in one write. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "连接每次读取套接字所用的缓冲区字节数，也是代理的请求体一次写出所传的最大字节数。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The bytes each stream keeps of its latest group of pictures, from its last key frame on, so that a new player starts at once with a picture; a group that outgrows it is dropped and caching starts again at the next key frame. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "每个流保留的最近一组图像（自其最后一个关键帧起）的字节数，使新播放器能立即看到画面；超出的一组会被丢弃，并从下一个关键帧起重新缓存。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The bytes of segments one stream and format holds; the oldest go first. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个流及格式保留的分片字节数；最旧的先被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The bytes one connection may have queued for its client before fit closes it, the bound on a peer that stops reading. 32 MiB when left out or 0. Takes effect at start, not on a reload.": "一个连接在 fit 将其关闭之前，可为其客户端排队的字节数，用于限制停止读取的对端。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。在启动时生效，重载时不生效。",
"The directories whose files the library holds, scanned with their subdirectories; an item's id is its path under its root. A root may not lie inside another. A root missing when scanned is reported, and the others are scanned.": "媒体库所含文件所在的目录，连同其子目录一起扫描；条目的 id 是其在根目录下的路径。根目录不能位于另一个根目录之内。扫描时缺失的根目录会被报告，其余根目录照常扫描。",
"The files looked at, by pattern: a pattern without '/' matches a file's name, as *.mp4, and one with '/' its path under the root, as films/**/*.mp4, where * matches within a name and ** any run of directories. Every file when left out; names starting with '.' are never looked at.": "按模式选取要查看的文件：不含 '/' 的模式匹配文件名，如 *.mp4；含 '/' 的模式匹配其在根目录下的路径，如 films/**/*.mp4，其中 * 匹配名称之内的字符，** 匹配任意层目录。不设置时查看所有文件；以 '.' 开头的名称从不查看。",
"The goroutines of the library's file pool, which probe, read sample tables and read the files' bytes, so that no fib worker waits on the disk: all the disk is asked to do at once. 4 a CPU, and at least 16, when left out or 0.": "媒体库文件池的 goroutine 数量，它们负责探测文件、读取样本表和读取文件的字节，使 fib 的 worker 不必等待磁盘：即同时向磁盘发出的全部请求。不设置或为 0 时为每个 CPU 4 个，且至少 16 个。",
"The hub's certificate, which its tls, wss and quic listeners present unless they have cert_file, and the connections of the quic listeners. The hub makes a self-signed certificate and writes it here when a listener needs one and none is set.": "中心节点的证书（其 tls、wss 和 quic 监听器在没有 cert_file 时出示它），以及 quic 监听器的连接。当监听器需要证书而未设置时，中心节点会生成自签名证书并写入此处。",
"The certificates of listen_tls, from files, as a listener's tls.certificates has them, and watched as theirs are: a change applies to the next handshake.": "listen_tls 的证书，来自文件，格式同监听器的 tls.certificates，并同样被监视：更改对下一次握手生效。",
"The challenges answered, in the order tried: http-01, which the CA checks on port 80 at the name, answered by any listener of fit's in the clear, and tls-alpn-01, which it checks on port 443, answered by the TLS listener that lists the name. A failed attempt is tried again with the next. Both, http-01 first, when left out.": "所应答的质询，按尝试顺序：http-01，CA 在该名称的 80 端口检查，由 fit 的任一明文监听器应答；tls-alpn-01，CA 在 443 端口检查，由列有该名称的 TLS 监听器应答。尝试失败则用下一个重试。不设置时两者都用，http-01 优先。",
"The codecs publishers may send, by encoding name: opus, VP8, VP9, H264 and AV1, every one when left out. Each publisher's offer is answered with the first of its codecs of each kind that is listed here, which its viewers must accept.": "发布者可发送的编解码器，按编码名称：opus、VP8、VP9、H264 和 AV1，不设置时为全部。对每个发布者的 offer，用此处所列其编解码器中每种类型的第一个应答，其观看者必须接受。",
"The console_socket's password.": "console_socket 的密码。",
"The controllerName of the GatewayClasses whose Gateways fit serves. lesismal.github.io/fit when left out.": "fit 所服务的 Gateway 所属 GatewayClass 的 controllerName。不设置时为 lesismal.github.io/fit。",
"The cookie's Path; / when left out.": "cookie 的 Path；不设置时为 /。",
"The cookie's name; fit_sticky when left out.": "cookie 的名称；不设置时为 fit_sticky。",
"The database selected. 0 when left out.": "所选的数据库。不设置时为 0。",
"The datacenter whose KV store is read; the agent's when left out.": "读取其 KV 存储的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The datacenter whose KV store is used; the agent's when left out.": "使用其 KV 存储的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The datacenter whose catalog is read; the agent's when left out.": "读取其目录的数据中心；不设置时为代理所在的数据中心。",
"The destination ports allowed; any when left out.": "允许的目标端口；不设置时为任意端口。",
"The destinations the proxy connects to: host names, \"*.example.com\" for every name below example.com, IP addresses and CIDR ranges, which also hold the address a host name resolves to. Every destination deny does not hold when left out, but for loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified and multicast addresses and the host's own, which are refused unless a range here lies inside theirs, as \"127.0.0.0/8\" does and \"0.0.0.0/0\" does not, or, for the host's own, names that address alone.": "代理所连接的目标：主机名，\"*.example.com\" 表示 example.com 之下的所有名称，IP 地址和 CIDR 范围（也涵盖主机名解析出的地址）。不设置时为 deny 未涵盖的所有目标，但环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定和组播地址以及本机自己的地址除外：这些地址被拒绝，除非这里有一个范围落在它们的范围之内（如 \"127.0.0.0/8\"，而 \"0.0.0.0/0\" 不算），对本机自己的地址则须单独写出该地址。",
"The destinations the proxy connects to: host names, \"*.example.com\" for every name below example.com, IP addresses and CIDR ranges, which also hold the address a host name resolves to. Every destination deny does not hold when left out, but for loopback, link-local (169.254.169.254, the metadata service of most clouds, among them), unspecified and multicast addresses and the host's own, which are refused unless a range here lies inside theirs, as \"127.0.0.0/8\" does and \"0.0.0.0/0\" does not, or, for the host's own, names that address alone; others are answered 403, or 502 for a host name whose address decides.": "代理所连接的目标：主机名，\"*.example.com\" 表示 example.com 之下的所有名称，IP 地址和 CIDR 范围（也涵盖主机名解析出的地址）。不设置时为 deny 未涵盖的所有目标，但环回、链路本地（其中包括大多数云的元数据服务 169.254.169.254）、未指定和组播地址以及本机自己的地址除外：这些地址被拒绝，除非这里有一个范围落在它们的范围之内（如 \"127.0.0.0/8\"，而 \"0.0.0.0/0\" 不算），对本机自己的地址则须单独写出该地址；其他目标得到 403 响应，若由主机名的地址决定则得到 502。",
"The directory accounts, keys and certificates are kept in, which instances of fit may share. $XDG_DATA_HOME/fit, or ~/.local/share/fit, when left out.": "存放账户、密钥和证书的目录，fit 的多个实例可共用。不设置时为 $XDG_DATA_HOME/fit，或 ~/.local/share/fit。",
"The directory files are served from. On a file system that folds case, as Windows' and macOS' do by default, a request whose path is not written as the names on disk are, or for a file whose extension a fastcgi handler's split_path names, in any case, is answered 404, so that a route matching names, as \\.php$, is not passed by.": "提供文件服务的目录。在不区分大小写的文件系统上（Windows 与 macOS 默认如此），路径与磁盘上名称写法不一致的请求，以及扩展名（不论大小写）为某个 fastcgi 处理器 split_path 所列扩展名的文件，均返回 404，以免绕过按名称匹配的路由（如 \\.php$）。",
"The directory the certificates of HTTPS listeners are written to, from the Secrets they name, for fit's TLS to load: each Secret's chain and key in one file only fit's user may read, named for the Secret and a hash of its contents. Files of that form that are no longer named are removed. A directory of fit's own in the system's temporary directory, removed when fit stops, when left out.": "写入 HTTPS 监听器证书的目录，证书来自其所指定的 Secret，供 fit 的 TLS 加载：每个 Secret 的证书链和密钥放在一个仅 fit 的用户可读的文件中，以 Secret 的名称和其内容的哈希命名。不再被引用的此类文件会被删除。不设置时为系统临时目录中 fit 自己的目录，fit 停止时删除。",
"The directory the zone's responses are kept in, made if it is missing. It is the zone's alone: no other zone may name it. What it holds is found again when fit starts.": "存放该区域响应的目录，不存在时创建。它仅属于该区域：其他区域不得使用同一目录。其中的内容在 fit 启动时会被重新找到。",
"The document root, which SCRIPT_FILENAME, DOCUMENT_ROOT and PATH_TRANSLATED are made from, as the application sees it.": "文档根目录，SCRIPT_FILENAME、DOCUMENT_ROOT 和 PATH_TRANSLATED 由它生成，即应用所看到的路径。",
"The encodings offered, the one the client prefers most chosen, and among those it prefers as much, the first here; zstd, br and gzip when left out.": "所提供的编码，选择客户端最偏好的一种；偏好程度相同的，取此处靠前的；不设置时为 zstd、br 和 gzip。",
"The files that stand for a directory, tried in order; [\"index.html\"] when left out, and none for [].": "代表目录的文件，按顺序尝试；不设置时为 [\"index.html\"]，设为 [] 则为无。",
"The highest local port of the sockets toward the media servers; with port_min. The range bounds the relays at once, beside max_relays.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的最高本地端口；与 port_min 配合。该范围同时限制中继数量，与 max_relays 并用。",
"The highest port of the relayed sockets; with port_min.": "中继套接字的最高端口；与 port_min 配合。",
"The host and port it listens on, as in \":7000\"; an empty host is every address.": "监听的主机和端口，如 \":7000\"；主机为空表示所有地址。",
"The host and port the API listens on: a loopback address serves agents on this machine; a LAN address, or an empty host, serves agents on other machines too, and needs cert_file and key_file, so that keys never cross a network in the clear.": "API 监听的主机和端口：回环地址只服务本机的代理；局域网地址或空主机也服务其他机器上的代理，且需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密钥不会以明文跨网络传输。",
"The host and port the WebSocket listens on; it answers on any path.": "WebSocket 监听的主机和端口；任何路径都会应答。",
"The host and port the console listens on. A host that is not a loopback address needs cert_file and key_file, so that passwords never cross a network in the clear. 127.0.0.1:2020 when left out.": "控制台监听的主机和端口。非回环地址的主机需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密码不会以明文跨网络传输。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:2020。",
"The host and port the pages listen on. A host that is not a loopback address needs cert_file and key_file, so that passwords never cross a network in the clear.": "页面监听的主机和端口。非回环地址的主机需要 cert_file 和 key_file，以使密码不会以明文跨网络传输。",
"The host and port the role takes links on, as a binding of its own on the listeners' engine; the WebSocket path is /ws. An empty host listens on every address.": "该角色接受链路的主机和端口，作为监听器所用引擎上自身的绑定；WebSocket 路径为 /ws。主机为空表示监听所有地址。",
"The host and port to listen on, as in \":8080\" or \"127.0.0.1:8080\".": "监听的主机和端口，如 \":8080\" 或 \"127.0.0.1:8080\"。",
"The hub's address: tls://host:port for TCP over TLS, wss://host:port/path for a WebSocket over TLS, quic://host:port for QUIC; or, only to a loopback host or with body_password, host:port or tcp://host:port for TCP and ws://host:port/path for a WebSocket in the clear. An address has no query, fragment or user ('?', '#', '@'): pin and ca_file say how the hub's certificate is checked.": "中心节点的地址：基于 TLS 的 TCP 用 tls://host:port，基于 TLS 的 WebSocket 用 wss://host:port/path，QUIC 用 quic://host:port；仅当主机为回环地址或设置了 body_password 时，才可用明文的 TCP（host:port 或 tcp://host:port）和 WebSocket（ws://host:port/path）。地址不含查询、片段或用户信息（'?'、'#'、'@'）：如何校验中心节点的证书由 pin 与 ca_file 决定。",
"The hub's addresses, in the order each link tries them: it dials the first one not disabled, and the next when that fails.": "中心节点的地址，按每条链路尝试的顺序：拨号第一个未禁用的，失败则拨下一个。",
"The hub's body_password, when it has one. A tcp:// or ws:// endpoint whose host is not a loopback one needs it.": "中心节点的 body_password，如果它有的话。主机不是回环地址的 tcp:// 或 ws:// 端点需要它。",
"The hub's console_socket, as ws://host:port/.": "中心节点的 console_socket，形如 ws://host:port/。",
"The hub's name here, which forwards and the pages name it by. The first endpoint's address when left out.": "中心节点在此处的名称，转发和页面用它来指代该节点。不设置时为第一个端点的地址。",
"The hub's name, for the pages.": "中心节点的名称，用于页面。",
"The hub's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "中心节点的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。不设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The hub's web pages; none when left out.": "中心节点的网页；不设置时为无。",
"The hubs and nodes the proxy dials. Its pages change them.": "代理所拨号的中心节点和节点。其页面可更改它们。",
"The hubs and proxies the node dials. Its pages change them.": "节点所拨号的中心节点和代理。其页面可更改它们。",
"The hubs the node links to and registers with. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "节点所链接并注册的中心节点。不设置时为无：控制台的页面可添加它们。",
"The hubs the proxy links to and registers with. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "代理所链接并注册的中心节点。不设置时为无：控制台的页面可添加它们。",
"The interval rate counts over. 1m when left out.": "rate 统计所依据的时间间隔。不设置时为 1m。",
"The iss a token must have; any when left out.": "令牌必须具有的 iss；不设置时为任意值。",
"The key nonces are made with; a random one when left out. Servers behind one load balancer, which may each see a client's requests, share one. A change starts a new server.": "用于生成 nonce 的密钥；不设置时随机生成。位于同一负载均衡器之后、可能各自看到某客户端请求的多个服务器，应共用同一个。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The key sent upstream: as Authorization: Bearer for openai, ollama and cohere, as x-api-key for anthropic, x-goog-api-key for gemini, api-key for azure_openai. None when left out. The pages never show it whole.": "发往上游的密钥：openai、ollama 和 cohere 用 Authorization: Bearer，anthropic 用 x-api-key，gemini 用 x-goog-api-key，azure_openai 用 api-key。不设置时为无。页面从不完整显示它。",
"The key's ID, 16 hex digits.": "密钥的 ID，16 位十六进制数字。",
"The key's first characters, to tell it by on the pages.": "密钥的前几个字符，用于在页面上识别它。",
"The key's name: 1 to 64 letters, digits, '_', '.', '~' and '-', which a media_tokens request names to sign with it, and a revoke to rotate it.": "密钥的名称：1 到 64 个字母、数字、'_'、'.'、'~' 和 '-'，media_tokens 的请求用它指定签发用的密钥，吊销也用它指定要轮换的密钥。",
"The key's secret, at least 16 bytes. Or secret_file, one of the two.": "该密钥的 secret，至少 16 字节。或 secret_file，二者取其一。",
"The key, at least 16 bytes, that tokens fit issues are signed with (HMAC-SHA256): fit media-token's and the media pages' logins. Tokens are good for this policy alone, until their expiry. When left out, a random key of the process's signs the pages' logins, which a restart forgets; fit media-token needs it. Or secret_file, one of the two, or keys.": "fit 签发的 token 所用的签名密钥（HMAC-SHA256），至少 16 字节：包括 fit media-token 签发的以及媒体页面登录时签发的。token 仅对该策略有效，直至过期。不设置时，进程会用一个随机密钥为页面登录签名，重启后即失效；fit media-token 则必须设置它。或 secret_file，二者取其一，或 keys。",
"The keys agents call the API with, each kept as its SHA-256 alone. Its pages make and delete them.": "代理调用 API 所用的密钥，每个只保存其 SHA-256。其页面可创建和删除它们。",
"The keys read are those starting with it. Each holds a JSON object of listeners, routes, upstreams and services, as a config holds them; keys ending in '/' and empty ones are passed over, and a key whose value is not such an object is left out and reported. fit/ when left out.": "所读取的键是以它开头的键。每个键保存一个由监听器、路由、上游和服务组成的 JSON 对象，与配置所含的相同；以 '/' 结尾的键和空键会被跳过，值不是此类对象的键会被忽略并报告。不设置时为 fit/。",
"The kubeconfig's context to use; its current-context when left out.": "所用的 kubeconfig 上下文；不设置时为其 current-context。",
"The largest RTMP message a client may send, a video frame among them; a larger one closes its connection. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "客户端可发送的最大 RTMP 消息（包括视频帧）；更大的消息会关闭其连接。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The largest body a request of the room API or the login may have, in bytes; a larger one is answered 413. 1024 when left out.": "房间 API 或登录请求的请求体最大字节数；更大的返回 413。不设置时为 1024。",
"The largest body kept; a larger response goes to its client without being kept. At most a sixteenth of max_bytes. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "所保留的最大响应体；更大的响应直接交给其客户端而不保留。至多为 max_bytes 的十六分之一。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest config the Admin API takes; a larger one gets 413. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "Admin API 接受的最大配置；更大的得到 413。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"The largest file a member may send in a room's chat, in bytes; a larger one is answered 413, and the page refuses it before sending. 5 MiB (5242880) when left out.": "成员在房间聊天中可发送的文件最大字节数；更大的文件返回 413，页面会在发送前拒绝它。不设置时为 5 MiB（5242880）。",
"The largest file kept in memory, in bytes; 1 MiB when left out.": "内存中保留的最大文件，单位为字节；不设置时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest message a TCP or TLS client may send, and so what its connection buffers of one not yet whole; a connection whose next message claims more is closed. At least 2048. 8 KiB when left out or 0. A change starts a new server.": "TCP 或 TLS 客户端可发送的最大消息，也就是其连接为尚未完整的一条消息所缓冲的上限；下一条消息声称更大的连接会被关闭。至少 2048。不设置或为 0 时为 8 KiB。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The largest offer taken; a larger one is answered 400. At most 64 KiB. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大 offer；更大的返回 400。最大为 64 KiB。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest offer taken; a larger one is answered 413. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大 offer；更大的得到 413。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest request and answer passed on, an offer and an answer among them; a larger request is answered 413, and a larger answer 502. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "转发的最大请求和应答，其中包括 offer 和 answer；更大的请求得到 413，更大的应答得到 502。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The largest request body a call may carry; one past it fails. A body is held whole only when the model's upstream differs from the name the call gives and the model is named in the body (its JSON model, or a form's model field), to set it. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用可携带的最大请求体；超过则失败。仅当模型的上游与调用所给的名称不同，且请求体中指明了模型（其 JSON 的 model，或表单的 model 字段）以便设置它时，才会完整保存请求体。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The largest request body a call may carry; one past it gets 413. It is held whole, to read the model it names and to send it again when a route cannot serve it. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用可携带的最大请求体；超过则得到 413。它会被完整保存，以读取其中指明的模型，并在某个路由无法处理时再次发送。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The largest request body a listener takes, whether it arrives whole or streams through; a larger one gets 413, or, once it has begun to stream, its connection or stream is ended. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "监听器接受的最大请求体，无论是整体到达还是以流的方式传入；更大的得到 413，若已开始流式传输，则其连接或流被终止。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The largest request body the route takes; a larger one is answered 413. 64 KiB when left out.": "路由接受的最大请求体；更大的返回 413。不设置时为 64 KiB。",
"The largest request header a listener takes; a larger one gets 431. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "监听器接受的最大请求头；更大的得到 431。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The largest sidecar, <name>.json, read; a larger one is reported and left out. At most 1 MiB. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "读取的 sidecar（<name>.json）的最大大小；更大的会被报告并略过。最多 1 MiB。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The largest subtitle file served, .vtt or .srt turned into WebVTT; a larger one is listed with its error and not served. 2 MiB when left out or 0.": "提供的字幕文件（.vtt，或转换为 WebVTT 的 .srt）的最大大小；更大的字幕会连同其错误一起列出，且不提供。不设置或为 0 时为 2 MiB。",
"The least level of some loggers, by name, over level: server (listeners, loading and reloading configs, shutting down), admin (the Admin API), tls (certificates: ACME, OCSP, certificate files), provider (providers), telemetry (exporting over OTLP), access_log (the access log's dropped lines), plugin (wasm plugins), fastcgi (what FastCGI applications write to their stderr), llm and tunnel (their roles), webrtc (the TURN server), sync (its pipelines), bittorrent (its roles) and engine (fib, the network engine, and whatever else writes to Go's log and log/slog). The same as loggers' level, which a logger may not have both of. A change takes effect on reload.": "按名称为某些日志记录器设置的最低级别，优先于 level：server（监听器、加载和重载配置、关闭）、admin（Admin API）、tls（证书：ACME、OCSP、证书文件）、provider（提供者）、telemetry（经 OTLP 导出）、access_log（访问日志被丢弃的行）、plugin（wasm 插件）、fastcgi（FastCGI 应用写入其 stderr 的内容）、llm 和 tunnel（它们的角色）、webrtc（TURN 服务器）、sync（其流水线）、bittorrent（其角色）以及 engine（fib，即网络引擎，以及其他写入 Go 的 log 和 log/slog 的内容）。与 loggers 的 level 相同，同一个日志记录器不能同时设置两者。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level of the requests written: a response with a status below 400 is info, a 4xx warn and a 5xx error, so warn writes the requests answered with 4xx and 5xx, and error those answered with 5xx. Every request when left out. A change takes effect on reload.": "所写入请求的最低级别：状态码低于 400 的响应为 info，4xx 为 warn，5xx 为 error，因此 warn 会写入以 4xx 和 5xx 应答的请求，error 则写入以 5xx 应答的请求。不设置时写入每个请求。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level the logger writes. A change takes effect on reload.": "该日志记录器所写入的最低级别。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least level written, of every logger levels and loggers do not set one for: debug, info, warn or error. info when left out. A change takes effect on reload.": "所写入的最低级别，适用于 levels 和 loggers 均未设置级别的所有日志记录器：debug、info、warn 或 error。不设置时为 info。更改在重载时生效。",
"The least time between two key frame requests (PLI) passed to a publisher, for the viewers that join or lose packets: the rest are dropped. 500ms when left out.": "传给发布者的两次关键帧请求（PLI）之间的最短时间，针对加入或丢包的观看者：其余的会被丢弃。不设置时为 500ms。",
"The length of each listening socket's queue of connections not yet accepted. The system's when left out or 0.": "每个监听套接字中尚未被接受的连接队列的长度。不设置或为 0 时取系统的值。",
"The library's name, which handlers and the Admin API's /media/library/<name> refer to it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "媒体库的名称，处理器和 Admin API 的 /media/library/<name> 以此引用它。由字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-' 组成。",
"The lifetime of an allocation whose client asks for less, or for none; clients refresh it before it ends. 10m when left out. Applies to the next allocation or refresh.": "客户端所请求的生存期少于此值或未请求时，分配的生存期；客户端在其结束前刷新。不设置时为 10m。对下一次分配或刷新生效。",
"The local host and port the forward listens on.": "转发所监听的本地主机和端口。",
"The local host and port the pages are served on.": "提供页面服务的本地主机和端口。",
"The longest a request may ask a token to be good for; a longer ttl is answered 400. 24h when left out.": "请求可要求 token 有效的最长时间；更长的 ttl 返回 400。不设置时为 24h。",
"The longest lifetime a client may ask for. 1h when left out. Applies to the next allocation or refresh.": "客户端可请求的最长生存期。不设置时为 1h。对下一次分配或刷新生效。",
"The lowest local port of the sockets toward the media servers, for a firewall in front of them that admits a range; with port_max. A port in use is skipped, and a peer address that finds the range full is dropped. Ports the kernel picks when both are left out. Applies to the next relay.": "通向媒体服务器的套接字的最低本地端口，用于其前方放行一个范围的防火墙；与 port_max 配合。正在使用的端口会被跳过，发现范围已满的对端地址会被丢弃。两者都不设置时由内核选择端口。对下一次中继生效。",
"The lowest port of the relayed sockets, as a firewall that opens a range expects; with port_max. Ports the kernel picks when both are left out. A change starts a new server.": "中继套接字的最低端口，如开放一个范围的防火墙所期望的；与 port_max 配合。两者都不设置时由内核选择端口。更改会启动新的服务器。",
"The media_auth policy RTSP requests must satisfy, by the stream's path: ANNOUNCE publish and DESCRIBE play on the stream their URL names, RECORD publish and PLAY play on the stream of the connection's session (one whose URL names another stream is refused with 455), and a SETUP play on its stream, or once a session is set up, play or publish on the session's. Credentials are a user with a plaintext password by Digest, a user by Basic when auth_methods offers it, or a token in the URL's query, as rtsp://host/live/cam?token=T. A refusal is 401 with the challenges, or 403. Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next request.": "RTSP 请求必须满足的 media_auth 策略，按流的路径判定：ANNOUNCE 需要其 URL 所指流的 publish，DESCRIBE 需要其 play；RECORD 需要该连接会话的流的 publish，PLAY 需要其 play（URL 指向别的流时以 455 拒绝）；SETUP 需要其流的 play，会话建立之后则需要会话的流的 play 或 publish。凭据为使用明文密码用户的 Digest、auth_methods 提供时使用用户的 Basic，或 URL 查询参数中的 token，如 rtsp://host/live/cam?token=T。拒绝时返回带质询的 401 或 403。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一个请求生效。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy to play the stream: its credentials need play on the stream's name, or the policy makes play public. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL takes its DELETE without credentials, as whip's. Everyone may play when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 播放该流所必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据需要对流的名称具有 play 权限，或该策略将 play 设为公开。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 的 DELETE 无需凭据，与 whip 相同。不设置时所有人均可播放，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy to publish the stream: its credentials, a bearer token or a user and password, need publish on the stream's name, or the policy makes publish public. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL takes its DELETE without credentials: its ID, 128 random bits, is the capability. Everyone may publish when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 发布该流所必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据（bearer token 或用户和密码）需要对流的名称具有 publish 权限，或该策略将 publish 设为公开。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 的 DELETE 无需凭据：其 ID（128 位随机数）即为凭证。不设置时所有人均可发布，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy, play on the stream's path, as stream_whip's. A session's URL takes PATCH and DELETE without credentials. Everyone may play when left out.": "POST 必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限，与 stream_whip 相同。会话的 URL 的 PATCH 和 DELETE 无需凭据。不设置时所有人均可播放。",
"The media_auth policy a POST must satisfy, publish on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. 401 with a Bearer challenge without credentials, 403 when they do not allow it. A session's URL takes PATCH and DELETE without credentials, its random ID being the capability (RFC 9725). Everyone may publish when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "POST 必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 publish 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。没有凭据时返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，凭据不被允许时返回 403。会话的 URL 的 PATCH 和 DELETE 无需凭据，其随机 ID 即为凭证（RFC 9725）。不设置时所有人均可发布，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy a caller must satisfy, publish for m=publish and play otherwise, by the stream ID's resource: a token as s= (#!::r=live/cam,m=publish,s=T), a user and password as u= and s=, or token, or user and pass, in the resource's query (live/cam?token=T). A refusal rejects the handshake with 1401 (unauthorized) or 1403 (forbidden). Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next caller.": "调用方必须满足的 media_auth 策略，m=publish 时需要 publish，否则需要 play，按 stream ID 的资源判定：以 s= 给出 token（#!::r=live/cam,m=publish,s=T），以 u= 和 s= 给出用户和密码，或在资源的查询参数中给出 token，或 user 和 pass（live/cam?token=T）。拒绝时以 1401（未授权）或 1403（禁止）拒绝握手。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一个调用方生效。",
"The media_auth policy a player must satisfy, play on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter (/live/cam.flv?token=T) or the fit_media_token cookie. 401 with a Bearer challenge without credentials, 403 when they do not allow it. With the policy's url_signing, a signed URL of the stream plays too. Everyone may play when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "播放器必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数（/live/cam.flv?token=T）或 fit_media_token cookie。没有凭据时返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，凭据不被允许时返回 403。策略设置了 url_signing 时，该流的签名 URL 也可播放。不设置时所有人均可播放，由路由的中间件决定。",
"Turns on playback URLs that expire: URLs signed for one viewer and one resource (an item of vod, a stream of hls or httpflv) with the policy's secret or a key of its keys, as media_tokens' /urls issues them, and checked by those handlers on every playlist, segment and subtitle, at once and without a callback. Needs secret, secret_file or keys. Off when left out.": "开启会过期的播放地址：用策略的 secret 或 keys 中的一个密钥，为一个观众和一个资源（vod 的一个条目、hls 或 httpflv 的一路流）签名的 URL，如 media_tokens 的 /urls 所签发；这些处理器在每个播放列表、分片和字幕上当场校验，不回调。需要 secret、secret_file 或 keys。不设置时关闭。",
"How long a URL media_tokens' /urls issues is good for when the request names no ttl, and at most the route's max_ttl. 10m when left out.": "请求未指定 ttl 时，media_tokens 的 /urls 签发的 URL 的有效期，且不超过该路由的 max_ttl。不设置时为 10m。",
"How a URL issued for a viewer's address is bound to it: ip, to that address alone, or subnet, to its /24 for IPv4 and its /64 for IPv6, for viewers whose address changes within their network. A URL issued without an address is good from anywhere. ip when left out.": "为观众地址签发的 URL 如何绑定该地址：ip，只绑定该地址；或 subnet，绑定其所在的 IPv4 /24 或 IPv6 /64，适合地址会在网络内变化的观众。签发时未给地址的 URL 在任何地方都有效。不设置时为 ip。",
"How long the grant a playlist hands its segments, init segments, keys and subtitles lives past the later of the URL's expiry and the item's end, played from when the playlist is fetched: so that a film does not stop halfway, nor after a pause, while the URL itself dies soon. A live stream's grant lives this long past the URL's expiry. 30m when left out.": "播放列表交给其分片、初始化分片、密钥和字幕的授权，在 URL 过期时间与条目结束时间（从取得播放列表时起播放到结尾）二者中较晚者之后，再存活多久：使影片不会在中途或暂停之后停止，而 URL 本身很快失效。直播流的授权在 URL 过期后再存活这么久。不设置时为 30m。",
"Hands the grant on as the cookie fit_media_grant, on the resource's path and HttpOnly, rather than in the query of every URI a playlist names, for players that drop a playlist's query parameters. The URL the player starts from keeps its query. Off when left out.": "把授权作为 cookie fit_media_grant（在资源的路径上，HttpOnly）交出，而不是放在播放列表列出的每个 URI 的查询中，供丢弃播放列表查询参数的播放器使用。播放器起始的 URL 仍保留其查询。不设置时关闭。",
"The most playback sessions one subject may have at once, a session being a URL's sid, playing while it fetches within session_idle; past it, on_limit says what happens. No cap when left out or 0.": "一个主体同时最多可有的播放会话数，会话即 URL 的 sid，在 session_idle 内仍有请求即视为在播放；超过时由 on_limit 决定如何处理。不设置或为 0 时不设上限。",
"What a new session past max_sessions does: refuse, answered 403, or end_oldest, which ends the subject's session that started first, whose next request is answered 403. refuse when left out.": "超过 max_sessions 的新会话如何处理：refuse，返回 403；或 end_oldest，结束该主体最早开始的会话，其下一个请求返回 403。不设置时为 refuse。",
"How long a session may go without a request and still count as playing. 2m when left out.": "会话在没有请求的情况下仍算作在播放的最长时间。不设置时为 2m。",
"The most sessions the policy keeps track of, of all its subjects; a new session past it is answered 503. 100000 when left out or 0.": "策略跟踪的会话总数上限（所有主体合计）；超过时新会话返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The origins of the pages that may play the URLs, as https://www.example.com or https://*.example.com, * matching any run of characters, matched against the origin of a request's Referer: a request with another Referer is answered 403, one without any let through. Any when left out.": "可以播放这些 URL 的页面的源，如 https://www.example.com 或 https://*.example.com，* 匹配任意一串字符，与请求 Referer 的源比对：Referer 不在其中的请求返回 403，没有 Referer 的请求放行。不设置时任意。",
"The origins whose scripts may fetch the URLs, as referers lists them, matched against a request's Origin: a request with another Origin is answered 403, one without any let through. Any when left out.": "其脚本可以获取这些 URL 的源，写法同 referers，与请求的 Origin 比对：Origin 不在其中的请求返回 403，没有 Origin 的请求放行。不设置时任意。",
"The addresses (\"10.0.0.1\") and networks (\"10.0.0.0/8\") of proxies in front of fit, whose X-Forwarded-For is believed when a URL bound to an address is checked: the viewer is the last address in it that is not one of them. None when left out: the viewer is the connection's peer.": "fit 前面的代理的地址（\"10.0.0.1\"）和网段（\"10.0.0.0/8\"），校验绑定了地址的 URL 时信任其 X-Forwarded-For：观众是其中最后一个不属于这些代理的地址。不设置时为无：观众是连接的对端。",
"What the URLs <prefix>/urls answers start with, before their paths: the scheme and host viewers reach fit's vod, hls and httpflv routes at, as https://media.example.com. The paths and their queries alone when left out.": "<prefix>/urls 返回的 URL 在路径之前的开头：观众访问 fit 的 vod、hls 和 httpflv 路由所用的协议和主机，如 https://media.example.com。不设置时只返回路径及其查询。",
"The path prefixes <prefix>/urls may sign URLs for: every path of a request must start with one of them, as /vod/films/, so that a URL cannot be signed for a resource outside them. Any path when left out.": "<prefix>/urls 可以为之签发 URL 的路径前缀：请求中的每个路径都必须以其中之一开头，如 /vod/films/，使 URL 无法为其之外的资源签发。不设置时任意路径。",
"The media_auth policy a publish and a play must satisfy, by the stream's path, app/stream: credentials go in the query of the stream name or the app, as rtmp://host/live/cam?token=T or ?user=U&pass=P. A refusal is answered with NetStream.Publish.Unauthorized or NetStream.Play.Failed and the connection closed. Everyone may publish and play when left out. A change applies to the next publish and play.": "发布和播放必须满足的 media_auth 策略，按流的路径 app/stream 判定：凭据放在流名称或 app 的查询参数中，如 rtmp://host/live/cam?token=T 或 ?user=U&pass=P。拒绝时返回 NetStream.Publish.Unauthorized 或 NetStream.Play.Failed 并关闭连接。不设置时所有人均可发布和播放。修改后对下一次发布和播放生效。",
"The media_auth policy an offer must satisfy before it is sent to a media server: its credentials need action on the stream, the last segment of the POST's path, which must then be 1 to 128 letters, digits, '.', '_', '~' and '-', decoded, or the offer is answered 400. Missing or bad credentials are answered 401 with a Bearer challenge, others 403. A session's URL is passed on without credentials, its ID being the capability; the request's Authorization goes on to the media server as it came. Everyone may when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "offer 在发送给媒体服务器之前必须满足的 media_auth 策略：其凭据需要对该流（POST 路径的最后一段）具有 action 权限，该段解码后须为 1 到 128 个字母、数字、'.'、'_'、'~' 或 '-'，否则 offer 答 400。缺少或错误的凭据返回带 Bearer 质询的 401，其他情况返回 403。会话的 URL 无需凭据即可转发，其 ID 即为凭证；请求的 Authorization 原样转发给媒体服务器。不设置时所有人均可，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The media_auth policy every request, playlist and segment, must satisfy, play on the stream's path: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. A playlist fetched with a token in its query names its playlists, segments and parts with the token too, so that a player that sends no header (Safari, ffmpeg) plays on. With the policy's url_signing, a signed URL of the stream plays too, and its playlists hand what they name a grant of their own. Everyone may play when left out.": "每个请求（播放列表和分片）都必须满足的 media_auth 策略，需要对流的路径具有 play 权限：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。带 token 查询参数获取的播放列表，其中的播放列表、分片和 part 也会带上该 token，使不发送请求头的播放器（Safari、ffmpeg）也能继续播放。策略设置了 url_signing 时，该流的签名 URL 也可播放，其播放列表会给列出的内容一个自己的授权。不设置时所有人均可播放。",
"The media_auth policy that signs the tokens, as whip's auth names one: it must set secret_file, or a keyring whose keys each set secret_file, so that a revoke can rotate a secret file and outlive a restart.": "签发 token 的 media_auth 策略，如 whip 的 auth 引用一条策略：它必须设置 secret_file，或设置 keys 密钥环且其中每个密钥都设置 secret_file，以便吊销时轮换 secret 文件并在重启后依然有效。",
"The media_auth policy the room API checks, and the pages' login and tokens belong to: joining a room and following it needs play on <room>-*, announcing that one publishes publish on <room>-<name>, as the WHIP and WHEP endpoints the pages use check with their own auth, which should name the same policy. Everyone may use the room API when left out, as the route's middleware allow.": "房间 API 检查的 media_auth 策略，页面的登录和 token 也属于该策略：加入并关注房间需要对 <room>-* 具有 play 权限，宣告加入则需要对 <room>-<name> 具有 publish 权限，页面使用的 WHIP 和 WHEP 端点会以各自的 auth 检查，其 auth 应指向同一策略。不设置时所有人均可使用房间 API，由路由的中间件决定。",
"The model ID sent upstream in place of name: in the body's model, a form's model field, Gemini's path, or as an azure_openai model's deployment. name when left out.": "发往上游的模型 ID，代替 name：置于请求体的 model、表单的 model 字段、Gemini 的路径中，或作为 azure_openai 模型的部署名。不设置时为 name。",
"The models the node serves: each an upstream API endpoint. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change them.": "节点所服务的模型：每个为一个上游 API 端点。其页面，以及 settings.allow_hub_manage 所允许的中心节点，可更改它们。",
"The module's name within its namespace.": "模块在其命名空间内的名称。",
"The module's params.": "模块的 params。",
"The most PeerConnections at once, publishers' and viewers'; one more offer is answered 503. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时存在的最大 PeerConnection 数，含发布者和观看者；再多一个 offer 就得到 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most QUIC handshakes under way at once; a new connection past it is dropped, and its proxy tries again. Past half of them, a client proves its address with a Retry first, so that Initials from forged addresses hold at most half. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时进行的最大 QUIC 握手数；超出的新连接会被丢弃，其代理会重试。超过一半后，客户端须先以 Retry 证明其地址，使伪造地址的 Initial 最多占一半。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most WHIP and WHEP sessions at once; one more offer is answered 503. 256 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大 WHIP 和 WHEP 会话数；多出的 offer 返回 503。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most WebSockets open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it opens. A WebSocket that has not proven the password, with a message it seals, is closed after 10s, and one IP address may have a quarter of them open that have not. 32 when left out or 0.": "同时打开的最大 WebSocket 数；超出的在打开后立即被关闭。未以其加密的消息证明密码的 WebSocket 在 10 秒后被关闭，且同一 IP 地址最多可占其中四分之一处于未证明状态。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"Let registered proxies set nodes' services through the hub, as a proxy's pages do; a node takes them only with its allow_hub_services. Every proxy that has the password could then do it. Off when left out: only the hub's own pages ask nodes to change their services.": "允许已注册的代理经由 hub 设置节点的服务（如代理页面所做）；节点只有开启 allow_hub_services 才接受。届时每个持有密码的代理都能这样做。不设置时关闭：只有 hub 自己的页面能请节点修改服务。",
"Let the hubs the node registers with set its services, which are the addresses it opens tunnels to, and write them into this member. Off when left out: only this member and the node's own pages set them.": "允许节点所注册的 hub 设置其服务（即它为隧道连接的地址），并写入本成员。不设置时关闭：只有本成员和节点自己的页面能设置。",
"The most files and directories a scan looks at, across the roots; past it the scan stops there, and says so. 200000 when left out or 0.": "一次扫描在所有根目录中查看的文件和目录的最大数量；超过时扫描在该处停止，并予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 200000。",
"The most files probed at once on the library's file pool, so that a scan leaves the pool's other workers to the files being served. 4 when left out or 0.": "在媒体库文件池上同时探测的文件的最大数量，使扫描把文件池的其他 worker 留给正在提供的文件。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most items the catalog holds; past it the rest are left out, and the scan says so. 20000 when left out or 0.": "目录所含条目的最大数量；超过时其余条目被略去，并且扫描会予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 20000。",
"The most jobs that wait for the file pool; one more is refused, as a request answered 503. 4096 when left out or 0.": "等待文件池的作业的最大数量；再多一个会被拒绝，相应的请求答 503。不设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most links from one IP address open at once that have not registered yet; one past it is closed as soon as it opens, and its node or proxy links again after its retry_interval. 32 when left out or 0.": "同一 IP 地址同时打开、尚未注册的最大链路数；超出的在打开后立即被关闭，其节点或代理在 retry_interval 后重新连接。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most links open at once that have not registered yet, which anyone who reaches a listener can open; one past it is closed as soon as it opens, so that they cannot take every link from the nodes and proxies that register. 256 when left out or 0.": "同时打开、尚未注册的最大链路数（任何能连到监听器的人都能打开这类链路）；超出的在打开后立即被关闭，使它们无法占满注册节点和代理的全部链路。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most a dialer waits between attempts at a peer it cannot reach; the waits grow to it, at random within each step. 5s when left out.": "拨号方在尝试连接无法到达的对端之间等待的最长时间；等待时间逐步增长直至该值，每一步内随机取值。不设置时为 5s。",
"The most a request may take, from its last byte to the media server's answer read whole; past it, it is answered 504. 10s when left out.": "一个请求可花费的最长时间，从其最后一个字节到完整读完媒体服务器的应答；超过则得到 504。不设置时为 10s。",
"The most a request may take, from when the proxy takes it to the end of its response, retries included: one past it before its response began is answered 504, and one whose response is under way is cut short. None when left out.": "一个请求可花费的最长时间，从代理接收它到其响应结束，含重试：在响应开始前超过的，得到 504；响应进行中超过的，被中途截断。不设置时为无。",
"The most a whole exchange may take; 10m when left out.": "整个交换可花费的最长时间；不设置时为 10m。",
"The most allocations held at once; one more is refused with 508. Each holds a relayed socket on every event loop. 1024 when left out or 0. A change applies to the next allocation; those held past a lowered one are kept until they end.": "同时持有的最大分配数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 508。每个分配在每个事件循环上持有一个中继套接字。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。更改对下一次分配生效；因调低而超出的已有分配保留至其结束。",
"The most allocations of one username; one more is refused with 486. 16 when left out or 0. Applies to the next allocation.": "同一用户名的最大分配数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 486。不设置或为 0 时为 16。对下一次分配生效。",
"The most bits a second a publisher may send: told to it as REMB feedback, which browsers keep under, and enforced with two seconds of burst, past which its packets are dropped. 8000000 when left out or 0.": "发布者每秒可发送的最大比特数：以 REMB 反馈告知它，浏览器会遵守，并以两秒的突发量强制执行，超过则丢弃其数据包。不设置或为 0 时为 8000000。",
"The most bytes a request's body may have.": "请求体可有的最大字节数。",
"The most bytes a second relayed for one username each way, to peers and from them, with a second's worth of burst; datagrams past it are dropped. 2 MiB when left out or 0.": "同一用户名每个方向每秒中继的最大字节数，即发往对端和来自对端的，附带一秒量的突发；超出的数据报被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 2 MiB。",
"The most bytes of spans waiting to be exported, besides the batch being sent; spans past it are dropped and counted. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "除正在发送的批次外，等待导出的 span 的最大字节数；超出的 span 被丢弃并计数。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"The most bytes the response's CGI header may take; past it the request is answered 502. 64 KiB when left out or 0.": "响应的 CGI 头部可占的最大字节数；超过则请求得到 502。不设置或为 0 时为 64 KiB。",
"The most bytes the zone keeps in memory, bodies, fields and keys counted; past it the least recently used responses go. 128 MiB when left out or 0. Caches of one zone take the size of the last one loaded.": "该区域在内存中保留的最大字节数，计入响应体、字段和键；超过则最近最少使用的响应被移除。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。同一区域的多个缓存取最后加载的大小。",
"The most bytes the zone keeps on disk; past it the least recently used responses go. 1 GiB when left out or 0.": "该区域在磁盘上保留的最大字节数；超过则最近最少使用的响应被移除。不设置或为 0 时为 1 GiB。",
"The most calls and streams a peer may have running here on one link at once; one past it fails at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "对端在此处一条链路上可同时运行的最大调用和流数；超出的立即失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most calls the API forwards at once; one past it gets 429. 256 when left out or 0.": "API 同时转发的最大调用数；超出的得到 429。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most calls the node forwards at once, across its models; a call past it goes to another node. 256 when left out or 0.": "节点同时转发的最大调用数，跨其所有模型；超出的调用转给另一节点。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most calls to the model the node forwards at once; a call past it goes to another node. No bound but proxy.max_inflight's when left out or 0.": "节点同时转发的对该模型的最大调用数；超出的调用转给另一节点。不设置或为 0 时仅受 proxy.max_inflight 限制。",
"The most channels one allocation binds; one more is refused with 508. 64 when left out or 0. Applies to the next request.": "一个分配可绑定的最大通道数；再多一个会被拒绝并返回 508。不设置或为 0 时为 64。对下一次请求生效。",
"The most client connections the listeners keep open at once, across all of them; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. Takes effect at start, not on a reload. 100000 when left out or 0.": "监听器同时保持打开的最大客户端连接数，跨所有监听器；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。在启动时生效，重载时不生效。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most connections and udp sessions the service proxies at once; a connection past it is closed as soon as it is accepted, and the datagrams of a session past it are dropped. 10000 when left out or 0.": "该服务同时代理的最大连接数和 udp 会话数；超出的连接在被接受后立即关闭，超出的会话的数据报被丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most connections at once; one more is closed as it opens. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大连接数；多出的一个连接在建立时即被关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most connections open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 32 when left out or 0.": "同时打开的最大连接数；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections open, or being opened, to one address; a request past it waits for one to be free. 256 when left out or 0.": "到同一地址同时打开或正在打开的最大连接数；超出的请求等待有空闲连接。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most connections the API keeps open at once; one past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 256 when left out or 0.": "API 同时保持打开的最大连接数；超出的在被接受后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most connections the Admin API keeps open at once, a quarter of them kept for those that have made a request with the token (any request, without token_file). When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those that have not, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. A connection that has not is closed 5s after it is accepted, whatever it is doing. 16 when left out or 0.": "Admin API 同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已发出带令牌请求的连接（没有 token_file 时为任意请求）。连接占满时，新连接关闭尚未发出此类请求的连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已发出此类请求时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。尚未发出此类请求的连接在被接受 5s 后关闭，无论其正在做什么。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"The most connections the console keeps open at once, a quarter of them kept for those with a login. When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those without one, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has a login; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. 32 when left out or 0.": "控制台同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已登录的连接。连接占满时，新连接关闭未登录连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已登录时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections the pages keep open at once, a quarter of them kept for those with a login. When they are taken, a new connection closes the oldest of those without one, of the client holding the most, and is closed as it is accepted only when every one has a login; one past a client's share, a quarter of them, is closed too, but for loopback clients. 32 when left out or 0.": "页面同时保持打开的最大连接数，其中四分之一留给已登录的连接。连接占满时，新连接关闭未登录连接中、持有最多此类连接的客户端最早的那个；只有每个连接都已登录时，新连接才在被接受后立即关闭；超出单个客户端份额（四分之一）的连接也被关闭，回环客户端除外。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"The most connections to the application, each carrying one request at a time. 64 when left out or 0.": "到应用的最大连接数，每个连接一次承载一个请求。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most containers taken; past it, the rest, by name, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "所取的最大容器数；超出的其余容器按名称被忽略并报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most entries a listing reads and shows; a directory with more is listed in part, and says so. 10000 when left out or 0.": "目录列表读取并显示的最大条目数；条目更多的目录只列出一部分，并会注明。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most events one wait of an event loop collects; the rest wait for the next. 1024 when left out or 0.": "事件循环一次等待所收集的最大事件数；其余的等下一次。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most idle connections kept for later requests. 16 when left out or 0.": "为后续请求保留的最大空闲连接数。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"How many leading bits of an IPv6 client address name the client with key ip: a host is given a /64 to pick its addresses from, so counting each address apart would let it make a fresh key with each request. 64 when left out or 0; 128 counts each address apart.": "key 为 ip 时，用 IPv6 客户端地址的前多少位来认定一个客户端：一台主机会分到一个 /64，从中任选地址，若每个地址分开计数，它每个请求都能换一个新键。不写或为 0 时为 64；128 表示每个地址分开计数。",
"The most keys kept at once, which bounds the memory the buckets take: under 100 bytes each, and up to 128 more for a header; 100000 when left out or 0.": "同时保留的最大键数，它限制桶所占的内存：每个不到 100 字节，带头部的最多再加 128；不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most keys taken; past it, the rest, by key, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "所取的最大键数；超出的其余键按键名被忽略并报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most links one node or proxy may register, from however many processes of the same name. 128 when left out or 0.": "一个节点或代理可注册的最大链路数，无论来自多少个同名进程。不设置或为 0 时为 128。",
"The most links the hub keeps open at once, registered or not; one past it is closed as soon as it opens. 1024 when left out or 0.": "中心节点同时保持打开的最大链路数，无论是否已注册；超出的在打开后立即关闭。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most links the role takes from its peers at once; one past it is refused, and its dialer backs off. 1024 when left out or 0.": "该角色同时接受其对端的最大链路数；超出的被拒绝，其拨号方会退避。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most logins kept at once; one more ends the oldest. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时保留的最大登录数；再多一个会结束最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most memory an instance may have; one that asks for more fails its call. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个实例可使用的最大内存；请求更多的实例其调用失败。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The most memory the catalog takes, as reckoned from its items' paths, titles, tracks and codec configurations; past it the rest of the items are left out, and the scan says so. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "目录所占的最大内存，按其条目的路径、标题、轨道和编解码器配置估算；超过时其余条目被略去，并且扫描会予以说明。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"The most memory the sample tables read from the files take, kept for the files being served; past it the least recently used are dropped, and a table larger than all of it is refused. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "从文件读取的样本表为正在提供的文件所保留的最大内存；超过时丢弃最久未用的，比全部上限还大的样本表会被拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The most nodes and proxies registered at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时注册的节点和代理数量上限。未设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most nodes the hub keeps in its table, offline ones included; past it the offline node seen longest ago is forgotten; online nodes are bounded by limits.max_conns and the hub's peers. 1024 when left out or 0.": "中心节点在其表中保留的节点数量上限，含离线节点；超出后，最久之前见到的离线节点会被遗忘；在线节点受 limits.max_conns 和中心节点的对端数量限制。未设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most objects of each kind kept: past it, the rest are left out and reported. 10000 when left out or 0.": "每类对象保留的数量上限：超出后，其余的会被舍弃并报告。未设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most one call may take, from its start to the end of its response. 30m when left out.": "一次调用从开始到响应结束所允许的最长时间。未设置时为 30m。",
"The most one call may take, to the end of its response. 30m when left out.": "一次调用到响应结束所允许的最长时间。未设置时为 30m。",
"The most peer addresses relayed at once, each with a UDP socket of its own toward its media server; past it, a new address's STUN request is dropped. A session relays at most 8 of its peer's addresses. 4096 when left out or 0.": "同时中继的对端地址数量上限，每个地址各有一个通往其媒体服务器的专用 UDP 套接字；超出后，新地址的 STUN 请求会被丢弃。一个会话最多中继其对端的 8 个地址。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most permissions, peer addresses, one allocation holds; one more is refused with 508. A channel's peer counts. 64 when left out or 0. Applies to the next request.": "一个分配（allocation）所持有的权限（即对端地址）数量上限；再多一个会被以 508 拒绝。通道的对端也计入。未设置或为 0 时为 64。对下一个请求生效。",
"The most players of one stream at once, over every protocol, HLS counting once a stream and format; one more is refused. Each packet a publisher sends is handed to every player on the worker that received it. 256 when left out or 0.": "同一个流同时允许的最大播放器数（所有协议合计，HLS 按每个流及格式计一次）；多出的一个会被拒绝。发布者发送的每个包都会在接收它的 worker 上交给每个播放器。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most requests under way at once.": "同时处理中的请求数量上限。",
"The most responses the zone keeps on disk, which bounds the memory their index takes, a few hundred bytes each. 100000 when left out or 0.": "区域在磁盘上保留的响应数量上限，它决定其索引占用的内存，每条约几百字节。未设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The most rotated files kept, newest first; 0 or left out has no count limit.": "最多保留多少个切割文件（从新到旧）；0 或不设置表示不限数量。",
"The most services taken; past it, the rest, by name, are left out and reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "接收的服务数量上限；超出后，其余的服务按名称被舍弃并报告。未设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most sessions at once; one more caller is rejected with 1402. 1024 when left out or 0.": "同时允许的最大会话数；多出的调用方会被 1402 拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The most sessions proxied at once; one more offer is answered 503 before it reaches a media server. 4096 when left out or 0.": "同时代理的会话数量上限；再多一个 offer 会在到达媒体服务器之前以 503 应答。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most streams at once, each a path with a publisher or players waiting for one; one more publisher is refused. 64 when left out or 0. A change of max_streams, max_players or gop_cache_bytes starts the hub again, ending every stream and connection.": "同时允许的最大流数，每个流是一条有发布者、或有播放者在等待发布者的路径；多出的发布者会被拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 64。修改 max_streams、max_players 或 gop_cache_bytes 会重新启动 hub，结束所有流和连接。",
"The most streams published at once; one more publisher is answered 503. 64 when left out or 0.": "同时发布的流数量上限；再多一个发布者会以 503 应答。未设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The most the rotated files may total, the oldest removed until they fit. 1 GiB when left out; 0 does not limit the total.": "切割出的文件总量上限，超出时从最旧的开始删除直到满足。不设置时为 1 GiB；0 表示不限制总量。",
"The most tokens one request may ask for; more is answered 400. 100 when left out.": "一个请求最多可要求的 token 数；更多返回 400。不设置时为 100。",
"The most tunnels open at once, over every forward; a connection past it is closed as soon as it is accepted. 4096 when left out or 0.": "所有转发合计同时打开的隧道数量上限；超出后的连接在被接受后立即关闭。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most tunnels open at once, over every hub; a hub's request for one more is refused. 4096 when left out or 0.": "所有中心节点合计同时打开的隧道数量上限；中心节点再请求多开一个会被拒绝。未设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The most tunnels the hub passes at once; a proxy's request for one more is refused. 16384 when left out or 0.": "中心节点同时放行的隧道数量上限；代理再请求多开一个会被拒绝。未设置或为 0 时为 16384。",
"The most viewers of one stream; one more is answered 503. Each packet a publisher sends is sent again to every viewer, on the worker that received it. 256 when left out or 0.": "一个流的观看者数量上限；再多一个会以 503 应答。发布者发送的每个数据包都会在接收它的 worker 上再发送给每个观看者。未设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most workers each engine's pool runs connections' reads and callbacks on at once. 100 for each CPU fit may use, and at least min_workers, when left out or 0.": "每个引擎的池同时用于运行连接读取和回调的 worker 数量上限。未设置或为 0 时为 fit 可用的每个 CPU 100 个，且不少于 min_workers。",
"The name agents ask for the model by: 1 to 128 characters, no spaces. A name is unique among a node's models of one agent API: an azure_openai model shares openai's.": "代理（agent）请求该模型时使用的名称：1 到 128 个字符，不含空格。名称在节点上同一代理 API 的模型中唯一：azure_openai 模型与 openai 共用同一范围。",
"The name of the hub the tunnels go through. When left out, they are spread over every hub that has the node, more of them through the faster ones.": "隧道所经过的中心节点名称。未设置时，隧道会分散到所有拥有该节点的中心节点上，经由较快者的更多。",
"The name of the upstream connections go to: one of its addresses, picked by its load_balancing (ip_hash by the client's address; header, cookie and URI hashes, which a connection has none of, in turn), out of rotation for its max_fails and health checks as for HTTP, dialed within its connect_timeout. A connect that fails is tried on the next address picked, up to three addresses. Its protocol and HTTP settings are not used.": "连接所前往的上游名称：从其地址中选取一个，按其 load_balancing 选择（ip_hash 按客户端地址；header、cookie 和 URI 哈希因连接没有这些信息，依次退而求其次），按其 max_fails 和健康检查（与 HTTP 相同）移出轮转，并在其 connect_timeout 内拨号。连接失败时会尝试选出的下一个地址，最多三个地址。其协议和 HTTP 设置不被使用。",
"The name of the upstream requests go to; or upstreams.": "请求所前往的上游名称；或 upstreams。",
"The name of the upstream the auth service is.": "认证服务所对应的上游名称。",
"The name of the upstream the copies go to.": "副本所前往的上游名称。",
"The name of the upstream.": "上游的名称。",
"The name the hub shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages change it.": "中心节点向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改。",
"The name the hub tells the nodes and proxies that register. The host's name when left out.": "中心节点告知注册的节点和代理的名称。未设置时为主机名。",
"The name the node shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages, and a hub that settings.allow_hub_manage lets, change it.": "节点向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改，也可由 settings.allow_hub_manage 允许的中心节点修改。",
"The name the provider goes by in the Admin API's /config/effective and in logs: lower-case letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-', unique among the providers. Its kind, as docker, when left out.": "提供者在 Admin API 的 /config/effective 和日志中使用的名称：小写字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'，在各提供者中唯一。未设置时为其类型，如 docker。",
"The name the proxy shows its peers; the host's name when left out. Its pages change it.": "代理向其对端显示的名称；未设置时为主机名。可通过其页面修改。",
"The names of the listeners the route serves; every listener when left out.": "路由所服务的监听器名称；未设置时为所有监听器。",
"The names of the listeners whose connections the service takes: those that serve tcp, alone or beside other protocols, and udp listeners, each one service's. A udp listener's session is a client's address: the datagrams it sends go to one upstream address, from a socket of the session's own, and what comes back to that socket goes to the client.": "服务接收其连接的监听器名称：包括提供 tcp 的监听器（单独或与其他协议并存）以及 udp 监听器，后者每个只属于一个服务。udp 监听器的会话以客户端地址标识：它发来的数据报会从会话专属的套接字发往一个上游地址，而返回到该套接字的数据则发给客户端。",
"The namespaces whose Gateways and routes are served; every namespace when left out. Resources are watched across the cluster either way, so fit's account needs to list and watch them cluster-wide, Secrets of type kubernetes.io/tls among them, and to patch the status of GatewayClasses, Gateways and routes.": "其 Gateway 和路由被服务的命名空间；未设置时为所有命名空间。无论如何，资源都会在整个集群范围内被监视，因此 fit 的账户需要有集群范围的列出和监视权限，其中包括 kubernetes.io/tls 类型的 Secret，并需要有修补 GatewayClass、Gateway 和路由状态的权限。",
"The node whose service the tunnels go to.": "隧道所前往的服务所在的节点。",
"The node's name, which proxies name to reach its services. The host's name when left out.": "节点的名称，代理通过该名称访问其服务。未设置时为主机名。",
"The node's own settings; the defaults when left out. Only its own pages change them.": "节点自身的设置；未设置时为默认值。只有其自己的页面可以修改。",
"The node's service the tunnels go to.": "隧道所前往的节点服务。",
"The node's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "节点的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。未设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The node's web pages; none when left out.": "节点的网页；未设置时没有。",
"The nodes and proxies the hub dials. Its pages change them.": "中心节点拨号连接的节点和代理。可通过其页面修改。",
"The pages' title; fit media when left out.": "页面的标题；不设置时为 fit media。",
"The part of the path before the stream's. /whep/ when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分。不设置时为 /whep/。",
"The part of the path before the stream's. /whip/ when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分。不设置时为 /whip/。",
"The part of the path before the stream's: with /flv/, /flv/live/cam.flv plays live/cam. / when left out: /live/cam.flv plays live/cam, the stream rtmp://host/live/cam publishes.": "路径中位于流之前的部分：前缀为 /flv/ 时，/flv/live/cam.flv 播放 live/cam。不设置时为 /：/live/cam.flv 播放 live/cam，即 rtmp://host/live/cam 发布的流。",
"The part of the path before the stream's: with /hls/, /hls/live/cam/index.m3u8 is the playlist of live/cam. / when left out.": "路径中位于流之前的部分：前缀为 /hls/ 时，/hls/live/cam/index.m3u8 是 live/cam 的播放列表。不设置时为 /。",
"The password hubs prove to link as a hub, on a node's or a proxy's listener; password when left out.": "中心以中心身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于节点或代理的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password nodes prove to link as a node, on a hub's or a proxy's listener; password when left out.": "节点以节点身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于中心或代理的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password of every role the listener links with that has no password of its own: peers prove they know it when they link, and it never crosses the network. Whoever holds it may link as any of those roles, so give each role its own instead. None when left out.": "监听所连接的、没有自己密码的各角色共用的密码：对端建立链路时证明自己知道它，它不会在网络上传输。持有它的任何一方都可以以这些角色中的任意一个建立链路，因此应改为给每个角色设置自己的密码。不设置时没有。",
"The password proxies prove to link as a proxy, on a hub's or a node's listener; password when left out.": "代理以代理身份建立链路时证明的密码，用于中心或节点的监听；不设置时为 password。",
"The password the WebSocket's messages are encrypted with, which a proxy's web_proxy needs. The hub's password when left out.": "用于加密 WebSocket 消息的密码，代理的 web_proxy 需要它。未设置时为中心节点的密码。",
"The password the store is encrypted with. Written here, it protects a store copied away from this file, not one read beside it; password_file or password_env keep it out of the file.": "用于加密存储的密码。写在此处只能保护被复制走的存储，而不能防止与此文件放在一起被读取的存储；用 password_file 或 password_env 可使其不出现在文件中。",
"The password; or key.": "密码；或 key。",
"The path the pages are served under, which the route must match with what is below it, as /media/* beside /media; a request outside it gets 404. /media when left out.": "页面所在的路径，路由必须同时匹配该路径及其下的内容，如 /media 旁加 /media/*；该路径之外的请求返回 404。不设置时为 /media。",
"The path the route serves under: the route must match it and what is below it, as /media-tokens and /media-tokens/*; a request outside it gets 404. /media-tokens when left out.": "路由提供服务的路径：路由必须匹配它及其下面的路径，即 /media-tokens 和 /media-tokens/*；其外的请求返回 404。不设置时为 /media-tokens。",
"The path, and query, of the request sent to the auth service; / when left out.": "发送给认证服务的请求的路径和查询；未设置时为 /。",
"The peer's host and port, as its listen.address says.": "对端的主机和端口，如其 listen.address 所示。",
"The name the peer listener's certificate must have with ca_file, and the TLS server name sent; the address's host when left out.": "配合 ca_file 时对端监听证书须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名称；不设置时取 address 中的主机。",
"The PEM certificate self_signed made; with key. Written by the role; delete both for a new one, which every peer must pin again.": "self_signed 生成的 PEM 证书；与 key 一起使用。由角色写入；删除两者会生成新证书，所有对端都须重新固定其指纹。",
"The SHA-256 fingerprint of the certificate the peer's listener presents, 64 hex digits (colons allowed), as its pages and its log show it: the link is made over TLS (wss://) and only to a listener with exactly that certificate. A peer at an address other than a loopback one needs pin or ca_file.": "对端监听所出示证书的 SHA-256 指纹，64 个十六进制数字（可含冒号），即其页面与日志中显示的值：连接走 TLS（wss://），且只连向恰好持有该证书的监听。非回环地址的对端需要 pin 或 ca_file。",
"A PEM file with the certificate the listener presents, followed by any intermediates; with key_file, links are taken over TLS (wss://), and peers check it with their ca_file or pin. A listener on an address other than a loopback one needs TLS: this, or self_signed. Read when the listener starts, and again when it changes on disk (fit run -watch-certs): links from then on are taken with the new certificate, and those open stay.": "PEM 文件，包含监听出示的证书及其后的任何中间证书；配合 key_file，以 TLS（wss://）接受连接，对端用其 ca_file 或 pin 校验该证书。非回环地址上的监听需要 TLS：设置此项，或 self_signed。在监听启动时读取，磁盘上的文件变化时再次读取（fit run -watch-certs）：此后的连接使用新证书，已建立的连接保持不变。",
"A PEM file with the private key of cert_file.": "PEM 文件，包含 cert_file 的私钥。",
"Take links over TLS (wss://) with a self-signed certificate the role makes and keeps, so that it outlives a restart: in cert and key with admin.store, or else in a file beside the config, 0600, as fit.llm.hub.pem beside fit.json; its pages and its log show its SHA-256 fingerprint, which peers set as their pin. For a listener without cert_file.": "以 TLS（wss://）接受连接，使用角色生成并保存的自签名证书，重启后保持不变：有 admin.store 时保存在 cert 与 key 中，否则保存在配置旁的文件中（权限 0600），例如 fit.json 旁的 fit.llm.hub.pem；其页面与日志显示该证书的 SHA-256 指纹，对端将其设为 pin。用于没有 cert_file 的监听。",
"A PEM file with the certificates of the authorities the peer listener's certificate must chain to: the link is made over TLS (wss://), and the certificate must name server_name, or the address's host. Or pin, one of the two.": "PEM 文件，包含对端监听证书须链接到的证书颁发机构的证书：连接走 TLS（wss://），且证书须包含 server_name，或 address 中的主机名。与 pin 二选一。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module that exports fit_on_request, as a WASI reactor; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个导出 fit_on_request 的 WebAssembly 模块，作为 WASI reactor；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建一个。",
"The policy's name, which the auth param of whip, whep and webrtc_proxy, and the media roles, refer to it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "策略的名称，whip、whep、webrtc_proxy 以及各媒体角色的 auth 参数通过它引用该策略。可包含字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The port Ingresses' rules are served on over HTTP. 80 when left out or 0.": "Ingress 的规则通过 HTTP 提供服务的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 80。",
"The port of the HTTPS listener, and the one redirects name when it is not 443. 443 when left out or 0.": "HTTPS 监听器的端口，也是重定向在其不是 443 时所指向的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 443。",
"The port of the listener in the clear that redirects to HTTPS. 80 when left out or 0.": "重定向到 HTTPS 的明文监听器的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 80。",
"The port probes go to, in place of each address's own.": "探测所前往的端口，取代各地址自身的端口。",
"The port the hosts of Ingresses' tls are served on over HTTPS. 443 when left out or 0.": "Ingress 的 tls 中的主机通过 HTTPS 提供服务的端口。未设置或为 0 时为 443。",
"The property's path, by segment, as [\"route_metadata\", \"filter_metadata\", \"envoy.filters.http.wasm\", \"auth\"].": "属性的路径，按段给出，如 [\"route_metadata\", \"filter_metadata\", \"envoy.filters.http.wasm\", \"auth\"]。",
"The protocol: tls, TCP over TLS; wss, a WebSocket over TLS, for networks that let only HTTPS through; quic, over UDP; or tcp and ws, the same in the clear, which only a loopback address, or a hub with body_password, may take.": "协议：tls，基于 TLS 的 TCP；wss，基于 TLS 的 WebSocket，用于只允许 HTTPS 通过的网络；quic，基于 UDP；或 tcp 和 ws，即对应的明文协议，只有回环地址或设置了 body_password 的中心节点才能使用。",
"The protocols served: http/1.1, h2c (HTTP/2 in the clear) and, with tls, h2 (HTTP/2 over TLS, chosen through ALPN) and h3 (HTTP/3 over QUIC, on the same port in UDP, announced to HTTP/1 and HTTP/2 clients with Alt-Svc); tcp, raw TCP, whose connections the services that list the listener proxy to their upstreams; socks, a SOCKS5 and SOCKS4 forward proxy, as socks says; or udp alone, whose datagrams a service proxies. A listener that serves more than one of HTTP, tcp and socks tells them apart on its port by what a client sends first: a TLS ClientHello goes to the service whose server_names hold its name, or else, with tls, is served HTTPS, or else goes to the service without server_names; a SOCKS greeting to socks; an HTTP request, in the clear, to HTTP; and whatever else to the service without server_names, or it is closed. A client that waits for the server to speak first is closed after 10s: such a protocol needs a listener of its own. http/1.1 alone when left out, or http/1.1 and h2 with tls.": "所提供的协议：http/1.1、h2c（明文 HTTP/2），以及在有 tls 时的 h2（TLS 上的 HTTP/2，通过 ALPN 选择）和 h3（QUIC 上的 HTTP/3，在同一端口的 UDP 上，通过 Alt-Svc 向 HTTP/1 和 HTTP/2 客户端宣告）；tcp，原始 TCP，其连接由列出该监听器的服务代理到其上游；socks，SOCKS5 和 SOCKS4 正向代理，如 socks 所述；或单独的 udp，其数据报由服务代理。同时提供 HTTP、tcp 和 socks 中不止一种的监听器，根据客户端先发送的内容在其端口上区分它们：TLS ClientHello 交给 server_names 包含其名称的服务，否则在有 tls 时按 HTTPS 提供服务，否则交给没有 server_names 的服务；SOCKS 问候交给 socks；明文的 HTTP 请求交给 HTTP；其他任何内容交给没有 server_names 的服务，否则关闭连接。等待服务器先发言的客户端会在 10s 后被关闭：这类协议需要独占一个监听器。未设置时仅为 http/1.1，有 tls 时为 http/1.1 和 h2。",
"The proxy's name, which the hubs and nodes show. The host's name when left out.": "代理的名称，中心节点和节点会显示它。未设置时为主机名。",
"The proxy's stable ID, which its peers know it by. Made when left out, and written back here.": "代理的稳定 ID，其对端凭此识别它。未设置时自动生成，并写回此处。",
"The proxy's web pages; none when left out.": "代理的网页；未设置时没有。",
"The realm of the challenges, which Digest's response is computed with. fit when left out.": "质询的 realm，Digest 的响应据此计算。不设置时为 fit。",
"The realm of the credentials, sent in every challenge: clients derive their key from their name, the realm and their password. A change starts a new server, ending the allocations of the old one when they share an address and draining it otherwise.": "凭据的 realm，在每次质询中发送：客户端根据其名称、realm 和密码派生其密钥。更改会启动一个新服务器；若新旧服务器共用一个地址，则结束旧服务器的分配，否则将其排空。",
"The realm the browser shows when it asks for a user and password; fit when left out.": "浏览器请求用户名和密码时显示的 realm；未设置时为 fit。",
"The receive latency asked for, the time a packet may take to be sent again when lost; the caller's wins when larger. 120ms when left out.": "所要求的接收延迟，即丢包后重发所允许花费的时间；调用方的值更大时以调用方为准。不设置时为 120ms。",
"The request's fields sent to the auth service; all but the hop-by-hop ones and those of the body when left out.": "发送给认证服务的请求字段；未设置时为除逐跳字段和请求体相关字段之外的全部字段。",
"The response body.": "响应体。",
"The role the peer must announce; a link to a peer of another role is refused. Never the dialing role's own.": "对端必须宣告的角色；与其他角色的对端建立链路会被拒绝。绝不能是拨号方自己的角色。",
"The schemes a 401 offers for users: digest, which needs a user's plaintext password, and basic, which sends the password in the clear and is the only one a password_hash user can use. [\"digest\"] when left out.": "401 为用户提供的方案：digest 需要用户的明文密码，basic 以明文发送密码，且是 password_hash 用户唯一可用的方案。不设置时为 [\"digest\"]。",
"The script a path ending in / runs; index.php when left out.": "以 / 结尾的路径所运行的脚本；未设置时为 index.php。",
"The segment format of a playlist's URL without a format query parameter: fmp4, fragmented MP4 for H.264, H.265, AV1, AAC and Opus, or ts, MPEG-TS for H.264, H.265, AAC and Opus. The other is played with ?format=ts or ?format=fmp4. fmp4 when left out.": "没有 format 查询参数的播放列表 URL 所用的分片格式：fmp4，即分片 MP4，适用于 H.264、H.265、AV1、AAC 和 Opus；或 ts，即 MPEG-TS，适用于 H.264、H.265、AAC 和 Opus。另一种格式用 ?format=ts 或 ?format=fmp4 播放。不设置时为 fmp4。",
"The server names (SNI) of the TLS connections the service takes from its tcp listeners, which it proxies as they are, without terminating their TLS; \"*.example.com\" takes the names one label below example.com. A tcp listener may then be listed by several services: a connection goes to the one whose names hold the name its ClientHello asks for, or else to the listener's service without server_names, if it has one, as one that is not TLS or asks for no name does; otherwise it is closed. The ClientHello must come within 10s.": "服务从其 tcp 监听器接收的 TLS 连接的服务器名称（SNI），服务按原样代理这些连接，不终止其 TLS；\"*.example.com\" 匹配 example.com 之下一级标签的名称。这样一个 tcp 监听器可以被多个服务列出：连接会交给其名称包含 ClientHello 所请求名称的服务，否则交给该监听器中没有 server_names 的服务（如果有），非 TLS 或未请求名称的连接同样如此；否则连接被关闭。ClientHello 必须在 10s 内到达。",
"The server's host and port. 127.0.0.1:6379 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口。未设置时为 127.0.0.1:6379。",
"The server's stun:, stuns:, turn: or turns: URLs.": "服务器的 stun:、stuns:、turn: 或 turns: URL。",
"The servers requests can be proxied to, by name.": "可以将请求代理到的服务器，按名称。",
"The service's TCP address, host and port.": "服务的 TCP 地址，含主机和端口。",
"The service's name among the node's, which proxies' forwards name.": "服务在节点的服务中的名称，代理的转发通过该名称引用它。",
"The service.name of the resource traces and metrics are about. fit when left out.": "追踪和指标所针对的资源的 service.name。未设置时为 fit。",
"The services the node reaches, and the only addresses it opens tunnels to.": "节点可访问的服务，也是它仅有的可以打开隧道的地址。",
"The share of failures in the window that opens it; 0.5 when left out.": "窗口内触发开启的失败占比；未设置时为 0.5。",
"The share of requests copied, chosen at random; all of them when left out.": "被复制的请求占比，随机选取；未设置时为全部请求。",
"The share of requests traced among those whose caller did not decide: from 0 to 1. A request whose traceparent says its caller sampled it is always traced, and one that says it did not is never. 0, only those a caller sampled, when left out.": "在调用方未决定的请求中被追踪的请求占比：0 到 1。traceparent 表明调用方已采样的请求总是被追踪，表明未采样的则绝不追踪。未设置时为 0，即仅追踪调用方已采样的请求。",
"The shared secret of time-limited credentials, as coturn's static-auth-secret (use-auth-secret) has it: a username \"<expiry in Unix seconds>:<anything>\" whose password is the base64 of HMAC-SHA1(secret, username), valid until the expiry. A web service that knows the secret hands them out.": "限时凭据的共享密钥，与 coturn 的 static-auth-secret（use-auth-secret）相同：用户名为 \"<expiry in Unix seconds>:<anything>\"，其密码是 HMAC-SHA1(secret, username) 的 base64，在过期时间前有效。知道该密钥的 Web 服务会分发这些凭据。",
"The shortest declared body compressed; 1024 when left out. A body that declares no length, as one that streams, is compressed.": "被压缩的响应体声明长度的最小值；未设置时为 1024。未声明长度的响应体（如流式响应体）会被压缩。",
"The status code; 200 when left out.": "状态码；未设置时为 200。",
"The status of a request refused; 429 when left out, or 503 as nginx's limit_conn answers.": "被拒绝请求的状态码；未设置时为 429，或如 nginx 的 limit_conn 那样为 503。",
"The status of a request refused; 429 when left out.": "被拒绝请求的状态码；未设置时为 429。",
"The status: 301 and 308 are permanent, 302, 303 and 307 temporary; 307 and 308 keep the method and body. 302 when left out.": "状态码：301 和 308 为永久重定向，302、303 和 307 为临时重定向；307 和 308 保留方法和请求体。未设置时为 302。",
"The statuses that count as failures; 500 to 599 when left out.": "算作失败的状态码；未设置时为 500 到 599。",
"The store responses are kept in. Caches of the same zone, in one route or several, share it, its size and its keys; it is kept across reloads while a cache uses it. default when left out.": "响应保存所在的存储。同一区域的缓存，无论在一个路由还是多个路由中，共享该存储、其大小及其键；只要有缓存在使用它，它就会在重新加载后保留。未设置时为 default。",
"The store's file, made 0600 when it is written. fit stops at start if it exists and does not open with the password.": "存储的文件，写入时权限为 0600。如果它存在而无法用该密码打开，fit 会在启动时停止。",
"The stream's name. When left out, the name is the last segment of the path a POST is sent to, as cam1 in /whep/cam1 on a route of /whep/*: one route plays every stream. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too, as /watch/* beside /watch.": "流的名称。未设置时，名称为 POST 所发送路径的最后一段，如路由为 /whep/* 时 /whep/cam1 中的 cam1：一个路由播放所有流。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配它，如 /watch 旁边的 /watch/*。",
"The stream's name. When left out, the name is the last segment of the path a POST is sent to, as cam1 in /whip/cam1 on a route of /whip/*: one route takes every stream. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too, as /live/* beside /live.": "流的名称。未设置时，名称为 POST 所发送路径的最后一段，如路由为 /whip/* 时 /whip/cam1 中的 cam1：一个路由接收所有流。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配它，如 /live 旁边的 /live/*。",
"The stream's path. When left out, it is the path after prefix a POST is sent to, as live/cam in /whep/live/cam. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too.": "流的路径。不设置时为 POST 所发送的 prefix 之后的路径，如 /whep/live/cam 中的 live/cam。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配该 URL。",
"The stream's path. When left out, it is the path after prefix a POST is sent to, as live/cam in /whip/live/cam. A session's URL is the path of its POST followed by its ID, which the route must match too.": "流的路径。不设置时为 POST 所发送的 prefix 之后的路径，如 /whip/live/cam 中的 live/cam。会话的 URL 是其 POST 的路径后接其 ID，路由也必须匹配该 URL。",
"The stream-name prefixes this route may sign for: every publish and play pattern of a request must start with one of them, so that a token cannot be signed for a stream outside them, as mtg- for mtg-42-*. Any valid pattern when left out.": "该路由可以为其签发 token 的流名前缀：请求中的每个 publish 和 play 模式都必须以其中之一开头，因此无法为这些前缀之外的流签发 token，例如用 mtg- 对应 mtg-42-*。不设置时接受任何合法模式。",
"The streams the token may play, as publish lists them. None when left out.": "该 token 可播放的流，写法与 publish 相同。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the token may publish, by name or path, with * matching any run of characters, '/' among them, as live/* or room1-*. None when left out.": "该 token 可发布的流，按名称或路径给出，* 匹配任意一串字符（包括 '/'），如 live/* 或 room1-*。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the user may play. None when left out.": "该用户可播放的流。不设置时为无。",
"The streams the user may publish, as a token's publish lists them. None when left out.": "该用户可发布的流，写法与 token 的 publish 相同。不设置时为无。",
"The token, at least 16 characters. Or token_sha256, one of the two.": "token，至少 16 个字符。与 token_sha256 二选一。",
"The tunnel's roles to run beside the gateway, on its engine: a hub, a node and a proxy, which reach services behind NAT through the hub. None when left out. What their web pages change is written back here.": "在网关旁边、在其引擎上运行的隧道角色：hub、node 和 proxy，它们通过中心节点访问 NAT 之后的服务。未设置时没有。它们的网页所做的更改会写回此处。",
"The upstream of the media servers, picked by its load balancing for each offer: fit's own whip and whep, or any WHIP or WHEP server. Its health checks and timeouts apply.": "媒体服务器的上游，每个 offer 按其负载均衡选取：fit 自己的 whip 和 whep，或任何 WHIP 或 WHEP 服务器。其健康检查和超时适用。",
"The upstream's base URL, http or https, without a query or a trailing slash. openai, anthropic and cohere calls go to it with their path appended, as base_url/chat/completions with http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1; gemini's to base_url/models/{upstream}:{method}, with https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta; azure_openai's to base_url/openai/deployments/{upstream}/{path}, with https://{resource}.openai.azure.com; ollama's to base_url/api/chat, with http://127.0.0.1:11434.": "上游的基础 URL，http 或 https，不含查询和末尾斜杠。openai、anthropic 和 cohere 的调用发往它并附加其路径，如 http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1 时为 base_url/chat/completions；gemini 的发往 base_url/models/{upstream}:{method}，如 https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta；azure_openai 的发往 base_url/openai/deployments/{upstream}/{path}，如 https://{resource}.openai.azure.com；ollama 的发往 base_url/api/chat，如 http://127.0.0.1:11434。",
"The user to authenticate as, with password_file, when etcd's authentication is on; none when left out.": "当 etcd 的认证开启时，配合 password_file 用于认证的用户；未设置时没有。",
"The user's name.": "用户名。",
"The user's name; it may not contain a colon or a control character.": "用户名；不得包含冒号或控制字符。",
"The user's name; it may not contain a colon.": "用户名；不能包含冒号。",
"The user's password. A user with one can also log in with RTSP's Digest, which needs the password itself. Or password_hash, one of the two.": "用户的密码。设置了密码的用户也可以使用 RTSP 的 Digest 登录，Digest 需要密码本身。与 password_hash 二选一。",
"The username.": "用户名。",
"The users allowed in, with their passwords' bcrypt hashes.": "允许进入的用户，附带其密码的 bcrypt 哈希。",
"The users with fixed credentials. With secret, or alone; at least one of the two.": "使用固定凭据的用户。配合 secret 使用，或单独使用；二者至少要有一个。",
"The version of fit's config this one is written for, 1; fit refuses a config written for a version it does not read, rather than read it wrongly. Optional: a config that leaves it out is read as version 1.": "此配置所针对的 fit 配置版本，即 1；fit 会拒绝为其不能读取的版本编写的配置，而不是错误地读取。可选：未设置的配置按版本 1 读取。",
"The window max_fails are counted in, and how long an address that reached them stays out; 10s when left out.": "统计 max_fails 的窗口，也是达到该值的地址被移出的时长；未设置时为 10s。",
"The zone a line's time is written in, and the zone a file's interval is rotated at: local (the default), utc, or an IANA zone name such as Asia/Shanghai. json and text wrote UTC and line local before this setting; now every format writes this zone, local when left out, and 24h turns at local midnight. A change takes effect on reload.": "一行时间写入所用、以及文件按 interval 切割所用的时区：local（默认）、utc，或 Asia/Shanghai 这类 IANA 时区名。在此设置之前，json 和 text 写 UTC、line 写本地时间；现在每种格式都写这个时区，不设置时为本地时间，24h 在本地午夜切割。修改后重载即生效。",
"The zone the time of every line is written in, and the zone a file's interval is rotated at: local (the default), utc, or an IANA zone name such as Asia/Shanghai. So 24h turns at local midnight by default, and at UTC midnight with utc. The zone database is embedded, so an IANA name works in a container without zoneinfo. A change takes effect on reload.": "每行时间写入所用、以及文件按 interval 切割所用的时区：local（默认）、utc，或 Asia/Shanghai 这类 IANA 时区名。因此默认 24h 在本地午夜切割，设为 utc 时在 UTC 午夜切割。时区数据库已内嵌，没有 zoneinfo 的容器中 IANA 名称也可用。修改后重载即生效。",
"Trace requests: a server span for each one sampled, and its context sent on to upstreams in traceparent. No traces when left out.": "追踪请求：为每个被采样的请求生成一个服务端 span，并通过 traceparent 将其上下文继续发送给上游。未设置时不追踪。",
"Turn HTTPS by default off: no listeners are made for a config that writes none, and an empty tls gets no certificates.": "关闭默认的 HTTPS：对于未写任何监听器的配置不创建监听器，空的 tls 也不会获得证书。",
"Turns on Low-Latency HLS with parts this long, 200ms to 1s being usual: blocking playlist reloads, EXT-X-PART and preload hints. Off when left out.": "启用低延迟 HLS，分片（part）为此时长，通常为 200ms 到 1s：阻塞式播放列表重载、EXT-X-PART 和预加载提示。不设置时关闭。",
"URLs of fit's own TURN server, webrtc.turn, as peers reach it, as in \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\": each answer's Link headers carry them with time-limited credentials made from webrtc.turn's secret, which must be set.": "fit 自己的 TURN 服务器 webrtc.turn 的 URL，即对端访问它时使用的地址，如 \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\"：每个应答的 Link 头会携带它们，以及由 webrtc.turn 的 secret 生成的限时凭据，该 secret 必须已设置。",
"Up to how much longer than interval each wait between probes may be, chosen at random each time, so that probes from many upstreams spread out; a tenth of interval when left out. Less than interval.": "每次探测之间的等待时间最多可比 interval 长多少，每次随机选取，使来自众多上游的探测错开；未设置时为 interval 的十分之一。小于 interval。",
"Upstreams requests are spread over at random by weight, as a canary release does, in place of upstream.": "请求按权重随机分配到的上游，如金丝雀发布所做的那样，取代 upstream。",
"Users with a password, each with the streams they may publish and play: sent as Authorization: Basic, as user and pass query parameters where a protocol has no header (RTMP, SRT), or RTSP's Digest. They also log in to fit's media pages, which hand out tokens signed with secret.": "带密码的用户，每个用户有其可发布和可播放的流：以 Authorization: Basic 发送，在协议没有请求头时（RTMP、SRT）以 user 和 pass 查询参数发送，或使用 RTSP 的 Digest。他们也可以登录 fit 的媒体页面，页面会发放用 secret 签名的 token。",
"Values to add to fields, after any already there.": "要添加到字段的值，附加在已有的值之后。",
"What a call that fails, traps or runs past its timeout leads to: fail answers 500, or fails a response under way, closing its HTTP/1 connection or resetting its stream; skip lets the request or its response go on as if the plugin were not there. fail when left out.": "调用失败、触发 trap或超时后的处理：fail 应答 500，或使进行中的响应失败，关闭其 HTTP/1 连接或重置其流；skip 让请求或其响应继续进行，就像插件不存在一样。未设置时为 fail。",
"What a request must match; every request when left out.": "请求必须匹配的条件；未设置时匹配每个请求。",
"What an offer asks of auth: publish for a WHIP endpoint, play for a WHEP one. Required with auth.": "offer 对 auth 的要求：WHIP 端点为 publish，WHEP 端点为 play。设置了 auth 时必填。",
"What answers the request.": "应答请求的内容。",
"What ends a script's name in a path, the rest being PATH_INFO: \"/index.php/a/b\" runs /index.php with PATH_INFO /a/b. A static handler on a file system that folds case serves no file with one of these extensions, in any case. [\".php\"] when left out.": "脚本名称在路径中的结束标志，其余部分为 PATH_INFO：\"/index.php/a/b\" 运行 /index.php，PATH_INFO 为 /a/b。在不区分大小写的文件系统上，static 处理器不提供带这些扩展名（不论大小写）的任何文件。未设置时为 [\".php\"]。",
"What fit runs for WebRTC beside the gateway, on its engine: a TURN server, the media port of the whip and whep handlers, and the relay of the webrtc_proxy handler. None when left out.": "fit 在网关旁边、在其引擎上为 WebRTC 运行的内容：TURN 服务器、whip 和 whep 处理器的媒体端口，以及 webrtc_proxy 处理器的中继。未设置时没有。",
"What replaces each match of regexp, in which $1 or ${name} stand for the regexp's groups.": "用于替换 regexp 每处匹配的内容，其中 $1 或 ${name} 代表 regexp 的分组。",
"What requests are counted by: ip, the client's address; route, every request of the route together; or header:Name, a header's value, with a request without it counted by ip. ip when left out.": "请求计数所依据的对象：ip，客户端地址；route，路由的所有请求合计；或 header:Name，某个头的值，没有该头的请求按 ip 计数。未设置时为 ip。",
"What the URL is, as RTMP or SRT.": "该 URL 的类别，如 RTMP 或 SRT。",
"What the key is for: 1 to 64 characters.": "该密钥的用途：1 到 64 个字符。",
"What the keys kept start with, as fit/certificates/<CA>/<name>.pem; instances that share certificates share it. fit/ when left out.": "所保存的密钥的前缀，如 fit/certificates/<CA>/<name>.pem；共享证书的实例共用它。未设置时为 fit/。",
"What the labels read start with, as in fit.routes.web.host. fit when left out.": "所读取标签的前缀，如 fit.routes.web.host。未设置时为 fit。",
"What the service is, for the pages.": "该服务是什么，用于页面显示。",
"What the tags read start with, as in fit.routes.web.host=example.com; tags without '=' are passed over. Besides the routes, services and upstream settings a Docker container's labels may set, <tag_prefix>.name names the upstream, the service's name when left out. fit when left out.": "所读取标签（tag）的前缀，如 fit.routes.web.host=example.com；不含 '=' 的标签会被跳过。除 Docker 容器的标签可设置的路由、服务和上游设置外，<tag_prefix>.name 为上游命名，未设置时为服务的名称。未设置时为 fit。",
"What the token is called in logs, which never show the token itself: token:<name>, or token when left out.": "日志中对该 token 的称呼，日志从不显示 token 本身：token:<name>，不设置时为 token。",
"When the key was made, in seconds since 1970.": "密钥的创建时间，自 1970 年起的秒数。",
"Where Consul's HTTP API is, as of the local agent: http:// or https:// and a host and port. http://127.0.0.1:8500 when left out.": "Consul 的 HTTP API 所在位置，即本地代理的位置：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口。未设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:8500。",
"Where a line is written for each request, as JSON or, as its format says, text or line; no access log when left out.": "为每个请求写入一行的位置，格式为 JSON，或按其 format 所指定的 text 或 line；未设置时没有访问日志。",
"Where etcd's client API is: http:// or https:// and a host and port, for each member to try, in turn when one fails. http://127.0.0.1:2379 when left out.": "etcd 客户端 API 所在位置：http:// 或 https:// 加主机和端口，每个成员各一个，一个失败时依次尝试下一个。未设置时为 http://127.0.0.1:2379。",
"Where nodes and proxies link to the hub, each over its protocol. A tcp or ws listener on an address that is not a loopback one needs body_password: use tls, wss or quic there. None when left out: the console's pages add them.": "节点和代理连接到中心节点的位置，各自基于其协议。非回环地址上的 tcp 或 ws 监听器需要 body_password：在那里请使用 tls、wss 或 quic。未设置时没有：控制台的页面会添加它们。",
"Where requests to a Service go: endpoints, to its ready endpoints from its EndpointSlices, balanced by fit; or cluster_ip, to its cluster IP, balanced by the cluster. endpoints when left out.": "对 Service 的请求前往的位置：endpoints，前往其 EndpointSlice 中就绪的端点，由 fit 做负载均衡；或 cluster_ip，前往其集群 IP，由集群做负载均衡。未设置时为 endpoints。",
"Where the Admin API listens: a host and port, or \"unix/\" and the path of a Unix socket, as in \"unix//run/fit/admin.sock\". A host that is not a loopback address or localhost needs token_file, cert_file and key_file, so that only holders of the token reach the API and the token never crosses a network in the clear. 127.0.0.1:2019 when left out.": "Admin API 监听的位置：主机和端口，或 \"unix/\" 加 Unix 套接字的路径，如 \"unix//run/fit/admin.sock\"。主机不是回环地址或 localhost 时，需要 token_file、cert_file 和 key_file，使只有持有令牌者能访问 API，且令牌不会以明文穿过网络。未设置时为 127.0.0.1:2019。",
"Where the Docker daemon's API is: unix:// and a socket's path, or tcp:// and a host and port, as of a socket proxy, in plain HTTP. unix:///var/run/docker.sock when left out.": "Docker 守护进程 API 所在位置：unix:// 加套接字路径，或 tcp:// 加主机和端口（如套接字代理的），使用明文 HTTP。未设置时为 unix:///var/run/docker.sock。",
"Where the application listens: a host and port, as \"127.0.0.1:9000\", or \"unix/\" and a socket's path, as \"unix//run/php/php-fpm.sock\".": "应用监听的位置：主机和端口，如 \"127.0.0.1:9000\"，或 \"unix/\" 加套接字路径，如 \"unix//run/php/php-fpm.sock\"。",
"Where the hub takes links from nodes and proxies; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "中心节点接收来自节点和代理的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the node takes links from hubs and proxies; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "节点接收来自中心节点和代理的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the proxy takes links from hubs and nodes; none when left out. Its pages change it.": "代理接收来自中心节点和节点的链路的位置；未设置时没有。可通过其页面修改。",
"Where the token is: header, after Bearer in the Authorization field; header:Name, the whole of that field; cookie:name; or query:name. header when left out.": "令牌所在位置：header，Authorization 字段中 Bearer 之后；header:Name，该字段的全部内容；cookie:name；或 query:name。未设置时为 header。",
"Where to: a URL or a path, in which {scheme}, {host} (with its port, as the client sent it), {path}, {query} (without the '?') and {uri} (the path and query) stand for the request's, and, with regexp, $1 or ${name} for its groups, as in \"https://{host}{uri}\" or \"/new/$1\".": "目标位置：URL 或路径，其中 {scheme}、{host}（含端口，与客户端发送的一致）、{path}、{query}（不含 '?'）和 {uri}（路径和查询）代表请求的相应部分，配合 regexp 时 $1 或 ${name} 代表其分组，如 \"https://{host}{uri}\" 或 \"/new/$1\"。",
"Whether a member's camera is on when it joins a call in the pages: off when left out, for the member to switch on, and a publisher sends a frame with its name while it is off, so a switch never renegotiates. The URL's cam=0 or cam=1 overrides it.": "页面中成员加入通话时摄像头是否开启：不设置时为关闭，由成员自行开启；关闭期间推流方发送带名字的帧，因此开关不会触发重新协商。URL 中的 cam=0 或 cam=1 覆盖此设置。",
"Whether a member's microphone is on when it joins a call in the pages: off when left out, for the member to switch on, and a publisher sends a silent track while it is off, so a switch never renegotiates. The URL's mic=0 or mic=1 overrides it.": "页面中成员加入通话时麦克风是否开启：不设置时为关闭，由成员自行开启；关闭期间推流方发送静音轨道，因此开关不会触发重新协商。URL 中的 mic=0 或 mic=1 覆盖此设置。",
"Whether a room call has a chat: the pages show it, and the room API carries the members' text messages and small files between them. False answers the chat's API 404 and shows no chat window. True when left out.": "房间通话是否有聊天：页面显示聊天窗口，房间 API 在成员之间传递文字消息和小文件。为 false 时聊天的 API 返回 404，且不显示聊天窗口。不设置时为 true。",
"Whether files and directories whose names start with a dot, as .git, .env and .htpasswd do, are served: deny answers a request for one, or for anything under a dot directory, 404, as for a file not there, but /.well-known/ under the root, for ACME's HTTP-01 challenge and security.txt; allow serves them as other files. Listings leave them out either way. On Windows deny also hides a path with a segment shaped as an 8.3 short name, as GIT~1 for .git, which NTFS may give a dotfile. deny when left out.": "是否提供名称以点开头的文件和目录（如 .git、.env 和 .htpasswd）：deny 对请求它们或点目录之下任何内容的请求返回 404，如同文件不存在，但根目录下的 /.well-known/ 除外，供 ACME 的 HTTP-01 质询和 security.txt 使用；allow 像其他文件一样提供它们。无论哪种，目录列表都不列出它们。在 Windows 上，deny 还会隐藏含有形如 8.3 短文件名的段的路径（如 .git 的 GIT~1，NTFS 可能为点文件生成）。不设置时为 deny。",
"Whether scripts whose paths have a segment starting with a dot, as /.git/x.php or /.env, run: deny answers a request for one 404, and try_files passes over it, but /.well-known/ under the root; allow runs them as other scripts. On Windows deny also refuses a script with a segment shaped as an 8.3 short name, as GIT~1 for .git, which NTFS may give a dotfile. The path info after a script is not looked at. deny when left out.": "路径中有以点开头的段的脚本（如 /.git/x.php 或 /.env）是否运行：deny 对请求它们的请求返回 404，try_files 也会跳过它们，但根目录下的 /.well-known/ 除外；allow 像其他脚本一样运行它们。脚本之后的 path info 不受检查。在 Windows 上，deny 还会拒绝含有形如 8.3 短文件名的段的脚本（如 .git 的 GIT~1，NTFS 可能为点文件生成）。不设置时为 deny。",
"Who may log in: at least one user.": "谁可以登录：至少一个用户。",
"Who may use the listener's socks, and where it connects them: needed with socks. It serves CONNECT, without authentication, and refuses BIND and UDP ASSOCIATE.": "谁可以使用监听器的 socks，以及将其连接到何处：使用 socks 时必需。它提供 CONNECT，不做认证，并拒绝 BIND 和 UDP ASSOCIATE。",
"With h2: a PEM file of the certificates the servers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots. It is watched, as a listener's certificate files are: a change loads the config again.": "配合 h2：一个 PEM 文件，包含用于校验服务器证书的证书，取代系统根证书。它会被监视，与监听器的证书文件一样：更改会重新加载配置。",
"With h2: a PEM file of the client certificate, and the chain after it, that fit presents to servers that ask for one (mutual TLS); needs tls_key_file. It is watched, as tls_ca_file is: a change loads the config again.": "配合 h2：一个 PEM 文件，包含 fit 向索要客户端证书的服务器出示的客户端证书及其后的证书链（双向 TLS）；需要 tls_key_file。它会被监视，与 tls_ca_file 一样：更改会重新加载配置。",
"With h2: the PEM file of tls_cert_file's private key.": "配合 h2：tls_cert_file 的私钥的 PEM 文件。",
"With h2: the name the servers' certificates are checked against, and sent in SNI; each address's host when left out.": "配合 h2：用于校验服务器证书并在 SNI 中发送的名称；未设置时为各地址的主机。",
"With header_hash, the header, and with cookie_hash, the cookie, whose value requests are hashed by.": "配合 header_hash 时为头，配合 cookie_hash 时为 cookie，请求按其值做哈希。",
"With http: the Host field the probe sends; the address's host when left out.": "配合 http：探测发送的 Host 字段；未设置时为地址的主机。",
"With http: the path, and query, the probe asks for; / when left out.": "配合 http：探测请求的路径和查询；未设置时为 /。",
"With http: the statuses that pass; any from 200 to 399 when left out.": "配合 http：视为通过的状态码；未设置时为 200 到 399 的任意状态码。",
"With slow_threshold, the share of slow responses in the window that opens it; 0.5 when left out.": "配合 slow_threshold：窗口内触发开启的慢响应占比；未设置时为 0.5。",
"fit's own log: what it says about starting, reloading, certificates, providers and the engine, by logger, each with the least level written, and the format and output it writes in, as fib writes its own. Messages at info and debug to stdout and the rest to stderr, at info and above, as lines, when left out.": "fit 自己的日志：它关于启动、重新加载、证书、提供者和引擎的输出，按 logger 区分，每个 logger 有写入的最低级别，以及写入的格式和输出位置，与 fib 写自己的日志一样。未设置时，info 和 debug 级别的消息输出到 stdout，其余输出到 stderr，级别为 info 及以上，格式为行。",
"fit's streaming role, beside the gateway on its engine: one media hub where a stream is published once, over RTMP, RTSP, SRT or WHIP, and played over any of them, HTTP-FLV and HLS too, each listener and handler with its media_auth policy. None when left out.": "fit 的流媒体角色，运行在其引擎上、与网关并列：一个媒体 hub，流只需发布一次（通过 RTMP、RTSP、SRT 或 WHIP），即可通过其中任何一种以及 HTTP-FLV 和 HLS 播放，每个监听器和处理器各有其 media_auth 策略。不设置时为无。",
"http sends a GET request, over the upstream's protocol, and passes on an expected status; tcp passes once a connection opens. http when left out.": "http 通过上游的协议发送 GET 请求，并放行预期的状态码；tcp 在连接打开后即视为通过。未设置时为 http。",
"require: a client without a valid certificate is refused in the handshake; verify_if_given: a client may send none, and a route that needs one says so with the client_cert middleware, but one it sends must be valid. require when left out. A listener that requires certificates cannot answer ACME's TLS-ALPN-01 challenge, whose CA sends none.": "require：没有有效证书的客户端在握手时被拒绝；verify_if_given：客户端可以不发送证书，需要证书的路由通过 client_cert 中间件声明这一点，但客户端发送的证书必须有效。未设置时为 require。要求证书的监听器无法应答 ACME 的 TLS-ALPN-01 质询，因为其 CA 不发送证书。",
"The PEM private key of cert_file.": "cert_file 的 PEM 私钥。",
"A PEM file of the CAs that sign the hub's certificate, which tls://, wss:// and quic:// endpoints check it against, its name too, in place of the system's roots. Read at each dial. Not with pin.": "PEM 文件，包含为中心节点证书签名的 CA，tls://、wss:// 和 quic:// 端点据此校验证书及其名称，取代系统根证书。每次拨号时读取。不能与 pin 同时设置。",
"A tls, wss or quic listener's certificate: a PEM file with it, followed by any intermediates, for nodes and proxies that check it with ca_file or the system's roots; with key_file. Read when the hub's member is applied, and again when it changes on disk (fit run -watch-certs). The hub's own certificate, in quic, when left out.": "tls、wss 或 quic 监听器的证书：PEM 文件，包含该证书及其后的中间证书，供用 ca_file 或系统根证书校验它的节点和代理使用；与 key_file 配合。在应用中心节点的配置成员时读取，磁盘上的文件变化时再次读取（fit run -watch-certs）。不设置时使用中心节点自己的证书（在 quic 中）。",
"Anything else about the token, for the pages; up to 1024 bytes.": "关于该令牌的其他说明，供页面显示；最多 1024 字节。",
"The members that first linked with the token, which no other token may link as: a tunnel's node/<name> or proxy/<name>, an LLM role's ID. Written by the listener; revoking the token frees them.": "首次用该令牌连接的成员，其他令牌不能再以它们的身份连接：隧道中为 node/<name> 或 proxy/<name>，LLM 中为角色的 ID。由监听方写入；吊销该令牌即释放它们。",
"The token the hub issued for this node or proxy, as fitt1.<id>.<secret>, which its pages, its Admin API module or fit token show once when they make it. Set token or password, not both.": "中心节点为本节点或代理签发的令牌，形如 fitt1.<id>.<secret>，由其页面、Admin API 模块或 fit token 在生成时显示一次。token 与 password 只设其一。",
"The shared password of the dialing role on the peer's listener, deprecated for token: a node dials with the peer's listen.node_password, a proxy with its listen.proxy_password, a hub with its listen.hub_password, or with its listen.password when it has none for the role. Taken in this release, with a warning on the peer's pages; refused in the next.": "拨号角色在对端监听上的共享密码，已弃用，请改用 token：节点使用对端的 listen.node_password，代理使用其 listen.proxy_password，中心节点使用其 listen.hub_password；对端没有该角色的密码时使用其 listen.password。本版本仍接受，对端页面会给出警告；下一版本将拒绝。",
"When set, the body of every frame on the links is encrypted with AES-256-GCM, and nodes and proxies need the same one: each frame is authenticated, so a tcp or ws listener on an address that is not a loopback one is allowed only with it. A link registered with a token derives its keys from the token and this, by HKDF; one with the password, from the password's PBKDF2. It applies to the links that open after it changes.": "设置后，链路上每一帧的消息体都用 AES-256-GCM 加密，节点和代理需要相同的值：每一帧都经过认证，因此只有设置了它，非回环地址上才允许 tcp 或 ws 监听。用令牌注册的链路由令牌与此值经 HKDF 派生密钥；用密码注册的链路由密码的 PBKDF2 派生。修改后对此后新建的链路生效。",
"When the token was made, in seconds since 1970.": "令牌的生成时间，自 1970 年起的秒数。",
"The hub's shared password: deprecated for token, taken by hubs of this release with a warning, and refused by the next.": "中心节点的共享密码：已弃用，请改用 token；本版本的中心节点仍接受并给出警告，下一版本将拒绝。",
"The password every node and proxy may register with, which they prove they know without sending it: deprecated for tokens, which give each member a credential of its own. Still taken in this release, with a warning on the pages while a member uses it; refused in the next. Without it, only tokens register.": "所有节点和代理都可用来注册的密码，它们无需发送即可证明自己知道它：已弃用，请改用令牌，令牌让每个成员拥有自己的凭据。本版本仍接受，有成员使用时页面会给出警告；下一版本将拒绝。不设置时只接受令牌注册。",
"When the token expires, in seconds since 1970: it is refused from then on, and the links it holds are closed. Never when left out or 0.": "令牌的过期时间，自 1970 年起的秒数：此后它将被拒绝，其持有的链路被关闭。不设置或为 0 时永不过期。",
"The tokens the node's listener issued, which hubs and proxies link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "节点监听签发的令牌，中心节点和代理用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The tokens the proxy's listener issued, which hubs and nodes link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "代理监听签发的令牌，中心节点和节点用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The tokens the hub's listener issued, which nodes and proxies link with in place of a password: each its own credential, of no role, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The pages, the Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "中心节点监听签发的令牌，节点和代理用它代替密码连接：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，不绑定角色，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The token the peer's listener issued for this role, as fitt1.<id>.<secret>, which the peer's pages, its Admin API module or fit token show once when they make it. Set token or password, not both.": "对端监听为本角色签发的令牌，形如 fitt1.<id>.<secret>，由对端的页面、Admin API 模块或 fit token 在生成时显示一次。token 与 password 只设其一。",
"The tokens the hub issued, which nodes and proxies register with in place of the password: each its own credential, kept as a hash, with an optional expiry. The hub's pages, its Admin API module and fit token make, list, change and revoke them; not written by hand.": "中心节点签发的令牌，节点和代理用它代替密码注册：每个令牌都是独立的凭据，只以哈希保存，可设过期时间。由中心节点的页面、Admin API 模块和 fit token 生成、列出、修改和吊销；不要手写。",
"The token's ID, 16 hex digits, the part of the token before its secret; unique among the listener's.": "令牌的 ID，16 位十六进制数，即令牌中密钥之前的部分；在同一监听的令牌中唯一。",
"The SHA-256 of the key the token's secret derives, in hex: what the listener checks a link's proof with, which cannot be used to link. The token itself is not kept.": "由令牌密钥派生出的密钥的 SHA-256，十六进制：监听方用它校验链路的证明，但它本身不能用来连接。令牌本身不保存。",
"What the token is for, as the pages list it: 1 to 64 characters.": "令牌的用途，页面列表中显示：1 到 64 个字符。",
"The workbench's assistant, a chat beside the console's pages that reads what fit does and drafts changes for a person to submit, calling the model APIs set here; off when left out, and then nothing is sent anywhere. Needs console. With a store, these settings are the first ones only: once the Settings page saves, the store's are used, keys included.": "工作台的助手：控制台页面旁的对话，读取 fit 的运行情况并起草修改，由人来提交；它调用此处设置的模型 API。不设置时关闭，此时不会向任何地方发送任何内容。需要 console。有 store 时，这些设置只是最初的设置：设置页一旦保存，便使用 store 中的设置（包括密钥）。",
"The model APIs the assistant may call, each by name. Their keys are not written here: the Settings page keeps them in admin.store, or api_key_env names a variable that holds one.": "助手可以调用的模型 API，各有名称。其密钥不写在这里：由设置页保存在 admin.store 中，或由 api_key_env 指定保存密钥的环境变量。",
"The provider and model the chat uses; the first model of the first provider when left out.": "对话使用的提供方与模型；不设置时为第一个提供方的第一个模型。",
"What a model call asks for: its output, temperature and thinking.": "模型调用的参数：输出、温度与思考。",
"Bounds on the assistant's conversations, tool calls and model answers; the defaults when left out.": "助手的对话、工具调用与模型回答的上限；不设置时使用默认值。",
"What of fit's logs may be sent to a model, and more of what is redacted before anything is.": "fit 的哪些日志可以发送给模型，以及发送前额外要脱敏的内容。",
"What each console user may have the assistant do, by user name; a user not listed has default_level.": "各控制台用户可以让助手做什么，按用户名设置；未列出的用户使用 default_level。",
"The level of a console user that users does not list: off, read (the read tools only), edit (also drafts on the open page, never submitted), propose (also proposals) or apply (also applies them). read when left out.": "users 未列出的控制台用户的级别：off、read（仅读取类工具）、edit（另可在打开的页面上起草，从不提交）、propose（另可提出变更提案）或 apply（另可应用提案）。不设置时为 read。",
"The provider's name, which default_model and the Settings page name it by: letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "提供方的名称，default_model 与设置页以此指代它：字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The API it speaks: anthropic (Messages), openai (Chat Completions), openai_responses (Responses), gemini (generateContent), azure_openai (Chat Completions of a deployment), ollama (/api/chat), openai_compatible (Chat Completions at any base_url, as vLLM, llama.cpp, DeepSeek or a gateway), or llm_proxy, this fit's own llm.proxy, reached on its api address, so that the assistant uses the mesh's models.": "它使用的 API：anthropic（Messages）、openai（Chat Completions）、openai_responses（Responses）、gemini（generateContent）、azure_openai（某个部署的 Chat Completions）、ollama（/api/chat）、openai_compatible（任意 base_url 上的 Chat Completions，如 vLLM、llama.cpp、DeepSeek 或网关），或 llm_proxy，即本 fit 自己的 llm.proxy，经其 api 地址访问，使助手使用网格中的模型。",
"The API's base URL, as https://api.openai.com/v1; the vendor's when left out, and needed for openai_compatible and azure_openai. Not for llm_proxy. A key is sent only over https, or to a loopback host.": "API 的基础 URL，如 https://api.openai.com/v1；不设置时为厂商的地址，openai_compatible 与 azure_openai 必须设置。llm_proxy 不使用。密钥只经 https 发送，或发送到回环主机。",
"The api-version of an azure_openai provider's calls, as 2024-10-21; needed for it, and for no other kind.": "azure_openai 提供方调用所带的 api-version，如 2024-10-21；该类型必须设置，其他类型不使用。",
"An environment variable holding the API key, read when a call is made; a key the Settings page keeps in the store comes first.": "保存 API 密钥的环境变量，在调用时读取；设置页保存在 store 中的密钥优先。",
"Headers sent with every call, as an organization or a gateway's own; not the key's headers, Host or the body's framing.": "每次调用都发送的请求头，如组织或网关自己的请求头；不能是密钥所用的请求头、Host 或请求体的分帧字段。",
"The models offered from this provider; the Settings page reads the provider's own list to add them.": "此提供方可用的模型；设置页可读取提供方自己的模型列表来添加。",
"How long a connect, TLS included, may take. 10s when left out.": "一次连接（含 TLS）可用的时间。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long a call may wait for its answer to begin. 2m when left out.": "一次调用等待回答开始的最长时间。不设置时为 2m。",
"How long a streamed answer may go silent. 1m when left out.": "流式回答可以停顿的最长时间。不设置时为 1m。",
"The most one call may take, to the end of its answer. 10m when left out.": "一次调用直到回答结束的最长时间。不设置时为 10m。",
"How often a call is tried again when it failed before any of its answer was taken: the connect failed, or the API answered 408, 429, 500, 502, 503, 504 or 529. 2 when left out; 0 tries once.": "调用在尚未取得任何回答前失败时的重试次数：连接失败，或 API 返回 408、429、500、502、503、504 或 529。不设置时为 2；0 表示只尝试一次。",
"The model's ID, as the provider names it.": "模型的 ID，与提供方的命名相同。",
"The model's context window, in tokens; 0 or left out when not known.": "模型的上下文窗口，以 token 计；未知时为 0 或不设置。",
"Whether the model calls tools. On when left out.": "模型是否调用工具。不设置时为是。",
"A provider's name.": "某个提供方的名称。",
"The model's ID.": "模型的 ID。",
"The most tokens a model's answer may have. 4096 when left out or 0.": "模型回答的最多 token 数。不设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"The sampling temperature; the model's own when left out.": "采样温度；不设置时使用模型自己的默认值。",
"How much a model that thinks before it answers may: off, low, medium or high, as its API takes it (an effort, or a budget of tokens). off when left out.": "会先思考再回答的模型可思考的程度：off、low、medium 或 high，按其 API 的方式传递（推理强度，或 token 预算）。不设置时为 off。",
"The most turns a conversation keeps, a user's message and the answer to it each. 40 when left out or 0.": "一次对话保留的最多轮数，每轮为用户的一条消息及其回答。不设置或为 0 时为 40。",
"The most tools an answer may call before the assistant stops it. 16 when left out or 0.": "一次回答在被助手停止前最多可调用的工具数。不设置或为 0 时为 16。",
"The most bytes of a tool's result handed to the model; a longer one is cut, and says so. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "交给模型的工具结果最多字节数；更长的结果会被截断并注明。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The most conversations kept for each user; one more removes the oldest. 50 when left out or 0.": "每个用户保留的最多对话数；再多一个时删除最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 50。",
"The most answers being made at once, across users; one more is refused until one ends. 4 when left out or 0.": "所有用户合计同时生成的最多回答数；超出的请求会被拒绝，直到有回答结束。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most tokens, in and out, one user's calls may take in a day, as the APIs count them. 1000000 when left out or 0.": "一个用户的调用一天内最多可用的 token 数（输入与输出合计，按 API 的计数）。不设置或为 0 时为 1000000。",
"The most bytes of one model answer as it streams in; a larger one is cut and fails. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次模型回答在流式接收时的最多字节数；更大的回答会被截断并失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The most entries the assistant's audit log keeps; one more removes the oldest. 1000 when left out or 0.": "助手审计日志保留的最多条目数；再多一条时删除最早的。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"An MCP server at /mcp on the console's address, for outside agents (Claude Code, Cursor, an SDK's client) to call the assistant's tools, read the config, the schema and the docs, and use the skills as prompts, with the MCP tokens users make on the workbench's MCP page. A token has its user's level, at most propose: what it proposes is applied only in the workbench. Off when left out.": "控制台地址上 /mcp 处的 MCP 服务器，供外部代理（Claude Code、Cursor、SDK 的客户端）凭用户在工作台 MCP 页上创建的 MCP 令牌调用助手的工具、读取配置、schema 与文档，并把技能用作提示词。令牌具有其用户的级别，最高为 propose：其提出的提案只在工作台中应用。不设置时关闭。",
"The addresses (as 127.0.0.1) and prefixes (as 10.0.0.0/8) MCP clients may call from; a token may narrow them further. Loopback only when left out.": "MCP 客户端可从中发起调用的地址（如 127.0.0.1）与前缀（如 10.0.0.0/8）；令牌可再加以收窄。不设置时仅限回环地址。",
"The most MCP tokens a console user may hold. 10 when left out or 0.": "每个控制台用户最多可持有的 MCP 令牌数。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"The longest a token may last, in days, from when it is made. 90 when left out or 0.": "令牌自创建起最长的有效天数。不设置或为 0 时为 90。",
"The most sessions a token keeps for clients of the protocol's versions before 2026-07-28, which open one with initialize; one more ends the one used least recently. 4 when left out or 0.": "对使用 2026-07-28 之前协议版本（以 initialize 打开会话）的客户端，每个令牌最多保留的会话数；再多一个时结束最久未用的会话。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"How long such a session is kept without a request. 1h when left out.": "此类会话在没有请求时保留的时长。不设置时为 1h。",
"The most bytes of a request's body, beside the console's own bound. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "请求体的最大字节数，在控制台自身的限制之外另加。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The most requests of one token served at once; one more is answered 429. 4 when left out or 0.": "同一令牌同时处理的最多请求数；再多一个时回答 429。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most requests of one token in a minute; past it they are answered 429 until the minute's share comes back. 120 when left out or 0.": "同一令牌每分钟的最多请求数；超过后回答 429，直到该分钟的额度恢复。不设置或为 0 时为 120。",
"Let the tools hand lines of fit's own log to the model, redacted. Off by default.": "允许工具把 fit 自身日志的行（脱敏后）交给模型。默认关闭。",
"Let the tools hand lines of the access log to the model, redacted. Off by default.": "允许工具把访问日志的行（脱敏后）交给模型。默认关闭。",
"Let the media tools hand playback sessions' subjects to the model as they are. Off by default: each subject is replaced by a hash of it, the same for one subject while fit runs, which the propose tools take back.": "允许媒体工具把播放会话的主体（subject）原样交给模型。默认关闭：每个主体以其哈希代替，fit 运行期间同一主体的哈希不变，提案工具可据此还原。",
"Let the sync tools hand the records of dry runs and dead letters to the model as they are. Off by default: each value of a record's key and rows is replaced by its kind, so that the model sees namespaces, operations, fields and errors, not what the fields hold.": "允许同步工具把试运行与死信中的记录原样交给模型。默认关闭：记录的键与行中的每个值都替换为其类型，模型只能看到命名空间、操作、字段与错误，看不到字段的内容。",
"Regular expressions (Go's syntax) whose matches are replaced in everything the tools hand a model, beside the keys, hashes, tokens and private keys that always are.": "正则表达式（Go 语法）：工具交给模型的所有内容中与之匹配的部分会被替换；密钥、哈希、令牌与私钥则始终会被替换。",
"A console user's name.": "控制台用户的名称。",
"What the user may have the assistant do: off, read, edit, propose or apply, each including the ones before it.": "该用户可以让助手做什么：off、read、edit、propose 或 apply，每一级都包含之前各级。",
"The media_library whose items are served.": "提供其条目的 media_library。",
"The part of the path before an item's ID: with /vod/films/, /vod/films/films/bbb/index.m3u8 is the playlist of the item films/bbb. /vod/<library>/ when left out.": "路径中位于条目 ID 之前的部分：前缀为 /vod/films/ 时，/vod/films/films/bbb/index.m3u8 是条目 films/bbb 的播放列表。不设置时为 /vod/<library>/。",
"The media_auth policy every request, playlist, segment, subtitle and file, must satisfy, play on the stream vod/<library>/<id>: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie. A playlist fetched with a token in its query names its playlists, segments and subtitles with the token too, so that a player that sends no header (Safari, ffmpeg) plays on. With the policy's url_signing, a signed URL of the item plays too, and its playlists hand what they name a grant of their own. Everyone may play when left out.": "每个请求（播放列表、分片、字幕和文件）都必须满足的 media_auth 策略，对流 vod/<library>/<id> 执行 play：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie。查询中带 token 取得的播放列表，其列出的播放列表、分片和字幕也带上该 token，使不发送请求头的播放器（Safari、ffmpeg）能继续播放。策略设置了 url_signing 时，该条目的签名 URL 也可播放，其播放列表会给列出的内容一个自己的授权。不设置时所有人都可以播放。",
"The segments of index.m3u8: fmp4, fragmented MP4 for H.264, H.265, AV1, AAC and Opus, or ts, MPEG-TS for H.264, H.265, AAC and Opus, for older players. Either is played by its own name too, index.fmp4.m3u8 and index.ts.m3u8. fmp4 when left out.": "index.m3u8 的分片格式：fmp4，即分片 MP4，用于 H.264、H.265、AV1、AAC 和 Opus；或 ts，即 MPEG-TS，用于 H.264、H.265、AAC 和 Opus，供较旧的播放器使用。两者也都可以用各自的名称播放：index.fmp4.m3u8 和 index.ts.m3u8。不设置时为 fmp4。",
"About how long segments are: a file with video is cut at the keyframe nearest this after a segment's start, so set it to the keyframe interval the files were made with, or a multiple of it. 1s to 60s. 4s when left out.": "分片的大致时长：有视频的文件在距分片起点最接近此时长的关键帧处切分，因此应设为制作文件时的关键帧间隔或其倍数。1s 到 60s。不设置时为 4s。",
"The most memory the handler keeps of what it builds from the files, for the next request: how each is cut into segments, its playlists, its segments and subtitles, the least recently used dropped; and of what it is building. 256 MiB when left out or 0.": "处理器为后续请求保留的、由文件构建出的内容最多占用的内存：每个文件的分片切分、其播放列表、分片和字幕，最久未用的先淘汰；以及正在构建的内容。不设置或为 0 时为 256 MiB。",
"The largest segment: one that would be larger is cut at an earlier keyframe, or without one when there is none. 64 KiB to 1 GiB, and at most a quarter of max_cache_bytes. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "最大的分片：会超过它的分片在更早的关键帧处切分，没有关键帧时不按关键帧切分。64 KiB 到 1 GiB，且不超过 max_cache_bytes 的四分之一。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"Sent as Cache-Control with every playlist, segment, subtitle and file, so that a CDN keeps them, as \"public, max-age=86400\": they change only when their file does, which their ETag and Last-Modified say. None when left out.": "随每个播放列表、分片、字幕和文件发送的 Cache-Control，使 CDN 可以缓存它们，如 \"public, max-age=86400\"：它们只在其文件变化时才变化，这由其 ETag 和 Last-Modified 表明。不设置时不发送。",
"How long a request may wait for what it needs to be read and built on the library's file pool; past it the answer is 503. 30s when left out.": "请求等待其所需内容在媒体库文件池上读取和构建的最长时间；超过则回答 503。不设置时为 30s。",
"Channels: items of a media_library played into the hub as live streams, in order, shuffled, looped or on a schedule, paced by their timestamps, which run on from one item to the next; every egress plays them under its auth. A reload changes a channel in place, from its next item. At most 256. None when left out.": "频道：把 media_library 的条目作为直播流播放进 hub，按顺序、随机、循环或按排期，以其时间戳控制节奏，时间戳从一个条目延续到下一个；每种出口都在其 auth 之下播放它们。重新加载时就地修改频道，从其下一个条目起生效。最多 256 个。不设置时没有。",
"How long connecting may take, the RTMP handshake and publish or the SRT handshake. 10s when left out.": "连接最多可用多长时间：RTMP 握手与发布，或 SRT 握手。不设置时为 10s。",
"How long the first retry waits, after a target refuses, drops or cannot be reached, or the stream is not published; each retry waits twice the last, up to retry_max, and a push that has stayed up retry_max starts again from retry_min. 1s when left out.": "首次重试等待多久：在目标拒绝、断开或无法连接，或流尚未发布之后；每次重试等待上一次的两倍，直至 retry_max，持续连接达 retry_max 的推流再次从 retry_min 开始。不设置时为 1s。",
"How much of the items is read ahead of what is sent, on the library's file pool, so that a slow disk does not stall the channel and the next item follows the last without a gap. 500ms to 1m. 3s when left out.": "在已发送内容之前预读多少条目内容（在媒体库的文件池上），使慢速磁盘不会让频道停顿，并让下一个条目紧接上一个、没有间隙。500ms 到 1m。不设置时为 3s。",
"Items started at set times, in time_zone, cutting what plays: daily, on days of the week, or once. A slot whose time has passed while its item would still be playing, when the channel starts, is joined where it would be. Between slots the channel plays items, or goes quiet without them. At most 1000.": "在 time_zone 中的设定时间开始的条目，打断正在播放的内容：每天、每周的某几天，或仅一次。频道启动时，若某时段的时间已过而其条目仍在播放期内，则从它应在的位置加入。时段之间频道播放 items，没有 items 时保持安静。最多 1000 个。",
"Outside RTMP or SRT servers, as a CDN's ingest, that streams of the hub are relayed to, each reconnected with backoff when it drops; a channel's own push lists its own. A reload keeps a target whose stream, url and connect_timeout are unchanged connected. At most 256 in all. None when left out.": "流被转推到的外部 RTMP 或 SRT 服务器，例如 CDN 的接入点，每个在断开后以退避方式重连；频道自己的 push 列出它自己的目标。重新加载时，流、url 与 connect_timeout 都未变的目标保持连接。总共最多 256 个。不设置时没有。",
"Outside servers the channel is relayed to, as streaming's push names them, their stream being the channel's.": "频道被转推到的外部服务器，写法同 streaming 的 push，其流就是该频道。",
"Play items again from the first once the last has played. With loop off, the channel goes quiet after the last, staying published, until its next slot, or until the Admin API stops and starts it, which plays the list again from the first. On when left out.": "播完最后一个条目后从第一个重新播放。关闭 loop 时，频道在最后一个条目之后保持安静但仍处于发布状态，直到其下一个时段，或直到 Admin API 停止并再次启动它，这会从第一个条目重新播放列表。不设置时打开。",
"The IANA time zone the schedule's times are in, as Asia/Shanghai or Local for the host's. UTC when left out.": "排期时间所用的 IANA 时区，例如 Asia/Shanghai，或用 Local 表示主机的时区。不设置时为 UTC。",
"The ID of the library's item the slot plays, from its start.": "该时段从头播放的媒体库条目 ID。",
"The IDs of the library's items the channel plays, in this order unless order is shuffle, and again from the first when loop is on; between the schedule's slots too. An item the library does not hold, or cannot serve, is skipped. At most 10000.": "频道播放的媒体库条目 ID，除非 order 为 shuffle，否则按此顺序播放，loop 打开时播完再从第一个开始；在排期的时段之间也播放它们。媒体库没有或无法提供的条目会被跳过。最多 10000 个。",
"The longest a retry waits. 30s when left out.": "一次重试最长等待多久。不设置时为 30s。",
"The media_library the channel's items are of.": "频道的条目所属的 media_library。",
"The most bytes read ahead and not yet sent, whatever read_ahead says, at least 1 MiB; a sample larger than it ends its item. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "已预读而尚未发送的最多字节数，不论 read_ahead 如何，至少 1 MiB；大于它的采样会结束其条目。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The order items are played in: sequence, as listed, or shuffle, every item once in a random order each time round. sequence when left out.": "条目的播放顺序：sequence 按列出的顺序，shuffle 每轮以随机顺序把每个条目播放一次。不设置时为 sequence。",
"The rendition played of each item, by its name, as 720p; one an item lacks plays its best instead. The rendition with the most pixels, the highest bit rate among equals, when left out.": "每个条目播放哪个版本，按其名称，例如 720p；缺少该版本的条目播放其最好的版本。不设置时为像素最多的版本，像素相同时取码率最高者。",
"The stream of the hub relayed, as live/cam or a channel's name. Required in streaming's push; a channel's push targets relay the channel.": "被转推的 hub 中的流，例如 live/cam 或某个频道的名称。在 streaming 的 push 中必填；频道的推流目标转推的就是该频道。",
"The stream the channel publishes into the hub, as tv/films: every egress of the streaming role plays it by that path, under its auth, as rtmp://host/tv/films or /hls/tv/films/index.m3u8. Parts of letters, digits, '.', '_', '~' and '-', split at '/'. A channel renamed is another channel: the old one ends.": "频道发布进 hub 的流，例如 tv/films：流媒体角色的每种出口都按这个路径、在其 auth 之下播放它，例如 rtmp://host/tv/films 或 /hls/tv/films/index.m3u8。由字母、数字、'.'、'_'、'~' 和 '-' 组成的若干段，以 '/' 分隔。改名后的频道是另一个频道：旧的会结束。",
"The target's name in the Admin API and the metrics, unique among the push targets. The stream's name and the target's place among the stream's when left out, as tv/films#1.": "目标在 Admin API 与指标中的名称，在所有推流目标中唯一。不设置时为流的名称加上该目标在此流的目标中的序号，例如 tv/films#1。",
"When the slot starts, in the channel's time_zone: HH:MM or HH:MM:SS every day; days of the week before it, as mon,wed,fri 20:00 or sat-sun 09:30; or a date, as 2026-12-31 23:00, once.": "时段何时开始，使用频道的 time_zone：HH:MM 或 HH:MM:SS 表示每天；前面加上星期几表示每周这几天，例如 mon,wed,fri 20:00 或 sat-sun 09:30；或写日期表示仅一次，例如 2026-12-31 23:00。",
"The secret, at least 16 bytes, the AES-128 keys of encrypted HLS are derived from: a key for each item of vod with encrypt, and for each channel with encrypt, rotated every key_rotation segments. Changing it changes every key, so that segments encrypted before, kept by a CDN, no longer play: purge them. Or secret_file, one of the two. None when left out: nothing of the library can be encrypted.": "加密 HLS 的 AES-128 密钥由它派生的密钥，至少 16 字节：开启 encrypt 的 vod 每个条目一把，开启 encrypt 的频道每个一把、每 key_rotation 个分片轮换。改变它会改变所有密钥，CDN 保存的、此前加密的分片将无法再播放：请清除它们。或 secret_file，二者取一。不设置时：媒体库的内容都不能加密。",
"A file holding the secret the AES-128 keys of encrypted HLS are derived from, read each time the config is applied. At least 16 bytes, its line breaks at the end aside. Or secret, one of the two. None when left out.": "存放加密 HLS 的 AES-128 密钥所派生自的密钥的文件，每次应用配置时读取。至少 16 字节，末尾的换行不计。或 secret，二者取一。不设置时没有。",
"Encrypts the channel's HLS segments with AES-128 (METHOD=AES-128), fMP4 and MPEG-TS alike, under a key derived from the library's secret, which the hls handler serves only to a request its auth lets play the channel; so that segments copied, as a CDN keeps them, do not play without it. Needs the library's secret or secret_file. Low-Latency HLS parts are encrypted too, each on its own. The other egresses play the channel as before, under their auth. Off when left out.": "用 AES-128（METHOD=AES-128）加密频道的 HLS 分片，fMP4 与 MPEG-TS 都是，密钥由媒体库的 secret 派生，hls 处理器只把它提供给其 auth 允许播放该频道的请求；这样被复制的分片（如 CDN 保存的）没有密钥就无法播放。需要媒体库的 secret 或 secret_file。低延迟 HLS 的部分分片也各自加密。其他出口照旧在各自的 auth 下播放该频道。不设置时关闭。",
"With encrypt, how many segments one key encrypts before the next takes over, so that a key handed out opens a few segments only. 10 when left out or 0.": "开启 encrypt 时，一把密钥加密多少个分片后换下一把，使交出的一把密钥只能打开少数分片。不设置或为 0 时为 10。",
"Encrypts the segments with AES-128 (METHOD=AES-128), fMP4 and MPEG-TS alike, each item under a key of its own derived from the library's secret, which the media playlists name as aes.key in the item's directory and the handler serves only to a request auth lets play that item: segments copied, as a CDN keeps them, do not play without it. The files themselves are then not served; initialization sections, subtitles and posters stay clear. Needs auth and the library's secret or secret_file. Off when left out.": "用 AES-128（METHOD=AES-128）加密分片，fMP4 与 MPEG-TS 都是，每个条目一把由媒体库的 secret 派生的密钥，媒体播放列表把它命名为条目目录中的 aes.key，处理器只把它提供给 auth 允许播放该条目的请求：被复制的分片（如 CDN 保存的）没有密钥就无法播放。此时不再提供文件本身；初始化分片、字幕与海报保持明文。需要 auth 以及媒体库的 secret 或 secret_file。不设置时关闭。",
"Where the stream is sent: rtmp://host[:port]/app/stream, or rtmps://, publishing to an RTMP server as a CDN's ingest takes it; or srt://host:port?streamid=...&passphrase=...&latency=ms, calling an SRT listener with MPEG-TS. The URL is a secret, its stream key with it: the Admin API and the logs show its scheme, host and app alone.": "流发送到哪里：rtmp://host[:port]/app/stream 或 rtmps://，像 CDN 的接入点那样发布到 RTMP 服务器；或 srt://host:port?streamid=...&passphrase=...&latency=ms，以 MPEG-TS 呼叫 SRT 监听端。URL 是机密，连同其中的推流密钥：Admin API 与日志只显示其协议、主机和 app。",
"A directory inside one of the roots, or a root itself, that files uploaded from the workbench, or the Admin API's /media/library/<name>/uploads, are written into: in pieces, resumable after a cut connection, to a temporary file named .fit-upload-*, renamed into place once whole and probed by the scan that follows. Made when missing. None when left out: no uploads; the files of the library are still renamed, moved and deleted from the workbench.": "位于某个根目录之内（或就是根目录本身）的目录，从工作台或 Admin API 的 /media/library/<name>/uploads 上传的文件写入其中：分块写入，连接中断后可续传，先写入名为 .fit-upload-* 的临时文件，完整后改名到位，并由随后的扫描探测。不存在时自动创建。不设置时为无：不接受上传；媒体库的文件仍可在工作台中改名、移动和删除。",
"The largest file uploaded; a larger one is refused 413 before any of it is written. 32 GiB when left out or 0.": "可上传的最大文件；更大的在写入任何字节之前即以 413 拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 32 GiB。",
"The most uploads under way at once, begun and not yet whole; one more is refused 429 until one ends, or is cancelled, or expires. 4 when left out or 0.": "同时进行中（已开始、尚未完整）的上传数量上限；再多一个以 429 拒绝，直到有上传完成、被取消或过期。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The disk space left free beside the uploads under way: an upload whose bytes, with those of the others still to come, would leave less free on upload_dir's disk is refused 507 before any of it is written. 1 GiB when left out or 0.": "除进行中的上传外须保留的磁盘空闲空间：若某次上传的字节数加上其他上传尚未写入的字节数会使 upload_dir 所在磁盘的空闲空间少于此值，则在写入任何字节之前以 507 拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 1 GiB。",
"How long an upload not written to is kept before it is given up and its temporary file removed, at the next scan; at least 1m. An upload is kept across restarts until then. 24h when left out.": "未被写入的上传保留多久后放弃，并在下次扫描时删除其临时文件；至少 1m。在此之前，上传在重启后仍然保留。不设置时为 24h。",
"Manage other fits from this one, the manager: their addresses and credentials, added on the workbench's Cluster pages, are kept in the store, and each one's state is read every poll_interval. Off when left out, and then nothing is called. Needs store and console. See decision 033.": "由本 fit（管理端）管理其他 fit：它们的地址和凭据在工作台的“集群”页面添加，保存在 store 中，每隔 poll_interval 读取一次每个成员的状态。不设置时关闭，此时不发出任何调用。需要 store 和 console。参见决策 033。",
"How often each member's GET /node, /status and /config/check are read. 10s when left out; 1s at least.": "多久读取一次每个成员的 GET /node、/status 和 /config/check。不设置时为 10s；至少 1s。",
"The longest one call to a member may take, from its connect to the last byte of its answer; the connect and the wait for the answer's header are bounded by it too. 10s when left out; 1s at least.": "对一个成员的一次调用最长可用的时间，从建立连接到收到应答的最后一个字节；连接和等待应答头也受它限制。不设置时为 10s；至少 1s。",
"The most members the manager keeps; one more is refused. 256 when left out or 0.": "管理端最多保存的成员数；再多一个即被拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"The most members polled at once; the others wait for their turn. Tests from the pages run beside them, 4 at most. Each operation on many members (reload, rollback, check, purge, test) calls at most this many of them at once too. 8 when left out or 0.": "同时轮询的最多成员数；其余的排队等候。页面发起的测试在此之外进行，最多 4 个。对多个成员的每次操作（重新加载、回滚、检查、清除缓存、测试）同时调用的成员也最多为此数。不设置或为 0 时为 8。",
"The largest answer read from a member; a larger one fails its call, and is reported as too large. 4 MiB when left out or 0; 16 KiB at least.": "从成员读取的最大应答；更大的应答使该次调用失败，并报告为过大。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB；至少 16 KiB。",
"The manager's link URL, as its Add by enrollment page gives it: wss://host:port/cluster/link.": "管理者的连接 URL，即其“通过注册添加”页面给出的：wss://host:port/cluster/link。",
"The SHA-256 of the manager's link certificate, 64 hex digits, with or without colons, as the page gives it: the only certificate this fit links to.": "管理者连接证书的 SHA-256，64 位十六进制数字，可带或不带冒号，即页面给出的：本 fit 只连接到出示该证书的管理者。",
"A file holding the enrollment token, in place of token.": "存放注册令牌的文件，代替 token。",
"Console users (admin.console.users) who are the cluster's admins whatever roles the Users and audit page gives: the way back in when no admin is left. Once this or a role is set, a console user does on the cluster what its roles let it, and only a cluster-wide admin changes this manager's own config; until then, every console user is a cluster-wide admin. Changed at a restart, as all of admin is.": "无论“用户与审计”页面给出什么角色，始终是集群管理员的控制台用户（admin.console.users）：在没有管理员时用来恢复访问。设置了此项或任一角色后，控制台用户在集群上只能做其角色允许的事，且只有集群范围的管理员才能修改本管理端自己的配置；在此之前，每个控制台用户都是集群范围的管理员。重启后生效，与 admin 的其他部分一样。",
"The URL members reach link_address at, as \"wss://manager.example.com:7444/cluster/link\", which the config line Add by enrollment gives names; when left out, the host the page was opened at and link_address's port. Only a wss URL.": "成员访问 link_address 所用的 URL，如 \"wss://manager.example.com:7444/cluster/link\"，即“通过注册添加”给出的配置行中所写的地址；不设置时为打开页面所用的主机名加 link_address 的端口。只能是 wss URL。",
"The enrollment token the manager made for this fit, fite1.<ID>.<secret>, used once: this fit proves it to the manager, which answers a credential of this fit's own, kept in the store, or without one in a file beside the config (fit.cluster-member beside fit.json); the token is not used again. Left out once this fit has a credential; a new token enrolls this fit again.": "管理者为本 fit 生成的注册令牌 fite1.<ID>.<secret>，只能使用一次：本 fit 向管理者证明持有它，管理者回以本 fit 自己的凭据，保存在 store 中，没有 store 时保存在配置旁的文件里（fit.json 旁的 fit.cluster-member）；令牌不再使用。本 fit 有凭据后可以省略；换一个新令牌会让本 fit 重新注册。",
"Link this fit out to a manager of many fits, which then manages it through the link as it manages others over HTTP: for a fit behind NAT, or with no port open to the manager. The manager's Add by enrollment gives the line to paste here. Off when left out, and then nothing is dialed. Read when fit starts. See decision 033.": "让本 fit 主动连接到管理多个 fit 的管理者，管理者随后通过这条连接管理它，如同通过 HTTP 管理其他成员：用于 NAT 之后、或没有向管理者开放端口的 fit。管理者的“通过注册添加”会给出要粘贴到这里的配置行。不设置时关闭，不会发起任何连接。在 fit 启动时读取。见决策 033。",
"Where members that link out to the manager reach it, as \":7444\" or \"0.0.0.0:7444\": a WebSocket listener over TLS, with a self-signed certificate the manager makes once and keeps in the store, which each member pins when it enrolls. Members behind NAT, or with no port open, link here with the config line Add by enrollment gives, and are managed through their link as the others are over HTTP. Off when left out: no member can enroll.": "主动连接管理者的成员访问它的地址，如 \":7444\" 或 \"0.0.0.0:7444\"：一个基于 TLS 的 WebSocket 监听，使用管理者生成一次并保存在 store 中的自签名证书，各成员在注册时固定（pin）该证书。NAT 之后或未开放端口的成员用“通过注册添加”给出的配置行连接到这里，并通过这条连接被管理，如同其他成员通过 HTTP 被管理。不设置时关闭：任何成员都不能注册。",
"Files of more allow entries, one on each line, each line told apart by its content: an address or prefix, with what follows # or ; left out, as the lists published for firewalls are written; a range, first-last; an eMule ipfilter.dat line, first - last , level , name, where a level above 127 is not listed; or a PeerGuardian .p2p line, name:first-last. IPv4 addresses of ranges may have leading zeros. Blank lines and lines that begin with #, ; or // are left out; any other line is an error. Read when the config is applied, and applied again when one changes; each at most 64 MiB.": "更多 allow 条目的文件，每行一条，按每行的内容区分格式：地址或前缀，# 或 ; 之后的内容被忽略，与防火墙发布的列表写法相同；范围 first-last；eMule ipfilter.dat 行 first - last , level , name，level 大于 127 的行不列入；或 PeerGuardian .p2p 行 name:first-last。范围中的 IPv4 地址可带前导零。空行以及以 #、; 或 // 开头的行被忽略；其他行是错误。在应用配置时读取，文件变化时重新应用；每个最多 64 MiB。",
"Files of more deny entries, written as allow_files.": "更多 deny 条目的文件，写法同 allow_files。",
"IP addresses and CIDR prefixes refused, whatever allow holds.": "拒绝的 IP 地址和 CIDR 前缀，无论 allow 包含什么。",
"IP addresses and CIDR prefixes served, as \"10.0.0.0/8\" or \"2001:db8::/32\": with any entry here or in allow_files, every address neither holds is refused, unless deny refuses it first.": "服务的 IP 地址和 CIDR 前缀，如 \"10.0.0.0/8\" 或 \"2001:db8::/32\"：这里或 allow_files 中有任一条目时，两者都不包含的地址一律拒绝；deny 先拒绝的除外。",
"The client addresses fit serves, by allow (whitelist) and deny (blacklist) lists, for every listener, route, service and role, the Admin API and the consoles, that sets no access of its own that decides: a more specific one, set on a listener, route, service, role, admin or a console, decides first, and this one only for an address that one has no say on. Every address is served when left out.": "fit 服务的客户端地址，由 allow（白名单）和 deny（黑名单）列表决定，适用于每个没有自己的 access 作出决定的监听、路由、服务、角色、Admin API 和控制台：更具体的 access（设在监听、路由、服务、角色、admin 或控制台上）先决定，这里的只对那个没有意见的地址作决定。不设置时服务所有地址。",
"The client addresses the Admin API serves, deciding before the global access, which applies to the API too: a connection either refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. Unlike the other admin settings it follows every config applied, without a restart. Set allow to \"127.0.0.1\" (and \"::1\") to keep local access whatever the global access says. A Unix socket's peers have no address and are never checked, and access is an error with one. Every address is served, unless the global access says otherwise, when left out.": "Admin API 服务的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定，全局 access 同样适用于 API：任一方拒绝的连接在被接受时即关闭。与 admin 的其他设置不同，它随每次应用的配置生效，无需重启。将 allow 设为 \"127.0.0.1\"（以及 \"::1\"）可无论全局 access 如何都保留本机访问。Unix socket 的对端没有地址，从不检查，在 Unix socket 上设置 access 会报错。不设置时服务所有地址，除非全局 access 另有规定。",
"The client addresses the console serves, deciding before the global access, which applies to the console too: a connection either refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. It follows every config applied, without a restart. Set allow to \"127.0.0.1\" (and \"::1\") to keep local access whatever the global access says. Every address is served, unless the global access says otherwise, when left out.": "控制台服务的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定，全局 access 同样适用于控制台：任一方拒绝的连接在被接受时即关闭。它随每次应用的配置生效，无需重启。将 allow 设为 \"127.0.0.1\"（以及 \"::1\"）可无论全局 access 如何都保留本机访问。不设置时服务所有地址，除非全局 access 另有规定。",
"The client addresses the listener serves, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted, or, for HTTP/3 and udp, its datagrams dropped, unless a route or service of the listener sets an access of its own, which then decides first, for its requests or connections. With proxy_protocol the address is the one the header names.": "监听服务的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：它拒绝的连接在被接受时即关闭，HTTP/3 和 udp 则丢弃其数据报；除非该监听的某个路由或服务设置了自己的 access，那么对其请求或连接由那个先决定。使用 proxy_protocol 时，地址为头部给出的地址。",
"The client addresses the proxy's listen takes links from and its api serves, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. A change applies to the connections that open from then on, without listening anew; those already open stay. Its console's pages take console.access.": "proxy 的 listen 接受链路、其 api 提供服务的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时即关闭。新的设置作用于此后建立的连接，无需重新监听；已打开的保持不变。其控制台页面由 console.access 控制。",
"The client addresses the hub's listen takes links from, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. A change applies to the links that open from then on, without listening anew; those already open stay. Its console's pages take console.access.": "hub 的 listen 接受链路的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时即关闭。新的设置作用于此后建立的连接，无需重新监听；已打开的保持不变。其控制台页面由 console.access 控制。",
"The client addresses the hub's listeners and its console_socket take, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted, and the datagrams a quic listener gets from an address it refuses are dropped. A change applies to the connections that open from then on, without listening anew; those already open stay. Its console's pages take console.access.": "hub 的各监听与 console_socket 接受的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时即关闭，quic 监听丢弃来自被拒地址的数据报。新的设置作用于此后建立的连接，无需重新监听；已打开的保持不变。其控制台页面由 console.access 控制。",
"The client addresses the proxy's forwards and web_proxies take, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. A change applies to the connections that open from then on, without listening anew; those already open stay. Its console's pages take console.access.": "proxy 的 forwards 与 web_proxies 接受的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时即关闭。新的设置作用于此后建立的连接，无需重新监听；已打开的保持不变。其控制台页面由 console.access 控制。",
"The client addresses the node's listen takes links from, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. A change applies to the links that open from then on, without listening anew; those already open stay. Its console's pages take console.access.": "node 的 listen 接受链路的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时即关闭。新的设置作用于此后建立的连接，无需重新监听；已打开的保持不变。其控制台页面由 console.access 控制。",
"The client addresses the pages serve, deciding before the global access, which applies to the pages too: a connection either refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted. It follows every config applied, without restarting the pages. Set allow to \"127.0.0.1\" (and \"::1\") to keep local access whatever the global access says. Every address is served, unless the global access says otherwise, when left out.": "页面服务的客户端地址，在全局 access 之前决定，全局 access 同样适用于页面：任一方拒绝的连接在被接受时即关闭。它随每次应用的配置生效，无需重启页面。将 allow 设为 \"127.0.0.1\"（以及 \"::1\"）可无论全局 access 如何都保留本机访问。不设置时服务所有地址，除非全局 access 另有规定。",
"The client addresses the route serves, deciding before its listener's access and the global one: a request it refuses is answered 403. The address is the connection's, or the one its PROXY header names, not X-Forwarded-For's.": "路由服务的客户端地址，在其监听的 access 和全局 access 之前决定：它拒绝的请求以 403 回应。地址为连接的地址，或其 PROXY 头部给出的地址，而不是 X-Forwarded-For 中的。",
"The client addresses the service takes, deciding before its listener's access and the global one: a connection it refuses is closed, once its PROXY header and ClientHello are read when the listener needs them, and the datagrams of a udp session it refuses are dropped.": "服务接受的客户端地址，在其监听的 access 和全局 access 之前决定：它拒绝的连接被关闭（在监听需要时，先读取其 PROXY 头部和 ClientHello），它拒绝的 udp 会话的数据报被丢弃。",
"The client addresses the server serves on listen, listen_tcp and listen_tls, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted, and the datagrams of a UDP client it refuses are dropped. Peers are not clients: allowed_peers and denied_peers decide those. A change applies to the next client, without starting a new server; the allocations held are kept.": "服务器在 listen、listen_tcp 和 listen_tls 上服务的客户端地址，先于全局 access 决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时立即关闭，被拒绝的 UDP 客户端的数据报被丢弃。对端不是客户端：由 allowed_peers 和 denied_peers 决定。变化作用于之后的客户端，不会启动新的服务器；已有的 allocation 保留。",
"The peer addresses the port relays, deciding before the global access: the datagrams of an address it refuses are dropped. A change applies to the next new address, without ending a session or relay; the addresses relayed are kept.": "该端口中继的对端地址，先于全局 access 决定：被拒绝地址的数据报被丢弃。变化作用于之后的新地址，不会结束会话或中继；正在中继的地址保留。",
"The peer addresses the port serves, deciding before the global access: the datagrams of an address it refuses are dropped, so its ICE checks go unanswered. A change applies to the next new address, without starting the media server again; the sessions and addresses served are kept.": "该端口服务的对端地址，先于全局 access 决定：被拒绝地址的数据报被丢弃，因此其 ICE 检查得不到应答。变化作用于之后的新地址，不会重启媒体服务器；已有的会话和正在服务的地址保留。",
"The client addresses the rtmp, rtsp, srt and webrtc listeners serve, deciding before the global access: a connection it refuses is closed as soon as it is accepted, and the datagrams of an srt caller or webrtc peer it refuses are dropped. A change applies to the next connection and peer, without starting a listener again; those connected are kept.": "rtmp、rtsp、srt 和 webrtc 监听服务的客户端地址，先于全局 access 决定：被拒绝的连接在接受时立即关闭，被拒绝的 srt 呼叫方或 webrtc 对端的数据报被丢弃。变化作用于之后的连接和对端，不会重启 listener；已连接的保留。",
"fit's sync role: pipelines that read records from a source (a database's changes, files, a queue) and write them to sinks, each with a checkpoint saved only once every sink has acknowledged the records it covers, kept in state_dir. None when left out: no connections out and no state on disk.": "fit 的同步角色：流水线从源（数据库的变更、文件、队列）读取记录并写入目标，每条流水线有一个检查点，只在每个目标都确认了它所涵盖的记录后才保存，保存在 state_dir 中。不设置时没有：不建立外连，也不在磁盘上留状态。",
"The directory each pipeline's checkpoint is kept in, as <state_dir>/<pipeline>.json, written to a temporary file, synced and renamed into place. Made when missing. A pipeline starts from its checkpoint there; moving a pipeline to another fit means moving its file.": "保存每条流水线检查点的目录，文件为 <state_dir>/<pipeline>.json，先写到临时文件、同步再改名到位。不存在时创建。流水线从那里的检查点开始；把流水线迁到另一个 fit 就要迁移它的文件。",
"The pipelines, each a source, its transforms in order and its sinks, with one checkpoint. A reload starts the pipelines added, stops those removed and restarts only those whose settings changed.": "各条流水线，每条包含一个源、按顺序的变换和若干目标，共用一个检查点。重载时启动新增的流水线、停止删除的，只重启设置改变的。",
"The pipeline's name, unique, which names its checkpoint file. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "流水线的名称，唯一，也是其检查点文件的文件名。由字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-' 组成。",
"stream follows the source for good; once stops at the source's end, as a batch job, with the checkpoint written. A pipeline also stops when its source has an end and reaches it. stream when left out.": "stream 持续跟随源；once 在源结束时停止，作为批处理作业，并写入检查点。源有终点并到达时，流水线也会停止。不设置时为 stream。",
"Where the records come from, and its params.": "记录从何处来，及其 params。",
"What each record goes through, in order, before the sinks: a transform may change, drop or split a record. None when left out.": "每条记录在到达目标之前依次经过的变换：变换可以修改、丢弃或拆分记录。不设置时没有。",
"Where every record is written, at least one: each sink takes every record, in order, in batches of its own, and the checkpoint is the position all of them have acknowledged.": "每条记录写往的目标，至少一个：每个目标按顺序接收每条记录，按各自的批次写入，检查点是所有目标都已确认的位置。",
"The sink's name, unique in its pipeline, which logs and errors call it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "目标的名称，在其流水线内唯一，日志和错误中以此称呼它。由字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-' 组成。",
"What the records are written to, and its params.": "记录写往何处，及其 params。",
"How records are gathered into a write: a batch is written once it holds max_records records or max_bytes bytes, or max_wait after its first record arrived, whichever comes first, and at once when the source has ended. The defaults when left out.": "记录如何聚成一次写入：批次中有 max_records 条记录或 max_bytes 字节时，或第一条记录到达 max_wait 之后（以先到者为准）写出；源结束时立即写出。不设置时使用默认值。",
"The most records in a batch. 500 when left out or 0.": "一个批次的最大记录数。不设置或为 0 时为 500。",
"The most bytes in a batch, as the records' sizes are reckoned; a record larger than it is a batch of its own. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个批次的最大字节数，按记录大小的估算；大于它的记录自成一个批次。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"How long a batch waits for more records after its first arrived. 1s when left out or 0.": "批次在第一条记录到达后等待更多记录的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 1s。",
"The bound on records read and not yet acknowledged by every sink: past it the source waits, so a slow sink slows the source rather than growing memory. The defaults when left out.": "已读取但尚未被所有目标确认的记录的上限：超过时源等待，因此慢的目标会拖慢源，而不是让内存增长。不设置时使用默认值。",
"The most records read and not yet acknowledged by every sink. 10000 when left out or 0.": "已读取但尚未被所有目标确认的最大记录数。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most bytes, as the records' sizes are reckoned, read and not yet acknowledged by every sink. A record larger than all of it waits until the queue is empty, and then goes through alone. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "已读取但尚未被所有目标确认的最大字节数，按记录大小的估算。大于这一上限的记录等队列清空后单独通过。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"How often, at most, the checkpoint is written when it has moved; it is also written when the pipeline stops. Records after the last checkpoint written are written again after a crash, so sinks write idempotently. 5s when left out.": "检查点有推进时最多多久写一次；流水线停止时也会写。最后写入的检查点之后的记录在崩溃后会再写一次，因此目标需幂等写入。不设置时为 5s。",
"How a failed write is tried again, with a backoff doubling up to max_backoff, before on_error applies. A source that fails restarts the pipeline from its checkpoint after the same backoff, for as long as it fails. The defaults when left out.": "写入失败后如何重试：退避时间逐次翻倍，最多到 max_backoff，之后按 on_error 处理。源失败时，流水线在同样的退避后从检查点重启，只要失败就一直重启。不设置时使用默认值。",
"How many times a write is tried, the first included, before on_error applies. 5 when left out or 0.": "一次写入最多尝试多少次（含第一次），之后按 on_error 处理。不设置或为 0 时为 5。",
"The wait before the first try again, doubled at each after. 200ms when left out or 0.": "第一次重试前的等待，之后每次翻倍。不设置或为 0 时为 200ms。",
"The longest wait between tries. 30s when left out or 0.": "两次尝试之间最长的等待。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"What happens to a record a sink still fails to write, or a transform fails on, once its attempts are spent: stop stops the pipeline, its checkpoint before the record, until the config changes or fit restarts; skip leaves the record out of that sink, and logs it; dead_letter writes it, with its error, to the dead_letter sink before going on. stop when left out.": "目标在尝试用尽后仍写入失败的记录、或变换处理失败的记录如何处理：stop 停止流水线，检查点停在该记录之前，直到配置改变或 fit 重启；skip 在该目标中跳过该记录并记录日志；dead_letter 先把它连同错误写到 dead_letter 目标再继续。不设置时为 stop。",
"The sink records go to when on_error is dead_letter, each a message record holding the record's canonical JSON, the error, where it failed and the attempts made. Needed with dead_letter, and only with it. A dead letter it cannot write either, after its attempts, stops the pipeline.": "on_error 为 dead_letter 时记录写往的目标，每条为一个 message 记录，包含原记录的规范 JSON、错误、出错位置和已尝试次数。使用 dead_letter 时必填，且只用于它。死信在尝试用尽后也写不进去时，流水线停止。",
"The records' namespace. generate.records when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为 generate.records。",
"How many records to make, after which the source ends and the pipeline stops; 0, or left out, makes them without end.": "生成多少条记录，之后源结束、流水线停止；为 0 或不设置时无休止地生成。",
"How many records a transaction holds; 1, or left out, makes each record a transaction of its own, without a transaction ID.": "一个事务包含多少条记录；为 1 或不设置时，每条记录自成一个事务，不带事务 ID。",
"How long to wait after each transaction; none when left out.": "每个事务之后等待多久；不设置时不等待。",
"The store's name: sinks naming the same store write into it. default when left out.": "存储的名称：指定同一存储的目标写入同一处。不设置时为 default。",
"The most records the store keeps; a write past it fails, as a full disk would. 100000 when left out or 0.": "存储保存的最大记录数；超过时写入失败，就像磁盘满了一样。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"keep keeps the records that match every condition and drops the others; drop drops those that match and keeps the others. keep when left out.": "keep 保留满足所有条件的记录并丢弃其他；drop 丢弃满足的并保留其他。不设置时为 keep。",
"Conditions on the row's fields, all of which a record must meet. The row is after, or before when after is null, as for a delete.": "对行中字段的条件，记录必须全部满足。行为 after，after 为 null 时（如 delete）为 before。",
"The field's name, at the top level of the row.": "字段名，位于行的顶层。",
"The text the field's value must have: a string as it is, a number in decimal (\"42\", \"1.5\"), a bool as \"true\" or \"false\", a time in RFC 3339, a date as 2006-01-02. A missing or null field never equals.": "字段的值必须具有的文本：字符串按原样，数值为十进制（\"42\"、\"1.5\"），bool 为 \"true\" 或 \"false\"，time 为 RFC 3339，date 为 2006-01-02。缺失或为 null 的字段永不相等。",
"Texts, as equals takes them, the field's value must have one of.": "字段的值必须是其中之一的文本，写法与 equals 相同。",
"true: the field must be there and not null; false: it must be missing or null.": "true：字段必须存在且不为 null；false：字段必须缺失或为 null。",
"The operations a record must be one of. Any operation when left out.": "记录的操作必须是其中之一。不设置时为任意操作。",
"Globs a record's namespace must match one of, as path.Match takes them: shop.* matches every table of shop. Any namespace when left out.": "记录的命名空间必须匹配其一的 glob，按 path.Match 的写法：shop.* 匹配 shop 的每张表。不设置时为任意命名空间。",
"Globs a record's namespace must match none of.": "记录的命名空间必须一个都不匹配的 glob。",
"A glob the namespace must match, as path.Match takes it: shop.*.": "命名空间必须匹配的 glob，按 path.Match 的写法：shop.*。",
"Namespaces renamed exactly, the old to the new: {\"shop.orders\": \"orders\"}. Tried before rules.": "精确重命名的命名空间，旧名到新名：{\"shop.orders\": \"orders\"}。先于 rules 尝试。",
"Rules tried in order for a namespace map does not name; the first whose match it matches renames it.": "对 map 未列出的命名空间依次尝试的规则；第一条其 match 匹配上的规则对其重命名。",
"The new namespace, a template: {namespace} is the old one, {first} its part before the first '.', {rest} its part after the first '.', {last} its part after the last '.'. shop.orders to {first}-{rest} is shop-orders; to {last} it is orders.": "新的命名空间，一个模板：{namespace} 为旧命名空间，{first} 为其第一个 '.' 之前的部分，{rest} 为其第一个 '.' 之后的部分，{last} 为其最后一个 '.' 之后的部分。shop.orders 按 {first}-{rest} 得到 shop-orders；按 {last} 得到 orders。",
"What becomes of a record whose namespace neither map nor a rule names: keep passes it on as it is, drop drops it. keep when left out.": "命名空间既不在 map 中、也没有规则匹配的记录如何处理：keep 原样传下去，drop 丢弃。不设置时为 keep。",
"Fields renamed, the old name to the new, after nest; a new name the row already has fails the record. The key's fields are renamed too, so the key names the sink's columns.": "重命名的字段，旧名称到新名称，在 nest 之后；新名称已在行中存在时该记录失败。键的字段也会被重命名，因此键对应目标的列名。",
"Fields removed, after rename, by their new names. Not with keep.": "移除的字段，在 rename 之后，按新名称。不能与 keep 同用。",
"The only fields kept, after rename, by their new names; the others are removed. Not with drop.": "仅保留的字段，在 rename 之后，按新名称；其他字段被移除。不能与 drop 同用。",
"Maps whose fields are lifted up to the row's top level, the map itself removed: unnest meta turns {\"meta\": {\"a\": 1}} into {\"a\": 1}. A lifted field whose name the row already has fails the record; a null or missing map is left out.": "将其字段提升到行顶层、自身被移除的 map：unnest meta 把 {\"meta\": {\"a\": 1}} 变为 {\"a\": 1}。被提升的字段名已在行中存在时该记录失败；为 null 或缺失的 map 被忽略。",
"Fields moved into a nested map, after unnest.": "移入嵌套 map 的字段，在 unnest 之后。",
"The nested map's name: made at the end of the row when the row has none, added to when it is a map.": "嵌套 map 的名称：行中没有时在行末创建，是 map 时向其中添加。",
"The fields moved, those the row has, in the row's order.": "要移动的字段（行中有的那些），按行中的顺序。",
"Fields set to a constant, last, added at the end of the row when it has none of that name: a value in the canonical JSON form, \"eu\" for a string, {\"int\": 5} for an int, true, null.": "设为常量的字段，最后处理，行中没有同名字段时添加到行末：值采用规范 JSON 形式，字符串为 \"eu\"，int 为 {\"int\": 5}，以及 true、null。",
"The fields the key is built from, at the top level of the row: after, or before for a delete. A record whose row lacks one, or has it null, fails, except a delete, which keeps the key it has; a key transform after a transform that removes one of them is refused.": "构造键所用的字段，位于行的顶层：after，delete 时为 before。行中缺少其一或其为 null 的记录失败，但 delete 例外，它保留已有的键；跟在移除了其中某个字段的变换之后的 key 变换会被拒绝。",
"map makes the key a map of the fields, in the order given; value makes it the one field's value, with a single field; join makes it a string of the fields' texts joined by separator, as a document ID. map when left out.": "map 使键为这些字段组成的 map，按给出的顺序；value 使键为该字段的值，只能有一个字段；join 使键为各字段文本以 separator 连接成的字符串，用作文档 ID。不设置时为 map。",
"What join puts between the fields' texts. : when left out.": "join 放在各字段文本之间的分隔符。不设置时为 :。",
"The fields cast, each to a type: string, int, uint, float, decimal, bool, bytes, time, date or json. Null stays null, and a value of the type already stays as it is. Numbers convert among themselves when the value fits exactly (1.5 is no int); strings parse as the type writes them (an int in decimal, a bool as true or false, a time in RFC 3339, a date as 2006-01-02, json as a document); a time takes an int or uint as Unix seconds, and a date; a date takes a time, its day in the time's own offset; json takes any value, as plain JSON; bytes take a string, decimal or json's text, and give a string their text when it is UTF-8. Anything else fails the record.": "要转换类型的字段，各自转为一种类型：string、int、uint、float、decimal、bool、bytes、time、date 或 json。null 保持为 null，已是该类型的值保持不变。数值之间在值能精确表示时相互转换（1.5 不是 int）；字符串按该类型的写法解析（int 为十进制，bool 为 true 或 false，time 为 RFC 3339，date 为 2006-01-02，json 为一个文档）；time 接受 int 或 uint（作为 Unix 秒）以及 date；date 接受 time，取该 time 自身偏移下的日期；json 接受任意值，作为普通 JSON；bytes 接受 string、decimal 或 json 的文本，并在其为 UTF-8 时把文本给 string。其他情况该记录失败。",
"The fields masked, at the top level of the rows before and after, and of the key for a hash.": "要掩码的字段，位于行 before 和 after 的顶层，哈希时也包括键的顶层。",
"hmac_sha256 replaces a value by the hex of its HMAC-SHA256 under the key key_env names, which cannot be reversed without the key; sha256 by the hex of its SHA-256, which anyone can reverse for a value from a small set (a phone number, an ID) by trying them all; null replaces it by null, which leaves the key as it is, since a key of nulls would no longer tell rows apart. A value is hashed as its text, so an int 5 and a string \"5\" hash the same; null stays null. The hashes keep the key unique and equal to the row's field. hmac_sha256 when left out.": "hmac_sha256 把值替换为它在 key_env 所指密钥下的 HMAC-SHA256 的十六进制，没有密钥无法逆推；sha256 替换为其 SHA-256 的十六进制，对于取自小集合的值（电话号码、ID），任何人都能通过穷举逆推；null 替换为 null，这时键保持不变，因为全为 null 的键无法再区分各行。值按其文本哈希，因此 int 5 和字符串 \"5\" 的哈希相同；null 保持为 null。哈希后的键仍唯一，并与行中的字段一致。不设置时为 hmac_sha256。",
"An environment variable holding the HMAC key, read when the pipeline starts: needed with hmac_sha256, and only with it. Changing the key changes every hash, so a sink keyed by them sees new rows.": "保存 HMAC 密钥的环境变量，在流水线启动时读取：使用 hmac_sha256 时必填，且只用于它。更换密钥会改变每个哈希值，以这些哈希值为键的目标会看到新的行。",
"flat makes the document the row (after, or before for a delete, or the key's fields when a delete has no before) with the meta fields added; pair makes it {\"before\": ..., \"after\": ...} with the meta fields; debezium makes it Debezium's envelope: before, after, source (name, namespace, db and table split at the namespace's first '.', ts_ms), op (c, u or d), ts_ms (the commit time in milliseconds, null when unknown) and transaction ({\"id\"}, or null). flat when left out.": "flat 使文档为该行（after，delete 时为 before，delete 没有 before 时为键的字段）并加上 meta 字段；pair 使其为 {\"before\": ..., \"after\": ...} 并加上 meta 字段；debezium 使其为 Debezium 的信封：before、after、source（name、namespace，在命名空间第一个 '.' 处拆分的 db 与 table，ts_ms）、op（c、u 或 d）、ts_ms（以毫秒计的提交时间，未知时为 null）和 transaction（{\"id\"} 或 null）。不设置时为 flat。",
"Metadata fields added to a flat or pair document, each named: the key one of op (insert, update or delete), namespace, source, commit_time (a time, null when unknown), tx_id (null when none) and deleted (true for a delete), the value the field's name: {\"op\": \"__op\", \"deleted\": \"__deleted\"}. None when left out; not with debezium.": "添加到 flat 或 pair 文档中的元数据字段，各自命名：键为 op（insert、update 或 delete）、namespace、source、commit_time（时间，未知时为 null）、tx_id（无时为 null）和 deleted（delete 时为 true）之一，值为字段名：{\"op\": \"__op\", \"deleted\": \"__deleted\"}。不设置时没有；不能与 debezium 同用。",
"What becomes of a delete: keep keeps it a delete, its document in after, so a sink still deletes by its key; drop drops it; rewrite makes it an update, so a sink upserts the document, which with flat needs meta's deleted to say it was removed. keep when left out.": "delete 如何处理：keep 保持为 delete，其文档放在 after 中，目标仍按键删除；drop 丢弃它；rewrite 把它变为 update，目标会 upsert 该文档，与 flat 同用时需要 meta 的 deleted 来表明它已被删除。不设置时为 keep。",
"How many instances of the plugin may run a batch's parts at once, each with its own memory, made as they are needed: the CPUs fit has, at most 4, when left out or 0.": "插件最多可同时运行多少个实例来处理一个批次的各部分，每个实例有自己的内存，按需创建：不设置或为 0 时为 fit 拥有的 CPU 数，最多 4。",
"The hosts the plugin's HTTP requests may go to: a host name or address, any port; host:port; or *.example.com for its subdomains. A request to any other fails the write. None when left out.": "插件的 HTTP 请求可以访问的主机：主机名或地址（任意端口）；host:port；或 *.example.com 表示它的子域名。访问其他主机的请求会使这次写入失败。不设置时一个也没有。",
"The hosts the plugin's HTTP requests may go to: a host name or address, any port; host:port; or *.example.com for its subdomains. A request to any other fails the poll. None when left out.": "插件的 HTTP 请求可以访问的主机：主机名或地址（任意端口）；host:port；或 *.example.com 表示它的子域名。访问其他主机的请求会使这次轮询失败。不设置时一个也没有。",
"The most bytes of records a poll may hand back. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次轮询最多可返回的记录字节数。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The most memory the plugin's instance may have. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "插件实例最多可使用的内存。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The most memory an instance may have; a call that asks for more fails its records. 128 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个实例最多可使用的内存；申请更多内存的调用会使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 128 MiB。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module, a WASI reactor, that exports fit_sync_write; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个导出 fit_sync_write 的 WebAssembly 模块，作为 WASI reactor；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module, a WASI reactor, that exports fit_sync_poll; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个导出 fit_sync_poll 的 WebAssembly 模块，作为 WASI reactor；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module, a WASI reactor, that exports fit_sync_transform; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个导出 fit_sync_transform 的 WebAssembly 模块，作为 WASI reactor；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建。",
"The most bytes of records a call may hand back; past it the call fails. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用最多可返回的记录字节数；超过时该调用失败。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The largest HTTP response body the plugin may be given; a larger one fails its request. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "插件可以收到的最大 HTTP 响应体；更大的响应会使该请求失败。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"The most records one call takes; the records the pipeline holds are split into calls of this many, run on the instances at once. 256 when left out or 0.": "一次调用最多处理的记录数；流水线持有的记录按此数拆分成多次调用，在各实例上同时运行。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"How long a call may run; past it the call is stopped, its instance made again, and its records fail, as on_error says. 1s when left out.": "一次调用最多可运行的时间；超过时停止该调用、重新创建其实例，其记录按 on_error 的规定失败。不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a poll may run, its HTTP requests and sleeps included; past it the poll fails, and the pipeline starts again from its checkpoint. 30s when left out.": "一次轮询最多可运行的时间，包括其中的 HTTP 请求和休眠；超过时该轮询失败，流水线从检查点重新开始。不设置时为 30s。",
"How long to wait before polling again once the plugin has caught up, or returned nothing. 1s when left out.": "插件已追上或没有返回任何内容后，再次轮询前等待的时间。不设置时为 1s。",
"How long a write may run, its HTTP requests and sleeps included; past it the write fails, and is tried again as retry says. 30s when left out.": "一次写入最多可运行的时间，包括其中的 HTTP 请求和休眠；超过时该写入失败，并按 retry 的规定重试。不设置时为 30s。",
"The field of after that holds the line. line when left out.": "after 中保存该行的字段。不设置时为 line。",
"plain reads and writes a row as a plain JSON object; record reads and writes whole records in their canonical JSON, which keeps every type, the operation, key and namespace. plain when left out.": "plain 把一行数据当作普通 JSON 对象读写；record 以规范 JSON 读写整条记录，保留每种类型、操作、键和命名空间。不设置时为 plain。",
"A line made of text and placeholders, in place of codec: {name} is the row's field name (after, or before when after is null) as text, and {$namespace}, {$op}, {$key}, {$commit_time} and {$record} (its canonical JSON) are the record's; {{ is a brace. A newline ends each line.": "由文本和占位符组成的一行，代替 codec：{name} 是该行数据（after，after 为 null 时为 before）中名为 name 的字段的文本，{$namespace}、{$op}、{$key}、{$commit_time} 和 {$record}（其规范 JSON）是记录自身的；{{ 表示一个花括号。每行以换行结尾。",
"The longest line, or multiline event, in bytes: a longer one is cut there, its rest skipped, and counted. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "一行或一个多行事件的最大字节数：更长的在此处截断，其余部分跳过，并计数。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"What makes a line of a record: line when left out, which writes after's line field, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json writes it as JSON, csv as comma-separated values.": "把记录变成一行的编解码器：不设置时为 line，写出 after 的 line 字段，没有该字段时写出记录的规范 JSON；json 写成 JSON，csv 写成逗号分隔的值。",
"The most files known at once, each in the checkpoint; files found past it are not read, and a warning says so. 100000 when left out or 0.": "同时知晓的最多文件数，每个文件都在检查点中；超过后发现的文件不读取，并给出警告。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"A regular expression (RE2) a line beginning an event matches.": "开始一个事件的行所匹配的正则表达式（RE2）。",
"How long a file may go without growing before its partial last line (or multiline event) is taken as it is, and the file closed; a closed file is opened again when a scan finds it grown. 1m when left out.": "文件多久不增长后，其不完整的最后一行（或多行事件）按现状取用，并关闭该文件；扫描发现已关闭的文件增长时再次打开。不设置时为 1m。",
"The columns' names, in order. Read, a row's values are named by them, and those past them c<n>, counting from 1; written, a record's fields of these names are written, a missing one empty. Left out, they are c1, c2 and so on read, and every field of the row written.": "各列的名称，按顺序。读取时，一行的值按这些名称命名，超出的命名为 c<n>（从 1 起计）；写出时，写出记录中这些名称的字段，缺失的为空。不设置时，读取命名为 c1、c2 等，写出该行数据的每个字段。",
"The file the lines are written to, appended to when it is there. One sink writes a path: neither another file sink nor fit's log or access log may write it.": "写入各行的文件，已存在时追加。一个路径只由一个目标写入：其他文件目标以及 fit 的日志或访问日志都不能写它。",
"The most lines of an event: the line past it begins another. 500 when left out or 0.": "一个事件的最多行数：超出的那一行开始另一个事件。不设置或为 0 时为 500。",
"The separator, one character other than a quote or a line break. A comma when left out.": "分隔符，引号和换行以外的一个字符。不设置时为逗号。",
"How often the globs are matched again, to find new, renamed, truncated and deleted files. 10s when left out.": "多久重新匹配一次通配符，以发现新建、改名、截断和删除的文件。不设置时为 10s。",
"Joins lines into events: a line matching start begins an event, and the lines after it, up to the next, belong to it, as a stack trace does. Each line is a record of its own when left out.": "把多行合并为事件：匹配 start 的行开始一个事件，其后直到下一个这样的行都属于它，如同堆栈跟踪。不设置时每行单独成为一条记录。",
"The files to read: paths or globs (*, ? and [...] within one path element), matched again each scan_interval, so new files are found.": "要读取的文件：路径或通配符（在一个路径元素内的 *、? 和 [...]），每个 scan_interval 重新匹配，以发现新文件。",
"The most bytes, of records or of encoded data, a call may hand back. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次调用可交回的最多字节数，无论是记录还是编码后的数据。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"Rotates and keeps the file as a log file is: by size and time, removing old files by age, count and total size, and compressing them. The file grows without bound when left out.": "像日志文件一样轮转和保留该文件：按大小和时间轮转，按时长、数量和总大小删除旧文件，并压缩它们。不设置时文件无限增长。",
"The plugin: a WebAssembly module, a WASI reactor, that exports fit_sync_decode, fit_sync_encode, or both; package plugin/wasm/guest builds one from Go with GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared.": "插件：一个 WebAssembly 模块（WASI reactor），导出 fit_sync_decode、fit_sync_encode 或两者；包 plugin/wasm/guest 可用 GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared 从 Go 构建。",
"The zone rotate's interval turns in: local (left out), utc, or an IANA name such as Asia/Shanghai.": "rotate 的 interval 据以切换的时区：local（不设置时）、utc，或 IANA 名称如 Asia/Shanghai。",
"How long the source waits, once every open file is read to its end, before reading them again. 250ms when left out.": "所有打开的文件都读到末尾后，源在再次读取前等待的时间。不设置时为 250ms。",
"What makes records of a line or an event: line when left out, a message record holding it as after's line.": "把一行或一个事件变成记录的编解码器：不设置时为 line，即一条 message 记录，把它保存在 after 的 line 中。",
"How many bytes of a file's head its fingerprint covers: a file whose device and inode are known but whose head differs is a new one, and a new file whose head matches a file just truncated is its copy, read on from where the original was. 1024 when left out or 0.": "文件指纹覆盖其开头的字节数：设备号和 inode 已知但开头不同的文件是新文件，开头与刚被截断的文件相同的新文件是它的副本，从原文件读到的位置接着读。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"How long a call may run; past it the call is stopped and fails. 1s when left out.": "一次调用最多可运行的时间；超过时停止该调用并使其失败。不设置时为 1s。",
"The most files open at once: past it, a file read to its end is closed to open another. 256 when left out or 0.": "同时打开的最多文件数：超过时关闭一个已读到末尾的文件，以打开另一个。不设置或为 0 时为 256。",
"When the job starts again, in cron's five fields (minute, hour, day of the month, month, day of the week, as 0 3 * * * for 03:00 every day) or a descriptor (@hourly, @daily, @weekly, @monthly, @yearly), in time_zone. A run never overlaps one still going: times passing while a job runs are skipped. A job interrupted, by a crash or a restart, goes on at once; one finished waits for the next time. Without a schedule a job runs once, when its pipeline starts, and not again once finished.": "作业再次启动的时间，用 cron 的五个字段（分钟、小时、月中的日、月、星期几，如 0 3 * * * 表示每天 03:00）或一个描述符（@hourly、@daily、@weekly、@monthly、@yearly）表示，按 time_zone 计。一次运行绝不与仍在进行的运行重叠：作业运行期间经过的时间点被跳过。被中断（崩溃或重启）的作业立即继续；已完成的作业等待下一个时间点。没有 schedule 时，作业在其流水线启动时运行一次，完成后不再运行。",
"In a job (mode once), split the records into chunks of this many, by ranges of their ids, read job.max_parallel at a time, each record a transaction of its own: for trying out jobs. Needs records; at most 100000 chunks. Not split when left out.": "在作业（mode once）中，按 id 的范围把记录分成每块这么多条的分块，每次读取 job.max_parallel 块，每条记录自成一个事务：用于试用作业。需要 records；最多 100000 块。不设置时不分块。",
"How many chunks of the source's snapshot are read at once, and how many writers each sink that can take writes at once (the memory sink, the database sinks) has, a record's key always going to the same writer, so that one key is never written out of order. A source that cannot split its snapshot is read whole, and a sink that cannot take writes at once has one writer. 4 when left out or 0.": "同时读取源快照的多少块，以及每个能接受并发写入的目标（memory 目标、数据库目标）有多少个写入者；同一个键的记录总是交给同一个写入者，所以一个键绝不会乱序写入。不能拆分快照的源整体读取，不能接受并发写入的目标只有一个写入者。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The IANA time zone the schedule is in, as Asia/Shanghai, or Local for the host's. UTC when left out. Times a daylight saving change skips do not run; times it repeats run once.": "schedule 所用的 IANA 时区，如 Asia/Shanghai，或用 Local 表示主机的时区。不设置时为 UTC。夏令时切换跳过的时间点不运行；重复出现的时间点只运行一次。",
"How a pipeline of mode once runs as a batch job: its source's snapshot read in chunks, max_parallel at a time, where the source can split it, its progress kept in the checkpoint so that a job interrupted goes on from its finished chunks, and a schedule starting it again. Only with mode once; the defaults when left out.": "mode 为 once 的流水线如何作为批处理作业运行：源能拆分快照时，按块读取，每次 max_parallel 块；进度保存在检查点中，使被中断的作业从已完成的块之后继续；并可由 schedule 再次启动。仅用于 mode once；不设置时用默认值。",
"The cluster's HTTP endpoints, as https://es1:9200, each a node or a load balancer: the one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when it fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504). fib's client does not follow redirects.": "集群的 HTTP 端点，如 https://es1:9200，每个是一个节点或负载均衡器：使用上次应答的那个，它未能应答（连接出错、超时、502、503 或 504）时依次换下一个。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"The user for basic authentication, with password_env.": "基本认证的用户名，与 password_env 一起使用。",
"The environment variable holding username's password, read when the pipeline loads.": "存放 username 密码的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取。",
"The environment variable holding an Elasticsearch API key as its create API key call returns it encoded (base64 of id:key), sent as Authorization: ApiKey, read when the pipeline loads. Not with username. OpenSearch has no API keys: it answers one with 401.": "存放 Elasticsearch API 密钥的环境变量，取其创建 API 密钥调用返回的编码形式（id:key 的 base64），以 Authorization: ApiKey 发送，在流水线加载时读取。不能与 username 同用。OpenSearch 没有 API 密钥：它对 API 密钥回应 401。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the cluster's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own (Elasticsearch's http_ca.crt, OpenSearch's root-ca.pem). The check cannot be turned off.": "用于校验集群证书的 PEM 证书文件，代替系统根证书，适用于自有 CA（Elasticsearch 的 http_ca.crt、OpenSearch 的 root-ca.pem）。校验不能关闭。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to a cluster that asks for one; needs key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，在集群要求时出示；需要 key_file。",
"The PEM file of cert_file's private key.": "cert_file 私钥的 PEM 文件。",
"The name the cluster's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; each URL's host when left out.": "集群证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为各 URL 的主机。",
"How long one request may take, from connecting to the end of its answer. 60s when left out or 0.": "一个请求从连接到应答结束可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The index a record goes to: text with placeholders, {namespace} the record's namespace and any other a date of the record's commit time (the time it is written when the source gives none) in time_zone, written with yyyy, yy, MM, dd and HH and the separators '.', '-' and '_': logs-{yyyy.MM.dd}; {{ is a brace. Index names are lowercase; one the cluster refuses fails its record. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的索引：带占位符的文本，{namespace} 为记录的命名空间，其他占位符为记录提交时间（源未给出时为写入时间）在 time_zone 中的日期，用 yyyy、yy、MM、dd、HH 及分隔符 '.'、'-'、'_' 书写：logs-{yyyy.MM.dd}；{{ 表示一个花括号。索引名为小写；集群拒绝的索引名使该记录失败。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The zone index's dates are in: UTC when left out, local, or an IANA name such as Asia/Shanghai.": "index 中日期所用的时区：不设置时为 UTC，或 local，或 IANA 名称如 Asia/Shanghai。",
"How inserts and updates are written: index replaces the document of the _id, so a replay converges; create writes it only when there is none, as a data stream needs, and a document already there (409) counts as written, so an update to it is lost. index when left out.": "插入和更新的写法：index 替换该 _id 的文档，使重放收敛；create 仅在没有文档时写入，如数据流所需，已有文档（409）视为已写入，因此对它的更新会丢失。不设置时为 index。",
"A field of the row (after, or before, or the key's for a delete) whose value routes the document to its shard; a record without it fails. None when left out.": "行中的一个字段（after，或 before，删除时也可取自键），其值将文档路由到分片；缺少它的记录失败。不设置时不路由。",
"The ingest pipeline inserts and updates go through. None when left out, or the index's default.": "插入和更新经过的 ingest pipeline。不设置时不指定，即用索引的默认值。",
"The most bytes of one _bulk request; a batch larger is sent in several, in order, and a document larger fails its record. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个 _bulk 请求的最大字节数；更大的批按顺序分成多个请求发送，超过它的单个文档使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"A top-level field marking a document deleted: a document with it set, to anything but null or false, is read as a delete of its _id, with the document as before. Deletes themselves are not seen by the source. None when left out.": "标记文档已删除的顶层字段：设置了该字段（值不为 null 或 false）的文档读作对其 _id 的删除，文档作为 before。删除本身源看不到。不设置时没有。",
"The environment variable holding an Elasticsearch API key as its create API key call returns it encoded (base64 of id:key), sent as Authorization: ApiKey, read when the pipeline loads. Not with username. OpenSearch has no API keys.": "存放 Elasticsearch API key 的环境变量，取创建 API key 调用返回的编码形式（id:key 的 base64），以 Authorization: ApiKey 发送，在流水线加载时读取。不能与 username 同时使用。OpenSearch 没有 API key。",
"How long to wait to poll again once a poll has read everything there was. 5s when left out or 0.": "一次轮询读完已有的全部内容后，等多久再轮询。不设置或为 0 时为 5s。",
"How the documents there are at the start are read: pit, every document, through a point in time, then the cursor from its value then; cursor, only those with the cursor, in its order, from its lowest value, resumed where a restart left off; none, no snapshot, the cursor from its value now. cursor and none need cursor. pit when left out.": "开始时已有的文档如何读取：pit，经时间点读取所有文档，再从当时的游标值起按游标读；cursor，只读有游标字段的文档，按游标顺序从其最小值起读，重启后从中断处续读；none，不读快照，从游标现在的值起读。cursor 和 none 需要 cursor。不设置时为 pit。",
"In a job (mode once) without a cursor, the documents a chunk is reckoned to hold: the snapshot is split into as many slices of the _id as the count of documents needs, at most 1024, read job.max_parallel at a time, each through a scroll of its own. 100000 when left out or 0.": "在没有游标的作业（mode once）中，一块预计包含的文档数：快照按文档总数分成所需数量的 _id 切片，最多 1024 个，每次并行读 job.max_parallel 个，各经自己的 scroll 读取。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The indices read: a name, an alias, a pattern such as logs-*, or several joined by commas; a record's namespace is the index its document is in.": "读取的索引：一个名称、别名、如 logs-* 的模式，或以逗号连接的多个；记录的命名空间是其文档所在的索引。",
"How long the cluster keeps a point in time, or a job's scroll, between two searches of it. A snapshot stalled longer than this (its sinks held by the queue) finds it gone and starts again. 5m when left out or 0.": "集群在对一个时间点（或作业的 scroll）的两次搜索之间保留它多久。快照停顿超过此时长（其目标经队列拖住它）会发现时间点已失效并从头开始。不设置或为 0 时为 5m。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the cluster's is checked against, in place of the system's roots. The check cannot be turned off.": "校验集群证书所用的 PEM 证书文件，代替系统根证书。校验不能关闭。",
"The most bytes a search's answer should hold: past them, the next searches ask for half as many documents, and twice as many again, up to page_size, once answers are under a quarter of it. An answer past 64 MiB is refused and asked again for half. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次搜索的应答应包含的最大字节数：超过时，之后的搜索请求一半的文档数，应答低于其四分之一后再加倍，最多到 page_size。超过 64 MiB 的应答会被拒绝，并以一半的数量重新请求。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The cluster's HTTP endpoints, as https://es1:9200, each a node or a load balancer: the one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when it fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504).": "集群的 HTTP 端点，如 https://es1:9200，每个是一个节点或负载均衡器：使用上次应答的那个，它无法应答时（连接错误、超时、502、503 或 504）依次换下一个。",
"A field every document written or changed gets a later value of (an update time, a sequence number), of type date, date_nanos, a number or keyword: after the snapshot, documents whose cursor reaches past the last value read are polled for, ordered by it. Documents without the field are read by the snapshot only. None when left out: the snapshot is read and the source ends.": "每个文档在写入或修改时会获得更大值的字段（更新时间、序列号），类型为 date、date_nanos、数字或 keyword：快照之后，按它的顺序轮询游标超过已读最后值的文档。没有该字段的文档只由快照读取。不设置时没有：读完快照后源结束。",
"The most documents one search returns. 1000 when left out or 0.": "一次搜索返回的最多文档数。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"For a date or date_nanos cursor, how far behind the cluster's clock polls stay: documents whose cursor is later than now less delay are read only once it has passed, so that a document written with a time but searchable only after the index refreshes (1s by default) is not passed over. Date math counts whole seconds: a fraction is rounded up. 0 reads up to now. 2s when left out.": "对 date 或 date_nanos 游标，轮询落后集群时钟多少：游标晚于当前时间减 delay 的文档，等这段时间过去后才读取，以免带着时间写入、但要等索引刷新（默认 1s）后才可搜索的文档被跳过。日期运算按整秒计，不足一秒向上取整。0 表示读到当前时间。不设置时为 2s。",
"The sync pipeline whose source, an http source, takes the bodies. While it is not running (not in the config, starting again, or stopped), requests are answered 503.": "接收请求体的 sync 流水线，其源须为 http 源。流水线未在运行时（不在配置中、正在重新启动或已停止），请求应答 503。",
"The endpoint batches are sent to, http or https, as https://collector.example.com/ingest. fib's client does not follow redirects: a 3xx fails the records.": "批次发往的端点，http 或 https，如 https://collector.example.com/ingest。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向：3xx 使记录失败。",
"What each record's JSON is: plain, its row (after, or before when after is null) as a plain JSON object; record, the whole record in its canonical JSON, with its operation, key, namespace and position. plain when left out.": "每条记录的 JSON 是什么：plain 为其行（after，after 为 null 时取 before），作为普通 JSON 对象；record 为整条记录的规范 JSON，含操作、键、命名空间和位置。不设置时为 plain。",
"How a batch is written: ndjson, a line of JSON per record (application/x-ndjson); json, a JSON array of them (application/json). ndjson when left out; codec takes its place.": "批次的写法：ndjson 为每条记录一行 JSON（application/x-ndjson）；json 为它们组成的 JSON 数组（application/json）。不设置时为 ndjson；设置 codec 时由它代替。",
"The environment variable holding a token sent as Authorization: Bearer, read when the pipeline loads. Not with username.": "存放以 Authorization: Bearer 发送的令牌的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取。不能与 username 同用。",
"The largest body taken; a larger one is answered 413. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大请求体；更大的应答 413。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The name the endpoint's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; the URL's host when left out.": "端点证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为 URL 的主机。",
"A codec that writes the batch's records in place of format and form, the body being what it makes of them, sent with content_type.": "代替 format 和 form 写出批次记录的编解码器，请求体即其输出，以 content_type 发送。",
"The namespace of records that come without one. http when left out.": "没有命名空间的记录所用的命名空间。不设置时为 http。",
"The header field the idempotency key goes in: 32 hex digits of a SHA-256 of the request's records' origins (or positions, for a source without them), its body and the lineage of the pipeline's checkpoint, the same each time the request is sent again, so a receiver can drop a request it already took, and new for the records a reset of the checkpoint reads again. Idempotency-Key when left out.": "放置幂等键的头字段：幂等键为请求中各记录来源（没有来源的源用位置）、请求体及管道检查点的谱系（lineage）的 SHA-256 的 32 位十六进制数字，请求每次重发时都相同，使接收方能丢弃已接收过的请求；检查点重置后重新读取的记录则用新的键。不设置时为 Idempotency-Key。",
"The most bytes of one request's body; a batch larger is sent in several, in order, and a record larger alone fails for good. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求体的最大字节数；更大的批按顺序分成多个请求发送，单条就超过它的记录永久失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The most bytes of bodies taken and not yet read into records; a body past it is answered 503 at once. The records are bounded by the pipeline's queue. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "已接收但尚未读成记录的请求体的最大字节数；超过它的请求体立即应答 503。记录由流水线的队列限制。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"How long a request waits for every sink to acknowledge its records before it is answered 503; its records may still be written, and a client sending it again then writes them twice, which an idempotent sink folds. 30s when left out or 0.": "请求等待所有目标确认其记录的时长，超过则应答 503；其记录仍可能被写入，客户端重发时就会写入两次，由幂等的目标合并。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"How long one request may take, from connecting to the end of its answer; one that takes longer is tried again. 30s when left out or 0.": "一个请求从连接到应答结束可用的时长；超时的请求会重试。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the endpoint's is checked against, in place of the system's roots. The check cannot be turned off.": "用于校验端点证书的 PEM 证书文件，代替系统根证书。校验不能关闭。",
"Header fields every request carries, as an X-Tenant. Not Authorization, which username or bearer_token_env set, nor Content-Type or the idempotency header.": "每个请求携带的头字段，如 X-Tenant。不能设置 Authorization（由 username 或 bearer_token_env 设置）、Content-Type 或幂等键头。",
"Without codec, what each JSON object is: plain, a row, made a message record whose after holds its members; record, a whole record in its canonical JSON, with its operation, key and namespace. plain when left out.": "没有 codec 时，每个 JSON 对象是什么：plain 为一行，成为 after 存放其成员的消息记录；record 为整条记录的规范 JSON，含操作、键和命名空间。不设置时为 plain。",
"With codec, what the codec is handed: lines, each line of the body (empty lines skipped, a trailing \\r dropped), or body, the whole body at once, for a format of several lines per record. lines when left out.": "有 codec 时交给编解码器的内容：lines 为请求体的每一行（跳过空行，去掉行尾的 \\r）；body 为一次交出整个请求体，用于每条记录占多行的格式。不设置时为 lines。",
"The request's method. POST when left out.": "请求的方法。不设置时为 POST。",
"The Retry-After a 503 carries, in whole seconds, at least 1. 1s when left out or 0.": "503 应答携带的 Retry-After，以整秒计，至少为 1。不设置或为 0 时为 1s。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to an endpoint that asks for one; needs key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，在端点要求时出示；需要 key_file。",
"What makes records of a body, in place of JSON: each line of it, or the whole body (framing), goes to the codec, whatever the request's Content-Type. JSON when left out: the body is JSON or NDJSON, its Content-Type application/json, application/x-ndjson, application/jsonl, a +json type, text/plain or none.": "代替 JSON 把请求体变成记录的编解码器：不论请求的 Content-Type，请求体的每一行或整个请求体（见 framing）交给它。不设置时请求体为 JSON 或 NDJSON，其 Content-Type 为 application/json、application/x-ndjson、application/jsonl、+json 类型、text/plain 或没有。",
"The Content-Type of a codec's body. application/octet-stream when left out; format sets its own.": "编解码器输出的请求体的 Content-Type。不设置时为 application/octet-stream；format 自行设置。",
"The most requests taken and not yet answered for good, waiting to be read or for their records' acknowledgement; one past it is answered 503 at once. 1024 when left out or 0.": "已接收但尚未最终应答的请求的最大数目，包括等待读取的和等待记录确认的；超过的请求立即应答 503。不设置或为 0 时为 1024。",
"The name the server's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; each URL's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为各 URL 的主机。",
"A field of the row (an int, a uint, or a time, in Unix nanoseconds) whose value is the version, for a source whose commit times can tie for one key, as a binlog's seconds; a record without it fails. The commit time when left out, or, when the source gives none, 0: a snapshot's rows never outrank a change, and rows of one version are kept as the last written.": "行中的一个字段（int、uint，或 time，取 Unix 纳秒），其值作为版本，用于同一个键的提交时间可能相同的源，如 binlog 的秒级时间；缺少它的记录失败。不设置时为提交时间，源未给出提交时间时为 0：快照的行永远不会压过变更，同一版本的行保留最后写入的。",
"The records' namespace. table when left out, or clickhouse for a query.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为 table，使用 query 时为 clickhouse。",
"The server's HTTP interface, as http://ch1:8123 or https://ch1:8443, each a server of the cluster or a load balancer: the one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when it fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504).": "服务器的 HTTP 接口，如 http://ch1:8123 或 https://ch1:8443，每个是集群中的一台服务器或负载均衡器：使用上次应答的那个，它未能应答（连接出错、超时、502、503 或 504）时依次换下一个。",
"A SELECT whose rows are read, as SELECT * FROM shop.orders FINAL WHERE region = 'eu': the source reads from it as a subquery, adding its own WHERE, ORDER BY and LIMIT, so it has the key's and the cursor's columns and no ORDER BY, LIMIT, FORMAT or SETTINGS of its own. Either table or query.": "读取其结果行的 SELECT，如 SELECT * FROM shop.orders FINAL WHERE region = 'eu'：源把它作为子查询读取，加上自己的 WHERE、ORDER BY 和 LIMIT，因此它须包含键列和游标列，且不带自己的 ORDER BY、LIMIT、FORMAT 或 SETTINGS。table 与 query 二选一。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to a server that asks for one; needs key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，在服务器要求时出示；需要 key_file。",
"The UInt64 column each row's version goes in, which a ReplacingMergeTree keeps the greatest of: the record's commit time in Unix nanoseconds, 0 when it has none (a snapshot's rows, which any change then outranks), or version_field's value. _version when left out.": "存放每行版本的 UInt64 列，ReplacingMergeTree 保留版本最大的行：记录的提交时间（Unix 纳秒），没有提交时间时为 0（快照的行，任何变更都会压过它），或 version_field 的值。不设置时为 _version。",
"The database of a table named without one, and the query's; the user's default when left out.": "未写数据库的表名所在的数据库，也是 query 的数据库；不设置时为用户的默认数据库。",
"In a job (mode once), split the snapshot into ranges of the key of about this many rows, read job.max_parallel at a time and resumed by chunk; the next job starts from the beginning. Not split when left out, and the job reads by the cursor, the next job going on after it.": "在作业（mode once）中，按键的范围把快照分成每块约这么多行，每次读取 job.max_parallel 块，按块续传；下一个作业从头开始。不设置时不分块，作业按游标读取，下一个作业从它之后继续。",
"The database of a table named without one; the user's default when left out.": "未写数据库的表名所在的数据库；不设置时为用户的默认数据库。",
"A column (a Bool or a number) whose true or non-zero value makes the row a delete rather than an insert, as the sink's _deleted. None when left out.": "一列（Bool 或数字），其值为 true 或非零时该行作为删除而非插入，如目标的 _deleted。不设置时没有。",
"The most bytes of one INSERT's rows; a batch larger is sent in several, in order, each with a token of its own, and a row larger fails its record. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个 INSERT 的行的最大字节数；更大的批按顺序分成多个 INSERT 发送，各有自己的令牌，超过它的单行使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The UInt8 column set to 1 for a delete and 0 otherwise, a ReplacingMergeTree's is_deleted. _deleted when left out.": "删除时设为 1、否则为 0 的 UInt8 列，即 ReplacingMergeTree 的 is_deleted。不设置时为 _deleted。",
"How many rows one query reads. 10000 when left out or 0.": "一次查询读取的行数。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own. The check cannot be turned off.": "用于校验服务器证书的 PEM 证书文件，代替系统根证书，适用于自有 CA。校验不能关闭。",
"ClickHouse settings sent with every query, the name to the value, as {\"async_insert\": \"1\"}; they cannot be query, database, insert_deduplication_token, insert_deduplicate or a param_.": "随每个查询发送的 ClickHouse 设置，名称到值，如 {\"async_insert\": \"1\"}；不能是 query、database、insert_deduplication_token、insert_deduplicate 或 param_ 开头的名称。",
"The table read, as db.table or a table of database. Either table or query.": "读取的表，写作 db.table，或 database 中的表。table 与 query 二选一。",
"How long to wait, once the rows past the cursor are read, before asking again. 5s when left out or 0.": "读完游标之后的行后，再次查询前等待的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 5s。",
"The environment variable holding username's password, read when the pipeline loads; none when left out.": "存放 username 密码的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取；不设置时无密码。",
"The table a record goes to: text with {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it), the record's namespace; db.table names the database too. The table is not made: it is the user's, a ReplacingMergeTree(_version, _deleted) ordered by the key for updates and deletes, with non_replicated_deduplication_window set unless it is replicated, so that the deduplication token works. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的表：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间，也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）的文本；db.table 同时指定数据库。表不会被创建：由用户建好，有更新和删除时为按键排序的 ReplacingMergeTree(_version, _deleted)，非复制表须设置 non_replicated_deduplication_window，去重令牌才生效。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The server's HTTP interface, as http://ch1:8123 or https://ch1:8443, each a server of the cluster or a load balancer: the one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when it fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504). fib's client does not follow redirects.": "服务器的 HTTP 接口，如 http://ch1:8123 或 https://ch1:8443，每个是集群中的一台服务器或负载均衡器：使用上次应答的那个，它未能应答（连接出错、超时、502、503 或 504）时依次换下一个。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"Write rows as they are, without the version and deleted columns, as for a log's MergeTree; deletes must then be delete or ignore. false when left out.": "按原样写入行，不加版本列和删除标记列，如日志的 MergeTree；此时 deletes 必须为 delete 或 ignore。不设置时为 false。",
"The columns that identify a row, in order, not Nullable: the records' key, and what rows are ordered by after the cursor, so that rows with the same cursor value are read once each.": "标识一行的列，按顺序，不能是 Nullable：作为记录的键，也是在游标之后对行排序所用的列，使游标值相同的行各读一次。",
"How deletes are written: flag, as a row with the deleted column set to 1; delete, as a lightweight DELETE of the key's rows, run in order between the inserts, which are then not deduplicated (a DELETE written again would remove a row a deduplicated insert would not bring back), so a replay stores rows again and the table is best a ReplacingMergeTree; ignore, not at all. flag when left out.": "删除的写法：flag，写一行并把删除标记列设为 1；delete，按键执行轻量 DELETE，在插入之间按顺序执行，此时插入不去重（再次执行的 DELETE 会删掉去重后不会再插入的行），因此重放会再次存入行，表最好是 ReplacingMergeTree；ignore，不写。不设置时为 flag。",
"Where a pipeline without a checkpoint starts: initial, at the first row, reading what is there; never, after the greatest cursor value now there, reading only what comes after (needs cursor). initial when left out.": "没有检查点的流水线从哪里开始：initial，从第一行开始读取现有的行；never，从当前最大的游标值之后开始，只读之后写入的行（需要 cursor）。不设置时为 initial。",
"ClickHouse settings sent with every query, the name to the value, as {\"max_threads\": \"4\"}; they cannot be query, database, insert_deduplication_token, insert_deduplicate or a param_.": "随每个查询发送的 ClickHouse 设置，名称到值，如 {\"max_threads\": \"4\"}；不能是 query、database、insert_deduplication_token、insert_deduplicate 或 param_ 开头的名称。",
"The user, sent with basic authentication; the server's default user when left out.": "用户名，以基本认证发送；不设置时为服务器的默认用户。",
"A column whose value grows as rows are written or changed (an update time, a version), not Nullable, polled by: rows past the position's are read every poll_interval. A row written later with a value at or below one already read is not seen. Without it the source reads the rows once by the key and ends.": "随行写入或修改而增长的列（更新时间、版本），不能是 Nullable，用于轮询：每隔 poll_interval 读取位置之后的行。之后写入、其值不大于已读值的行不会被看到。不设置时源按键读取一遍后结束。",
"How records are written: stream, each an entry added to a stream with XADD; keys, each the value of a key of its own, set, replaced or deleted. stream when left out.": "记录的写法：stream，每条记录用 XADD 作为一个条目追加到流；keys，每条记录是自己一个键的值，被设置、替换或删除。不设置时为 stream。",
"The ACL user to authenticate as, with password_env; the default user when left out.": "认证所用的 ACL 用户，与 password_env 一起使用；不设置时为默认用户。",
"Where a pipeline without a checkpoint starts: initial, at each stream's first entry; never, after its last entry now, reading only what comes after. initial when left out.": "没有检查点的管道从哪里开始：initial，从每个流的第一个条目开始；never，从其当前最后一个条目之后开始，只读之后来的。不设置时为 initial。",
"With mode stream and form fields, a field set to the record's operation (insert, update, delete, message) before the row's fields, so that a delete can be told from an insert. None when left out.": "在 mode 为 stream、form 为 fields 时，在行的字段之前加一个字段，值为记录的操作（insert、update、delete、message），以便区分删除和插入。不设置时没有。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own; needs tls.": "用来校验服务器证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书，用于自建 CA；需要 tls。",
"The records' namespace. The stream's key when left out, or, for form record, the record's own.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为流的键，form 为 record 时为记录自己的。",
"The environment variable holding the password, read when the pipeline loads; no authentication when left out.": "存放密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取；不设置时不认证。",
"With mode keys, how long a key written lives (SET PX, PEXPIRE). For ever when left out or 0.": "在 mode 为 keys 时，写入的键存活多久（SET PX、PEXPIRE）。不设置或为 0 时永久。",
"With mode keys, what a key holds: json, the row as a plain JSON object (SET); record, the whole record in its canonical JSON (SET); hash, the row's fields as a hash (HSET), each value as text, maps and arrays as JSON, nulls left out, the key deleted and set in one MULTI so that no field of an earlier row stays. A delete deletes the key (DEL). json when left out.": "在 mode 为 keys 时，键里存什么：json，行作为普通 JSON 对象（SET）；record，整条记录的规范 JSON（SET）；hash，行的字段作为哈希（HSET），每个值为文本，映射和数组为 JSON，略去 null，键在一个 MULTI 中先删除再设置，不留下旧行的字段。删除记录删除该键（DEL）。不设置时为 json。",
"The server's host and port, a standalone server or a primary (not Redis Cluster). 127.0.0.1:6379 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口，单机服务器或主节点（不支持 Redis Cluster）。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:6379。",
"With mode stream, the stream's key: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace, and {key}, its key's text. {namespace} when left out.": "在 mode 为 stream 时，流的键：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间）和 {key}（其键的文本）的文本。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The most entries one XREAD reads of each stream. 1000 when left out or 0.": "一次 XREAD 从每个流最多读取的条目数。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"With mode stream, the entry's ID: auto, the server's (XADD *), so that a batch written again after a crash adds its entries again; key, the record's key (its id field, or the key itself), an ID as ms-seq as the source redis gives, so that a replay's entries, at or below the stream's last, are refused by the server and counted as written: a stream copied exactly once. auto when left out.": "在 mode 为 stream 时，条目的 ID：auto，由服务器生成（XADD *），崩溃后重写的批次会再次追加其条目；key，取记录的键（其 id 字段，或键本身），即 redis 源给出的 ms-seq 形式 ID，重放的条目不大于流的最后一个时被服务器拒绝并算作已写入：流被恰好复制一次。不设置时为 auto。",
"With mode stream, what an entry holds: fields, the row's fields (after, or before for a delete), each value as text, maps and arrays as JSON, nulls left out; record, one field, record, holding the whole record in its canonical JSON, which the source redis reads back with every type, the operation and the key. fields when left out.": "在 mode 为 stream 时，条目里存什么：fields，行的字段（after，删除时为 before），每个值为文本，映射和数组为 JSON，略去 null；record，一个名为 record 的字段，存放整条记录的规范 JSON，redis 源可连同所有类型、操作和键读回。不设置时为 fields。",
"The RESP version spoken, 2 or 3. When left out, 3 if the server knows HELLO (Redis 6 and later, Valkey), 2 otherwise.": "所用的 RESP 版本，2 或 3。不设置时，服务器支持 HELLO（Redis 6 及以后、Valkey）则为 3，否则为 2。",
"With mode keys, the key a record is written to: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace, and {key}, its key's text, a key of several fields their values joined by ':'. A record without a key fails. {namespace}:{key} when left out.": "在 mode 为 keys 时，记录写入的键：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间）和 {key}（其键的文本，多字段的键为各值以 ':' 连接）的文本。没有键的记录失败。不设置时为 {namespace}:{key}。",
"The streams read, by their keys, together, in one XREAD.": "要读取的流，按其键，在一次 XREAD 中一起读取。",
"With mode stream, trim each stream to about this many entries as they are added (XADD MAXLEN ~). Not trimmed when left out or 0.": "在 mode 为 stream 时，追加条目时把每个流修剪到约这么多条（XADD MAXLEN ~）。不设置或为 0 时不修剪。",
"The most commands sent in one round trip; a batch with more is sent in several, in order. 1000 when left out or 0.": "一次往返最多发送的命令数；命令更多的批次按顺序分几次发送。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to a server that asks for one (tls-auth-clients); needs tls and key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，提供给要求客户端证书的服务器（tls-auth-clients）；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"What an entry is: fields, a message record whose row is the entry's fields, its key the entry's ID; record, the record held in its record field in canonical JSON, as the sink redis writes with form record, with its operation, key, namespace and rows (an entry without one is read as fields). fields when left out.": "条目是什么：fields，一条 message 记录，其行为条目的字段，键为条目的 ID；record，条目 record 字段中以规范 JSON 存放的记录，即 redis 汇以 form record 写入的，带有操作、键、命名空间和行（没有该字段的条目按 fields 读取）。不设置时为 fields。",
"Connect over TLS, the server's certificate checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，服务器证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 的证书校验；校验不能关闭。",
"The name the server's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; address's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为 address 的主机。",
"How long one XREAD waits for new entries before asking again. 5s when left out or 0.": "一次 XREAD 等待新条目多久后再次请求。不设置或为 0 时为 5s。",
"How long connecting, and each command but XREAD's wait, may take. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接以及除 XREAD 等待外的每条命令可用的时间。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"How long connecting, and each round trip of a batch's commands, may take. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接以及一批命令的每次往返可用的时间。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"The access key's ID, sent in each request's signature; with secret_access_key_env. Requests are not signed when both are left out, for a public bucket.": "访问密钥的 ID，随每个请求的签名发送；与 secret_access_key_env 一起设置。两者都不设置时请求不签名，用于公开的存储桶。",
"Where a pipeline without a checkpoint starts: the objects whose keys come after it. The first object under prefix when left out.": "没有检查点的管道从哪里开始：键排在它之后的对象。不设置时从 prefix 下的第一个对象开始。",
"Gzip each object, its key ending in .gz through {ext}, with Content-Type application/gzip. false when left out.": "用 gzip 压缩每个对象，其键经由 {ext} 以 .gz 结尾，Content-Type 为 application/gzip。不设置时为 false。",
"The name the server's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; the endpoint's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名称；不设置时为 endpoint 的主机名。",
"The objects' keys: text with placeholders, of the object's first record: {namespace} (a leading / dropped), {date} as 2006-01-02, {yyyy}, {mm}, {dd}, {hh}, {timestamp} as 20060102T150405.000000000Z, all from its commit time in UTC (or the time of the write, when it has none), {position}, 20 hex digits from its origin (a Kafka offset, a Pulsar message ID, a CDC transaction and place) or, without one, its position, and {ext}, the codec's extension (.txt for line, .jsonl for json, .csv for csv) and .gz when gzipped. It must have {position}, so that two objects do not have one name. {namespace}/{date}/{timestamp}-{position}{ext} when left out.": "对象的键：带占位符的文本，取自对象的第一条记录：{namespace}（去掉开头的 /），{date} 形如 2006-01-02，{yyyy}、{mm}、{dd}、{hh}，{timestamp} 形如 20060102T150405.000000000Z，均取自其 UTC 提交时间（没有提交时间时取写入时间），{position} 为由其来源（Kafka 偏移、Pulsar 消息 ID、CDC 事务及序号）或没有来源时由其位置得出的 20 位十六进制数，{ext} 为编解码器的扩展名（line 为 .txt，json 为 .jsonl，csv 为 .csv），gzip 压缩时再加 .gz。必须包含 {position}，以免两个对象同名。不设置时为 {namespace}/{date}/{timestamp}-{position}{ext}。",
"The longest line, in bytes: a longer one is cut there, its rest skipped, and counted. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "最长的行，单位为字节：更长的行在此处截断，其余部分跳过，并计数。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"The server, as https://minio.internal:9000 or https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com, with no path: an S3 compatible's address, or AWS's endpoint of region. https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com when left out.": "服务器，如 https://minio.internal:9000 或 https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com，不带路径：S3 兼容服务的地址，或 AWS 在 region 的端点。不设置时为 https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com。",
"The most bytes of lines (before gzip) in one object: a batch larger is written as several, in order. A record larger is an object of its own. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个对象中行的最大字节数（gzip 压缩前）：更大的批次按顺序写为多个对象。更大的单条记录自成一个对象。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"What makes records of a line: line when left out, a message record holding it as after's line; json reads it as JSON, csv as comma-separated values. A line the codec fails on is a message record of the line and the error.": "由行生成记录的方式：不设置时为 line，即一条 message 记录，行内容放在 after 的 line 中；json 按 JSON 读取，csv 按逗号分隔值读取。编解码器处理失败的行成为一条包含该行和错误的 message 记录。",
"The environment variable holding a session token, for temporary credentials, sent as x-amz-security-token; none when left out. Temporary credentials are read once: they are not renewed while the pipeline runs.": "存放会话令牌的环境变量，用于临时凭证，以 x-amz-security-token 发送；不设置时没有。临时凭证只读取一次：管道运行期间不会续期。",
"Which objects are gunzipped: auto, those whose keys end in .gz; gzip, every one; none, none. A gzipped object resumed after a restart is read again from its start, its lines up to the offset skipped. auto when left out.": "哪些对象需要 gzip 解压：auto，键以 .gz 结尾的对象；gzip，所有对象；none，都不解压。重启后续读的 gzip 对象会从头重新读取，偏移量之前的行被跳过。不设置时为 auto。",
"The region requests are signed for: the bucket's on AWS, and what the server is set to elsewhere (MinIO's and most compatibles' us-east-1, R2's auto). us-east-1 when left out.": "请求签名所用的区域：在 AWS 上为存储桶所在区域，在其他服务上为服务器设置的区域（MinIO 和多数兼容服务为 us-east-1，R2 为 auto）。不设置时为 us-east-1。",
"The environment variable holding access_key_id's secret, read when the pipeline loads.": "存放 access_key_id 对应密钥的环境变量，在管道加载时读取。",
"How the bucket is named in a request: path, as https://endpoint/bucket/key, which every compatible takes; virtual, as https://bucket.endpoint/key, as AWS prefers. virtual when endpoint is left out (AWS), path otherwise.": "请求中如何指明存储桶：path，形如 https://endpoint/bucket/key，所有兼容服务都支持；virtual，形如 https://bucket.endpoint/key，AWS 推荐的方式。不设置 endpoint（AWS）时为 virtual，否则为 path。",
"The bucket. It is not made: it is the user's.": "存储桶。不会自动创建：由用户自行准备。",
"The objects read are those whose keys begin with it, as logs/2026/; every object of the bucket when left out. Keys ending in / (folders' markers) are skipped.": "读取键以它开头的对象，如 logs/2026/；不设置时读取存储桶中的所有对象。以 / 结尾的键（文件夹标记）被跳过。",
"How long to wait, once every object listed is read, before listing again for keys past the last. 30s when left out or 0.": "列出的对象全部读完后，等待多久再次列出最后一个键之后的键。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"How many bytes of an object one request reads; an object is read in such ranges, so it never needs to be held whole. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求读取对象的字节数；对象按这样的范围分段读取，因此无需整个保存在内存中。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The records' namespace. The object's key when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为对象的键。",
"The database read. Every database but admin, config and local when left out.": "读取的数据库。不设置时为除 admin、config 和 local 之外的所有数据库。",
"The collections of database read. Every collection of it (not views, time series or system collections) when left out; needs database.": "读取 database 中的哪些集合。不设置时为其所有集合（不含视图、时间序列和系统集合）；需要 database。",
"What an update's after is: updateLookup, the document as it is when the change is read (an update of a document deleted since is passed over: its delete follows); whenAvailable or required, its post-image, which the collection must record (changeStreamPreAndPostImages), passed over or an error when there is none. updateLookup when left out.": "更新的 after 是什么：updateLookup，读到变更时文档的当前内容（之后已被删除的文档的更新会被跳过，其删除随后到来）；whenAvailable 或 required，其后像，需集合记录（changeStreamPreAndPostImages），没有时分别跳过或报错。不设置时为 updateLookup。",
"Whether updates and deletes carry the document as it was, their before: off, no; whenAvailable or required, its pre-image, which the collection must record (changeStreamPreAndPostImages), left out or an error when there is none. off when left out.": "更新和删除是否带上文档原来的内容，即其 before：off，不带；whenAvailable 或 required，其前像，需集合记录（changeStreamPreAndPostImages），没有时分别略去或报错。不设置时为 off。",
"Where a pipeline without a checkpoint starts: initial, every document there is, then the changes from just before it read them; never, the changes from now. initial when left out.": "没有检查点的管道从哪里开始：initial，先读现有的全部文档，再读从读取它们之前起的变更；never，只读从现在起的变更。不设置时为 initial。",
"The most documents, or changes, one batch of a cursor holds. 1000 when left out or 0.": "游标一批最多包含的文档或变更数。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How long the server holds a request for changes while there are none, below timeout; also how long the last record of a transaction may wait to be known as its last. 1s when left out or 0.": "没有变更时服务器挂起一次变更请求多久，须小于 timeout；也是事务最后一条记录被确认为最后一条前最多等待多久。不设置或为 0 时为 1s。",
"In a job (mode once), the documents a chunk of the snapshot is reckoned to hold: each collection is split into as many ranges of _id as its count needs, from a sample of _ids, read job.max_parallel at a time. 100000 when left out or 0.": "在作业（mode 为 once）中，快照每个分块估计包含的文档数：每个集合按其文档数切成相应数量的 _id 区间，边界取自 _id 的抽样，每次并行读取 job.max_parallel 个。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The database every record is written to. When left out, the record's namespace's part before its first '.', a namespace without one failing its record.": "每条记录写入的数据库。不设置时取记录命名空间第一个 '.' 之前的部分，没有 '.' 的命名空间使其记录失败。",
"The write concern's w: majority, a number of members (1 or more; 0, unacknowledged writes, is refused), or a tag set's name. The server's default (majority on a replica set) when left out.": "写关注的 w：majority、成员数（1 或以上；0 即不确认的写入，会被拒绝），或标签集的名称。不设置时为服务器的默认值（副本集上为 majority）。",
"Ask for the writes to be in the journal before they are acknowledged (j: true).": "要求写入在确认之前写入日志（j: true）。",
"The PEM file of cert_file's private key, when cert_file does not hold it.": "cert_file 私钥的 PEM 文件，用于 cert_file 不包含私钥时。",
"The replica set's name: a server of another set is not taken. Any set when left out.": "副本集的名称：不接受其他副本集的服务器。不设置时接受任何副本集。",
"The most bytes of documents in one bulk write; a batch larger is sent in several. A document larger than 16 MiB fails its record. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次批量写入中文档的最多字节数；更大的批次分多次发送。大于 16 MiB 的文档使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the servers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own; needs tls.": "用于校验服务器证书的证书 PEM 文件，代替系统根证书，用于自有 CA；需要 tls。",
"The database the user is defined in. admin when left out.": "定义该用户的数据库。不设置时为 admin。",
"How long the server waits for the write concern (wtimeout) before it answers with an error, which the pipeline retries; the writes stay. Without a limit when left out.": "服务器等待写关注满足的时长（wtimeout），超时后返回错误，由流水线重试；已做的写入保留。不设置时不限。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, presented to servers that ask for one; with its key in it too, as MongoDB's tlsCertificateKeyFile, unless key_file is set. Needs tls.": "客户端证书的 PEM 文件，提供给要求客户端证书的服务器；除非设置了 key_file，私钥也在其中，如 MongoDB 的 tlsCertificateKeyFile。需要 tls。",
"The collection every record is written to. When left out, the record's namespace after its first '.', or the whole namespace when it has none and database is set.": "每条记录写入的集合。不设置时取记录命名空间第一个 '.' 之后的部分；命名空间没有 '.' 且设置了 database 时取整个命名空间。",
"The name the servers' certificates must have, and the TLS server name sent; each server's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为各服务器的主机名。",
"How long connecting to a server may take, its TLS, hello and authentication. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接服务器可用的时长，包括 TLS、hello 和认证。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"Connect over TLS, the servers' certificates checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off. These TLS params replace the connection string's TLS options.": "通过 TLS 连接，服务器证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 的证书校验；校验不能关闭。这些 TLS 参数代替连接字符串中的 TLS 选项。",
"How long connecting, and each wait for the server in a statement, may take. 60s when left out or 0.": "连接，以及语句中每次等待服务器，最多可用多久。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The server's host and port: MySQL 5.7 or later, MariaDB 10.11 or later, or TiDB. 127.0.0.1:3306 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口：MySQL 5.7 及以上、MariaDB 10.11 及以上，或 TiDB。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:3306。",
"How records are grouped in the server's transactions: source, each source transaction as one, and the records without one (a snapshot's) of a batch together; batch, a batch's records up to the last that ends a source transaction in one, several source transactions together, and those after it, a part of one source transaction, in one held open into the next batch. Either way a source transaction is never committed in part, unless it is larger than max_transaction_bytes. source when left out.": "记录如何归入服务器的事务：source，每个源事务写成一个事务，一批中没有事务的记录（快照的）合在一起；batch，一批中直到最后一条结束源事务的记录为止的记录写成一个事务，多个源事务合在一起，其后的记录（某个源事务的一部分）放在一个保持打开、延续到下一批的事务中。无论哪种，源事务都不会只提交一部分，除非它大于 max_transaction_bytes。不设置时为 source。",
"The most bytes of values one of the server's transactions holds: past it, a transaction is committed at the next record that ends a source transaction, and a source transaction larger than this alone is committed in parts, with a warning. Against TiDB, whose transactions are bounded by txn-total-size-limit, 16 MiB when left out or 0; no bound against MySQL and MariaDB.": "服务器的一个事务最多容纳的值的字节数：超过后，事务在下一条结束源事务的记录处提交；单个源事务就超过它时分几部分提交，并给出警告。对 TiDB（其事务受 txn-total-size-limit 限制），不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB；对 MySQL 和 MariaDB 不限制。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to a server that asks for one; needs tls and key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，在服务器要求时出示；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"The user to log in as, which needs INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE on the tables written.": "登录所用的用户，需要对所写的表有 INSERT、UPDATE 和 DELETE 权限。",
"What a ddl record does: report, logged and not applied; stop, fails, so that on_error takes it, which with on_error stop stops the pipeline before it, for a person to change the table. report when left out.": "ddl 记录如何处理：report，记入日志而不执行；stop，记录失败，交由 on_error 处理，on_error 为 stop 时管道在它之前停止，由人来修改表。不设置时为 report。",
"Offer TLS's RSA key exchange besides the default suites, for MySQL 5.7's image, which offers no other that Go has; needs tls. false when left out.": "除默认密码套件外，再提供 TLS 的 RSA 密钥交换，用于 MySQL 5.7 的镜像（它不提供 Go 支持的其他密钥交换）；需要 tls。不设置时为 false。",
"The table a record goes to: text with {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it), the record's namespace; db.table names the database too. The table is not made: it is the user's, with a primary or unique key on the record's key columns, which the upserts rely on. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的表：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间，也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）的文本；db.table 同时指明数据库。表不会被创建：它由用户提供，需在记录的键列上有主键或唯一键，upsert 依赖于此。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"Connect over TLS, required: a server that does not offer it is refused, never spoken to in plain text. The server's certificate is checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，且为必需：不提供 TLS 的服务器会被拒绝，绝不以明文通信。服务器证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验；校验不能关闭。",
"The database of a table named without one.": "未指明数据库的表所在的数据库。",
"A PEM file of the server's RSA public key, with which caching_sha2_password and sha256_password send the password without TLS. Without it and without TLS, a user of those plugins logs in only through the server's cache.": "服务器 RSA 公钥的 PEM 文件，caching_sha2_password 和 sha256_password 在没有 TLS 时用它发送密码。既无它也无 TLS 时，使用这些插件的用户只能经服务器的缓存登录。",
"When a run of upserts is copied: COPY into a temporary table, then one INSERT ... SELECT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE from it, faster for many rows, as a snapshot's: auto, a run of copy_min_rows or more; always; never. auto when left out.": "何时复制一串 upsert：先 COPY 到临时表，再从中执行一条 INSERT ... SELECT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE，行多时（如快照）更快：auto，一串达到 copy_min_rows 行或更多时；always；never。不设置时为 auto。",
"The database; the user's name when left out, as the server has it.": "数据库；不设置时为用户名，与服务器的默认一致。",
"What a transaction of the sink's holds: batch, each batch written; source, each of the source's transactions, its records held across batches until its last arrives, so that a reader never sees part of one. A transaction with a record the server refuses for good is then not written at all; on_error takes the record refused, or the first of the batch for one held. batch when left out, source with checkpoint sink, which batch cannot go with.": "目标的一个事务包含什么：batch，写入的每个批次；source，源的每个事务，其记录跨批次暂存直到最后一条到达，读者永远看不到事务的一部分。此时含有被服务器永久拒绝的记录的事务整个不写入；on_error 处理被拒绝的记录，若被拒绝的是暂存的记录，则处理批次的第一条。不设置时为 batch；设置 checkpoint sink 时为 source，batch 不能与之同用。",
"Where the pipeline's checkpoint is kept: file, in the pipeline's file alone, so that a crash between a commit and the file's next checkpoint writes the records after it again (to the same rows); sink, also in checkpoint_table, written in the same transaction as the records it covers and read back when the pipeline starts, in preference to the file, so that no record is written twice: exactly once, while every sink of the pipeline keeps it. file when left out.": "管道的检查点保存在哪里：file，只在管道的文件中，因此在一次提交与文件的下一个检查点之间崩溃时，其后的记录会再写一遍（写到相同的行）；sink，同时保存在 checkpoint_table 中，与它覆盖的记录在同一个事务中写入，并在管道启动时读回、优先于文件，因此没有记录会被写两次：只要管道的每个 sink 都保存它，即为恰好一次。不设置时为 file。",
"With checkpoint sink, the table the checkpoint is kept in, a row a pipeline, made when missing (which needs CREATE on it); db.table names the database too, database's otherwise. _fit_sync_checkpoints when left out.": "设置 checkpoint sink 时保存检查点的表，每个管道一行，不存在时创建（需要对它的 CREATE 权限）；db.table 同时指定数据库，否则为 database 的。不设置时为 _fit_sync_checkpoints。",
"Where the pipeline's checkpoint is kept: file, in the pipeline's file alone, so that a crash between a commit and the file's next checkpoint writes the records after it again (to the same rows); sink, also in checkpoint_table, written in the same transaction as the records it covers and read back when the pipeline starts, in preference to the file, so that no record is written twice: exactly once, while every sink of the pipeline keeps it. Needs transactions source. file when left out.": "管道的检查点保存在哪里：file，只在管道的文件中，因此在一次提交与文件的下一个检查点之间崩溃时，其后的记录会再写一遍（写到相同的行）；sink，同时保存在 checkpoint_table 中，与它覆盖的记录在同一个事务中写入，并在管道启动时读回、优先于文件，因此没有记录会被写两次：只要管道的每个 sink 都保存它，即为恰好一次。需要 transactions source。不设置时为 file。",
"With checkpoint sink, the table the checkpoint is kept in, a row a pipeline, made when missing (which needs CREATE on its schema); schema.table names the schema too, found by the search_path otherwise. _fit_sync_checkpoints when left out.": "设置 checkpoint sink 时保存检查点的表，每个管道一行，不存在时创建（需要对其 schema 的 CREATE 权限）；schema.table 同时指定 schema，否则按 search_path 查找。不设置时为 _fit_sync_checkpoints。",
"The server's host and port. 127.0.0.1:5432 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:5432。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own.": "用来校验服务器证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书，用于自建 CA。",
"With copy auto, the fewest rows of a run that is copied. 100 when left out or 0.": "在 copy 为 auto 时，一串被复制的最少行数。不设置或为 0 时为 100。",
"SCRAM's channel binding to the TLS connection: prefer, when the server offers it; require, refusing a server that does not authenticate with it; disable. prefer when left out.": "SCRAM 与 TLS 连接的通道绑定：prefer，服务器提供时使用；require，拒绝不用它认证的服务器；disable，不使用。不设置时为 prefer。",
"The environment variable holding user's password, read when the pipeline loads; none when left out. SCRAM-SHA-256 is used; MD5 and cleartext passwords are refused.": "存放用户密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取；不设置时没有密码。使用 SCRAM-SHA-256；拒绝 MD5 和明文密码。",
"TLS: verify-full, the server's certificate and its name checked; verify-ca, the certificate only; require, TLS without a check; disable, none. There is no prefer: a connection does not fall back to plain text. verify-full when left out.": "TLS：verify-full，校验服务器证书及其名称；verify-ca，只校验证书；require，使用 TLS 但不校验；disable，不用 TLS。没有 prefer：连接不会回退到明文。不设置时为 verify-full。",
"How long connecting and writing one batch may take; a write that takes longer breaks its connection and is tried again. 60s when left out or 0.": "连接和写入一个批次可用的时间；超时的写入会断开其连接并重试。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The most rows of one INSERT or DELETE (and fewer when its parameters would pass PostgreSQL's 65535); a longer run is written in several. 1000 when left out or 0.": "一条 INSERT 或 DELETE 最多的行数（参数会超过 PostgreSQL 的 65535 个时更少）；更长的一串分几条写入。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The user to connect as, which needs INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE on the tables written, and TEMPORARY on the database for COPY.": "连接所用的用户，需要对所写的表有 INSERT、UPDATE 和 DELETE 权限，COPY 还需要数据库的 TEMPORARY 权限。",
"The columns of the key the upserts conflict on and the deletes delete by, their values taken from the record's key, or from its row. The record's key's fields when left out, so that the key must then be a map of columns.": "upsert 据以冲突、删除据以删除的键列，其值取自记录的键或其行。不设置时为记录键的字段，此时键必须是列的映射。",
"The table a record goes to: text with {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it), the record's namespace; split at its first dot into the schema and the table (shop.orders is the table orders of the schema shop), a name without a dot found by the search_path. The table is not made: it must have a primary key or unique index on the key's columns. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的表：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间，也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）的文本；在第一个点处分为模式和表（shop.orders 是模式 shop 的表 orders），不含点的名称按 search_path 查找。表不会被创建：它必须在键列上有主键或唯一索引。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The server's host and port, the port 5432 when only a host is given. 127.0.0.1:5432 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口，只给主机时端口为 5432。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:5432。",
"The user to connect as: one with the REPLICATION attribute (or a superuser), allowed to read the published tables, and, with create, to create the publication.": "连接所用的用户：须有 REPLICATION 属性（或为超级用户），能读取发布的表，设置 create 时还要能创建发布。",
"The environment variable holding the password, read when the pipeline loads; none when left out.": "存放密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取；不设置时不用密码。",
"The database whose changes are read: a slot belongs to one database.": "读取其变更的数据库：一个槽属于一个数据库。",
"TLS to the server: verify-full, the certificate and the host name checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; verify-ca, the certificate alone; require, TLS unchecked; disable, none. There is no prefer: a silent fall back to plain text is not offered. verify-full when left out.": "到服务器的 TLS：verify-full，按系统根证书或 ca_file 的证书校验证书和主机名；verify-ca，只校验证书；require，用 TLS 但不校验；disable，不用 TLS。没有 prefer：不提供悄悄退回明文的做法。不设置时为 verify-full。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against, in place of the system's roots.": "一个 PEM 文件，存放用来校验服务器证书的证书，代替系统根证书。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, presented to a server that asks for one; needs key_file.": "一个存放客户端证书的 PEM 文件，在服务器要求时出示；需要 key_file。",
"SCRAM-SHA-256's channel binding to the TLS connection: prefer, when TLS is used and the server offers it; require, fail without it; disable. prefer when left out.": "SCRAM-SHA-256 与 TLS 连接的通道绑定：prefer，在用 TLS 且服务器提供时使用；require，没有则失败；disable，不用。不设置时为 prefer。",
"How long connecting, TLS and authentication may take. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接、TLS 握手和认证最多可用的时间。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"The publication read: the tables whose changes come, and which operations. With create, made FOR TABLE tables when it does not exist; it is never changed.": "读取的发布：决定哪些表的变更、哪些操作会传来。设置 create 时，不存在则以 FOR TABLE tables 创建；之后从不修改它。",
"The logical replication slot read, of plugin pgoutput: lowercase letters, digits and underscores. With create, made when it does not exist; it is never dropped: drop it (pg_drop_replication_slot) when the pipeline is gone, or the server keeps its WAL for good.": "读取的逻辑复制槽，插件为 pgoutput：由小写字母、数字和下划线组成。设置 create 时，不存在则创建；从不删除它：管道不再使用时请删除它（pg_drop_replication_slot），否则服务器会一直保留它的 WAL。",
"The tables, schema.table or table (in public), the publication is made for with create; with a publication that exists, each must be in it. Required with create.": "设置 create 时创建发布所针对的表，写作 schema.table 或 table（在 public 中）；发布已存在时，每张表都必须在其中。设置 create 时必填。",
"Create the publication and the slot when they do not exist, rather than fail. With snapshot initial, the slot made exports the snapshot the tables are read from; with never, changes come from its creation on.": "发布和槽不存在时创建它们，而不是失败。snapshot 为 initial 时，新建的槽导出读取各表所用的快照；为 never 时，变更从槽创建之时起传来。",
"Where a pipeline without a checkpoint starts: initial, every row of the tables, read from a snapshot exported at the point the stream then starts from (the slot's own when create makes it, a temporary slot's otherwise), then the changes after it; never, the changes from the slot's position on. A job (mode once) reads the snapshot and stops, or, with never, the changes up to the server's end. initial when left out.": "没有检查点的管道从哪里开始：initial，先读各表的全部行，读自在流随后开始之处导出的快照（create 新建槽时用该槽自己的，否则用一个临时槽的），再读其后的变更；never，从槽的位置起读变更。作业（mode once）读完快照即停止，或在 never 时读到服务器当前末尾的变更为止。省略时为 initial。",
"How many chunks of the snapshot are read at once, each on a connection of its own, before the stream; a job reads job.max_parallel at a time instead. 4 when left out or 0.": "流开始前同时读取快照的多少个分块，每块用自己的连接；作业则改为一次读 job.max_parallel 个。省略或为 0 时为 4。",
"The rows of a chunk of the snapshot: a table with a primary key, or a replica identity index, is split into ranges of that key of this many rows, each read in a transaction of its own and resumed after its last row; a table without one is read whole. 100000 when left out or 0.": "快照一个分块的行数：有主键或复制标识索引的表按该键切成每段这么多行的范围，每段在自己的事务中读取，并从其最后一行之后续读；没有的表整表读取。省略或为 0 时为 100000。",
"Large transactions streamed by the server while they run (PostgreSQL 14 and later), kept in files under spool_dir until they commit, rather than spilled by the server and sent at their commit: auto, on servers that have it; off. auto when left out.": "大事务在运行时就由服务器以流的方式发来（PostgreSQL 14 及以后），在提交前保存在 spool_dir 下的文件中，而不是由服务器溢写到磁盘、提交时才发送：auto，在支持的服务器上使用；off，不用。不设置时为 auto。",
"The directory streamed transactions are kept in until they commit or abort, a file each, removed then. The system's temporary directory when left out.": "流式事务在提交或中止前保存所在的目录，每个事务一个文件，届时删除。不设置时为系统的临时目录。",
"How often the source tells the server the position the sinks have, also when it has not moved, which keeps the connection alive (below the server's wal_sender_timeout). 10s when left out or 0.": "源把各输出端已有的位置告诉服务器的间隔，位置没变时也照样发送，以保持连接（须低于服务器的 wal_sender_timeout）。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"The slot's lag, in bytes of WAL between the server's end and the position confirmed, past which a warning is logged: the WAL the server keeps for the pipeline. 1 GiB when left out or 0.": "槽的滞后，即服务器 WAL 末端与已确认位置之间的字节数，超过它时记录一条警告：这是服务器为该管道保留的 WAL。不设置或为 0 时为 1 GiB。",
"The servers as a connection string, mongodb://[user@]host1[:port1][,host2...][/authdb][?options], as the MongoDB drivers take it, with the options replicaSet, authSource, authMechanism (SCRAM-SHA-256), tls, tlsCAFile, tlsCertificateKeyFile, connectTimeoutMS, socketTimeoutMS, serverSelectionTimeoutMS, maxPoolSize and appName; any other is refused, and so is a password in it: password_env holds it. mongodb+srv is not read. uri or hosts; the params below replace what it sets.": "以连接串给出的服务器，mongodb://[user@]host1[:port1][,host2...][/authdb][?options]，与 MongoDB 驱动所接受的相同，可带选项 replicaSet、authSource、authMechanism（SCRAM-SHA-256）、tls、tlsCAFile、tlsCertificateKeyFile、connectTimeoutMS、socketTimeoutMS、serverSelectionTimeoutMS、maxPoolSize 和 appName；其他选项会被拒绝，其中带密码也会被拒绝：密码由 password_env 提供。不读取 mongodb+srv。uri 与 hosts 二选一；下面的参数会替换它所设置的内容。",
"The servers to find the primary from, host or host:port (27017 when left out), in place of uri: a replica set's members (the others are learned from them), a standalone server, or mongos routers. The primary is found again after a failover.": "用于查找主节点的服务器，host 或 host:port（省略端口时为 27017），代替 uri：副本集的成员（其余成员从它们获知）、单机服务器或 mongos 路由。故障转移后会重新查找主节点。",
"The user to authenticate as, with SCRAM-SHA-256 and password_env, in place of a user in uri; no authentication when neither names one.": "用于认证的用户，使用 SCRAM-SHA-256，与 password_env 一起使用，代替 uri 中的用户；两者都未给出用户时不认证。",
"The environment variable holding the user's password, read when the pipeline loads; needs a user, in username or uri.": "保存该用户密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取；需要有用户，由 username 或 uri 给出。",
"How long one command may take, from sending it to the end of its answer: a batch of a cursor, a bulk write of up to the sink's max_request_bytes. 60s when left out or 0.": "一条命令从发出到收完应答最多可用多久：游标的一批，或输出端一次至多 max_request_bytes 的批量写入。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The most connections open to the primary, the open cursors' among them, shared by a job's parallel readers or writers. 4 when left out or 0.": "到主节点打开的最多连接数，包括打开的游标所占的连接，由作业的并行读取者或写入者共享。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The file the dead letters are kept in, a JSON line each, a relative path being under the sync's state_dir; <state_dir>/<pipeline>.dead_letters.jsonl when left out. Two pipelines may not share one.": "保存死信的文件，每条一行 JSON，相对路径位于 sync 的 state_dir 之下；不设置时为 <state_dir>/<pipeline>.dead_letters.jsonl。两条流水线不能共用一个文件。",
"The most dead letters kept. 10000 when left out or 0.": "最多保存的死信条数。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。",
"The most bytes of dead letters kept, as their lines in the file. 64 MiB when left out or 0.": "最多保存的死信字节数，按它们在文件中的行计算。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。",
"What a dead letter that does not fit does: refuse fails its write, so that after its attempts the pipeline stops, its checkpoint before the record, and nothing is lost; drop_oldest drops the oldest dead letters to make room, counting them. refuse when left out.": "放不下的死信如何处理：refuse 让它的写入失败，于是在尝试次数用完后流水线停止，检查点停在该记录之前，不丢任何数据；drop_oldest 丢弃最旧的死信腾出空间，并计数。不设置时为 refuse。",
"fit's BitTorrent roles, beside the gateway on its engine: a client that downloads and seeds torrents on one port for TCP and UDP, and a tracker. None when left out: no BitTorrent port and no state on disk.": "fit 的 BitTorrent 角色，与网关一起运行在其引擎上：一个在同一端口上以 TCP 和 UDP 下载和做种的客户端，以及一个 tracker。不设置时没有：没有 BitTorrent 端口，也不在磁盘上保存状态。",
"The records' namespace. The codec's (canal_json's db.table, say), or the topic, when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为编解码器给出的（例如 canal_json 的 db.table），否则为主题名。",
"What happens when the checkpoint's offset of a partition is no longer in its log, its messages deleted by retention before they were read: error, the pipeline fails and says so, for a person to decide; earliest or latest, it goes on from there, the messages between lost. error when left out.": "检查点中某分区的偏移量已不在其日志中（消息在读取前已被保留策略删除）时如何处理：error，流水线失败并说明原因，交由人来决定；earliest 或 latest，从该处继续，其间的消息丢失。不设置时为 error。",
"How long a broker holds a fetch waiting for messages. 500ms when left out or 0.": "broker 为等待消息而挂起一次拉取的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 500ms。",
"Who acknowledges a batch: all, every in-sync replica (min.insync.replicas of them at least); leader, the partition's leader alone, so a leader lost before its followers copy the batch loses it; none, no one, the batch counted as written once sent. all when left out.": "由谁确认一个批次：all，所有同步副本（至少 min.insync.replicas 个）；leader，仅分区的 leader，因此 leader 在跟随者复制该批次之前丢失时批次也会丢失；none，无人确认，批次一经发出即视为已写入。不设置时为 all。",
"The field of after that holds the value. value when left out.": "after 中保存消息值的字段。不设置时为 value。",
"How long connecting, each answer beyond the fetch's wait, and the retries of a leader that moved may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、每次应答（拉取等待时间之外）以及 leader 迁移后的重试可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the brokers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots; needs tls.": "用于校验 broker 证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书；需要 tls。",
"What a pipeline without a checkpoint does first: initial, read tables at a timestamp, then the changes after it; never, only the changes, from the kafka source's start. initial when left out; it needs tables.": "没有检查点的流水线先做什么：initial，在一个时间戳上读取各表，然后读取其后的变更；never，只读变更，从 kafka 源的 start 开始。不设置时为 initial，此时需要 tables。",
"The topic's configs, as cleanup.policy compact or retention.ms.": "主题的配置项，例如 cleanup.policy 为 compact 或 retention.ms。",
"The topics read, every partition of each; partitions added to them are found within a minute and read from their start.": "要读取的主题，读取每个主题的所有分区；新增的分区会在一分钟内被发现，并从头读取。",
"The tables, as db.table, the snapshot reads and the changes are kept of; each needs a primary key. Every table the changefeed writes, with no snapshot, when left out.": "快照读取、且保留其变更的表，写作 db.table；每张表都需要主键。不设置时为 changefeed 写出的所有表，且不做快照。",
"The SASL user.": "SASL 用户。",
"Connect over TLS, the brokers' certificates checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，并用系统根证书或 ca_file 校验 broker 的证书；校验不可关闭。",
"The changefeed's protocol: canal-json (with enable-tidb-extension=true, for the commit TS) or simple. canal-json when left out.": "changefeed 的协议：canal-json（需 enable-tidb-extension=true 以带上提交 TS）或 simple。不设置时为 canal-json。",
"The topic's partitions; the brokers' num.partitions when left out or 0.": "主题的分区数；不设置或为 0 时为 broker 的 num.partitions。",
"What a message with a null value is: delete, a delete record of the message's key, as a compacted topic means it; skip, nothing, as after a Debezium delete event. delete when left out.": "值为 null 的消息是什么：delete，以消息的键生成一条删除记录，正如压缩主题的含义；skip，什么也不生成，例如 Debezium 删除事件之后的墓碑。不设置时为 delete。",
"The most bytes, keys and values before compression, of one record batch to a partition; a sink batch with more for a partition sends several, in order. Keep it below the topic's max.message.bytes. 1048576 when left out or 0.": "发往一个分区的单个记录批次的最大字节数（压缩前的键和值）；sink 批次中某分区超出时按顺序分多批发送。应小于主题的 max.message.bytes。不设置或为 0 时为 1048576。",
"TiDB's MySQL host and port, for the snapshot and the tables' schemas. 127.0.0.1:4000 when left out.": "TiDB 的 MySQL 协议主机和端口，用于快照和读取表结构。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:4000。",
"A PEM file of the certificates TiDB's is checked against, in place of the system's roots; needs tls.": "用于校验 TiDB 证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书；需要 tls。",
"How long connecting, each answer, and the retries of a leader that moved may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、每次应答以及 leader 迁移后的重试可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The zone DATETIME values are written in, the changefeed's time-zone; TIMESTAMP values carry their own. UTC when left out.": "DATETIME 值所用的时区，即 changefeed 的 time-zone；TIMESTAMP 值自带时区。不设置时为 UTC。",
"The copies of each partition; the brokers' default.replication.factor when left out or 0.": "每个分区的副本数；不设置或为 0 时为 broker 的 default.replication.factor。",
"Create a topic that does not exist when a record first goes to it, with these settings; a record for a missing topic fails when left out.": "当记录首次发往一个不存在的主题时，按这些设置创建它；不设置时，发往不存在主题的记录失败。",
"The name the brokers' certificates must have; each broker's host when left out.": "broker 证书必须具有的名称；不设置时为各 broker 的主机名。",
"The changefeed's time-zone, in which it writes DATETIME values (and canal-json TIMESTAMP ones). UTC when left out.": "changefeed 的 time-zone，它以此写出 DATETIME 值（以及 canal-json 的 TIMESTAMP 值）。不设置时为 UTC。",
"The SASL mechanism to authenticate with, with username and password_env: PLAIN (over TLS, or the password goes in clear), SCRAM-SHA-256 or SCRAM-SHA-512. None when left out.": "用于认证的 SASL 机制，配合 username 和 password_env：PLAIN（应走 TLS，否则密码以明文传输）、SCRAM-SHA-256 或 SCRAM-SHA-512。不设置时不认证。",
"How record batches are compressed. zstd needs Kafka 2.1 or later. lz4 when left out.": "记录批次的压缩方式。zstd 需要 Kafka 2.1 及以上。不设置时为 lz4。",
"The topic a record goes to: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace (a route transform can map namespaces to topics first). A record whose topic is not a name Kafka takes fails. {namespace} when left out.": "记录发往的主题：可含 {namespace} 的文本，{namespace} 为记录的命名空间（可先用 route 转换把命名空间映射为主题）。主题名不被 Kafka 接受的记录会失败。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The codec's level: gzip 1 to 9, zstd 1 to 22; the codec's default when left out or 0.": "压缩级别：gzip 为 1 到 9，zstd 为 1 到 22；不设置或为 0 时为该算法的默认级别。",
"Connect over TLS, required and verified against the system's roots or ca_file's.": "通过 TLS 连接，强制使用，并用系统根证书或 ca_file 校验。",
"The user to log in as; it needs SELECT on the tables. root when left out.": "登录所用的用户；需要对这些表有 SELECT 权限。不设置时为 root。",
"How long connecting and each statement of the snapshot may take. 60s when left out or 0.": "连接以及快照的每条语句可用的时长。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The environment variable holding the SASL password, read when the pipeline loads.": "保存 SASL 密码的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取。",
"What makes records of a message's value: raw when left out, a message record holding it as after's value.": "把消息值变成记录的编解码器：不设置时为 raw，即一条 message 记录，其 after 的 value 字段保存该值。",
"Where the changefeed writes: the kafka source's params (brokers, topics, TLS, SASL, start), without codec, which protocol picks.": "changefeed 写入的位置：kafka 源的参数（brokers、topics、TLS、SASL、start），不含 codec，codec 由 protocol 决定。",
"Read transactional producers' messages before they commit, and those of aborted transactions; otherwise only committed ones, up to the last stable offset.": "读取事务型生产者尚未提交的消息以及已中止事务的消息；否则只读已提交的消息，直到最后稳定偏移量。",
"The rows one SELECT of the snapshot reads. 1000 when left out or 0.": "快照每次 SELECT 读取的行数。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The most bytes a fetch reads of a partition, though a partition's first batch comes whole. 1048576 when left out or 0.": "一次拉取从一个分区读取的最大字节数，但分区的第一个批次总是完整返回。不设置或为 0 时为 1048576。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, for brokers that ask for one; needs tls and key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件，提供给要求客户端证书的 broker；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"The client ID the brokers see, in their logs and quotas. fit-sync when left out.": "broker 在其日志和配额中看到的客户端 ID。不设置时为 fit-sync。",
"What a delete with a key is: tombstone, a message of the key with a null value, which a compacted topic takes as the key gone and the source kafka reads back as a delete; encode, a message of what the codec makes of it. tombstone when left out.": "带键的删除写成什么：tombstone，该键的值为 null 的消息，压缩主题视为该键已删除，kafka 源读回时为一条删除；encode，由编解码器编码的消息。不设置时为 tombstone。",
"Where a partition the checkpoint does not hold starts, when the pipeline has no checkpoint: earliest, the oldest message kept; latest, after the newest, reading only what comes after. A partition found later, or missing from a checkpoint, starts at its earliest. earliest when left out.": "流水线没有检查点时，检查点中没有的分区从哪里开始：earliest，保留的最旧消息；latest，最新消息之后，只读此后到来的消息。之后发现的分区或检查点中缺少的分区从其最早处开始。不设置时为 earliest。",
"The bootstrap brokers, host:port each; the others are found from them.": "引导 broker，每个为 host:port；其余 broker 由它们发现。",
"The zone DATETIME and TIMESTAMP values are written in: TiCDC's changefeed's time-zone, the server's for Canal. UTC when left out.": "DATETIME 和 TIMESTAMP 值所用的时区：TiCDC 为 changefeed 的 time-zone，Canal 为服务器的时区。不设置时为 UTC。",
"The name TiDB's certificate must have; address's host when left out.": "TiDB 证书必须具有的名称；不设置时为 address 的主机名。",
"What makes a message's value of a record: raw when left out, after's value field as it is, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json for the row as plain JSON (form plain) or the whole record (form record); canal_json or debezium for those formats.": "把记录变成消息值的编解码器：不设置时为 raw，原样写出 after 的 value 字段，没有该字段时写出记录的规范 JSON；json 把行写成普通 JSON（form plain）或写出整条记录（form record）；canal_json 或 debezium 写成相应格式。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it; needs tls and key_file.": "客户端证书及其后证书链的 PEM 文件；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"Run a BitTorrent client, on fit's engine: one port for TCP and UDP (uTP, the DHT and UDP trackers), downloading and seeding torrents kept in data_dir across restarts. None when left out.": "运行一个 BitTorrent 客户端，在 fit 的引擎上：TCP 和 UDP（uTP、DHT 和 UDP tracker）共用一个端口，下载和做种的种子保存在 data_dir 中，重启后依然保留。不设置时没有。",
"The host and port peers reach the client at, the same port for TCP and UDP (uTP, the DHT and UDP trackers share it), as in \":6881\". Port 0 picks one free for both. A change makes a new client: the torrents are saved, the client closed, and the torrents added to the new one, resuming without a check.": "对端连接客户端的主机和端口，TCP 和 UDP 使用同一端口（uTP、DHT 和 UDP tracker 共用），如 \":6881\"。端口 0 选择一个两者都空闲的端口。更改会新建客户端：先保存种子、关闭旧客户端，再把种子加入新客户端，无需校验即可续传。",
"The directory the client's state is kept in: torrents.json, the list of torrents with their sources, directories, file priorities and whether they are paused; torrents/, their .torrent files; and resume/, their resume data, so that a restart resumes without hashing what is on disk again. Each file is written to a temporary file, synced and renamed into place. Made when missing. A state file that does not read, or is larger than its bound, keeps the role from starting, rather than being overwritten. A change makes a new client, which starts from the state in the new directory, as a restart would; the old directory is left as it was saved.": "保存客户端状态的目录：torrents.json，即种子列表及其来源、目录、文件优先级和是否暂停；torrents/，各种子的 .torrent 文件；resume/，各种子的续传数据，使重启后无需重新哈希磁盘上已有的数据即可续传。每个文件都先写入临时文件、同步后再改名就位。不存在时自动创建。无法读取或超过上限的状态文件会使角色不启动，而不会被覆盖。更改会新建客户端，它像重启一样从新目录的状态开始；旧目录保持保存时的样子。",
"The directory torrents added from now on download into, each torrent's files below it, their names made safe for the system; no path of a torrent leads out of it. A torrent keeps the directory it was added with when this changes. <data_dir>/downloads when left out.": "此后添加的种子下载到的目录，每个种子的文件都在其下，文件名处理为系统可用的名称；种子中的路径都不会通向目录之外。更改时，已有的种子保留添加时的目录。不设置时为 <data_dir>/downloads。",
"How peer connections use Message Stream Encryption: prefer dials with it and again in plaintext when a peer refuses, accepting both; allow dials in plaintext first, accepting both; require dials and accepts only encrypted connections. prefer when left out. A change makes a new client.": "对端连接如何使用消息流加密（MSE）：prefer 先加密拨号，对端拒绝时再以明文重拨，两种都接受；allow 先以明文拨号，两种都接受；require 只拨出和接受加密连接。不设置时为 prefer。更改会新建客户端。",
"Find peers through the mainline DHT (BEP 5), bootstrapping from the public routers. On when left out. A change makes a new client.": "通过主线 DHT（BEP 5）查找对端，从公共路由节点引导。不设置时开启。更改会新建客户端。",
"Exchange peers with connected peers (BEP 11). On when left out. A change makes a new client.": "与已连接的对端交换对端（BEP 11）。不设置时开启。更改会新建客户端。",
"Speak uTP (BEP 29) beside TCP: peers are dialed over uTP first, then TCP. On when left out. A change makes a new client.": "在 TCP 之外使用 uTP（BEP 29）：先以 uTP 拨号对端，再用 TCP。不设置时开启。更改会新建客户端。",
"Find peers on the local network by local service discovery (BEP 14, IPv4 multicast). Off by default. A change makes a new client.": "通过本地服务发现（BEP 14，IPv4 组播）在本地网络中查找对端。默认关闭。更改会新建客户端。",
"How many goroutines read and write the torrents' files and hash their pieces, which never happens on a fib worker. The number of CPUs, at most 8, when left out or 0. A change makes a new client.": "读写种子文件并对分片做哈希的 goroutine 数，这些工作从不在 fib 的 worker 上进行。不设置或为 0 时为 CPU 数，最多 8。更改会新建客户端。",
"The most bytes of received blocks waiting to be written: past it the client stops reading from the peers that sent them until half has been written, so that a slow disk slows the peers rather than growing memory. 64 MiB when left out or 0. A change makes a new client.": "等待写入的已接收块的最大字节数：超过后，客户端停止读取发送这些块的对端，直到写完一半，使慢磁盘拖慢对端而不是增长内存。不设置或为 0 时为 64 MiB。更改会新建客户端。",
"How often, at most, the state is saved when something changed: a piece verified, a torrent added, removed, paused or its metadata received. It is saved when the role stops too, and changes to the list of torrents are saved at once. 5s when left out.": "有变化时（分片校验通过，种子被添加、移除、暂停或收到元数据）最多多久保存一次状态。角色停止时也会保存，种子列表的变化立即保存。不设置时为 5s。",
"The peer addresses the client deals with, deciding before the global access: a peer it refuses is closed as soon as it connects over TCP, has its uTP connection ignored, is never dialed, and as a DHT node gets no answers. Trackers and web seeds are URLs, not peers, and are not asked about. A change applies at once, closing the connected peers it now refuses. Every address when left out, unless the global access says otherwise.": "客户端与哪些对端地址打交道，先于全局 access 决定：被拒绝的对端一经 TCP 连接即被关闭，其 uTP 连接被忽略，从不被拨号，作为 DHT 节点得不到应答。tracker 和 web seed 是 URL 而不是对端，不受其约束。更改立即生效，关闭现在被拒绝的已连接对端。不设置时为所有地址，除非全局 access 另有规定。",
"The client's web pages; none when left out.": "客户端的网页；不设置时没有。",
"Run a BitTorrent tracker, on fit's engine: HTTP announces and scrapes through routes whose handler is bt_tracker, UDP ones on its own listen, public or private (passkeys of a media_auth policy), with an allow-list of info hashes. Its swarms are kept in memory, bounded. None when left out.": "在 fit 的引擎上运行一个 BitTorrent tracker：HTTP 的 announce 和 scrape 经由处理器为 bt_tracker 的路由，UDP 的在它自己的 listen 上；公开或私有（media_auth 策略的 passkey），可带 info hash 的允许列表。其 swarm 保存在内存中，有上限。不设置时没有。",
"The host and port the tracker answers UDP announces and scrapes on (BEP 15), as \":6969\". Announces over HTTP and HTTPS come through a route whose handler is bt_tracker, on fit's listeners. No UDP when left out. A change moves the UDP port, keeping the swarms.": "tracker 应答 UDP announce 和 scrape（BEP 15）的主机和端口，如 \":6969\"。HTTP 和 HTTPS 的 announce 经由 fit 监听器上处理器为 bt_tracker 的路由到来。不设置时没有 UDP。更改会移动 UDP 端口，swarm 保留。",
"How often clients are told to announce. 30m when left out. A change applies at once, keeping the swarms.": "告诉客户端多久 announce 一次。不设置时为 30m。更改立即生效，swarm 保留。",
"The \"min interval\" of HTTP answers: how soon a client may announce again of its own accord. None when left out. At most interval. A change applies at once, keeping the swarms.": "HTTP 应答中的 \"min interval\"：客户端主动再次 announce 的最短间隔。不设置时没有。最多为 interval。更改立即生效，swarm 保留。",
"How long a peer is kept after its last announce, longer than interval so that a peer announcing a little late is not forgotten; a torrent left without peers is forgotten, its completed count with it. 1h when left out. A change applies in place, keeping the swarms; a shorter one expires the peers kept past it.": "peer 在最后一次 announce 之后保留多久，须长于 interval，以免稍晚 announce 的 peer 被遗忘；没有 peer 的种子会被遗忘，连同其完成次数。不设置时为 1h。更改原地生效，保留 swarm；改短时，已保留超过新时长的 peer 随之过期。",
"The most torrents tracked at once; an announce of one more is refused with \"tracker is full\". 100000 when left out or 0. A change applies in place, keeping the swarms; lowered, it drops none and refuses new torrents until the store is back under it.": "同时跟踪的最多种子数；再多一个的 announce 以 \"tracker is full\" 拒绝。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。更改原地生效，保留 swarm；调低时不丢弃任何种子，在回到上限以下之前拒绝新种子。",
"The most peers kept of one torrent; a peer past it still gets peers but is not handed out. 10000 when left out or 0. A change applies in place, keeping the swarms; lowered, it drops no peer.": "一个种子保留的最多 peer 数；超出的 peer 仍能获得 peer，但不会被分发给别人。不设置或为 0 时为 10000。更改原地生效，保留 swarm；调低时不丢弃任何 peer。",
"A store of the swarms that the trackers of several fit instances share, so that they answer as one tracker: each keeps its own peers in memory, as without it, and shares them through the store, answering an announce with peers of every instance and a scrape with the counts of all. Each instance's swarms alone, in its memory, when left out. A change of it, or adding or removing it, makes a new store: this instance's swarms start anew in memory (clients announce again within their interval), the shared ones staying in the store. The bounds max_torrents, max_peers_per_torrent and max_peers apply to the shared store too, to all instances' peers together.": "多个 fit 实例的 tracker 共享的 swarm 存储，使它们作为一个 tracker 应答：每个实例仍像没有它时一样在内存中保留自己的 peer，并通过该存储共享，announce 得到所有实例的 peer，scrape 得到所有实例的计数。不设置时每个实例只有自己内存中的 swarm。修改、添加或移除它会建立新的存储：本实例的 swarm 在内存中重新开始（客户端会在其间隔内再次 announce），共享的 swarm 仍留在存储中。max_torrents、max_peers_per_torrent 和 max_peers 这些上限也适用于共享存储，即所有实例的 peer 合计。",
"Share the swarms through Redis 6.2 or later (or Valkey), a standalone server or a primary (not Redis Cluster), with Lua scripts, each announce one script run, on Redis's clock. Its maxmemory-policy must not evict keys (noeviction): the store bounds them instead.": "通过 Redis 6.2 或更高版本（或 Valkey）共享 swarm，单机服务器或主节点（不支持 Redis Cluster），使用 Lua 脚本，每次 announce 执行一次脚本，以 Redis 的时钟为准。其 maxmemory-policy 不得淘汰键（noeviction）：键的数量由存储自己限定。",
"What the store's keys start with, as fit/bittorrent/tracker/t/<info hash>/s; the trackers that answer as one share it. fit/bittorrent/tracker/ when left out.": "存储的键的前缀，如 fit/bittorrent/tracker/t/<info hash>/s；作为一个 tracker 应答的各 tracker 共用它。不设置时为 fit/bittorrent/tracker/。",
"How long each round trip to the store may take, connecting included; past it the store counts as unreachable, and is tried again after a back-off. 2s when left out.": "与存储的每次往返（含建立连接）最长可用的时间；超过则视存储为不可达，退避一段时间后重试。不设置时为 2s。",
"How often the peers of the torrents this instance serves are read from the store again, and so how late an instance learns of another's peers. Read peers are used for three times this, then only the instance's own. 5s when left out; at least 100ms, and shorter than interval.": "多久从存储重新读取一次本实例所服务种子的 peer，也就是一个实例最迟多久得知另一个实例的 peer。读到的 peer 在三倍于此的时间内使用，之后只用本实例自己的。不设置时为 5s；至少 100ms，且短于 interval。",
"The most announces waiting to be written to the store, one per peer and torrent, a later announce of a peer taking its earlier one's place; past it announces are still answered but not shared, and counted as dropped. 65536 when left out or 0.": "等待写入存储的 announce 最多条数，每个 peer 与种子一条，同一 peer 后来的 announce 取代之前的；超出时 announce 仍会应答，但不共享，并计为丢弃。不设置或为 0 时为 65536。",
"The most torrents whose shared peers this instance keeps a sample of; a torrent past it is answered with this instance's own peers. A torrent leaves when nobody has announced or scraped it here for peer_ttl; scrapes alone may fill three quarters. 4096 when left out or 0.": "本实例保留其共享 peer 样本的种子最多个数；超出的种子只用本实例自己的 peer 应答。一个种子在本实例 peer_ttl 内无人 announce 或 scrape 时移出；仅凭 scrape 最多可占四分之三。不设置或为 0 时为 4096。",
"How many seeders and how many leechers of a torrent's shared peers, picked at random, each sample keeps, about 60 bytes each; announces get peers from it. 100 when left out or 0.": "每个样本随机选取并保留的种子共享 peer 中做种者和下载者各多少个，每个约 60 字节；announce 从中获得 peer。不设置或为 0 时为 100。",
"The most peers kept of all torrents together, each about 150 bytes; a peer past it still gets peers but is not handed out. 500000 when left out or 0. A change applies in place, keeping the swarms; lowered, it drops no peer.": "所有种子合计保留的最多 peer 数，每个约 150 字节；超出的 peer 仍能获得 peer，但不会被分发给别人。不设置或为 0 时为 500000。更改原地生效，保留 swarm；调低时不丢弃任何 peer。",
"The most peers an announce gets, whatever its numwant asks; 50 when it asks for none. A UDP answer is also kept within 1400 bytes. 200 when left out or 0.": "一次 announce 最多获得的 peer 数，无论其 numwant 要多少；未指定时为 50。UDP 应答还限制在 1400 字节以内。不设置或为 0 时为 200。",
"The most torrents one HTTP scrape may name; a UDP scrape is bounded to 74 by its packet. A scrape naming none, a full scrape, gets nothing. 64 when left out or 0.": "一次 HTTP scrape 最多可指定的种子数；UDP scrape 受数据包限制为 74 个。未指定任何种子的 scrape（完整 scrape）得不到任何内容。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The media_auth policy whose passkeys the tracker takes, which makes it private: an announce or scrape must carry a passkey, in its path as /<passkey>/announce or as ?passkey=, that is one of the policy's tokens (static, or signed by fit) or a user's passkey, derived from the policy's secret and the user's name, and whose grant plays bittorrent/<info hash in hex> (play [\"bittorrent/*\"] for every torrent). Others are refused with a failure reason. Public when left out: anyone may announce.": "tracker 接受其 passkey 的 media_auth 策略，设置后 tracker 为私有：announce 或 scrape 必须带有 passkey，放在路径中如 /<passkey>/announce，或作为 ?passkey=；它是该策略的令牌之一（静态的，或 fit 签发的），或用户的 passkey（由策略的密钥和用户名派生），且其授权须能播放 bittorrent/<十六进制 info hash>（play [\"bittorrent/*\"] 表示所有种子）。其他请求以失败原因拒绝。不设置时为公开：任何人都可 announce。",
"The info hashes the tracker tracks, in hex: 40 digits for a v1 hash, or 64 for a v2 one, tracked by its first 20 bytes as v2 clients announce it. With any here or in allow_files, announces of other torrents are refused with \"unregistered torrent\", and scrapes of them get nothing. Every torrent when both are left out.": "tracker 跟踪的 info hash，十六进制：v1 哈希为 40 位，v2 哈希为 64 位（按 v2 客户端 announce 的方式，以其前 20 字节跟踪）。这里或 allow_files 中有任何一项时，其他种子的 announce 以 \"unregistered torrent\" 拒绝，对它们的 scrape 得不到任何内容。两者都不设置时跟踪所有种子。",
"Files of more allowed info hashes: one on each line, as allow has them, with blank lines and what follows # left out. Read when the config is applied, and read again when one changes; each at most 64 MiB, and at most 1048576 info hashes in all.": "更多允许的 info hash 的文件：每行一个，写法同 allow，忽略空行和 # 之后的内容。在应用配置时读取，文件变化时重新读取；每个最多 64 MiB，总计最多 1048576 个 info hash。",
"The client addresses the tracker serves, deciding before the global access: a UDP datagram from an address it refuses is dropped before a connection is made, and an HTTP announce or scrape through bt_tracker from one is answered with a failure reason. A change applies at once. Every address when left out, unless the global access says otherwise.": "tracker 服务的客户端地址，先于全局 access 决定：来自被拒地址的 UDP 数据报在建立连接之前即被丢弃，经由 bt_tracker 来自被拒地址的 HTTP announce 或 scrape 以失败原因应答。更改立即生效。不设置时服务所有地址，除非全局 access 另有规定。",
"The tracker's web pages: its statistics, read-only. None when left out.": "tracker 的网页：其统计信息，只读。不设置时没有。",
"The most bytes per second uploaded, payload of all torrents together. Unlimited when left out or 0.": "每秒最多上传的字节数，所有种子的有效载荷合计。不设置或为 0 时不限。",
"The most bytes per second downloaded, payload of all torrents together. Unlimited when left out or 0.": "每秒最多下载的字节数，所有种子的有效载荷合计。不设置或为 0 时不限。",
"The most peer connections of the client at once. 200 when left out or 0.": "客户端同时的最多对端连接数。不设置或为 0 时为 200。",
"The most peer connections of one torrent at once. 50 when left out or 0.": "单个种子同时的最多对端连接数。不设置或为 0 时为 50。",
"The most dials to peers in flight at once. 32 when left out or 0.": "同时进行中的最多对端拨号数。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"How many peers a torrent uploads to at once, beside one optimistic unchoke. 4 when left out or 0.": "一个种子同时向多少个对端上传，另有一个乐观解除阻塞。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"Pause a torrent once it has uploaded this many times its size since it was added or fit started. Seeds for ever when left out or 0.": "种子自添加或 fit 启动以来上传量达到其大小的这么多倍后暂停。不设置或为 0 时一直做种。",
"Pause a torrent once it has seeded this long since it was added or fit started. Seeds for ever when left out.": "种子自添加或 fit 启动以来做种这么久后暂停。不设置时一直做种。",
"The most torrents the client holds, running or paused; one more is refused. Lowering it removes none. 1000 when left out or 0.": "客户端持有的最多种子数，无论运行还是暂停；再多一个被拒绝。调低它不会移除任何种子。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The key's columns of tables, by db.table, in place of the primary key: for a table without one, or to key by a unique key. A table with neither key nor primary key has records without a key.": "按 db.table 给出表的键列，代替主键：用于没有主键的表，或以某个唯一键为键。既无 keys 也无主键的表，其记录没有键。",
"Tables left out of those tables names, as db.table globs.": "从 tables 所列中排除的表，形如 db.table 的通配模式。",
"The user to log in as, which needs REPLICATION SLAVE, REPLICATION CLIENT and SELECT on the tables read (information_schema tells the source the columns' names and keys).": "登录所用的用户，需要 REPLICATION SLAVE、REPLICATION CLIENT 权限以及所读表的 SELECT 权限（源从 information_schema 得知列名和键）。",
"The tables read, as db.table globs (* and ? within a name, [ranges]): shop.orders, shop.*. Every table of every database but mysql, sys, information_schema and performance_schema when left out.": "读取的表，形如 db.table 的通配模式（名称内的 * 和 ?，以及 [范围]）：shop.orders、shop.*。不设置时为除 mysql、sys、information_schema 和 performance_schema 之外所有数据库的所有表。",
"The server's host and port: MySQL 5.7 or later, or MariaDB 10.11 or later, with the binlog on (log_bin), binlog_format ROW and binlog_row_image FULL. 127.0.0.1:3306 when left out.": "服务器的主机和端口：MySQL 5.7 或更高版本，或 MariaDB 10.11 或更高版本，需开启 binlog（log_bin），binlog_format 为 ROW，binlog_row_image 为 FULL。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:3306。",
"How long the server waits, when it has nothing to send, before it sends a heartbeat, which tells the source that it is caught up and the connection alive; below timeout. 10s when left out or 0.": "服务器无内容可发送时，等待多久后发送一次心跳，心跳告诉源它已追上、连接仍然存活；须小于 timeout。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"How long connecting, and each wait for the server, may take; above heartbeat. 60s when left out or 0.": "连接以及每次等待服务器可用的最长时间；须大于 heartbeat。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The replica's server ID, unique among the server's replicas and the servers of its topology: a second replica connecting with the same ID cuts the first one off. Not 0.": "副本的 server ID，在该服务器的所有副本及其拓扑中的服务器之间唯一：以相同 ID 连接的第二个副本会把第一个断开。不能为 0。",
"In a job (mode once), the rows of a chunk of the snapshot: each table is split into ranges of its key this many rows each, read job.max_parallel at a time. 100000 when left out or 0.": "作业（mode once）中快照一块的行数：每张表按其键分成每块这么多行的范围，每次读取 job.max_parallel 块。不设置或为 0 时为 100000。",
"The rows a snapshot's query reads, by key, each in a transaction of its own with a consistent snapshot. 1000 when left out or 0.": "快照每次查询按键读取的行数，每次查询各在一个带一致性快照的事务中。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"Whether the tables' rows are read before the binlog: initial, when the pipeline has no checkpoint; always, at every start of the source, unless its checkpoint is inside a snapshot, which it goes on with; never, the binlog alone, from the checkpoint or from now. The binlog's position is read first and the stream starts there, so what changes during the snapshot comes again. initial when left out.": "是否在 binlog 之前先读取表中的行：initial，在流水线没有检查点时读取；always，在源每次启动时读取，除非检查点处于某个快照之中，此时继续该快照；never，只读 binlog，从检查点或当前开始。先读取 binlog 位置，流从那里开始，所以快照期间的变更会再次到来。不设置时为 initial。",
"The part of the path before a torrent's info hash: with /bt/, /bt/<info hash>/<file path> is a file of the torrent by its path as the torrent lists it, its name first, /bt/<info hash>/<n> its file of index n, and /bt/<info hash>/ its largest file. The info hash is the bittorrent.client role's torrent ID, 40 hex digits. /bt/ when left out.": "路径中位于种子 info hash 之前的部分：前缀为 /bt/ 时，/bt/<info hash>/<file path> 是种子中按其列出的路径（以种子名称开头）指定的文件，/bt/<info hash>/<n> 是索引为 n 的文件，/bt/<info hash>/ 是其中最大的文件。info hash 即 bittorrent.client 角色的种子 ID，40 位十六进制数字。不设置时为 /bt/。",
"The media_auth policy every request must satisfy, play on the stream bt/<info hash>: a bearer token, Basic, the token query parameter or the fit_media_token cookie, or, with the policy's url_signing, a URL signed for <prefix><info hash>/. Adding a torrent by magnet link takes publish on the same stream as well. Everyone may play when left out; magnet needs it.": "每个请求都必须满足的 media_auth 策略，对流 bt/<info hash> 执行 play：bearer token、Basic、token 查询参数或 fit_media_token cookie，或者在策略设置了 url_signing 时，为 <prefix><info hash>/ 签名的 URL。通过磁力链接添加种子还需要对同一路流有 publish 权限。不设置时所有人都可以播放；magnet 需要设置它。",
"The most responses the handler streams at once, each with a goroutine of its own while it reads; past it a request is answered 503. At most 4096. 32 when left out or 0.": "处理器同时流式发送的最多响应数，每个响应在读取时占用一个自己的 goroutine；超过时请求得到 503。最多 4096。不设置或为 0 时为 32。",
"How long a read waits for the piece it needs to arrive: past it a response not begun is answered 504, and one begun is cut short. 60s when left out.": "一次读取等待所需分块到达的时长：超过时，尚未开始的响应得到 504，已开始的响应被截断。不设置时为 60s。",
"How far past what a response reads the pieces are fetched before all others, nearest first. 64 KiB to 256 MiB. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "在响应读取位置之后多远范围内的分块优先于其他所有分块下载，近者优先。64 KiB 到 256 MiB。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"Lets a request add the torrent its path names when the role does not have it, from the magnet link in its magnet query parameter, which must be of that torrent: /bt/<info hash>/?magnet=<link>, escaped. Such torrents are temporary: they download only the files streamed, are bounded by max_temporary and max_temporary_bytes, and are removed with their data temporary_ttl after their last stream ended, and when fit starts. Needs auth, whose publish on bt/<info hash> the request must have. Off when left out.": "角色没有路径所指的种子时，允许请求用其 magnet 查询参数中的磁力链接添加该种子，链接必须属于该种子：/bt/<info hash>/?magnet=<link>，需转义。这样的种子是临时的：只下载被流式播放的文件，受 max_temporary 和 max_temporary_bytes 限制，在最后一个流结束 temporary_ttl 之后以及 fit 启动时连同数据一起被移除。需要 auth，请求必须对 bt/<info hash> 有 publish 权限。不设置时关闭。",
"How long a request waits for the info of a torrent added from a magnet link to arrive from peers; past it the answer is 504. 60s when left out.": "请求等待由磁力链接添加的种子从对等方取得 info 的时长；超过时回答 504。不设置时为 60s。",
"The most temporary torrents, added by magnet link on the fly, the role holds at once; past it adding one is answered 503. At most 1000. 4 when left out or 0.": "角色同时持有的、通过磁力链接即时添加的临时种子的最多数量；超过时添加请求得到 503。最多 1000。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most bytes the temporary torrents may want of the disk together: a torrent whose files streamed would take it past this is answered 507, and removed when it was just added. 16 GiB when left out or 0.": "临时种子合计最多可以占用的磁盘字节数：若某个种子被流式播放的文件会使总量超过它，请求得到 507，刚添加的该种子会被移除。不设置或为 0 时为 16 GiB。",
"How long a temporary torrent stays after its last stream ended, for the next range a player asks: then it is removed with its data. At most 7 days. 10m when left out.": "临时种子在最后一个流结束后保留的时长，供播放器请求下一个范围：之后连同数据一起被移除。最多 7 天。不设置时为 10m。",
"Sent as Cache-Control with every file. None when left out.": "随每个文件作为 Cache-Control 发送。不设置时不发送。",
"How often dir is walked again for files added, changed or removed, as static files follow the disk. A file is told by its size, modification and status change times and inode; one new or changed is built into a torrent once it has not changed for a check_interval, so that a file still being copied is not hashed; a file removed or changed stops its torrent at once. 10s when left out or 0.": "多久重新遍历一次 dir，找出新增、改变或删除的文件，与静态文件跟随磁盘的方式相同。文件以大小、修改时间、状态改变时间和 inode 识别；新增或改变的文件在一个 check_interval 内不再变化后才生成种子，以免对仍在复制的文件做哈希；删除或改变的文件立即停止其种子。不设置或为 0 时为 10s。",
"The directory published. Its files are seeded where they are, never written to, moved or deleted: a torrent whose file changes is replaced by a new one. Files and directories whose names start with '.' and symbolic links are left out.": "发布的目录。其文件在原处做种，从不被写入、移动或删除：文件改变的种子由新种子取代。名称以 '.' 开头的文件和目录以及符号链接不发布。",
"The http or https URL at which dir is served, as by a static route whose root is dir, put in every torrent as its web seed (BEP 19): a file's own URL in mode per_file, and in mode whole_dir the URL's parent, so the URL's last element must be dir's last element then. None when left out.": "提供 dir 的 http 或 https URL（例如 root 为 dir 的静态路由），作为 web seed（BEP 19）写入每个种子：per_file 模式下是文件自己的 URL，whole_dir 模式下是该 URL 的上一级，因此这时 URL 的最后一段必须与 dir 的最后一段相同。不设置时没有。",
"The most bytes published, the files' sizes together: past it, in mode per_file, the files after are left out, and in mode whole_dir the directory is not published; either is reported. 1 TiB when left out or 0.": "发布的最多字节数，即文件大小之和：超过时，per_file 模式下之后的文件不发布，whole_dir 模式下整个目录不发布；两者都会报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1 TiB。",
"The most files published: in mode per_file the first by path are, the rest are left out and reported; in mode whole_dir a directory with more is not published, and is reported. 1000 when left out or 0.": "发布的最多文件数：per_file 模式下按路径发布前面的文件，其余不发布并报告；whole_dir 模式下文件更多的目录不发布，并报告。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"per_file makes a single-file torrent of each file below dir; whole_dir makes one torrent of the whole directory, named as its last element, which any change of a file below it replaces. per_file when left out.": "per_file 为 dir 下的每个文件生成一个单文件种子；whole_dir 为整个目录生成一个种子，以目录的最后一段命名，其下任何文件改变都会生成新种子取代它。不设置时为 per_file。",
"Mark the torrents private (BEP 27): clients find peers only through the trackers of announce, not the DHT or peer exchange. A change makes new torrents, of other info hashes.": "把种子标为私有（BEP 27）：客户端只经 announce 中的 tracker 寻找 peer，不用 DHT 或 peer 交换。更改会生成 info hash 不同的新种子。",
"The entry's name, which the bt_publish handler and the state in data_dir know it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "条目的名称，bt_publish 处理器和 data_dir 中的状态以它识别该条目。字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The torrents' piece length, a power of two from 16 KiB to 64 MiB. Picked for each torrent's size when left out or 0: the smallest of at least 16 KiB that makes fewer than 2048 pieces, up to 16 MiB. A change makes new torrents.": "种子的分片长度，16 KiB 到 64 MiB 之间的 2 的幂。不设置或为 0 时按每个种子的大小选取：至少 16 KiB、使分片少于 2048 个的最小值，最大 16 MiB。更改会生成新种子。",
"Tracker URLs, http, https or udp, put in every torrent, each a tier of its own, tried in order: as fit's own bt_tracker route. None when left out: peers find the torrents by the DHT, unless private.": "写入每个种子的 tracker URL，http、https 或 udp，每个自成一层，按顺序尝试：例如 fit 自己的 bt_tracker 路由。不设置时没有：peer 经 DHT 找到这些种子，私有种子除外。",
"The publish entries of the bittorrent.client served, by name; a name the client has not is listed in the index with its error. Every entry when left out.": "提供的 bittorrent.client 发布条目，按名称；客户端没有的名称在索引中连同错误一起列出。不设置时为全部条目。",
"The files published, by pattern: a pattern without '/' matches a file's name, as *.iso, and one with '/' its path under dir, as releases/**/*.tar.gz, where * matches within a name and ** any run of directories. Every file when left out.": "发布的文件，按模式：不含 '/' 的模式匹配文件名，如 *.iso；含 '/' 的模式匹配其在 dir 下的路径，如 releases/**/*.tar.gz，其中 * 在名称内匹配，** 匹配任意层目录。不设置时为全部文件。",
"Files and directories left out, by pattern, as files writes them, as *.part or **/tmp/**; a directory left out is not walked. None when left out.": "不发布的文件和目录，按模式，写法同 files，如 *.part 或 **/tmp/**；排除的目录不会被遍历。不设置时没有。",
"Directories the client publishes: each built into hybrid torrents, a torrent of each file or one of the whole directory, on goroutines of its own, and seeded where the files are, the .torrent files and magnet links served by the bt_publish handler. Each follows the disk: a file added gets a torrent, and one changed or removed stops its torrent, a changed one getting a new torrent. The torrents are kept in data_dir/publish/<name>/, so that a restart neither builds nor checks a file that did not change. None when left out.": "客户端发布的目录：每个目录在自己的 goroutine 上生成 hybrid 种子（每个文件一个，或整个目录一个），并在文件所在处做种，.torrent 文件和磁力链由 bt_publish 处理器提供。每个条目跟随磁盘：新增的文件得到种子，改变或删除的文件停止其种子，改变的文件得到新种子。种子保存在 data_dir/publish/<name>/ 中，因此重启时既不重新生成也不重新校验未改变的文件。不设置时没有。",
"How many torrents are built at once, each reading and hashing its files on a goroutine of the entry's own, never on a fib worker. 1 when left out or 0.": "同时生成的种子数，每个种子在条目自己的 goroutine 上读取并哈希其文件，从不在 fib worker 上。不设置或为 0 时为 1。",
"The client's rates and connection, seeding, queueing, disk and torrent limits. A change applies in place, keeping the peers connected, but those over a lowered connection limit. The defaults when left out.": "客户端的速率，以及连接、做种、排队、磁盘和种子数的限制。更改就地生效，对端保持连接，超出调低后连接上限的除外。不写时使用默认值。",
"The categories a torrent may be added in: each downloads into a directory of its own, gives its torrents its own limits, and may name a media_library that is scanned again when a torrent of it completes. A torrent added with no category downloads into download_dir. A change applies in place: limits to the torrents of the category at once, a new directory to the torrents added from then on. A torrent whose category is removed keeps its directory and loses the category's limits. At most 1000.": "添加种子时可选的分类：每个分类下载到自己的目录，给其种子自己的限制，并可指定一个 media_library，该分类的种子完成时重新扫描它。不带分类添加的种子下载到 download_dir。更改就地生效：限制立即作用于该分类的种子，新目录作用于此后添加的种子。分类被删除的种子保留其目录、失去该分类的限制。最多 1000 个。",
"A directory looked at every watch_interval for .torrent files and .magnet files (a magnet link on the first line that is not blank), each added once it has kept its size and modification time across two looks, so that one being written is not taken half way: those directly in it with no category, those in a subdirectory named after a category in that category. A file added, or whose torrent is already held, is moved into its .done subdirectory; one that cannot be added, being too large, not a torrent or not a link, into .failed, beside a .error file saying why; one that may be added later (max_torrents reached, the state not written) is left to be tried again. None when left out.": "每 watch_interval 查看一次的目录，其中的 .torrent 文件和 .magnet 文件（第一个非空行是磁力链接）在连续两次查看中大小和修改时间都不变后才被添加，正在写入的文件不会被读到一半：直接在其中的文件不带分类，在以分类命名的子目录中的文件归入该分类。添加成功或其种子已存在的文件移入其 .done 子目录；无法添加的（过大、不是种子或不是链接）移入 .failed，旁边写一个说明原因的 .error 文件；之后可能加得上的（已达 max_torrents、状态写不进去）留在原处再试。不写时没有。",
"How often watch_dir is looked at. 10s when left out.": "查看 watch_dir 的间隔。不写时为 10s。",
"The most files of watch_dir and its category subdirectories taken in one look, the rest left for the next. 100 when left out or 0.": "每次查看从 watch_dir 及其分类子目录中最多取走的文件数，其余留到下一次。不写或为 0 时为 100。",
"How long the download of a .torrent file by its URL may take in all, connecting, redirects (at most 5) and the body (at most 32 MiB) included; at most 4 run at once. 30s when left out.": "经 URL 下载 .torrent 文件总共可用的时间，包括连接、重定向（最多 5 次）和响应体（最多 32 MiB）；同时最多进行 4 个。不写时为 30s。",
"Alternative rates, in place of limits' upload_rate and download_rate while one of their schedules holds, or while the API turns them on. None when left out.": "备用速率：在其某个时间表生效期间、或 API 打开它们时，取代 limits 的 upload_rate 和 download_rate。不写时没有。",
"The most torrents downloading at once: past it, torrents queue, paused by the client, in the order of the list (which the API's queue position changes), and the first of them starts when one finishes, is paused or removed. A torrent fetching a magnet link's metadata counts as downloading. No queue when left out or 0.": "同时下载的种子数上限：超出的种子排队，由客户端暂停，按列表顺序（API 的队列位置可改变它）排列，有种子完成、暂停或被移除时，队首的种子开始。获取磁力链接元数据的种子算作下载中。不写或为 0 时不排队。",
"The most torrents seeding at once, queued as max_active_downloads queues downloads. No queue when left out or 0.": "同时做种的种子数上限，与 max_active_downloads 排队下载一样排队。不写或为 0 时不排队。",
"The disk space a download leaves free: a torrent starts downloading only when its directory's disk has what it still has to download and this much more free, and one downloading pauses, with an error saying so, when less than this is left; it starts again by itself once the space is there. Where the free space cannot be told, it is not checked. 1 GiB when left out or 0.": "下载留出的磁盘空间：只有当种子目录所在磁盘上空闲的空间够它还要下载的量再加这么多时，种子才开始下载；正在下载的种子在剩余空间少于此值时暂停，并有错误说明；空间够了会自行重新开始。无法得知空闲空间时不检查。不写或为 0 时为 1 GiB。",
"The category's name, which the API and watch_dir's subdirectories name it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "分类的名称，API 和 watch_dir 的子目录以此指称它。字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The directory the category's torrents download into: a relative path is below download_dir, and may not lead out of it. A torrent keeps the directory it was added with when this changes. <download_dir>/<name> when left out.": "该分类的种子下载到的目录：相对路径位于 download_dir 之下，且不能跑出它。该值更改时，已有种子保留添加时的目录。不写时为 <download_dir>/<name>。",
"A media_library to scan again when a torrent of the category completes, so that what it downloaded into the library's roots appears in its catalog. None when left out.": "该分类的种子完成时重新扫描的 media_library，使下载到该库根目录中的内容出现在其目录（catalog）中。不写时没有。",
"The limits of each torrent of the category, under the client's; a torrent's own limits take the place of those they set. The client's alone when left out.": "该分类每个种子的限制，受客户端限制约束；种子自己的限制取代它所设置的那些。不写时只有客户端的限制。",
"The most bytes per second the torrent uploads, under the client's rate. The client's rate alone when left out, 0 or negative.": "该种子每秒最多上传的字节数，受客户端速率约束。不写、为 0 或负数时只受客户端速率约束。",
"The most bytes per second the torrent downloads, under the client's rate. The client's rate alone when left out, 0 or negative.": "该种子每秒最多下载的字节数，受客户端速率约束。不写、为 0 或负数时只受客户端速率约束。",
"The most peer connections of the torrent, in place of max_conns_per_torrent, above or below it; negative is the client's max_conns alone. max_conns_per_torrent when left out or 0.": "该种子的对端连接数上限，取代 max_conns_per_torrent，可高于或低于它；负数表示只受客户端的 max_conns 约束。不写或为 0 时为 max_conns_per_torrent。",
"How many peers the torrent uploads to at once, beside one optimistic unchoke, in place of the client's; negative unchokes every interested peer. The client's when left out or 0.": "该种子同时上传给多少个对端（另加一个乐观解除阻塞），取代客户端的设置；负数表示对每个感兴趣的对端都解除阻塞。不写或为 0 时采用客户端的设置。",
"Pause the torrent once it has uploaded this many times its size, in place of the client's; negative seeds for ever. The client's when left out or 0.": "该种子上传量达到其大小的这么多倍后暂停，取代客户端的设置；负数表示一直做种。不写或为 0 时采用客户端的设置。",
"Pause the torrent once it has seeded this long, in place of the client's; negative seeds for ever. The client's when left out or 0.": "该种子做种这么久后暂停，取代客户端的设置；负数表示一直做种。不写或为 0 时采用客户端的设置。",
"The most bytes per second uploaded while the alternative rates hold, all torrents together. Unlimited when left out or 0.": "备用速率生效期间每秒最多上传的字节数，所有种子合计。不写或为 0 时不限。",
"The most bytes per second downloaded while the alternative rates hold, all torrents together. Unlimited when left out or 0.": "备用速率生效期间每秒最多下载的字节数，所有种子合计。不写或为 0 时不限。",
"When the alternative rates hold: while any of these does. Only while the API turns them on when left out. At most 100.": "备用速率生效的时间：其中任何一个生效时即生效。不写时只在 API 打开它们时生效。最多 100 个。",
"The zone the schedules' times are in: local (the default), utc, or an IANA zone name such as Asia/Shanghai.": "时间表中的时间所在的时区：local（默认）、utc，或 IANA 时区名，如 Asia/Shanghai。",
"The days the range begins on: mon, tue, wed, thu, fri, sat, sun, weekdays (mon to fri) and weekend (sat and sun). A range that runs past midnight holds into the next day. Every day when left out.": "时间段开始的日子：mon、tue、wed、thu、fri、sat、sun、weekdays（mon 到 fri）和 weekend（sat 和 sun）。跨过午夜的时间段延续到第二天。不写时每天。",
"The time the range begins at, HH:MM, 00:00 to 23:59.": "时间段开始的时刻，HH:MM，00:00 到 23:59。",
"The time the range ends at, HH:MM, 00:01 to 24:00, not included: one earlier than from runs past midnight, as 22:00 to 06:00. It may not equal from.": "时间段结束的时刻，HH:MM，00:01 到 24:00，不含该时刻：早于 from 的跨过午夜，如 22:00 到 06:00。不能等于 from。",
"Add each episode once: an item whose title names an episode (S01E02, 1x02, or a date, as 2026-11-09) the rule has added already, of a show of the same name (the title before the episode), is left out, as another quality or a repack of it. Without an episode in the title, an item is told only by its own ID.": "每集只添加一次：标题指明的一集（S01E02、1x02，或日期，如 2026-11-09）若该规则已添加过同名节目（标题中集数之前的部分）的这一集，则略去，如它的另一种画质或重新打包版本。标题中没有集数时，条目只按其自己的 ID 区分。",
"Add the torrents paused.": "以暂停状态添加种子。",
"Headers sent with the feed's requests whose values are read from environment variables at each poll, by the header's name: {\"Authorization\": \"FEED_AUTH\"}. A variable not set sends no header.": "随该订阅源的请求发送的请求头，其值在每次轮询时从环境变量读取，按请求头名称：{\"Authorization\": \"FEED_AUTH\"}。未设置的变量不发送该头。",
"Headers sent with the feed's requests, as a cookie a site wants. Not Host or the body's framing. A secret is better named by headers_env.": "随该订阅源的请求发送的请求头，如网站要求的 cookie。不能是 Host 或正文分帧的头。机密最好用 headers_env 指定。",
"How long a feed's download may take in all: connecting, redirects (at most 5) and the body. 30s when left out.": "下载一个订阅源总共可用的时间：连接、重定向（最多 5 次）和正文。不写时为 30s。",
"How many items of each feed are remembered as seen, in data_dir/rss.json, so that an item is handled once, across restarts; the oldest are forgotten first. At least each feed's max_items. 1000 when left out or 0.": "每个订阅源记为已见的条目数，保存在 data_dir/rss.json 中，使一个条目跨重启也只处理一次；最旧的先被遗忘。至少为每个订阅源的 max_items。不写或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How often the feed is polled, at least 1m; the server's ETag and Last-Modified are sent back, so that an unchanged feed answers 304 and costs nothing more. 15m when left out.": "轮询该订阅源的间隔，至少 1m；会回送服务器的 ETag 和 Last-Modified，使未变化的订阅源回答 304，不再多花什么。不写时为 15m。",
"Patterns an item's title must match one of, in any case: a glob matching the whole title, where * matches any run of characters and ? one, as *Show Name*1080p*; or, after re:, a regular expression (Go's syntax) found anywhere in it, as re:S0[1-3]E\\d+. Every title when left out. At most 32.": "条目标题必须匹配其中之一的模式，不区分大小写：匹配整个标题的通配符，* 匹配任意一串字符，? 匹配一个，如 *Show Name*1080p*；或者 re: 之后的正则表达式（Go 的语法），在标题任意位置找到即可，如 re:S0[1-3]E\\d+。不写时为所有标题。最多 32 个。",
"Patterns, as patterns writes them, of titles the rule leaves out, as *720p* or re:(?:cam|ts)\\b. None when left out. At most 32.": "规则排除的标题的模式，写法同 patterns，如 *720p* 或 re:(?:cam|ts)\\b。不写时没有。最多 32 个。",
"Poll the feed. On when left out. The Admin API may turn it off or on, which data_dir keeps until it is turned back.": "轮询该订阅源。不写时开启。Admin API 可以关闭或打开它，data_dir 会保留这一选择，直到改回。",
"RSS auto-download: feeds polled on their intervals, and rules adding the torrents of the items they pick (magnet links, .torrent enclosures or links) in a category, with size bounds and each episode once. What was seen is kept in data_dir/rss.json. A change applies in place. None when left out.": "RSS 自动下载：按各自间隔轮询的订阅源，以及把所选条目的种子（磁力链接、.torrent 附件或链接）添加到某个分类的规则，带大小界限，每集只下载一次。已见过的条目保存在 data_dir/rss.json 中。更改原地生效。不写时没有。",
"The category the torrents are added in, one of categories. None, download_dir, when left out.": "种子添加到的分类，为 categories 之一。不写时没有分类，即 download_dir。",
"The feed's http or https URL. Redirects are followed, at most 5. A private tracker's passkey may be in it: the Admin API and the pages show it without its user and query.": "订阅源的 http 或 https URL。会跟随重定向，最多 5 次。其中可能含有私有 tracker 的 passkey：Admin API 和页面显示时去掉其用户信息和查询串。",
"The feed's name, which the rules, the Admin API and data_dir/rss.json know it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "订阅源的名称，规则、Admin API 和 data_dir/rss.json 以此指称它。字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The feeds polled, RSS 2.0 (or 1.0) and Atom, each on its own interval. Their URLs come from the config alone. At most 100.": "轮询的订阅源，RSS 2.0（或 1.0）和 Atom，各按自己的间隔。它们的 URL 只来自配置。最多 100 个。",
"The feeds whose items the rule looks at, by name. Every feed when left out.": "规则查看其条目的订阅源，按名称。不写时为所有订阅源。",
"The least size of an item's content, in bytes, from its torrent:contentLength, or its enclosure's length. An item whose size the feed does not give passes. No bound when left out or 0.": "条目内容的最小大小，以字节计，取自其 torrent:contentLength，或其附件的 length。订阅源没有给出大小的条目视为通过。不写或为 0 时不限。",
"The most bytes of a feed downloaded: a larger one fails its poll. 4 MiB when left out or 0, at most 32 MiB.": "下载一个订阅源的最多字节数：更大的使该次轮询失败。不写或为 0 时为 4 MiB，最多 32 MiB。",
"The most items of the feed read at a poll, the first in the document; the rest are left out. 200 when left out or 0.": "每次轮询读取该订阅源的最多条目数，取文档中靠前的；其余略去。不写或为 0 时为 200。",
"The most size of an item's content, in bytes, as min_size reads it. No bound when left out or 0.": "条目内容的最大大小，以字节计，读法同 min_size。不写或为 0 时不限。",
"The most torrents the rule adds at one poll of a feed; the items past it are left for the next poll. 5 when left out or 0.": "规则在一个订阅源的一次轮询中最多添加的种子数；超出的条目留给下一次轮询。不写或为 0 时为 5。",
"The rule's name, which the Admin API and data_dir/rss.json know it by. Letters, digits, '_', '.' and '-'.": "规则的名称，Admin API 和 data_dir/rss.json 以此指称它。字母、数字、'_'、'.' 和 '-'。",
"The rules that pick the items whose torrents are added, tried in order: an item is added by the first rule whose feeds, patterns and size bounds it meets; an item no rule picks is only remembered as seen. At most 200.": "挑选要添加其种子的条目的规则，按顺序尝试：条目由第一条其订阅源、模式和大小界限都满足的规则添加；没有规则挑中的条目只被记为已见。最多 200 条。",
"Use the rule. On when left out. The Admin API may turn it off or on, which data_dir keeps until it is turned back.": "使用该规则。不写时开启。Admin API 可以关闭或打开它，data_dir 会保留这一选择，直到改回。",
"The zone times are written in, as DATETIME text: UTC when left out, local, or an IANA name such as Asia/Shanghai.": "写入时间所用的时区，时间写成 DATETIME 文本：不设置时为 UTC，也可以是 local 或 IANA 名称，如 Asia/Shanghai。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against over https, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own. The check cannot be turned off.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 校验服务器证书所用的证书，取代系统根证书，用于自建 CA。校验无法关闭。",
"The name the receiver's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; each URL's host when left out.": "接收端证书必须具有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为各 URL 的主机。",
"A field of the row whose value is the severity: text (trace, debug, info, warn or warning, error, fatal or critical, any case), kept as the severity text and numbered as OTLP numbers them, or a number from 1 to 24. None when left out.": "行中值为严重级别的字段：文本（trace、debug、info、warn 或 warning、error、fatal 或 critical，不区分大小写）保留为严重级别文本，并按 OTLP 的编号转为数字；或 1 到 24 的数字。不设置时没有。",
"The user for basic authentication, as a gateway asks for; none when left out.": "基本认证的用户，用于要求认证的网关；不设置时没有。",
"How an export is sent: protobuf (application/x-protobuf) or JSON (application/json), OTLP/HTTP's two. protobuf when left out.": "导出的发送方式：protobuf（application/x-protobuf）或 JSON（application/json），即 OTLP/HTTP 的两种编码。不设置时为 protobuf。",
"A field of the row holding a span's ID as 16 hex digits. None when left out.": "行中以 16 位十六进制数字保存 span ID 的字段。不设置时没有。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the receiver's is checked against over https, in place of the system's roots, for a CA of its own. The check cannot be turned off.": "PEM 文件，包含通过 https 校验接收端证书所用的证书，取代系统根证书，用于自建 CA。校验无法关闭。",
"The most bytes of one export's log records, before compression; a batch larger is exported in several, in order, and a record larger fails. The Collector's own bound is its max_request_body_size, 20 MiB by default. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次导出中日志记录的最大字节数（压缩前）；更大的批次按顺序分成多次导出，超过它的单条记录失败。Collector 自身的上限是它的 max_request_body_size，默认 20 MiB。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"A field of the row whose value is a record's tenant, in place of tenant for the records that have it: a batch is pushed in a request per tenant.": "行中值为该记录租户的字段，对有此字段的记录取代 tenant：一个批次按租户分成多个请求推送。",
"The columns that identify a row, in order, never null: the records' key, and what rows are ordered by after the cursor, so that rows with the same cursor value are read once each.": "标识一行的列，按顺序，且不能为 null：即记录的键，也是在游标之后对行排序所用的列，使游标值相同的行各被读取一次。",
"The table a record goes to: text with {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it), the record's namespace; db.table names the database too. The table is not made: it is the user's, of the unique key model (merge on write) on Doris or the primary key model on StarRocks for updates and deletes. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的表：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间，也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）的文本；db.table 形式同时指定数据库。表不会自动创建：由用户建好，要处理更新和删除时，Doris 上为 Unique Key 模型（merge on write），StarRocks 上为主键模型。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The system loaded into: doris, whose deletes set __DORIS_DELETE_SIGN__ and whose partial updates are partial_columns; starrocks, whose deletes set __op and whose partial updates are partial_update. doris when left out.": "导入的目标系统：doris，删除时设置 __DORIS_DELETE_SIGN__，部分列更新使用 partial_columns；starrocks，删除时设置 __op，部分列更新使用 partial_update。不设置时为 doris。",
"More attributes of the resource, the name to a template of the value: text with {name}, a field of the row (after, or before when after is null), and {$namespace}, {$op}, {$source} and {$key}, the record's; {{ is a brace. Records whose resources come out the same are exported under one. Empty values are left out. service.name and service.version are the sink's. None when left out.": "资源的更多属性，属性名对应值的模板：文本中 {name} 为行（after，after 为 null 时为 before）的字段，{$namespace}、{$op}、{$source} 和 {$key} 为记录的对应部分；{{ 表示一个花括号。资源相同的记录在同一资源下导出。空值不写入。service.name 和 service.version 由 sink 设置。不设置时没有。",
"The connection's default database, of a table named without one and of the query's. None when left out.": "连接的默认数据库，用于未带数据库名的表和查询。不设置时没有。",
"A field of the row holding a trace's ID as 32 hex digits, which the log record is tied to, with span_id_field. None when left out.": "行中以 32 位十六进制数字保存 trace ID 的字段，日志记录与该 trace 关联，可配合 span_id_field。不设置时没有。",
"What a log record's body is: line, the text its codec makes; row, the record's row as a map of its fields, typed (ints, floats, booleans, bytes, arrays and maps as OTLP has them; times, dates and decimals as text). line when left out.": "日志记录的 body：line，为其 codec 生成的文本；row，为记录的行，作为各字段的 map 并保留类型（整数、浮点数、布尔值、字节、数组和 map 用 OTLP 的对应类型；时间、日期和 decimal 为文本）。不设置时为 line。",
"A column (a boolean or a number) whose true or non-zero value makes the row a delete rather than an insert. None when left out.": "一列（布尔或数字），其值为 true 或非零时，该行作为删除而不是插入。不设置时没有。",
"The user for basic authentication, with password_env; none when left out.": "基本认证的用户，配合 password_env；不设置时没有。",
"The user to load as, which needs LOAD on the tables (INSERT on StarRocks), sent with basic authentication.": "执行导入的用户，需要对表的 LOAD 权限（StarRocks 上为 INSERT），通过基本认证发送。",
"Update only the columns a run's rows have, keeping the others as they are, rather than replacing the row: Doris's partial_columns, StarRocks's partial_update. Needs a unique key table with merge on write, or a primary key table. false when left out.": "只更新一组记录的行中带有的列，其他列保持原样，而不是替换整行：即 Doris 的 partial_columns、StarRocks 的 partial_update。需要 merge on write 的 Unique Key 表或主键表。不设置时为 false。",
"How long one export may take, from connecting to the end of its answer. 60s when left out or 0.": "一次导出最长可用的时间，从建立连接到响应结束。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"How a push is sent: protobuf, compressed with snappy, as Promtail and Alloy send it; json, Loki's JSON push. protobuf when left out.": "推送的发送方式：protobuf，用 snappy 压缩，与 Promtail 和 Alloy 相同；json，即 Loki 的 JSON 推送。不设置时为 protobuf。",
"A field of the row whose value is the line's time: a time, an integer of Unix seconds, milliseconds, microseconds or nanoseconds, or RFC 3339 text. The record's commit time when left out or when a record lacks it, and the time of the write when it has neither, a nanosecond apart for each record of a batch.": "行中值为该日志行时间的字段：时间、Unix 秒/毫秒/微秒/纳秒整数，或 RFC 3339 文本。不设置或记录没有该字段时用记录的提交时间；两者都没有时用写入时间，同一批次中的每条记录相差一纳秒。",
"How long connecting, and each query, may take. 60s when left out or 0.": "建立连接以及每次查询最长可用的时间。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"The stream's labels, the label's name to a template of its value: text with {name}, a field of the row (after, or before when after is null), and {$namespace}, {$op}, {$source} and {$key}, the record's; {{ is a brace. A label whose value comes out empty is left out. Name only fields of few values here: each set of values is a stream of Loki's. {\"job\": \"fit\", \"namespace\": \"{$namespace}\"} when left out.": "流的标签，标签名对应值的模板：文本中 {name} 为行（after，after 为 null 时为 before）的字段，{$namespace}、{$op}、{$source} 和 {$key} 为记录的对应部分；{{ 表示一个花括号。值为空的标签不写入。这里只引用取值很少的字段：每组取值都是 Loki 的一个流。不设置时为 {\"job\": \"fit\", \"namespace\": \"{$namespace}\"}。",
"The tenant the lines go to, sent as X-Scope-OrgID, for a Loki with auth_enabled; none when left out.": "日志行所属的租户，以 X-Scope-OrgID 发送，用于开启 auth_enabled 的 Loki；不设置时没有。",
"Stream Load's other headers, sent with every load, as {\"max_filter_ratio\": \"0.1\", \"strict_mode\": \"true\", \"timeout\": \"600\"}; they cannot be the ones the sink sets: label, format, columns, the JSON and CSV ones, partial_columns, partial_update, hidden_columns, merge_type, delete, jsonpaths, Expect.": "Stream Load 的其他请求头，随每次导入发送，如 {\"max_filter_ratio\": \"0.1\", \"strict_mode\": \"true\", \"timeout\": \"600\"}；不能是 sink 自己设置的：label、format、columns、JSON 和 CSV 相关的头、partial_columns、partial_update、hidden_columns、merge_type、delete、jsonpaths、Expect。",
"The receiver's OTLP/HTTP address, as http://collector:4318, with or without the path /v1/logs, which goes after it when it is not there. The one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when one fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504).": "接收端的 OTLP/HTTP 地址，如 http://collector:4318，可带或不带路径 /v1/logs，不带时自动加上。使用上次响应的那个，失败时（连接错误、超时、502、503 或 504）依次换下一个。",
"The start of each load's label, letters, digits, _ and -, before a hash of the table, the run's positions and the lineage of the pipeline's checkpoint, which a reset changes, so that records a reset reads again are loaded again; pipelines loading the same database need prefixes of their own only when their sources' positions could match. fit when left out.": "每次导入的 label 的开头，由字母、数字、_ 和 - 组成，后接表、这组记录的位置及管道检查点的谱系（lineage）的哈希；重置会改变谱系，因此重置后重新读取的记录会再次导入；只有当写入同一数据库的多个管道的源位置可能相同时，才需要各用各的前缀。不设置时为 fit。",
"The frontends' HTTP addresses (their http_port), as http://fe1:8030, or backends' (http://be1:8040) to load into directly: the one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when one fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504). A frontend's redirect to a backend is followed, with the credentials, but not from https to http; the backend's address must be one fit reaches.": "前端的 HTTP 地址（其 http_port），如 http://fe1:8030，或直接导入的后端地址（http://be1:8040）：使用上次响应的那个，失败时（连接错误、超时、502、503 或 504）依次换下一个。前端到后端的重定向会带着凭据跟随，但不跟随从 https 到 http 的；后端地址必须是 fit 能访问到的。",
"A SELECT whose rows are read, as SELECT * FROM shop.orders WHERE region = 'eu': the source reads from it as a subquery, adding its own WHERE, ORDER BY and LIMIT, so it has the key's and the cursor's columns and no ORDER BY or LIMIT of its own. Either table or query.": "要读取其结果行的 SELECT，如 SELECT * FROM shop.orders WHERE region = 'eu'：源把它作为子查询读取，加上自己的 WHERE、ORDER BY 和 LIMIT，因此它须含键和游标的列，且自身不带 ORDER BY 或 LIMIT。table 与 query 二选一。",
"What makes a record's line: line when left out, which writes after's line field, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json writes the row as a JSON object, which Loki's json parser reads.": "生成记录日志行的方式：不设置时为 line，写出 after 的 line 字段，没有该字段时写出记录的规范 JSON；json 把行写成 JSON 对象，可由 Loki 的 json 解析器读取。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, presented to a receiver that asks for one; needs key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书及其后的证书链，在接收端要求时出示；需要 key_file。",
"How an export's body is compressed: gzip, or none. gzip when left out.": "导出请求体的压缩方式：gzip 或 none。不设置时为 gzip。",
"The user to read as, which needs SELECT on the table, or on what the query reads.": "执行读取的用户，需要对该表或查询所读内容的 SELECT 权限。",
"How rows are sent: json, a JSON object of each row's columns; csv, comma-separated values, quoted with escapes, null as \\N (Doris 2.0 and StarRocks 3.0 or later). Either way the load names its columns, the union of the run's rows', so a row without a column of the union loads it null. json when left out.": "行的发送方式：json，每行的列作为一个 JSON 对象；csv，逗号分隔的值，带引号和转义，null 写为 \\N（需要 Doris 2.0 或 StarRocks 3.0 及以上）。两种方式下导入都指明列，即这组记录各行列的并集，因此一行缺少并集中的某列时，该列导入为 null。不设置时为 json。",
"A column whose value grows as rows are written or changed (an update time, a version), never null, polled by: rows past the position's are read every poll_interval. A row written later with a value at or below one already read is not seen. Without it the source reads the rows once by the key and ends.": "一列，其值随行的写入或修改而增长（更新时间、版本号），不能为 null，按它轮询：每隔 poll_interval 读取位置之后的行。之后写入的行若其值不大于已读到的值，则不会被读到。不设置时源按键读一遍所有行后结束。",
"Structured metadata of each line, the name to a template as labels has them, for values of many kinds (a trace ID, a user) that are not to be labels: Loki 3 with allow_structured_metadata (the default from 3.0, on schema v13). Empty values are left out. None when left out.": "每行的结构化元数据，名称对应模板，与 labels 相同，用于取值很多、不宜作为标签的值（trace ID、用户）：需要开启 allow_structured_metadata 的 Loki 3（3.0 起在 schema v13 上默认开启）。空值不写入。不设置时没有。",
"How deletes are written: sign, as the row before (or the key, when the source has no row before) with the flavor's delete column set to 1, which a table of the unique or primary key model takes as deleting the key; ignore, not at all, for a table of another model. A run without deletes sends no delete column. sign when left out.": "删除的写入方式：sign，写出删除前的行（源没有删除前的行时为键），并把该系统的删除列设为 1，Unique Key 或主键模型的表据此删除该键；ignore，不写入，用于其他模型的表。没有删除的一组记录不发送删除列。不设置时为 sign。",
"The most bytes of the lines of one push, before compression; a batch larger is pushed in several, in order, and a line larger fails its record. Loki's own bound is its grpc_server_max_recv_msg_size, 4 MiB by default. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次推送中日志行的最大字节数（压缩前）；更大的批次按顺序分成多次推送，超过它的单行使其记录失败。Loki 自身的上限是它的 grpc_server_max_recv_msg_size，默认 4 MiB。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"Each log record's attributes, the name to a template as resource has them; empty values are left out. {\"fit.namespace\": \"{$namespace}\", \"fit.op\": \"{$op}\"} when left out.": "每条日志记录的属性，名称对应模板，与 resource 相同；空值不写入。不设置时为 {\"fit.namespace\": \"{$namespace}\", \"fit.op\": \"{$op}\"}。",
"The most bytes of one load's rows; a batch larger is loaded in several, in order, each with a label of its own, and a row larger fails its record. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "一次导入中行的最大字节数；更大的批次按顺序分成多次导入，各有自己的 label，超过它的单行使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The resource's service.name. fit when left out, as fit's telemetry has it.": "资源的 service.name。不设置时为 fit，与 fit 的遥测相同。",
"A frontend's MySQL query port, host and port: Doris's and StarRocks's query_port. 127.0.0.1:9030 when left out.": "前端的 MySQL 查询端口，主机和端口：即 Doris 和 StarRocks 的 query_port。不设置时为 127.0.0.1:9030。",
"The environment variable holding a token sent as Authorization: Bearer, in place of username.": "保存令牌的环境变量，令牌以 Authorization: Bearer 发送，取代 username。",
"How long one load may take, from connecting to the end of its answer. 60s when left out or 0.": "一次导入最长可用的时间，从建立连接到响应结束。不设置或为 0 时为 60s。",
"A field of the row whose value is the log record's time: a time, an integer of Unix seconds, milliseconds, microseconds or nanoseconds, or RFC 3339 text. The record's commit time when left out or when a record lacks it, and none when it has neither (its observed time is the export's).": "行中值为该日志记录时间的字段：时间、Unix 秒/毫秒/微秒/纳秒整数，或 RFC 3339 文本。不设置或记录没有该字段时用记录的提交时间；两者都没有时不设时间（其观测时间为导出时间）。",
"The records' namespace. table when left out, or doris for a query.": "记录的命名空间。不设置时为 table，使用 query 时为 doris。",
"Connect over TLS, required: a server that does not offer it is refused. The server's certificate is checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，且为必需：不提供 TLS 的服务器会被拒绝。服务器证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验；校验无法关闭。",
"Loki's HTTP address, as http://loki:3100, or a gateway's with the path before /loki (https://logs.example.com/tenant-a): /loki/api/v1/push goes after it. The one that answered last is used, and the next in turn when one fails to (a connection's error, a timeout, a 502, 503 or 504).": "Loki 的 HTTP 地址，如 http://loki:3100，或网关地址，带 /loki 之前的路径（https://logs.example.com/tenant-a）：其后加上 /loki/api/v1/push。使用上次响应的那个，失败时（连接错误、超时、502、503 或 504）依次换下一个。",
"The database of a table named without one. Needed unless every table is named as db.table.": "未带数据库名的表所属的数据库。除非每个表都写成 db.table，否则需要设置。",
"What makes a record's line, with body line: line when left out, which writes after's line field, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json writes the row as a JSON object.": "body 为 line 时生成记录日志行的方式：不设置时为 line，写出 after 的 line 字段，没有该字段时写出记录的规范 JSON；json 把行写成 JSON 对象。",
"A file of headers sent with every export, one \"Name: value\" a line, # starting a comment, as telemetry's headers_file, for a vendor's API key kept out of the config. Read when the pipeline loads.": "随每次导出发送的请求头文件，每行一个 \"Name: value\"，# 开头为注释，与 telemetry 的 headers_file 相同，用于把服务商的 API key 放在配置之外。在管道加载时读取。",
"The vectors' size asked of a model that can shorten them (OpenAI's text-embedding-3 models); the model's own when left out or 0.": "向能缩短向量的模型（OpenAI 的 text-embedding-3 系列）要求的向量维数；不设置或为 0 时用模型自己的。",
"The user of api v1's basic authentication, with password_env.": "api v1 基本认证的用户，与 password_env 一起使用。",
"The super table a record's row goes to: text with placeholders, {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it) the record's namespace and {name} the row's field name; {{ is a brace. {namespace} when left out.": "记录的行写入的超级表：带占位符的文本，{namespace}（也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）为记录的命名空间，{name} 为行中名为 name 的字段；{{ 表示一个花括号。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The organization of api v2, its name or ID.": "api v2 的组织，名称或 ID。",
"The name the server's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; the URL's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须带有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为 URL 的主机。",
"Milvus's RESTful endpoint, as http://milvus:19530 (Zilliz Cloud's cluster endpoint too). fib's client does not follow redirects.": "Milvus 的 RESTful 端点，如 http://milvus:19530（也可以是 Zilliz Cloud 集群的端点）。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"The row's field the vector is set in, an array of floats, replacing what is there. embedding when left out.": "向量写入的行字段，为浮点数数组，覆盖原有的值。不设置时为 embedding。",
"The server's HTTP endpoint, as http://influxdb:8086 (InfluxDB 2), http://influxdb3:8181 (InfluxDB 3). fib's client does not follow redirects.": "服务器的 HTTP 端点，如 http://influxdb:8086（InfluxDB 2）、http://influxdb3:8181（InfluxDB 3）。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"The row's fields that are the subtable's tags. In mode schemaless a field missing, null or empty is left out of them; in mode sql it is NULL. Tags are fixed when a subtable is made. None when left out.": "作为子表标签的行字段。在 schemaless 模式下，缺失、为 null 或为空的字段不计入标签；在 sql 模式下为 NULL。标签在子表创建时即固定。不设置时没有。",
"The database of the collections; default when left out.": "集合所在的数据库；不设置时为 default。",
"The database's precision, which timestamps are cut to: ns, us or ms. Two records of a subtable within one unit are one row. ms, TDengine's default, when left out.": "数据库的精度，时间戳会截断到该精度：ns、us 或 ms。同一子表在一个单位内的两条记录是同一行。不设置时为 TDengine 的默认值 ms。",
"The environment variable holding a token, sent as Authorization: Bearer, read when the pipeline loads: an API key, or user:password. Not with username.": "保存令牌的环境变量，以 Authorization: Bearer 发送，在管道加载时读取：API 密钥，或 user:password。不能与 username 同用。",
"The collection's primary key field, set from the record's key: an Int64 key from a single int or uint, a VarChar from any other key's text (a single value's, or a map's values joined by ':'). id when left out.": "集合的主键字段，取自记录的键：单个 int 或 uint 的键为 Int64，其他键为其文本形式的 VarChar（单个值的文本，或 map 各值以 ':' 连接）。不设置时为 id。",
"The most texts one request carries. 64 when left out or 0.": "一个请求最多携带的文本数。不设置或为 0 时为 64。",
"The model the vectors are computed by, as text-embedding-3-small.": "计算向量所用的模型，如 text-embedding-3-small。",
"How rows are written: schemaless, as InfluxDB's line protocol, TDengine making the super tables, subtables and columns as they are first written (tags as NCHAR, ints as BIGINT, floats as DOUBLE, strings as VARCHAR; the timestamp column _ts); sql, as INSERT ... USING the super table TAGS (...) VALUES (...) into the subtable subtable names, made at its first row, the super table yours. schemaless when left out.": "行的写法：schemaless，以 InfluxDB 的行协议写入，由 TDengine 在首次写入时创建超级表、子表和列（标签为 NCHAR，整数为 BIGINT，浮点数为 DOUBLE，字符串为 VARCHAR；时间戳列为 _ts）；sql，以 INSERT ... USING 超级表 TAGS (...) VALUES (...) 写入 subtable 指定的子表，子表在其首行写入时创建，超级表由你创建。不设置时为 schemaless。",
"What a delete does: skip leaves it out, counted as written; fail fails it, which on_error takes. skip when left out.": "删除的处理方式：skip 跳过它并计为已写入；fail 使其失败，交给 on_error 处理。不设置时为 skip。",
"The row's field the point's time is read from: a time, a date, an int of Unix nanoseconds, or a string in RFC 3339. The record's commit time when left out, or the time it is written when the source gives none, which a replay does not repeat.": "读取数据点时间的行字段：time、date、Unix 纳秒的整数，或 RFC 3339 字符串。不设置时为记录的提交时间；源未给出提交时间时为写入时间，重放时不会重复同一时间。",
"The collection's named vector the vector is, for a collection of several; its one unnamed vector when left out.": "向量对应的集合命名向量，用于有多个向量的集合；不设置时为其唯一的未命名向量。",
"The row's fields written, the vector fields among them, beside the primary key; every field of the row when left out, which the collection takes when its schema has them or its dynamic field is on. Vectors are arrays of numbers, as the embed transform makes.": "除主键外写入的行字段，其中包括向量字段；不设置时写入行的所有字段，集合的 schema 有这些字段或开启了动态字段时才会接受。向量为数字数组，正如 embed 转换生成的那样。",
"The name the API's certificate must have, and the TLS server name sent; the URL's host when left out.": "API 证书必须带有的名称，也是发送的 TLS 服务器名；不设置时为 URL 的主机。",
"The row's fields written as the point's fields; every field of the row but the tags and time_field when left out. Ints, uints, floats, decimals (as floats) and bools are written as such, any other value as a string of its text (bytes in base64, maps and arrays as JSON). Null fields are left out; a point with no field fails its record.": "作为数据点字段写入的行字段；不设置时为除标签和 time_field 外的所有字段。int、uint、float、decimal（作为浮点数）和 bool 按原类型写入，其他值写为其文本的字符串（bytes 为 base64，map 和数组为 JSON）。null 字段不写；没有字段的数据点使其记录失败。",
"The most bytes of vectors kept, by a hash of the model, the dimensions and the text, the least used dropped first, so that a text seen again is not sent again: a replay, an update that leaves the text as it was. 32 MiB when left out or 0.": "按模型、维数和文本的哈希缓存的向量最多占用的字节数，最少使用的先淘汰，使再次遇到的文本（重放、未改变文本的更新）不必再发送。不设置或为 0 时为 32 MiB。",
"The precision of the points' times, which are cut to it: ns, us, ms or s. Two records of a series within one unit are one point. ns when left out.": "数据点时间的精度，时间会截断到该精度：ns、us、ms 或 s。同一序列在一个单位内的两条记录是同一个数据点。不设置时为 ns。",
"The row's field holding the point's vector: an array of numbers, or JSON of one, as the embed transform makes. A record without it fails. embedding when left out.": "保存数据点向量的行字段：数字数组或其 JSON，正如 embed 转换生成的那样。没有该字段的记录会失败。不设置时为 embedding。",
"The user, as root.": "用户，如 root。",
"taosAdapter's HTTP endpoint, as http://tdengine:6041. fib's client does not follow redirects.": "taosAdapter 的 HTTP 端点，如 http://tdengine:6041。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"The longest text embedded; a record whose text is longer fails, which on_error takes, rather than be cut. Keep it within the model's input tokens. 32 KiB when left out or 0.": "嵌入文本的最大长度；文本更长的记录会失败并交给 on_error 处理，而不是被截断。请使其不超过模型的输入 token 数。不设置或为 0 时为 32 KiB。",
"The collection a record's point goes to, which must exist: text with placeholders, {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it) the record's namespace and {name} the row's field name; {{ is a brace.": "记录的数据点写入的集合，必须已存在：带占位符的文本，{namespace}（也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）为记录的命名空间，{name} 为行中名为 name 的字段；{{ 表示一个花括号。",
"The row's fields kept in the point's payload; every field but vector_field when left out.": "保存在数据点 payload 中的行字段；不设置时为除 vector_field 外的所有字段。",
"The write API: v2, /api/v2/write with org and bucket (InfluxDB 2, and 3's compatibility); v3, /api/v3/write_lp with database (InfluxDB 3); v1, /write with database and retention_policy (InfluxDB 1, and 2's compatibility). v2 when left out.": "写入 API：v2，带 org 和 bucket 的 /api/v2/write（InfluxDB 2，以及 3 的兼容接口）；v3，带 database 的 /api/v3/write_lp（InfluxDB 3）；v1，带 database 和 retention_policy 的 /write（InfluxDB 1，以及 2 的兼容接口）。不设置时为 v2。",
"How long one request may take, from connecting to the end of its answer. 30s when left out or 0.": "一个请求从连接到应答结束最多可用多久。不设置或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The row's field the row's timestamp is read from: a time, a date, an int of Unix nanoseconds, or a string in RFC 3339. The record's commit time when left out, or the time it is written when the source gives none, which a replay does not repeat.": "读取行时间戳的行字段：time、date、Unix 纳秒的整数，或 RFC 3339 字符串。不设置时为记录的提交时间；源未给出提交时间时为写入时间，重放时不会重复同一时间。",
"The row's fields that are the point's tags, as text; a field missing, null or empty is left out of them. Tags and the measurement are the series, which with the time is the point: keep them to fields that do not change, or bounded ones. None when left out.": "作为数据点标签的行字段，以文本形式写入；缺失、为 null 或为空的字段不计入标签。标签和 measurement 构成序列，序列加时间即数据点：请只用不变或取值有限的字段。不设置时没有。",
"The API's base URL, to which /embeddings is added, as https://api.openai.com/v1 or http://ollama:11434/v1. This config's llm.proxy's api, on loopback, when left out; one or the other is needed.": "API 的基础 URL，其后加 /embeddings，如 https://api.openai.com/v1 或 http://ollama:11434/v1。不设置时为本配置 llm.proxy 的 api（经回环地址）；二者至少需要一个。",
"mode sql's timestamp column, the super table's first. ts when left out.": "sql 模式的时间戳列，即超级表的第一列。不设置时为 ts。",
"api v1's retention policy; the database's default when left out.": "api v1 的保留策略；不设置时为数据库的默认策略。",
"The most bytes of points, before gzip, one request carries; a batch larger is sent in several, in order, and a point larger fails its record. 4 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求携带的数据点在 gzip 前最多的字节数；更大的批次按顺序分多次发送，超过它的单个数据点使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 4 MiB。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the server's is checked against, in place of the system's roots. The check cannot be turned off.": "用于校验服务器证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书。校验不能关闭。",
"The environment variable holding an API key, sent as the api-key header, read when the pipeline loads.": "保存 API 密钥的环境变量，以 api-key 头发送，在管道加载时读取。",
"The collection a record's entity goes to, which must exist with a primary key that is not auto_id: text with placeholders, {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it) the record's namespace and {name} the row's field name; {{ is a brace.": "记录的实体写入的集合，必须已存在且主键不是 auto_id：带占位符的文本，{namespace}（也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）为记录的命名空间，{name} 为行中名为 name 的字段；{{ 表示一个花括号。",
"The most bytes of one request: lines, or an INSERT, which TDengine's maxSQLLength bounds (1 MiB by default); a batch larger is sent in several, in order, and a row larger fails its record. 1 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求最多的字节数：若干行，或一条 INSERT，后者受 TDengine 的 maxSQLLength 限制（默认 1 MiB）；更大的批次按顺序分多次发送，超过它的单行使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 1 MiB。",
"What joins the fields' texts. A line break when left out.": "连接各字段文本所用的分隔符。不设置时为换行。",
"How many times a request is sent while it fails to be answered or is answered 408, 429 or 5xx, with a backoff between, before its records fail. 3 when left out or 0.": "请求在得不到应答或应答为 408、429、5xx 时最多发送几次（每次之间退避），之后其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 3。",
"The measurement a record's point goes to: text with placeholders, {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it) the record's namespace and {name} the row's field name (which the point still has as a field or tag); {{ is a brace. {namespace} when left out.": "记录的数据点写入的 measurement：带占位符的文本，{namespace}（也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）为记录的命名空间，{name} 为行中名为 name 的字段（数据点仍保留它作为字段或标签）；{{ 表示一个花括号。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"The most bytes of one request; a batch larger is sent in several, and a point larger fails its record. Below Qdrant's service.max_request_size_mb (32 MiB). 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求最多的字节数；更大的批次分多次发送，超过它的单个数据点使其记录失败。应低于 Qdrant 的 service.max_request_size_mb（32 MiB）。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"What a delete does: skip leaves it out, counted as written (the line protocol has no deletes); fail fails it, which on_error takes. skip when left out.": "删除的处理方式：skip 跳过它并计为已写入（行协议没有删除）；fail 使其失败，交给 on_error 处理。不设置时为 skip。",
"The environment variable holding an API token, read when the pipeline loads: sent as Authorization: Token (v2, v1) or Bearer (v3). Not with username.": "保存 API 令牌的环境变量，在管道加载时读取：以 Authorization: Token（v2、v1）或 Bearer（v3）发送。不能与 username 同用。",
"The row's fields written as columns; every field of the row but the tags and time_field when left out. Null fields are left out. In mode schemaless ints are BIGINT, uints BIGINT UNSIGNED, floats and decimals DOUBLE, bools BOOL, and any other value a VARCHAR of its text (bytes in base64, maps and arrays as JSON).": "作为列写入的行字段；不设置时为除标签和 time_field 外的所有字段。null 字段不写。在 schemaless 模式下 int 为 BIGINT，uint 为 BIGINT UNSIGNED，float 和 decimal 为 DOUBLE，bool 为 BOOL，其他值为其文本的 VARCHAR（bytes 为 base64，map 和数组为 JSON）。",
"The environment variable holding the API's key, sent as Authorization: Bearer, read when the pipeline loads: one of llm.proxy's api_keys for it. None when left out.": "保存 API 密钥的环境变量，以 Authorization: Bearer 发送，在管道加载时读取：对 llm.proxy 而言为其 api_keys 之一。不设置时没有。",
"The database written to, which must exist; its precision must be precision's.": "写入的数据库，必须已存在；其精度必须与 precision 一致。",
"The most requests a batch sends at once. 4 when left out or 0.": "一个批次同时发送的最多请求数。不设置或为 0 时为 4。",
"The most bytes of one request; a batch larger is sent in several, and an entity larger fails its record. 8 MiB when left out or 0.": "一个请求最多的字节数；更大的批次分多次发送，超过它的单个实体使其记录失败。不设置或为 0 时为 8 MiB。",
"The database api v3 and v1 write to; required with them.": "api v3 和 v1 写入的数据库；使用它们时必填。",
"The bucket api v2 writes to; required with it.": "api v2 写入的 bucket；使用它时必填。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the API's is checked against, in place of the system's roots. The check cannot be turned off; llm.proxy's own certificate is pinned.": "用于校验 API 证书的 PEM 证书文件，替代系统根证书。校验不能关闭；llm.proxy 自己的证书会被固定（pin）。",
"mode sql's subtable a record's row goes to: a template as measurement's, as d_{device}. When left out, t_ and the MD5, in hex, of the super table and the tags' names and values, so that a series keeps its subtable.": "sql 模式下记录的行写入的子表：与 measurement 相同的模板，如 d_{device}。不设置时为 t_ 加超级表及各标签名和值的 MD5（十六进制），使一个序列始终对应同一子表。",
"Send requests gzipped. On when left out.": "以 gzip 压缩发送请求。不设置时开启。",
"The row's fields whose text is embedded, joined by separator in this order; a field missing or null is left out. A record with none of them passes without a vector.": "要嵌入其文本的行字段，按此顺序以 separator 连接；缺失或为 null 的字段跳过。这些字段都没有的记录不加向量直接通过。",
"The user, with password_env, sent as the token user:password.": "用户，与 password_env 一起以令牌 user:password 发送。",
"Qdrant's REST endpoint, as http://qdrant:6333. fib's client does not follow redirects.": "Qdrant 的 REST 端点，如 http://qdrant:6333。fib 的客户端不跟随重定向。",
"Publish messages as transient (delivery mode 1), which a classic queue keeps in memory alone; persistent when left out. Quorum and stream queues keep every message on disk.": "以 transient（投递模式 1）发布消息，经典队列只把它留在内存中；不写时为持久。仲裁队列与流队列把每条消息都存在磁盘上。",
"How many deliveries of each queue may be unacknowledged at once (basic.qos): bounds what the broker sends ahead of the sinks. 1000 when left out or 0.": "每个队列可同时未确认的投递数（basic.qos）：限制代理领先目标发送的量。不写或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How long connecting and each answer, the broker's receipt of a batch among them, may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接以及每次应答（包括代理对一批的回执）可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 30s。",
"How many messages of each partition the broker may send ahead of what the source has taken. 1000 when left out or 0.": "代理可领先于源已取走的部分、为每个分区预先发送的消息数。不写或为 0 时为 1000。",
"With mode core, the queue group the subscriptions join, so that several fits share the messages.": "mode core 时订阅加入的队列组，使多个 fit 分担消息。",
"The environment variable holding a token (a JWT) to authenticate with, read when the pipeline loads; no authentication when left out.": "存放用于认证的令牌（JWT）的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取；不写时不认证。",
"What a message with a null value is: delete, a delete record of the message's key, as a compacted topic means it; skip, nothing. delete when left out.": "值为 null 的消息是什么：delete，按消息的键生成删除记录，与压缩主题的含义一致；skip，什么也不生成。不写时为 delete。",
"What makes records of a message's body: raw when left out, a message record holding it as after's value.": "由消息体生成记录的方式：不写时为 raw，一条消息记录，以其作为 after 的 value。",
"The user, for PLAIN.": "PLAIN 认证的用户。",
"The stream read; needed with mode jetstream.": "读取的流；mode jetstream 时必需。",
"jetstream, each message acknowledged by the stream that takes its subject, deduplicated by its Nats-Msg-Id; core, published to core NATS, at most once. jetstream when left out.": "jetstream，每条消息由接收其主题的流确认，按其 Nats-Msg-Id 去重；core，发布到 core NATS，至多一次。不写时为 jetstream。",
"Where a stream the checkpoint has no offset of starts: first, its oldest message kept; last, its last chunk; next, after its end, reading only what comes after. first when left out.": "检查点中没有其偏移的流从哪里开始：first，保留的最早消息；last，其最后一个块；next，其末尾之后，只读之后到来的。不写时为 first。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the nodes' are checked against, in place of the system's roots; needs tls.": "PEM 文件，包含用于校验各节点证书的证书，取代系统根证书；需要 tls。",
"The most messages one pull asks for. 256 when left out or 0.": "一次拉取最多请求的消息数。不写或为 0 时为 256。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, for servers that verify clients; needs tls and key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书及其后的证书链，供校验客户端的服务器使用；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"Make the consumer when it does not exist, and make it again when it is lost or a run finds it holding messages delivered and not acknowledged: from after the checkpoint's sequence (or its acknowledgement floor, when later), its ack policy all, its filter subjects, start, ack_wait and max_ack_pending these params'. A consumer that does not exist is an error when left out.": "consumer 不存在时创建它，在它丢失、或某次运行发现它持有已投递未确认的消息时重新创建：从检查点的序号之后（或其确认下限，若更晚）开始，ack 策略为 all，过滤主题、start、ack_wait 与 max_ack_pending 取这些参数。不写时 consumer 不存在即报错。",
"The subject a record goes to: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace (a route transform can map namespaces to subjects first). A record whose subject is empty or holds a wildcard fails. {namespace} when left out.": "记录发往的主题：含 {namespace} 的文本，即记录的命名空间（route 变换可先把命名空间映射为主题）。主题为空或含通配符的记录失败。不写时为 {namespace}。",
"What makes records of a message's data: raw when left out, a message record holding it as after's value.": "由消息数据生成记录的方式：不写时为 raw，一条消息记录，以其作为 after 的 value。",
"How long connecting, each answer of the broker, each write, the wait for a batch's confirms (from the last one), the wait while the broker blocks publishing (a memory or disk alarm), and closing may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、代理的每次应答、每次写入、等待一批的确认（从最后一条算起）、代理阻塞发布时（内存或磁盘告警）的等待以及关闭可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The name the servers' certificates must have; each server's host when left out.": "服务器证书必须具有的名称；不写时为各服务器的主机名。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, for nodes that ask for one or for EXTERNAL; needs tls and key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书及其后的证书链，供要求客户端证书的节点或 EXTERNAL 使用；需要 tls 和 key_file。",
"The servers, host:port each; the others of the cluster are learnt from them, and the client connects to another when one fails.": "服务器，每个为 host:port；集群中的其他服务器从它们获知，一台失败时客户端连接另一台。",
"A field of after that the message's subject, headers, stream, sequence and time go in, as a map, in records a codec makes rows of; a message record holds them beside its value without it.": "after 的一个字段，在编解码器生成行的记录中以 map 存放消息的主题、头、流、序号和时间；不设置时，消息记录把它们放在其 value 旁。",
"In a job (mode once), the source ends once no message has come for this long, every record acknowledged. 2s when left out or 0.": "在作业（mode once）中，这么久没有消息到来、且所有记录都已确认时，源结束。不写或为 0 时为 2s。",
"How long connecting and each answer may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接以及每次应答可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The stream queues consumed, by name, each from the offset after the last one in the checkpoint, or from stream_start without one. At least one of queues and streams.": "按名称消费的流队列，每个从检查点中最后一个偏移之后读，没有检查点时从 stream_start 读。queues 与 streams 至少要有一个。",
"The durable pull consumer the stream is read through; needed with mode jetstream. One pipeline a consumer. A consumer fit does not make is read from its acknowledgement floor, and needs ack policy explicit (none reads at most once).": "读取流所经的持久拉取 consumer；mode jetstream 时必需。一个 consumer 对应一条流水线。非 fit 创建的 consumer 从其确认下限读起，且需要 ack 策略 explicit（none 为至多一次）。",
"The service URL: pulsar://host:6650, or pulsar+ssl://host:6651 for TLS, the broker's certificate checked against the system's roots or ca_file's (the check cannot be turned off); several hosts separated by commas are tried in order.": "服务 URL：pulsar://host:6650，或 TLS 时为 pulsar+ssl://host:6651，代理的证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验（校验不可关闭）；以逗号分隔的多个主机按顺序尝试。",
"What makes a message's value of a record: raw when left out, after's value field as it is, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json for the row as plain JSON (form plain) or the whole record (form record).": "由记录生成消息值的方式：不写时为 raw，即 after 的 value 字段原样，没有时为记录的规范 JSON；json 为把行写成纯 JSON（form plain）或整条记录（form record）。",
"A creds file, as nsc writes it, holding a user's JWT and NKey seed, for servers in operator mode.": "nsc 写出的 creds 文件，包含用户的 JWT 与 NKey 种子，用于 operator 模式的服务器。",
"The environment variable holding the password, read when the pipeline loads.": "存放密码的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取。",
"The records' namespace. The codec's, or the queue's name, when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不写时为编解码器给出的，或队列名。",
"The subscription's type: exclusive, one consumer, a second pipeline refused; failover, one active consumer of each partition and others standing by. exclusive when left out.": "订阅的类型：exclusive，一个消费者，第二条流水线被拒绝；failover，每个分区一个活动消费者，其余待命。不写时为 exclusive。",
"The connection's name, in the servers' monitoring. fit-sync when left out.": "连接的名称，显示在服务器的监控中。不写时为 fit-sync。",
"The largest frame asked for, the broker's when lower; larger messages come in several frames. 131072 when left out or 0.": "请求的最大帧，代理的更小时取代理的；更大的消息分成多帧到来。不写或为 0 时为 131072。",
"What makes a message's data of a record: raw when left out, after's value field as it is, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json for the row as plain JSON (form plain) or the whole record (form record).": "由记录生成消息数据的方式：不写时为 raw，即 after 的 value 字段原样，没有时为记录的规范 JSON；json 为把行写成纯 JSON（form plain）或整条记录（form record）。",
"A file holding a user's NKey seed (SU...), whose key signs the server's nonce.": "存放用户 NKey 种子（SU...）的文件，以其密钥签名服务器的 nonce。",
"Where a consumer made without a checkpoint starts: all, the stream's first message; new, after its last, reading only what comes after. all when left out.": "没有检查点时创建的 consumer 从哪里开始：all，流的第一条消息；new，其最后一条之后，只读之后到来的。不写时为 all。",
"The durable subscription's name, for mode subscription.": "持久订阅的名称，用于 mode subscription。",
"The most messages of one Pulsar batch. 1000 when left out or 0.": "一个 Pulsar 批次最多的消息数。不写或为 0 时为 1000。",
"The routing key of a record's message: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace, and {key}, its key (a string as it is, anything else as JSON). At most 255 bytes once made. {namespace} when left out.": "记录消息的路由键：含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间）和 {key}（其键，字符串原样，其他为 JSON）的文本。生成后最多 255 字节。不写时为 {namespace}。",
"How batches are compressed. lz4 when left out.": "批次的压缩方式。不写时为 lz4。",
"The environment variable holding a token to authenticate with, read when the pipeline loads.": "存放用于认证的令牌的环境变量，在流水线加载时读取。",
"How long connecting, and each publish's acknowledgement, may take. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接以及每次发布的确认可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 10s。",
"How the topics are read: reader, a non-durable reader of each partition from the checkpoint's message IDs, which needs nothing kept on the broker (messages the topic's retention removed before they are read are lost); subscription, the durable subscription named by subscription, which keeps the messages until it acknowledges them, cumulatively, once every sink has them. reader when left out.": "读取主题的方式：reader，每个分区一个非持久读者，从检查点中的消息 ID 读起，不需要在代理上保留任何东西（主题的保留策略在读取前删除的消息会丢失）；subscription，以 subscription 命名的持久订阅，它保留消息直到在所有目标都拿到后累积确认。不写时为 reader。",
"Connect over TLS, the nodes' certificates checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，各节点的证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验；校验不可关闭。",
"The field of after that holds the message's metadata (topic, message_id, properties, producer, publish_time, event_time) in the records a codec makes of rows. A message record has them as fields of its own, beside value; a row has them only when this is set.": "after 中的字段，在编解码器生成行的记录中存放消息的元数据（topic、message_id、properties、producer、publish_time、event_time）。消息记录把它们作为自己的字段放在 value 旁；行只在设置此项时才带有它们。",
"What a delete with a key is: tombstone, a message of the key with a null value, which topic compaction takes as the key gone and the source pulsar reads back as a delete; encode, a message of what the codec makes of it. tombstone when left out.": "带键的删除是什么：tombstone，一条该键、值为 null 的消息，主题压缩视其为键已删除，pulsar 源读回时为删除；encode，一条由编解码器生成内容的消息。不写时为 tombstone。",
"The largest message body taken: a larger one ends the connection, as a broken one would. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "接受的最大消息体：更大的会像连接损坏一样结束连接。不写或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"The nodes, host:port each (5672, or 5671 for TLS), tried in order until one answers.": "节点，每个为 host:port（5672，TLS 时为 5671），按顺序尝试直到有一个应答。",
"How long connecting, and each answer of JetStream's API beyond a pull's wait, may take. 10s when left out or 0.": "连接以及 JetStream API 每次应答（拉取的等待之外）可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 10s。",
"With mode jetstream, the most publishes waiting for the stream's acknowledgement at once. 256 when left out or 0.": "mode jetstream 时，同时等待流确认的发布的最大数量。不写或为 0 时为 256。",
"How long a pull waits for messages. 5s when left out or 0.": "一次拉取等待消息的时长。不写或为 0 时为 5s。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the servers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots; needs tls.": "PEM 文件，包含用于校验各服务器证书的证书，取代系统根证书；需要 tls。",
"The name the nodes' certificates must have; each node's host when left out.": "节点证书必须具有的名称；不写时为各节点的主机名。",
"A PEM file of a client certificate, and the chain after it, for brokers that ask for one; needs key_file.": "PEM 文件，包含客户端证书及其后的证书链，供要求客户端证书的代理使用；需要 key_file。",
"The producers' name, the same for every partition: the brokers deduplicate by it, so it must stay the same across restarts, and differ between two sinks writing one topic (the broker refuses a second producer of a name). fit-sync when left out.": "生产者的名称，所有分区相同：代理按它去重，所以它在重启之间必须保持不变，且写同一主题的两个目标必须不同（代理拒绝同名的第二个生产者）。不写时为 fit-sync。",
"The topic a record goes to: text with {namespace}, the record's namespace (a route transform can map namespaces to topics first), a name (public/default's), tenant/namespace/name or persistent://tenant/namespace/name. A record whose topic is not a name Pulsar takes fails. The topic is not made by the sink, unless the brokers make topics when first used. {namespace} when left out.": "记录发往的主题：含 {namespace} 的文本，即记录的命名空间（route 变换可先把命名空间映射为主题），一个名称（属于 public/default）、tenant/namespace/name 或 persistent://tenant/namespace/name。主题不是 Pulsar 接受的名称的记录失败。目标不创建主题，除非代理在首次使用时创建。不写时为 {namespace}。",
"The exchange published to, which must exist; the default exchange when left out, which routes a message to the queue its routing key names.": "发布到的交换机，必须存在；不写时为默认交换机，它把消息路由到其路由键所指的队列。",
"How long connecting, each answer of the broker, each write and closing may take. 30s when left out or 0.": "连接、代理的每次应答、每次写入以及关闭可用的时长。不写或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The largest frame asked for, the broker's when lower; larger messages go in several frames. 131072 when left out or 0.": "请求的最大帧，代理的更小时取代理的；更大的消息分成多帧发送。不写或为 0 时为 131072。",
"What a message the exchange routes to no queue is: error, its record fails (the message is published mandatory and returned), on_error then taking it; drop, it is dropped by the broker unseen. error when left out.": "交换机路由不到任何队列的消息是什么：error，其记录失败（消息以 mandatory 发布并被退回），随后由 on_error 处理；drop，由代理悄然丢弃。不写时为 error。",
"The service URL: pulsar://host:6650, or pulsar+ssl://host:6651 for TLS, the broker's certificate checked against the system's roots or ca_file's (the check cannot be turned off); several hosts separated by commas are tried in order. Topics are looked up from it, and their brokers connected to, or a proxy, as the lookup says.": "服务 URL：pulsar://host:6650，或 TLS 时为 pulsar+ssl://host:6651，代理的证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验（校验不可关闭）；以逗号分隔的多个主机按顺序尝试。主题经它查找，再按查找结果连接其代理或代理服务（proxy）。",
"How to authenticate: PLAIN, with username and password_env (over TLS, or the password goes in clear); EXTERNAL, with the TLS client certificate of cert_file, as the rabbitmq_auth_mechanism_ssl plugin takes it. PLAIN when left out.": "认证方式：PLAIN，配合 username 与 password_env（应走 TLS，否则密码明文传输）；EXTERNAL，使用 cert_file 的 TLS 客户端证书，由 rabbitmq_auth_mechanism_ssl 插件接受。不写时为 PLAIN。",
"The user to authenticate as, with password_env.": "用于认证的用户，配合 password_env。",
"The topics read: a name (public/default's), tenant/namespace/name or persistent://tenant/namespace/name; every partition of a partitioned topic, partitions added found within a minute and read from their start.": "读取的主题：一个名称（属于 public/default）、tenant/namespace/name 或 persistent://tenant/namespace/name；分区主题的每个分区都读，新增的分区在一分钟内被发现并从头读起。",
"With mode jetstream, the filter subjects of a consumer made (the whole stream when left out); with mode core, the subjects subscribed to, which are needed; * and > are wildcards.": "mode jetstream 时，创建的 consumer 的过滤主题（不写时为整个流）；mode core 时，订阅的主题，必需；* 与 > 为通配符。",
"The classic and quorum queues consumed, by name; they are not declared, and must exist. Their messages are acknowledged once every sink has them, so a restart delivers again what was not.": "按名称消费的经典队列与仲裁队列；不声明它们，它们必须已存在。其消息在所有目标都拿到后才确认，所以重启会重新投递未确认的。",
"The heartbeat interval asked for, the broker's when lower: a connection silent for two of them is lost. 30s when left out or 0.": "请求的心跳间隔，代理的更小时取代理的：静默两个间隔的连接视为丢失。不写或为 0 时为 30s。",
"The most bytes, keys and values before compression, of one Pulsar batch; a sink batch with more for a partition sends several, in order. Keep it below the brokers' maxMessageSize (5 MiB by default). 1048576 when left out or 0.": "一个 Pulsar 批次压缩前的最多字节数（键与值）；一个目标批次中某分区超过时分成多个，按顺序发送。应低于代理的 maxMessageSize（默认 5 MiB）。不写或为 0 时为 1048576。",
"How a batch written again is kept from being stored twice: read_back, the last 64 entries (Pulsar batches) of each partition read back when the producer is made (which needs the permission to consume the topic), and the records of a batch whose fit-id it, or a message stored since, has dropped; off, nothing, every record sent, so a batch written again after a crash is stored again. read_back when left out.": "如何避免再次写入的批次被存两次：read_back，创建生产者时读回每个分区最后 64 个条目（Pulsar 批次）（需要消费该主题的权限），丢弃批次中 fit-id 已在其中或已在此后存下的记录；off，不做处理，每条记录都发送，崩溃后再次写入的批次会再存一次。不写时为 read_back。",
"The records' namespace. The codec's (canal_json's db.table, say), or the topic as written in topics, when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不写时为编解码器给出的（例如 canal_json 的 db.table），或 topics 中写的主题。",
"The records' namespace. The codec's, or the message's subject, when left out.": "记录的命名空间。不写时为编解码器给出的，或消息的主题。",
"The virtual host. / when left out.": "虚拟主机。不写时为 /。",
"A PEM file of the certificates the brokers' are checked against, in place of the system's roots; needs a pulsar+ssl:// url.": "PEM 文件，包含用于校验各代理证书的证书，取代系统根证书；需要 pulsar+ssl:// 的 url。",
"A consumer made's max_ack_pending: the most messages delivered and not acknowledged. 10000 when left out or 0.": "创建的 consumer 的 max_ack_pending：已投递未确认的最多消息数。不写或为 0 时为 10000。",
"A field of after to put the message's metadata in (exchange, routing_key, queue, redelivered, headers and the properties set), on the records a codec makes rows of; a message record has them as fields of its own. None when left out.": "after 的一个字段，在编解码器生成行的记录中存放消息的元数据（exchange、routing_key、queue、redelivered、headers 以及已设置的属性）；消息记录把它们作为自己的字段。不写时没有。",
"What makes a message's body of a record: raw when left out, after's value field as it is, or the record's canonical JSON when it has none; json for the row as plain JSON (form plain) or the whole record (form record).": "由记录生成消息体的方式：不写时为 raw，即 after 的 value 字段原样，没有时为记录的规范 JSON；json 为把行写成纯 JSON（form plain）或整条记录（form record）。",
"jetstream, a stream read through a durable consumer, at least once; core, subjects subscribed to, at most once. jetstream when left out.": "jetstream，经持久 consumer 读取一个流，至少一次；core，订阅主题，至多一次。不写时为 jetstream。",
"The content_type property of every message, as application/json; none when left out.": "每条消息的 content_type 属性，例如 application/json；不写时没有。",
"With mode core, the most messages held between the connection and the pipeline; more are dropped. 10000 when left out or 0.": "mode core 时，在连接与流水线之间暂存的最多消息数；超出的被丢弃。不写或为 0 时为 10000。",
"A consumer made's ack_wait: how long the server waits for a message's acknowledgement before it delivers it again. Keep it above the time the sinks take. 1m when left out or 0.": "创建的 consumer 的 ack_wait：服务器等待消息确认、之后重新投递的时长。应大于目标所需的时间。不写或为 0 时为 1m。",
"Where a partition starts when the pipeline has no checkpoint (and, in mode subscription, the subscription is new): earliest, the oldest message kept; latest, after the newest. A partition found later starts at its earliest. earliest when left out.": "流水线没有检查点（以及 mode subscription 中订阅是新的）时分区从哪里开始：earliest，保留的最早消息；latest，最新消息之后。之后发现的分区从其最早处开始。不写时为 earliest。",
"The largest message body published: a record that makes a larger one fails, and on_error takes it. Keep it at or below the broker's max_message_size. 16 MiB when left out or 0.": "发布的最大消息体：生成更大消息体的记录失败，由 on_error 处理。应不超过代理的 max_message_size。不写或为 0 时为 16 MiB。",
"Connect over TLS, the servers' certificates checked against the system's roots or ca_file's; the check cannot be turned off.": "通过 TLS 连接，各服务器的证书按系统根证书或 ca_file 中的证书校验；校验不可关闭。",
"The database the tables are in; the login's default when left out.": "表所在的数据库；不设置时为该登录名的默认数据库。",
"The table a record goes to: text with {namespace} (or {$namespace}, as record templates write it), the record's namespace; its parts, split at dots, are schema.table or db.schema.table (a MySQL source's shop.orders is the schema shop's table orders). The table is not made: it is the user's, with a primary key or unique index on the record's key columns. {namespace} when left out.": "记录写入的表：可含 {namespace}（记录的命名空间，也可按记录模板的写法写作 {$namespace}）的文本；按点分成的各部分为 schema.table 或 db.schema.table（MySQL 源的 shop.orders 即 schema shop 中的表 orders）。表不会自动创建：由用户建好，在记录的键列上要有主键或唯一索引。不设置时为 {namespace}。",
"With checkpoint sink, the table the checkpoint is kept in, a row a pipeline, made when missing (which needs CREATE TABLE); schema.table names its schema, the login's default otherwise. _fit_sync_checkpoints when left out.": "checkpoint 为 sink 时保存检查点的表，每条流水线一行，不存在时自动创建（需要 CREATE TABLE 权限）；schema.table 指明其 schema，否则为该登录名的默认 schema。不设置时为 _fit_sync_checkpoints。",
"A run of at least this many inserts without a source transaction (a snapshot's, a job's) is bulk loaded (INSERT BULK) into a temporary table and merged from it into the table, rather than written as statements of parameters. A number larger than any batch turns it off. 1000 when left out or 0.": "至少这么多条、不属于源事务的连续插入（快照的、作业的）先批量装载（INSERT BULK）到临时表，再从临时表合并进目标表，而不是写成带参数的语句。设成比任何批次都大的数即关闭此功能。不设置或为 0 时为 1000。",
"How a row is written: merge, a MERGE ... WITH (HOLDLOCK) of the run's rows; update_insert, an UPDATE by the key and, when it found no row, an INSERT, for those who keep MERGE out of their servers. merge when left out.": "行的写入方式：merge，对这组行执行 MERGE ... WITH (HOLDLOCK)；update_insert，先按键 UPDATE，找不到行时再 INSERT，适合不在服务器上使用 MERGE 的用户。不设置时为 merge。",
"How records are grouped in the server's transactions: source, each source transaction as one, and the records without one (a snapshot's) of a batch together; batch, a batch's records up to the last that ends a source transaction in one, and those after it, a part of one source transaction, in one held open into the next batch. Either way a source transaction is never committed in part. source when left out.": "记录在服务器事务中的分组方式：source，每个源事务作为一个事务，一个批次中不属于源事务的记录（快照的）合在一起；batch，一个批次中直到最后一个结束源事务的记录为止的所有记录作为一个事务，其后的记录（一个源事务的一部分）放在一个保持打开、延续到下一批次的事务中。两种方式都不会只提交源事务的一部分。不设置时为 source。",
"The SQL login, which needs SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE on the tables written (and ALTER, with identity_insert); with auth, the Windows account (kerberos, ntlm). Needed but with auth's entra.": "SQL 登录名，需要对写入的表有 SELECT、INSERT、UPDATE 和 DELETE 权限（使用 identity_insert 时还需要 ALTER）；使用 auth 时为 Windows 账户（kerberos、ntlm）。除 auth 的 entra 外都需要。",
"Write the rows' values in the tables' IDENTITY columns (SET IDENTITY_INSERT ON around each statement), as a copy of another database's keys needs; the login then needs ALTER on the tables. false when left out.": "把行中的值写入表的 IDENTITY 列（在每条语句前后 SET IDENTITY_INSERT ON），复制另一个数据库的键时需要；此时登录名需要对表的 ALTER 权限。不设置时为 false。",
"A login other than SQL authentication's username and password: Microsoft Entra ID (Azure SQL), or Windows authentication by Kerberos or NTLM. SQL authentication when left out.": "SQL 身份验证（用户名与密码）以外的登录方式：Microsoft Entra ID（Azure SQL），或通过 Kerberos 或 NTLM 的 Windows 身份验证。不设置时为 SQL 身份验证。",
"How the login is made: entra, Microsoft Entra ID (Azure SQL Database and Managed Instance), an access token (a service principal's, a managed identity's, or one given) sent in TDS's FEDAUTH, username and password_env unused; kerberos, Windows authentication with a Kerberos ticket, username the principal (user, or user@REALM), its key from password_env or keytab_file; ntlm, Windows authentication with NTLMv2, username DOMAIN\\user and password_env its password, for a server outside a domain (weaker than Kerberos: the server is not authenticated).": "登录方式：entra，Microsoft Entra ID（Azure SQL Database 与 Managed Instance），在 TDS 的 FEDAUTH 中发送访问令牌（服务主体的、托管标识的或直接给出的），不使用 username 与 password_env；kerberos，用 Kerberos 票据的 Windows 身份验证，username 为主体（user 或 user@REALM），其密钥来自 password_env 或 keytab_file；ntlm，用 NTLMv2 的 Windows 身份验证，username 为 DOMAIN\\user，password_env 为其密码，用于域外的服务器（比 Kerberos 弱：服务器不被验证）。",
"With entra, the service principal's directory (tenant) ID or domain.": "使用 entra 时，服务主体的目录（租户）ID 或域名。",
"With entra, the service principal's application (client) ID; with managed_identity, a user-assigned identity's client ID (the system-assigned identity when left out).": "使用 entra 时，服务主体的应用程序（客户端）ID；使用 managed_identity 时，为用户分配的托管标识的客户端 ID（不设置时用系统分配的标识）。",
"With entra, the environment variable holding the service principal's client secret, read when the pipeline loads.": "使用 entra 时，保存服务主体客户端密码的环境变量，在管道加载时读取。",
"With entra, a PEM file of the service principal's certificate and its RSA private key, which signs the client assertion in place of a secret.": "使用 entra 时，含服务主体证书及其 RSA 私钥的 PEM 文件，用于代替客户端密码为客户端断言签名。",
"With entra, the token is the host's managed identity's, from Azure's instance metadata service (or App Service's identity endpoint, when IDENTITY_ENDPOINT is set). false when left out.": "使用 entra 时，令牌取自主机的托管标识，来自 Azure 实例元数据服务（设置了 IDENTITY_ENDPOINT 时为 App Service 的标识端点）。不设置时为 false。",
"With entra, the environment variable holding an access token for https://database.windows.net/, read at each connection, for a token got elsewhere.": "使用 entra 时，保存 https://database.windows.net/ 访问令牌的环境变量，每次连接时读取，用于在别处获取的令牌。",
"With entra, a file holding an access token for https://database.windows.net/, read at each connection, so that whatever renews it may replace it.": "使用 entra 时，保存 https://database.windows.net/ 访问令牌的文件，每次连接时读取，以便续期的程序替换它。",
"With entra and a service principal, the token endpoint's origin: another cloud's (https://login.microsoftonline.us, https://login.chinacloudapi.cn). https://login.microsoftonline.com when left out.": "使用 entra 与服务主体时，令牌端点的源：其他云的（https://login.microsoftonline.us、https://login.chinacloudapi.cn）。不设置时为 https://login.microsoftonline.com。",
"With kerberos, the principal's realm; username's @REALM, or krb5_conf's default_realm, when left out.": "使用 kerberos 时，主体的领域（realm）；不设置时为 username 的 @REALM，或 krb5_conf 的 default_realm。",
"With kerberos, the realm's KDCs, as host or host:port (88), tried in turn over TCP; krb5_conf's when left out.": "使用 kerberos 时，领域的 KDC，写作 host 或 host:port（88），通过 TCP 依次尝试；不设置时取自 krb5_conf。",
"With kerberos, the krb5.conf whose default_realm and realms' kdc lines are read when realm or kdc is left out. /etc/krb5.conf when left out.": "使用 kerberos 时，在未设置 realm 或 kdc 时读取其 default_realm 与 realms 中 kdc 行的 krb5.conf。不设置时为 /etc/krb5.conf。",
"With kerberos, a keytab file holding the principal's keys (AES), in place of password_env.": "使用 kerberos 时，保存主体密钥（AES）的 keytab 文件，代替 password_env。",
"With kerberos, the server's service principal name, as MSSQLSvc/host.example.com:1433; MSSQLSvc/ with address's host and port when left out (the host must then be the name the SPN was registered with, not an IP address).": "使用 kerberos 时，服务器的服务主体名称（SPN），如 MSSQLSvc/host.example.com:1433；不设置时为 MSSQLSvc/ 加 address 的主机与端口（此时主机须是注册 SPN 时用的名称，而不是 IP 地址）。"
};
